window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2301,"title":"Chapter 2301 Senior White Two, Help Me","paragraphs":["2301 Senior White Two, Help Me","With this thought in mind, Gao Moumou calmly closed the chat software and went back to focusing on his writing.","On the other side, Song Shuhang’s lips curled into a sly smile. “Excellent~ One down.”","He then proceeded to log into the accounts of ‘Eastern Moonlit Night’ and ‘True Monarch Red Plum.’","The success with Gao Moumou signaled the effectiveness of his illusions.","Though it was a basic ‘covert induction’ illusion technique, the addition of the Mirage Dragon’s nascent soul made the illusion even more potent than Song Shuhang had anticipated.","Once he had added his three roommates to the group, Senior Yellow Mountain’s puppet was about to arrive.","By that time, he would activate these puppets one by one and place them in Senior Medicine Master’s small building. Then, he would remotely control these puppets and gently guide his friend down the path of cultivation.","If needed, he could dispatch the virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, Lady Onion, and others to play the roles in the group. It would be similar to how Soft Feather, Sixteen, and Senior Medicine Master had guided him into the world of cultivation.","His current capabilities had their limits. This was the most he could do for his roommates at the moment. In the future, as his abilities grew stronger... perhaps he could do even more.","Song Shuhang executed his plan once again.","He used his illusions to discreetly add them to the groups. Dongfang Yue Ye’s account was used to add Tubo, while True Monarch Red Plum’s account was used to add Yangde. Success followed.","“Shuhang,” Tubo suddenly raised his head and inquired, “Do you believe there are martial arts masters in this world?”","“There has to be.” Song Shuhang nodded thoughtfully. “Personally, I’m pretty sure there are genuine martial arts in this world.”","The effectiveness of the ‘covert induction’ illusion was so strong that Tubo was already pondering the topic of ‘martial arts masters’ so quickly.","“Hmm, is that why you taught Ji Shuangxue’s father ‘The Times are Calling’?” Yangde suddenly raised his head, pushed up his glasses, and grinned.","Song Shuhang was left momentarily speechless.","“Later, I heard Zhuge Yue mention that Ji Shuangxue’s father practices ‘The Times are Calling’ every day. During the summer vacation, he even bought a house in Wenzhou and moved near your place,” Gao Moumou casually remarked without looking up from his work.","As the conversation shifted towards Zhuge Yue, Ji Shuangxue, and her father Joseph, Gao Moumou felt like the sealed memories in his mind were becoming clearer.","Song Shuhang gave a dry laugh.","Just as they were chatting, Song Shuhang’s phone rang.","It was an unknown number from the Jiangnan area.","“Is this the delivery?” Song Shuhang answered while acknowledging Senior Yellow Mountain’s efficiency.","“Hello, is this Student Shuhang?” a woman’s voice came from the phone.","“It’s me. Who’s calling?” Song Shuhang asked politely. It seemed unlikely to be a female courier. The probability of female couriers was relatively low these days.","“I am Ji Shuangxue. Do you still remember me?” the woman replied.","Song Shuhang raised his head and glanced at the sky. It was quite a coincidence; they had just been talking about her.","“Yes, Shuangxue. How can I assist you?” Gao Moumou, Tubo, and Yangde stopped what they were doing, eagerly listening.","As they had just discussed Ji Shuangxue, she had immediately called Song Shuhang. It was quite a coincidence. So, why did she call?","“Student Shuhang... Do you believe there are martial arts in this world?” Ji Shuangxue asked nervously while explaining her recent experiences.","Song Shuhang replied, “I do. I think there are genuine martial arts in this world.”","Opposite him, Ji Shuangxue fell silent. Her father’s dedication to ‘The Times are Calling’ was on her mind.","“Thank you,” Ji Shuangxue finally said. “I feel better after hearing your answer. Goodbye, Shuhang.”","After ending the call, Song Shuhang was puzzled. Had his words been particularly wise, or did his voice have a calming effect?","When he saw Song Shuhang end the call, Gao Moumou asked, “Did she scold you?”","“No, not at all,” Song Shuhang replied, shaking his head.","“Her temperament is really good. If it were me, I’d probably secretly beat you up,” Tubo sighed.","Tubo’s attack power wouldn’t even break Song Shuhang’s defenses, even if he tried.","“Why is it that when I mentioned about beating him up, he smiled with such a gentle expression?” Tubo wondered.","...","...","Afternoon classes began.","Song Shuhang and his three roommates chose seats by the window on the left side of the classroom. It offered better lighting and occasional views.","During the more important afternoon class, they paid closer attention. Song Shuhang used his illusion to conceal himself while continuing to multitask. He created chat records for Gao Moumou, Tubo, and Yangde based on the conversations in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Back when he had first joined the group, he had spent his days observing the seniors discussing their cultivation experiences, secret realms, and pill refinement.","He used these chat records as a foundation and made modifications as needed.","Tired from her stroll, Lady Onion found Song Shuhang’s position and quietly returned, jumping into his pocket.","[Feeling tired?] Song Shuhang asked telepathically.","[Yes.] Lady Onion replied softly.","Additionally, she was too embarrassed to mention something. While she was strolling around, she suddenly felt a little flustered. Out of instinct, she quickly found Song Shuhang’s location.","Subconsciously, Song Shuhang’s position was a safe place for her.","Song Shuhang gently patted Lady Onion and closed his book, “Basic Ancient Language.”","Suddenly, a series of glass shattering sounds echoed from the left side of the classroom.","“He’s here!” Monster hunter Zhang Xiaofan stood up abruptly.","Song Shuhang glanced at the shattered glass and swept his spiritual energy over it. The shattered glass near him moved away.","Upon seeing this, Song Shuhang quickly contacted Senior White Two.","Senior White Two was speechless.","After sighing, he replied, “What disaster did you encounter this time?”","He had only left for a short while.","“Senior White, I heard that you have a magical technique that can instantly restore glass?” Song Shuhang asked. He remembered that the hamster had mentioned this before.","Senior White Two was silent."]},{"number":2302,"title":"Chapter 2302 Senior White Has Turned Off His Phone.","paragraphs":["2302 Senior White Has Turned Off His Phone.","For a moment, Senior White Two suspected that the communication channel between him and Song Shuhang had been hacked. Song Shuhang was looking for him just to repair some glass?","“Who told you I have a boring skill like fixing glass?”","Song Shuhang replied, “Hmm... The hamster said that Senior White has the ability to instantly restore shattered glass.”","Senior White Two fell silent.","“Do you believe that I would actually want to kill the two of you right now and then fry you together until you’re golden brown?” Senior White Two said. It was clear he was just joking.","“I was just kidding, Senior White,” Song Shuhang assured him.","At this point, Song Shuhang’s mind entered a state of rapid thought exchange. In this mode, he and Senior White Two could have more extensive conversations within a limited time.","This was one of the advantages of thought communication. They could exchange numerous thoughts in an instant. With enough mental energy, they could make hundreds of exchanges within moments.","Of course, Song Shuhang hadn’t contacted Senior White Two just to ask him to repair the glass. He had genuinely sensed danger. From his time as a cultivator until now, Song Shuhang’s danger intuition had rarely activated, but it had always been accurate.","This time, his sixth sense was alerting him to an extremely oppressive danger. So, he had reached out to Senior White Two just to be safe.","“Do you want to learn?” Suddenly, Senior White Two’s voice echoed in Song Shuhang’s mind.","Learn what? Was Senior White Two talking about the glass repair skill?","“Is there really such a convenient skill?” Song Shuhang asked. He was intrigued. Learning a skill like that seemed rather unusual.","“Indeed, the time-type skill ‘Time Backtrack.’ It can easily restore a mere piece of glass,” Senior White Two explained.","Song Shuhang was taken aback. It sounded like a high-level and sophisticated skill. But the name alone made it seem like it wasn’t meant for him.","“Do you wish to learn it?” Senior White Two inquired further.","“Can I really learn something like that?” Song Shuhang asked. He was a little incredulous.","Would anyone actually study such an odd spell?","“Yes, after you reach the ninth rank, you’ll have the chance to master Time Backtrack,” Senior White Two confirmed.","Song Shuhang was amazed. It felt like a distant goal, but it was something to look forward to.","Song Shuhang was left speechless once again. Setting up nine resurrection arrays seemed like a daunting task.","“Wait, Senior White, I was just joking earlier. I was being cheeky. I’m worried there might be a big disaster on my end!” Song Shuhang quickly added.","“It’s fine. I’ve left a resurrection array for you in the Netherworld Realm. If you die, you’ll come back as a glorious demon of the Netherworld Realm. I’m hanging up, till next time,” Senior White Two replied casually before ending the conversation.","Song Shuhang sighed and closed the book. He had been playful, and now it seemed he had brought potential trouble upon himself. As he thought, Soft Feather’s words came to mind — they were all adults, and they couldn’t run away from the consequences of their actions.","Meanwhile, a loud crash was heard outside the window.","Glass shards from the window Song Shuhang had pushed away earlier suddenly fell into the classroom. Fortunately, they didn’t harm anyone.","However, the students were still frightened. There was a lot of screaming and panicking. Glass shattering beside them was a terrifying experience.","The teacher had been lecturing with his microphone on. In his shock he had shouted into it and added fuel to the panic.","Tubo jumped to his feet. “What happened? Why did all the glass shatter?”","Gao Moumou quickly gathered his belongings and moved away from the window. “This reminds me of a similar incident in a small district near Jiangnan College Town.”","“Let’s move away from here first. Is anyone hurt?” Tubo asked.","“We were lucky. The glass shards fell without hurting anyone,” a classmate replied.","At the same time, the monster hunter Zhang Xiaofan exposed a rune strip on his shoulder. It acted as a monster detector","Song Shuhang had advised them to maintain a low profile during their mission and avoid drawing attention. So, Zhang Xiaofan tried to remain inconspicuous.","From the students’ perspective, they saw Zhang Xiaofan suddenly lift his coat, remove a talisman, and toss it out the window. It all seemed superstitious.","Some students even followed suit. They took out their protective talismans and tossed them out the window.","After releasing the talisman to attack, Zhang Xiaofan discreetly cast a spell. He left an illusory clone behind. Meanwhile, his real body was concealed by an invisibility array as he jumped out of the shattered window.","Outside the window, his two companions had already arrived and formed a formation to receive him. They seemed to be aware of the type of evil they were facing and had a plan to eliminate it.","Song Shuhang didn’t directly intervene, but stood by to assist the monster hunters.","As he looked around, he began to gather information in his mind. Simultaneously, his divine sense acted as a radar.","The Evil Wang that had appeared wasn’t the source of his ‘crisis perception.’ In the darkness, an even greater calamity might be lurking.","On the sidelines, Gao Moumou couldn’t help but sneak a glance at Song Shuhang. While everyone else was in a state of panic, Song Shuhang had remained calm and composed.","Gao Moumou couldn’t help but think about his words: “Could there really be martial arts in this world?”","As he pondered, there was a loud noise from downstairs outside the window. Something had crashed into the crowd where they were.","Song Shuhang, who was beside him, raised his hand and lightly slapped the ground.","The thing that was thrown over flew back at an even faster speed.","It came quickly and left even faster.","It was so fast that no one could see what had just smashed in through the window."]},{"number":2303,"title":"Chapter 2303 The Final Moments of Normalcy","paragraphs":["2303 The Final Moments of Normalcy","“Shuhang?” Several pairs of eyes turned towards Song Shuhang from behind.","It had moved too fast for them to catch.","Moreover, Song Shuhang’s recent attack carried a hint of martial arts expertise!","Song Shuhang gazed out the window into the distance.","[Warning ~ Detected ‘distant interference’ signal...] The message was cut off. The newly added ‘virus alert’ function reminded him in his mind.","However, this time, Song Shuhang didn’t need the ‘virus alert’ function to sense the presence of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had entered the mortal realm directly from the Heavenly Dao Prison’s interstitial spaces.","From the beginning to the end, it hadn’t concealed its presence, so as soon as it entered Earth, Song Shuhang sensed it.","So, the process of the world’s collapse had now reached the mortal realm, Earth?","The appearance of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball signaled the end of peaceful days for all cultivators on Earth.","Tonight, none of Earth’s cultivators would get any sleep.","All of their peace was about to be shattered.","Song Shuhang’s divine sense also swept over his three close friends.","In fact, his ordinary days had already come to an end. From the start of this semester until now, the number of days he had spent at school could be counted on one hand.","He had only tried to maintain the identity of ‘Student Song Shuhang’ at Jiangnan University out of habit and nostalgia. In reality, he had already reached the Seventh Stage Realm, and it was no longer suitable for him to stay here.","If he didn’t suppress his aura, just sitting there would exert immense pressure on the ordinary people around him.","[Finally, the time has come.]","It was too bad for his three good friends. They didn’t possess the talent for cultivation, and Song Shuhang couldn’t change that.","Perhaps there would be an opportunity in the future, but not now.","Song Shuhang had decided to give them a chance to grow on their own.","This was the last time he would live his daily life like this.","[Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, are you ready?] he asked.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet hung at his waist and replied, “[Preparing libation, preparing libation.]”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Boom!","Down below, the battle had reached a climax.","The monster hunters had come well-prepared with several methods to subdue the monsters. These spirits possessed the ability to ‘burrow’ underground, but couldn’t escape the combined attacks of the three hunters.","Just as the three monster hunters were about to join forces and seal their enemy, it suddenly detonated.","The shockwave from the explosion sent the three monster hunters flying.","“Self-destruct?” Zhang Xiaofan was stunned.","Since when would these monsters choose death over surrender?","However, Zhang quickly realized that the evil apparition didn’t dissipate after the self-destruction. Instead, it transformed into a black mist that enveloped Senior Brother Lu Feng.","Lu Feng clutched his throat in pain as he suffocated.","The black mist liquefied and coiled around him and formed a tight leather jacket using his liquidized body as material. Unfortunately, Lu Feng was a big guy. The black, tight leather jacket didn’t look good on him.","Lu Feng let out a weird cry and leaped up toward the classroom upstairs.","Up there, it sensed a few ordinary humans with abundant Vitality.","All it needed was to absorb the Vitality from one or two of them to fully recover.","Bang!","Evil Lu Feng smashed through the window frame and crashed into the classroom.","At that moment, he resembled a villainous boss and left everyone shocked.","The students in the classroom fled without hesitation. It was natural instinct to avoid impending disaster.","But the issue was that when people inside wanted to leave, there were people outside trying to enter.","Some of those nearby had heard the explosion and the sound of shattering glass and wanted to come over to see what had happened.","The scene was chaotic.","His eyes settled on Song Shuhang’s three roommates.","His three roommates maintained a healthy lifestyle, ate well, slept soundly, and occasionally enjoyed spiritual tea and even immortal dishes that Song Shuhang brought them. Consequently, their Vitality was far more robust than that of regular people.","Naturally, they became the prime targets.","Lu Feng’s body charged at Tubo. His outstretched hand moved as if he were eyeing a gourmet delicacy.","The group of people scrambled to avoid him. No one wanted to be caught by this peculiar giant.","In this day and age, the combination of a pervert and a lunatic was most unsettling and terrifying.","“Though it’s a little hasty... it’s time to say goodbye to everyone,” Song Shuhang said to Gao Moumou and the other two.","Tubo was confused.","“We’ll meet again if fate allows,” Song Shuhang stated with a faint smile. He took a mysterious step forward and positioned himself in front of the possessed monster hunter .","“Your smile this time isn’t as charming as before,” Yangde remarked suddenly.","For a period, Song Shuhang had looked back and smiled enchantingly.","But now, that allure had dissipated.","‘If I have the chance, I’ll show you a smile that can captivate nations. The kind that can make the world fade with just a grin.’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He controlled his strength and lightly struck with his palm to intercept Lu Feng. He couldn’t use too much force; otherwise, he might accidentally kill a monster hunter of this caliber.","The possessed monster hunter instinctively attempted to evade Song Shuhang’s palm.","However, Song Shuhang’s palm was versatile and went through a myriad of changes. Regardless of what he tried, the possessed monster hunter couldn’t escape it.","Bang! Boom!","The two palms collided and created a resounding crash.","It was as though two speeding cars had collided.","The possessed Lu Feng let out two different cries and was sent hurtling backward.","The students who were initially in disarray in their attempt to flee the classroom, were all taken aback.","Such a scene, usually seen only in movies and television dramas, was actually happening at school?","It was true that Song Shuhang had acted in a movie before...","Evil Lufeng slammed into the wall and caused the entire classroom to tremble.","‘That was too hard.’ Song Shuhang thought and adjusted his palm.","Catching a tiny ant without squashing it was somewhat challenging for him.","After lightly shaking his hand, Song Shuhang approached possessed Lu Feng with a few steps.","Before he could get up from the ground, Song Shuhang grabbed his neck and hoisted his massive body into the air.","Lu Feng began to struggle with all his might and landed punches on Song Shuhang’s arm.","However, his weak blows produced nothing but a metallic sound when they struck Song Shuhang’s arm.","“I’m sorry, but I’m quite busy today, so I don’t have time to play with you,” Song Shuhang said.","In his mind, he had already compared the attributes and information of this spirit.","[Virus... Possesses potent latent and reproductive abilities and has the temporary body possession ability.]","While it was not overwhelmingly powerful, it had been sealed with over twenty different seals.","Unfortunately, Song Shuhang was unfamiliar with any of them."]},{"number":2304,"title":"Chapter 2304 I Have a Plan","paragraphs":["2304 I Have a Plan","Fortunately, Song Shuhang had something that could perfectly counter this evil entity – the Heavenly Tribulation.","The stronger the Heavenly Tribulation, the greater the harm it would inflict on them.","Song Shuhang held Lu Feng in one hand and opened a passage to his Inner World behind him.","He summoned the head of a ‘Heavenly Tribulation Nuclear Bomb’ from his Inner World. He exposed only the tip of the warhead to ensure it didn’t take up much space.","Both the Inner World and the ‘nuclear bomb’ were invisible to ordinary people, so there was no need to worry about causing panic.","With one hand gripping Lu Feng and the other controlling the portal of the Inner World, Song Shuhang used the bullet-like tip of the nuclear bomb to sear possessed Lu Feng’s body.","This was a ‘nuclear warhead’ that would only appear during the Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation. Even when sealed, the power of the Heavenly Tribulation attached to it was fatal to an entity at this level.","The entity struggled frantically and attempted to pry Song Shuhang’s arm away. However, its feeble strength couldn’t budge Song Shuhang’s arm in the slightest.","Song Shuhang controlled the ‘nuclear warhead’ of the Heavenly Tribulation and scorched Lu Feng from head to toe, front to back.","As the scorching continued, the pitiful cries faded away.","It had been incinerated by the nuclear warhead of the Heavenly Tribulation.","It was a most tragic and painful death.","Meeting Tyrannical Song in the wrong place at the wrong time sealed its tragic and malevolent fate.","Even as it burned from head to toe, its corpse clung to Lu Feng like a tight-fitting leather jacket.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and cut off a small piece of the Virus’s corpse and stowed it in his Universe Magical Treasure bracelet.","Then, he tossed Lu Feng’s massive body out of the window.","The two monster hunters below quickly caught their comrade.","“Thank you for your help, Senior Tyrannical Song,” Zhang Xiaofan transmitted his gratitude. He hadn’t expected Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to be right next to him, in this classroom.","After spending so much time with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, he was still safe and sound. He was indeed fortunate.","“No worries,” Song Shuhang replied softly.","“The warm-up is over. Next, it’s time for the main course,” Song Shuhang replied.","Song Shuhang surveyed the broken glass and the shattered window frame that Lu Feng had smashed. There was nothing he could do about it.","“Also, it’s time for me to depart.”","If he didn’t leave now, the disaster would spread to the surrounding areas when the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball descended.","He turned around and looked at his three roommates.","Without waiting for their response, Song Shuhang leaped out of the window.","Song Shuhang had always thought of the ‘hero jumping out of the window’ trope as a sickness in need of a cure. He had unknowingly adopted the ‘shortest path between two points’ method when descending from heights.","This was the power of habit—it changed people without them realizing it.","Gao Moumou and the other two were stunned. They rushed to the window and looked down, but Song Shuhang had already vanished.","The bewildered crowd behind them suddenly sprung into action.","“Was that really Song Shuhang?”","“Did he just jump from such a height?”","“Just now, he subdued that big guy with just two moves. Is Song Shuhang really that powerful?”","“Is this some kind of movie?”","The students in the classroom felt like their worldviews were shattering.","“Gao Moumou, you’re Shuhang’s roommates, right? Do you know martial arts?”","“Did you know that Shuhang knows martial arts?”","Song Shuhang made his escape, and as his roommates, Gao Moumou and the others found themselves surrounded by their classmates, bombarded with all sorts of questions.","There were countless inquiries from people eager to learn more about Song Shuhang. They wanted answers from Gao Moumou and the others.","...","Song Shuhang used an illusion as he descended from the window.","Upon landing, he entered stealth mode and concealed himself in the shadows.","Then, he swiftly sent a message to Qing Wu and recounted everything that had occurred and his decision.","“I understand, Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song. Leave the rest to me,” Qing Wu responded.","“I’ll assist Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song in handling the chaos at the school first, then I’ll make arrangements to leave,” Qing Wu replied. She had enjoyed her time at the school and wanted to help restore order before her departure.","“Alright, I’ll inform Senior White to come and pick you up,” Song Shuhang said.","Qing Wu responded with a simple, “Deal.”","...","After concluding his message with Qing Wu, Song Shuhang gazed at the sky.","He sensed that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had already appeared in the main world, Earth. However, its descent seemed to be restricted for the time being, and it had not yet arrived.","Previously, when it had launched a ‘long-range interference attack’ on Song Shuhang, it had been abruptly interrupted.","This was a fortunate turn of events for Song Shuhang, as it provided him with time to prepare and brace for what lay ahead.","‘The arrival of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball is inevitable. It’s just a matter of time. Since I’m already a marked target, I must minimize the damage.’ Song Shuhang thought.","“Then, let’s proceed according to the plan,” Song Shuhang said, clenching his fists.","“Should we head straight up? But you’re out of spirit stones, ‘Krypton Gold Strike’ and my ‘God Suppressing Great Sun’ are out of the question,” Daoist Stone Tablet reminded him.","“I’m not that reckless... I have a plan. Since the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball has locked onto my coordinates, it’s likely that when it descends to the main world, it will do so directly above me. Therefore, we have plenty to do before it arrives,” Song Shuhang explained.","He extended his hand and buried a ‘Sage Seal Wooden Saber’ beneath Jiangnan College Town.","Then, he sped out of the Jiangnan area as fast as he could.","He intended to head to the headquarters of the Limitless Demon Sect.","He was now a moving disaster that was targeted by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. If that was the case, it was time to settle all scores with the Limitless Demon Sect.","However, there was a small problem with this plan.","The Limitless Demon Sect’s headquarters were exceptionally well-hidden. When Senior Seven had been in a fit of rage, Song Shuhang had only been able to vent his frustration on one of the sect’s branches.","At present, the only useful lead in Song Shuhang’s possession was the three-part ‘Demon Monarch Anzhi’ gift set tied to his Inner World.","Demon Monarch Anzhi undoubtedly knew the whereabouts of the Limitless Demon Sect.","The challenge was how to extract this information from him.","Additionally, Song Shuhang sent a message to the group and alerted them that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was about to descend upon the main world.","Many of the bigwigs in the group had business interests on Earth and needed to take precautions to minimize their losses."]},{"number":2305,"title":"Chapter 2305 I Have a Part in This Pot","paragraphs":["2305 I Have a Part in This Pot","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, Venerable Song had left a message.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer was the first to respond. “Don’t say a word. Keep that bad news locked up inside you. There’s been way too much negativity lately. I could use some good news.”","Song Shuhang was momentarily at a loss for words.","“Has Phoenix Slayer been in a bad mood lately? What’s been going on? Share it with everyone. Let’s have a good laugh,” Doudou chimed in cheerfully. He even added a cute dog head emoji that was a caricature of himself.","Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da replied with an [Angry Dog Head Scratching Upstairs emoji] – “Ah, this should be fun!”","Last time, Silly Doudou had threatened to destroy Guo Da’s dog head building, and Guo Da hadn’t forgotten. He had been lurking in the group ever since and was patiently awaiting the day Doudou sent a dog head emoji.","Doudou was left speechless.","“Doudou, Guo Da, and Phoenix Slayer, let’s not mess around. Shuhang, go ahead and share whatever news you have. Is this bad news related to you?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator inquired.","Medicine Master also pitched in. “Don’t hesitate to share. I’ve already distributed liver and kidney protection pills to all fellow Daoists in the group. Feel free to take them.”","It wasn’t convenient for Medicine Master to use voice chat at the moment, and everyone understood why.","“Alright, here it is... The world, or more precisely, Earth, is on the brink of entering a phase of collapse,” Song Shuhang typed quickly.","He needed to convey the gravity of the situation to get the seniors’ attention, so he began with the worst-case scenario.","“What?” Fairy Dongfang Six exclaimed. “Is it like the 2012 apocalypse?”","“If the world is going to end, Fairy Dongfang Six must have something to do with it. You probably offended Earth somehow,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber commented.","Fairy Dongfang Six retorted with “Shuhang already said it’s his fault, okay?”","[System Notification: Fairy Dongfang Six and Thrice Reckless Mad Saber have been muted by the group owner ‘Yellow Mountain is so tired that he wants to retire’ for 1 minute.]","Senior Yellow Mountain silently retrieved the liver and kidney protection pills from Medicine Master and fed them to Doudou. Doudou had been taking various medications lately and it caused him stomach discomfort. This way, Senior Yellow Mountain could take the medicine without any trouble as long as he heard the pills being chewed.","Doudou reluctantly chewed on the pill. His dog face was filled with despair.","Then, Venerable Yellow Mountain typed in the group. “Please continue, Shuhang.”","“Seniors, you must be aware of the recent changes in the ‘Heaven,’ right? Well, a part of the world, which no one is aware of, has already begun to collapse. And when this world collapses, it will give birth to a monster related to the past ‘heavens.’ Now, the monster symbolizing the world’s collapse has appeared near the main world, Earth. The worst-case scenario is that Earth might plunge into an era of collapse.” Song Shuhang got straight to the point and revealed everything he knew.","After a lengthy pause without any responses, Song Shuhang began to wonder if he’d lost his connection.","Song Shuhang responded, “But this information is crucial, and I had to inform all of you.”","Fairy Lychee was as attentive as ever. She asked, “How are you involved in this? What did you do?”","“Don’t worry...” True Monarch White Crane interjected, “How powerful is that monster? Can I take it?”","“I can answer both Fairy Lychee and Senior White Crane at once. In terms of the monster’s strength, I used up all my resources during our last encounter and even sacrificed my beast fur just to barely escape from it,” Song Shuhang replied. After all, it was a Heavenly Dao Molt. Anything related to the Heavenly Dao should be at least at the Immortal level.","“You killed it?” Doudou asked.","“No, I barely escaped its clutches... However, the next step for the monster is to come to Earth,” Song Shuhang explained. There was a reason behind it.","“Where’s Senior White?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer inquired.","“I’m here. I’ve been watching the screen. Additionally, I bear some responsibility for this matter. I’m the one who buried Shuhang in the small black layer of the ‘Wielder of the Will’ and went into seclusion.”","“Senior White, don’t blame yourself. No matter how you look at it, it’s because Song Shuhang isn’t handsome enough that he attracted the monster,” True Monarch White Crane hastily remarked.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“Shuhang, when is that monster going to descend?” Ah Bai asked again.","“It appeared outside the main world this afternoon. However, it seems to be constrained and currently unable to move freely. It’s hard to predict when it will officially descend,” Song Shuhang replied.","“In that case, don’t panic. I’ll figure out a way to test this monster and gather intelligence on the enemy. But as a precaution, everyone should be prepared to transfer their assets,” Senior White added.","With his mastery over spatial power, Senior White was the best candidate for probing the situation. Furthermore, he didn’t need to send his main body for this task; a simple reconnaissance was enough.","With Senior White taking the lead, most members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group felt a sense of relief.","While thinking of spatial power, Senior White recalled something else.","“Right, Shuhang, I have a treasure here. It’s a golden formation disk. I’ve already transferred it to your Inner World. It’s advisable to keep it with you at all times,” Senior White mentioned.","Senior White had acquired a set of spatial secret techniques called ‘World Refining Holy Ape’ from the Almighty Merchant. After mastering these techniques, he had left behind this formation disk.","This formation disk was also a valuable treasure. When refined, carrying it with you daily offered a chance to awaken a minor spatial talent.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up upon hearing this. A treasure, gold, day and night presence—this sounded like an amulet!","Perhaps Senior White had noticed that he’d been experiencing some bad luck lately and had created a lucky charm for him?","“Thank you, Senior White,” Song Shuhang said as he retrieved the golden formation disk from his Inner World.","Huh? It wasn’t an amulet, but a magical tool?","Under normal circumstances, when a Sixth Stage cultivator advanced to the Seventh Stage, a lotus flower would bloom on their spiritual lake and give birth to a Nascent Soul. The spiritual lake would vanish.","However, due to Song Shuhang’s life-bound whale core being resurrected by the ‘Dragon Talisman,’ his Nascent Soul and Golden Core coexisted and preserved the spiritual lake. Moreover, nourishing magical tools with a seventh-grade spiritual lake produced even more remarkable results."]},{"number":2306,"title":"Chapter 2306: Make Me Unhappy for a Moment and I’ll Make Your Life Unpleasant!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2306: Make Me Unhappy for a Moment and I’ll Make Your Life Unpleasant!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After transferring the golden disk array to the spiritual lake and allowing it to suppress his core, Song Shuhang felt his entire body relaxing. It was as if he had received a blessing. His streak of bad luck seemed to be fading away.","However, he realized that this feeling was likely a psychological effect. Lately, he had become acutely aware of his own circumstances.","“By the way, there’s something else. Elders, do you have any information about the headquarters of the Limitless Demon Sect? Do you know of any methods to forcibly extract information from the mind of an enemy cultivator?” Song Shuhang inquired once more.","“What’s the difference in cultivation level between you and the person whose mind you want to extract?” asked True Virtue’s Seventh Cultivator.","“He’s at the Fourth Stage Realm,” Song Shuhang replied.","Demon Monarch Anzhi, who had failed his tribulation and hadn’t reached the Fifth Stage yet, was the one he referred to. In fact, Song Shuhang’s fear of heights was partially Demon Monarch Anzhi’s fault as it had caught him like a chicken.","“If he’s at the Fourth Stage Realm now and you are at the Seventh Stage, you could easily retrieve a lot of information using ordinary memory reading methods. The difference in spiritual power is significant, and no special technique is required,” True Virtue’s Seventh Cultivator explained.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“As for the Limitless Demon Sect, it seems they’re recruiting rogue cultivators,” Su Clan’s Seven added. “Furthermore, the true location of the Limitless Demon Sect should be similar to that of the Faraway Wandering Temple. It exists between the main world and the interdimensional space. It appears randomly all over the world. Finding it won’t be easy.”","Senior White chimed in, “You can also use the Memory Erasing Spell I taught you to read memories. It’s quite convenient. When you use it, instead of clicking ‘delete,’ click ‘read.’ We can give it a try.”","“Can the Memory Erasing Spell really do that? Alright, Senior White, I’ll give it a shot immediately,” Song Shuhang promptly replied.","He turned off his phone and surveyed his surroundings. He had already flown far from the Jiangnan area and was nearing a remote mountainous region. In this location, even if the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball suddenly targeted him, it wouldn’t endanger ordinary people.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and thrust a wooden saber engraved with the Sage Seal into the ground. To make future movements more convenient, he decided to set a marker each time he found a suitable location. This would facilitate his spatial jumps.","Afterward, in a moment of contemplation, Song Shuhang took out his ‘Squid Tyrant’s Dual Blades’ from his life-bound magical treasure. He hung a ‘Sage Sealed Wooden Saber’ on each blade and employed the Saber Controlling Technique to send them into space. Mastering the method of using ‘Sage Sealed Wooden Sabers’ to record spatial jump coordinates was challenging, so he intended to make the most of this technique.","Should the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball use him as the coordinate, he could instantly jump through space via the Sage Seal Wooden Sabers and lead the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball away.","“Here goes nothing.” Song Shuhang thought.","With his preparations in order, he entered his Inner World.","Inside the Inner World, Demon Monarch Anzhi had awoken from his coma long ago. However, due to the injuries sustained during his Heavenly Tribulation failure, he remained too weak to move. Furthermore, even if he had recovered, it wouldn’t have mattered.","That’s because he had been relocated to a new residence—the Immortal Sealing Prison.","The Immortal Sealing Prison was the secret realm of the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City, collected by ‘Zither Master Fengyi’ and members of the ancient Heavenly City. Senior White had used the ‘Holy Prison Refining World’ technique to transport it here.","The Immortal Sealing Prison was a place where even Immortals could be confined for a short duration.","Honestly, during the era of the ancient Heavenly City, being imprisoned in the Immortal Sealing Prison was a significant feat. Only esteemed individuals could end up here.","Demon Monarch Anzhi leaned weakly against a corner of the Immortal Sealing Prison.","As he gazed at this dreadful prison, despair washed over him.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was more formidable than anyone could have imagined.","The title of the first Sage in a thousand years didn’t even begin to capture a fraction of the other party’s terror.","Demon Monarch Anzhi couldn’t help but recall Young Master Hal’s and Zheng Neng’s speculations. They had guessed that the seemingly weak Song Shuhang was just a disguise of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in the mortal realm.","However, after careful consideration, Demon Monarch Anzhi felt that something was amiss. Many details didn’t add up.","After pondering it, Demon Monarch Anzhi believed the closer-to-truth possibility was that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had been possessed.","Alternatively, he might be the reincarnation of an ancient mighty figure who, upon reaching adulthood, had finally regained his own inheritance and power.","Tap, tap, tap—","At that moment, footsteps echoed from afar.","“Long time no see,” Song Shuhang said as he approached the edge of the Immortal Sealing Prison with a smile on his face.","Demon Monarch Anzhi weakly raised his head.","“I have a question for you,” Song Shuhang declared.","Demon Monarch Anzhi remained silent. He neither nodded nor shook his head.","“Do you know the location of the Limitless Demon Sect’s headquarters?” Song Shuhang asked.","After a moment of silence, Demon Monarch Anzhi shook his head. “Senior Tyrannical Song, you think too highly of me. A Fourth Stage disciple like me has no way of coming into contact with the ‘core’ of the Limitless Demon Sect. I have no idea where their mysterious headquarters is.”","“You really don’t know?” Song Shuhang pressed.","“Absolutely,” Demon Monarch Anzhi affirmed. ‘Moho Peak,’ where he, Young Master Hai, and Zheng Neng cultivated, was only the sixty-ninth peak of the Limitless Demon Sect.","Let alone the core members of the Limitless Demon Sect, their rank among the peaks wasn’t high.","To the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect’s branch, the location of Devil Throat Peak was already considered the headquarters of the Limitless Demon Sect. However, Demon Monarch Anzhi knew it wasn’t the actual headquarters.","He, Young Master Hai, and Zheng Neng had paid a considerable price and put forth great effort to condense a Golden Core with seven or even eight dragon patterns. This was in order to gain a higher status within the Limitless Demon Sect and access the true core of the sect.","Only then would he have a chance to come into contact with the ‘grand plan’ Young Master Hai had mentioned and gain more resources and opportunities.","“Senior Stone Tablet, how much do you trust his words?” Song Shuhang asked, lowering his head.","“Under normal circumstances, if you believe the nonsense of Demon Sect disciples, you’re setting yourself up for a loss,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet bluntly stated.","“That’s true,” Song Shuhang agreed.","Demon Monarch Anzhi was speechless.","At this moment, Demon Monarch Anzhi truly realized the significance of one’s ‘reputation.’","“Whether it’s true or not, let me verify it myself,” Song Shuhang declared.","With a thought, the prison door of the Immortal Sealing Prison opened.","At this moment, Demon Monarch Anzhi was like a helpless chick. He was devoid of strength to resist.","The tables had turned.","No one could guarantee that the young man he had grabbed and teased like a chick today wouldn’t, one day, turn the tables and treat him the same way.","In space, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was in a quandary.","Firstly, the Heavenly Dao laws in the main world hadn’t collapsed. Upon entering the main world, it felt as if it had been ensnared in steel and rendered it immobile.","Secondly, it had discovered that the ‘core’ it had painstakingly acquired was now being targeted by a formidable will.","In the Netherworld Realm, the chubby ball was furious. Its body had inflated, a clear sign of its anger. The experimental core it had spent so much effort on had been extracted.","Who dared to do this?","“No matter who it is, if they dare to extract the core of my experimental subject, they won’t have an easy time,” it vowed.","“If you make me unhappy for a moment, I’ll ensure you’re unhappy for the rest of your life!”"]},{"number":2307,"title":"Chapter 2307: Truly Envious of Bai Youyou","paragraphs":["Chapter 2307: Truly Envious of Bai Youyou","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although the Scholarly Sage had played a trick on him and caused him to lose his Bone, the liquid metal ball’s power couldn’t be transmitted to the main world as recklessly as before.","However, after studying the Bone of Immortality for a considerable time, and with the accidental acquisition of Song Shuhang’s necrotic kidney, the fat ball had pieced together some clues and devised its own plan.","Furthermore, as the ruler of the Netherworld corresponding to the current Wielder of the Will, it naturally possessed some special treasures—especially items left behind by previous Wielders of the Will.","Suddenly, the fat ball gritted its teeth and exclaimed, “That damned Bai Youyou.”","Bai Youyou was no saint. Not only did she seize its nest, but she also laid claim to the fertile land it had painstakingly cultivated. This fertile land was a prized area for cultivating the spiritual plants required for research.","“Fortunately, I won’t have to endure the sight of Bai Youyou’s detestable face for at least five thousand years,” the fat ball sighed with relief at the thought.","Given the opportunity, it hoped to prolong Bai Youyou’s sealing period. It hoped to do so for ten thousand years.","Five thousand years... ten thousand years...","At the thought of this, the fat ball suddenly seemed deflated, its entire form slumping.","Bai Youyou, the bane of its existence, could undoubtedly live for another five thousand years, ten thousand years, or even longer.","However, that wasn’t necessarily the case.","Without exerting effort, it might disappear at any moment.","[Sometimes, i truly envy Bai Youyou for having a dependable ‘Heavenly Dao.’]","With that, the fat ball’s form instantly teleported to a corner of the Netherworld Realm.","This was a specially shielded area it had established. It was the kind of zone where even Bai Youyou, with her authority as the ruler of the Netherworld, couldn’t detect. It was a hidden treasure trove.","Even though it was the ruler of the Netherworld, the entity that governed the Netherworld, it behaved as if it were hiding its own stash of money just to secure certain treasures.","Fortunately, the fat ball boss had been accustomed to this survival strategy from the beginning.","Upon entering, the fat ball retrieved a dragon-shaped commander’s seal from the treasure vault.","The ‘dragon’ on the dragon-shaped commander’s seal differed from a typical true dragon. It was composed of black and white and had only one leg.","This was a treasure left behind by the Third Wielder of the Will, Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon, and it had been collected by the fat ball.","With the power of the dragon-shaped commander’s seal, combined with its comprehension of the Bone of Immortality, it could briefly exert its influence on the present world using its own power.","‘No matter who it is, they shall face the wrath of the ruler of the Netherworld.’ The fat ball decisively severed a small portion of its liquefied body from its spherical form.","Subsequently, it retrieved several precious refining materials and fused them into this portion of its liquid body, commencing the refinement process directly.","Under the fat ball’s exceptional refining skills, the liquid body soon transformed into the prototype of a pseudo-immortal bone. Nevertheless, without the charging of a genuine Bone of Immortality, the pseudo-undying bone prototype alone couldn’t enable the fat ball’s clone to move in the main world.","“The final step.” The fat ball cast a series of spells and fused the bone into the dragon-shaped commander’s seal. “Transform!”","Boom!","The dragon-shaped commander’s seal in its grasp seemed to come to life while emitting black smoke resembling Song Shuhang’s smoky form.","This smoke dragon bared its fangs and brandished its claws in the void.","A spatial gate leading to the main world opened.","The smoke dragon directly infiltrated the main world, Earth and headed straight for the core.","Given the smoke dragon’s limited time in the main world, the fat ball boss didn’t waste a moment.","It promptly launched a vehement rebuke!","Simultaneously, Senior White employed his spatial abilities and discreetly arrived near the main world.","As a precaution, Pavilion Master Chu Daofao, Fairy Creation, Black-skinned Soft Feather, and Scarlet Heaven Sword had all been returned to Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","The virtuous lamia, on the other hand, didn’t need to fret over ‘death’ due to her unique existence. Consequently, she accompanied Senior White on this expedition.","Furthermore, in case of any unforeseen circumstances, the virtuous lamia could buy Senior White some escape time at a crucial moment. After all, even if she exploded, she could still be resurrected within Song Shuhang’s body.","Senior White and the virtuous lamia materialized with caution. Senior White was cloaked in a sheet akin to the Almighty Merchant’s and concealed his aura.","The moment they appeared, they swiftly located the ‘Heavenly Molt’ as mentioned by Song Shuhang.","“My luck seems to be holding. 1 found my target right after arriving,” Senior White telepathically communicated.","In space, a colossal mass of liquid metal continued to expand. It resembled an ‘artificial planet base’ straight out of science fiction.","Just as Song Shuhang had speculated, this immense liquid metal sphere was evidently restrained and unable to move.","‘So, how should 1 test it?’ Senior White pondered.","The virtuous lamia blinked and pointed to herself. Her undying attribute was evidently well-suited for such hazardous endeavors.","While they conversed, a spatial gate suddenly materialized in space.","On the other side of the spatial gate, a chilling Netherworld aura pervaded the surroundings.","A colossal smoke dragon roared and hurtled forth from within. It seemed to be heading toward the massive fat ball in space.","Senior White promptly shrouded himself in a blanket.","‘Perfect. 1 was just contemplating how to test this Heavenly Dao Molt, but I didn’t anticipate that something would step in to test it for me immediately.’ Senior White whispered in a low voice.","Boom!","The smoke dragon was relentless. Confronting a sphere several times larger than itself, it made no attempt to evade, instead colliding head-on!","In space, the immense Heavenly Dao Molt Ball couldn’t evade or resist.","It was held captive by the laws of the Heavenly Dao in the main world and had been rendered immobile.","In this state, the smoke dragon represented the full-strength assault of the ruler of the Netherworld. It obliterated the massive Heavenly Dao Molt Ball into countless fragments!","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball disintegrated into innumerable droplets of liquid and scattered them throughout space.","Among them, a sports shoe and a core were ejected from the ruptured Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","As expected of the +10 godly sneakers, they surprisingly withstood the brunt of the smoke.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball frantically induced spiritual impacts to thwart the smoke dragon. It was its sole method of resistance.","Nevertheless, the smoke dragon remained impervious to the mental onslaught and used the sports shoes and core as shields to deflect the psychic interference.","“Humph, a cadaverous entity dares to pilfer my core and even attempts a mental assault on me,” the smoke dragon scoffed.","Having said that, the smoky tornado scooped up the core and sneakers, executed a swift turn, and re-entered the spatial gate.","“Sizzle, sizzle, sizzle.” The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, reduced to raindrops by the smoke, cried out anxiously.","A portion of the water droplets finally broke free and zealously pursued the smoke dragon without hesitation.."]},{"number":2308,"title":"Chapter 2308: F * ck, I’m dead?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2308: F * ck, I’m dead?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In a burst of sparks, the spatial gate to the ‘Netherworld Realm’ closed.","Senior White, wrapped in a sheet, gazed at the water droplets of the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ floating in space.","“It’s over,” Senior White muttered.","The virtuous lamia nodded in agreement.","The events had unfolded rapidly—from the sudden collision of the smoke dragon to the explosion of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, then the smoke dragon snatching the sneakers and core, and finally the brief mental showdown between the smoke dragon and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. It all happened so quickly that no one had time to react.","In the vastness of space, the dismembered body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball floated silently. It resembled countless water droplets. It hadn’t been completely obliterated; each droplet remained in motion, but there was no indication of them reassembling anytime soon.","Senior White studied these water droplets carefully—this was a golden opportunity to dissect the structure of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball!","To resolve the crisis that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball posed to the main world, understanding its structure was the first step. They needed to determine if there was a way to harm it or, better yet, seal it.","With that in mind, Senior White retrieved several jade boxes and collected over ten drops of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s body and sealed the boxes meticulously.","He had initially intended to collect more since there were numerous scattered drops of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball in space. However, when he tried to gather more, the remaining droplets reacted aggressively and attempted to converge forcibly.","Senior White had no choice but to retreat with the virtuous lamia in tow. Only after putting a substantial distance between themselves and the droplets did the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s remnants calm down.","“What a wasted opportunity,” Senior White murmured softly. If the droplets hadn’t been so sensitive, he could have used a disposable flying sword to disperse them to different locations and buy them more time.","The virtuous lamia blinked her eyes in agreement.","It was evident that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was an exceedingly perilous item. It hardly seemed fit to be a treasure.","“I find this thing rather intriguing... Perhaps we can extract valuable information from it. Moreover, to resolve the crisis it poses, we must dissect its structure and explore potential means of destroying it or sealing it. Only by fully comprehending it can we address the current world’s peril at its root,” Senior White remarked.","The virtuous lamia silently nodded, but was vexed by Senior White’s foresight.","“However, this thing is also highly dangerous. As per Song Shuhang’s account, it signifies the onset of the world’s collapse. No matter which world it’s introduced to, it could bring calamity upon that world,” Senior White added.","Before a thorough study was conducted, it couldn’t be placed within Song Shuhang’s Inner World, lest it trigger a collapse of the Inner World. Thus, there was only one suitable storage location.","Senior White fashioned a branch of Tyrannical Song into a disposable flying sword, the small black room version. He then arranged the six jade boxes on the wooden sword, formed a sword seal with his hand, and sent them into another wielder’s small black room.","Senior White’s intuition suggested that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s body could greatly aid his plan to create a deity.","When the time came, he would dispatch a batch of research magical treasures and materials to this wielder’s small black room. Research on ascending to godhood and crafting a deity was conducted within these rooms.","Of course, it was unwise to place all their eggs in one basket.","The remaining three jade boxes were dispatched to the depths of space, on an uninhabited planet.","Based on Song Shuhang’s earlier description, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball only faced restrictions and immobilization upon entering the main world. Should it regain mobility after being transferred to the small black room, studying it would be far more challenging.","Hence, a small portion of the research materials had to be left in the main world as a precaution.","“Done. Let’s withdraw for now,” Senior White declared. After explaining everything, he discreetly left a disposable flying sword in the space.","This particular flying sword bore the image of an eye and had been designed for monitoring purposes. Through it, Senior White could track the movements of the Heavenly Dao Relic in space at any time.","The virtuous lamia nodded in agreement. She reached into her eye socket and left one of her eyes behind in secret. With this eye, she could directly transmit images from space to Song Shuhang.","“Let’s go,” Senior White said as he quietly departed while accompanied by the virtuous lamia.","Once they had left the space, Senior White took out his cellphone and provided a brief account of the recent events to the fellow cultivators in the group.","“A smoke dragon emerged in the Netherworld Realm and attacked the shed skin of the ‘Heaven’? Does the Netherworld Realm hold a grudge against the ‘Heaven’s Remains?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator inquired, puzzled.","“Can this ‘Heaven’s Molt’ be destroyed or sealed?” Lord Spirit Butterfly asked.","“Is there a way to deal with these ‘Heaven’s Remains?” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue queried.","“I’ve collected a few drops of the Molt and placed them in the small black room world and the main world,” All Bai explained. “Is there any fellow cultivator willing to collaborate on researching these remains with me?”","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue volunteered, “Let me handle it.”","“Count me in,” Lord Spirit Butterfly chimed in.","“I believe I can assist,” Skylark of the Xuan Nu Sect offered.","“I’ll come pick you guys up-” Senior White cheerfully offered. He was in high spirits at the prospect of collaborating on research with everyone after a long time.","***","In the Netherworld Realm, the smoke dragon returned successfully with both the core and a pair of +10 sports shoes.","The fat ball’s liquid palm extended to catch the smoke dragon.","The core, the sneakers, and the dragon-shaped commander’s seal all landed in its palm.","“What in the world are these shoes?” the fat ball exclaimed before promptly tossing the sneakers aside without hesitation.","Subsequently, the spiritual energy strand attached to the dragon-shaped commander’s seal returned and brought with it the memories of the recent events to the fat ball.","Through this returning spiritual energy, the fat ball ‘witnessed’ the smoke dragon’s foray into space. There, the dragon collided with an enormous... liquid metal ball.","The fat ball boss exclaimed,”!!!”","What had he just witnessed?","This colossal spherical entity floating in space bore a striking resemblance to him!","What was happening?","What had Bai Youyou done?","“Hold on, wait!” the fat ball boss urgently called out.","Boom-","In the memories it had recovered, the smoke dragon had shattered the liquid metal ball in space into pieces.","It had been utterly obliterated...","The fat ball boss suddenly felt a twinge of pain coursing through its form.","Just what was that liquid metal ball in space?","The returned memories continued to unfold.","After the smoke dragon had shattered the liquid metal ball in space, it engaged in a brief mental confrontation with the other party.","It was during this mental showdown that the fat ball boss was able to instantly confirm the other entity’s identity.","“Heavenly Dao Molt!” it exclaimed.","Only in the absence of the Heavenly Dao and the waning of Heavenly Dao laws would such a creature emerge.","“Darn it!” the fat ball boss’s composure crumbled.","Had its main body perished?","No matter how much it ruminated on the matter, it had never anticipated that its main body would falter at such a crucial juncture.."]},{"number":2309,"title":"Chapter 2309: Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s Left Boot","paragraphs":["Chapter 2309: Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s Left Boot","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With the demise of the original body of the Wielder of the Will, the fat ball, as the ruler of the Netherworld, would naturally cease to exist as well.","It could be tomorrow. It could be the day after.","In short, if it couldn’t find a way to maintain its position as the ruler of the Netherworld, much like Bai Youyou, it could disappear at any moment.","Its life had already started counting down.","“Damn it,” the fat ball’s liquid arm grasped the core and the dragon-shaped commander seal tightly as it expressed its frustration.","Given a bit more time, its research would have yielded results in just a few decades.","But its main body had failed to stand the test of time.","“Beep beep- Bai Youyou,” the fat ball boss lamented.","Swish-","At this moment, several more ‘water droplets’ suddenly crashed into it from the void.","These were the drops of water from the Heavenly Dao Relic shattered by the Smoke Dragon.","Upon collision, these water droplets split into two groups. Some headed for the ‘core’ in the fat ball’s hand, while the others targeted the sports shoe on the ground.","“You never lent a hand when you were alive, and now even in death, you still try to cause me trouble!” the fat ball exclaimed angrily.","It reached out and grabbed the Heavenly Dao Molt drop that had collided with the core in its hand.","One was the half-body of the Wielder of the Will, the ruler of the Netherworld, and the other was the corpse of the Wielder of the Will, the metamorphosis of the Wielder of the Will.","On this dark night, the two met.","In the next moment, the drop of water formed by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was devoured by the fat ball.","Although the two were both composed of liquid metal and had some distinctions, upon collision, they mixed directly.","The water droplet from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was enveloped by the fat ball’s body and dispersed into every part of its body.","“Huh?” The fat ball was slightly stunned.","Could it actually merge with the Heavenly Dao Relic?","‘Then, if 1 swallow the entire Heavenly A/Iolt, what will happen?’ This thought surfaced in the fat ball’s mind.","The fat ball, already feeling that its demise was imminent, was in a desperate state. Thus, regardless of whether it was useful or not, as long as it sensed a glimmer of hope, it wanted to try.","“Well then, let’s give it a shot! At a time like this, why would I have any reservations, even if it’s something like a corpse?” the fat ball whispered.","It suddenly turned its head to look at the water droplets on its sneakers.","However, the few drops of Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had already lifted their sneakers and employed spatial power to escape.","“Where are you running to?” The fat ball extended its hand and sucked in the water droplets on the sneakers.","Simultaneously, the water droplets initiated spatial teleportation.","Thud-","Some of the water droplets were absorbed by the fat ball.","But it seemed like a trace of water clung to the sneakers and vanished along with the spatial gate!","The fat ball was left speechless.","It seemed like that sneaker held a profound significance to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Was it an item left behind by someone important to it?","[The scent on that shoe seems very familiar. Whose scent was that? It should be someone I’ve come into contact with before... Moreover, they should have been something he came into contact with when he went to the main world with the help of the Bone of Immortality not long ago. In other words, it belongs to him.]","After a moment of contemplation, the fat ball deduced the answer.","The ‘humans’ it had come into contact with, those who wore sports shoes instead of magical ones... it was the accursed Tyrannical Song, much like Bai Youyou.","Lately, the only ‘human’ who had left a deep impression on it was Tyrannical Song.","That vexing little bug... that small mouse.","But why did the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball guard Tyrannical Song’s sneakers like they were a treasure?","“As expected of something corpse-like. How repulsive,” the fat ball muttered in a deep voice.","Such a Heavenly Dao Relic had no reason to continue existing, so it might as well let it be consumed!","‘I need to make a trip to the main world and directly devour the entire Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.’ The fat ball gazed at the dragon-shaped commander seal in its hand.","In order to deceive the heavenly secrets and allow its entire body to infiltrate the main world directly, it needed to enhance the power of the dragon-shaped commander’s seal.","The fat ball got up and ventured into the depths of the treasure vault.","This was where its refining workshop was concealed.","It needed to refine and improve the dragon-shaped commander seal comprehensively.","***","Song Shuhang emerged from his Inner World.","He hadn’t expected Demon Monarch Anzhi to be far more truthful than he had anticipated. Everything it had said earlier was indeed the truth.","Demon Monarch Anzhi didn’t possess knowledge of the true headquarters of the Limitless Demon Sect.","The headquarters it was aware of was merely the regional headquarters comprised of the 20 peaks of the Limitless Demon Sect.","“While it’s regrettable that it’s not the headquarters, a regional headquarters is still good. Breaking into it will be much easier compared to the headquarters, and it will also be convenient for me to draw the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball over,” Song Shuhang mused while pinching his chin.","In that case, why not make haste to the headquarters of the Limitless Demon Sect before the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball arrived?","Just as Song Shuhang was contemplating this, a spatial gate suddenly materialized in front of him.","Song Shuhang instinctively took a step back, opened his Inner World, and slipped half of his body into it.","Each time he encountered a spatial gate that abruptly appeared in front of him, nothing good came of it.","Those who emerged from such spatial gates were at least Tribulation Transcenders.","Song Shuhang had to be cautious.","The Space Gate before him appeared somewhat small. If he were to gauge it, the size of the powerhouse emerging from it was about as large as five hamsters combined.","Something shot out from the spatial gate.","A sneaker, shimmering with the radiance of a seven-colored divine weapon, zoomed out of the spatial gate and crashed into Song Shuhang.","“Huh? Why do these look so familiar?” Song Shuhang extended his hand and caught the sneaker.","These basketball sneakers were a style he greatly favored...","“Wait, these are mine!” After catching the sneaker, Song Shuhang suddenly sensed his own aura.","He hoisted the sneaker up high. As he examined the gleaming divine sneaker, Song Shuhang fell deep into thought.","How did my sneaker end up like this?","So dazzling.","Consequently, he didn’t dare to acknowledge that these sneakers belonged to him.","“I recall that these shoes were supposed to have ended up with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, right?” Song Shuhang contemplated.","Why did they suddenly emerge from the spatial gate and return to his hand?","“Could it be that those sneakers transformed into magical artifacts and gave birth to a shoe spirit?” While pondering, Song Shuhang stretched his hand and pressed it onto the sneaker while using his secret appraisal technique.","After paying the price of a minor one-centimeter-deep injury and some mild discomfort, the result of the appraisal was relayed to Song Shuhang’s mind.","[Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s battle boots (left leg). Originally ordinary shoes, but after continuous strengthening by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, they have been upgraded to sneakers +10.]","[There is a strand of the Heavenly Dao’s flesh attached to the boots.. Why not try to refine it into the boots?]"]},{"number":2310,"title":"Chapter 2310: You ‘ve Already Grown Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 2310: You ‘ve Already Grown Up","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only a fool would try to infuse ‘Heavenly Dao Molt’ into a pair of shoes! If he were really going to do it, what should he name these shoes?","“Tyrannical Song Treads on Heavenly Corpses”?","That name was way too arrogant, and unless your luck was as tough as nails, wearing them might even shorten your lifespan.","Plus, there was just one sneaker – specifically, the left foot. That detail was giving him, someone with a bit of OCD, quite the headache.","After pondering for a while, Song Shuhang took out his ‘One-Inch Reduction","Bag,’ stashed the shoes inside, and then attempted to fit them into his ‘Wristband Artifact.’ But alas, the shoes, with their strand of ‘Heavenly Dao Molt,’ refused to be squeezed into the wristband.","Song Shuhang didn’t want to keep them in his ‘Core World.’","His Core World was incredibly vital to him and one of his most significant secrets. If he were to bring the shoes in there, it could spell trouble if the ‘Heavenly Dao Relic’ followed the vines and locked onto his Core World.","Was he going to hang them on his person like this?","“Bring them to the world of the Black Lotus,” suddenly came the voice of Senior White Two in Song Shuhang’s ears.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang was bewildered.","Didn’t Senior White Two say he wouldn’t bother with him today? There was still some time before midnight. Why was he reaching out again?","Was Senior White the kind of person who would change his mind so easily?","Of course, Song Shuhang didn’t dare to even ‘think’ about this notion. The moment it surfaced, he buried it deep in his mind because any stray thought was likely to be picked up by Senior White Two.","‘Are you interested in these shoes?’ Song Shuhang inquired seriously in his mind.","Senior White Two replied, ‘I’m interested in the strand of ‘Heavenly Dao Molt’ on your shoes. No need for chit-chat, bring them to the world of the Black Lotus.’","‘Understood.’ Song Shuhang entered his Core World and shifted into the world of the Black Lotus.","Inside the world of the Black Lotus, in the metallic nest of the fat ball.","Senior White Two’s main body... lay atop the sealing pillar.","Inside the sealing pillar, Senior White’s research clone calmly read a book, while his other hand worked on calculations. Even in a sealed state, Senior White Two’s research clone remained diligent and capable.","Song Shuhang gazed up at the sealing pillar’s summit.","What was Senior White Two attempting to accomplish here?","After some consideration...","“Could it be that the top of the pillar is comfier to lie on?” Song Shuhang had an epiphany.","“I’m not a cat demon. How could lying at the top of a pillar be comfortable?” Senior White Two’s main body rolled its eyes and retorted, “I’m merely experimenting with the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ on the sealing pillar to see if it opens a door for me. I’ve been at it all day, but it’s been utterly futile.” Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“In theory, my ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ isn’t any different from yours. So why won’t the sealing pillar respond to my ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’?” Senior White Two grumbled.","Stepping forward, Song Shuhang handed over the +10 Tyrannical Song War Boots to Senior White Two. Then, he placed his hand on the sealing pillar and unleashed the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ ten times in a row.","The sealing pillar suddenly grew brighter and brighter.","The dazzling seven-colored light was akin to the effect of Song Shuhang grinding all night!","In response, Senior White Two smacked the sealing pillar in annoyance.","At the same time, Song Shuhang felt that his affinity with the sealing pillar had risen considerably.","It seemed that Senior White Two had spent the whole morning practicing the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique,’ and all the affinity points had been awarded to him?","Hence, the effect of just ten uses of the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ equaled a full night’s effort.","Song Shuhang silently retracted his hand.","It was probably better not to inform Senior White Two about this.","He had no desire to activate the Netherworld Realm’s resurrection array today.","“Is this yours?” Senior White Two, perched on the sealing pillar, inquired.","Song Shuhang nodded.","“It seems the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ used this shoe to lock onto you,” Senior White Two remarked, “Now that this shoe is in my possession, it won’t be able to lock onto you from a distance and interfere with you. You’re rather fortunate; you’ve resolved a potential problem.”","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted.","Wait, without this shoe, the ‘Heavenly Dao Remnant Ball’ couldn’t lock onto him?","Wouldn’t that mean his plan to serve as a beacon to attract the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ to the Limitless Demon Sect was kaput?","Had his scheme unraveled once more?","“Judging by your regretful expression... What exactly do you plan to do with the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’?” Senior White Two knelt on the sealing pillar and inquired.","“It’s fine. This is good as well. It’s a preventive measure to avoid losing control and accidentally overdosing, ” Song Shuhang replied slowly.","The hamster, which had been munching on fruit, dropped the fruit in its hand in shock.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","“Senior White, aside from confronting it head-on, are there any other methods to deal with the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball!?” Song Shuhang raised his head and asked.","“Wait until you reach at least the ‘Tribulation Transcender’ realm before fretting about this issue,” Senior White recommended while shaking his +10 Tyrannical Song boots. “However, I can investigate the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt’s’ weaknesses.”","“Thank you, Senior White,” Song Shuhang said while raising his head and gazing at the ceiling of the fat ball’s nest. He muttered to himself, “If... If only someone were to suddenly obliterate the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ outside the main world.”","As he uttered this, he kept giving sidelong glances at Senior White Two.","“Don’t even think that I’d do it,” Senior White Two replied with narrowed eyes while wearing a smirk. “Don’t even entertain the thought.”","Song Shuhang chuckled dryly.","“You’ve grown up now; you’re already a Seventh Stage Venerable. Don’t rely on your seniors to resolve everything. You should start thinking about solving problems on your own,” Senior White Two yawned.","“But isn’t asking for help a way to solve problems too?” Song Shuhang retorted.","“Get lost.” Senior White Two snapped irritably.","The hamster squeaked.","“In truth, I have a plan in mind, but it’ll take some time,” Song Shuhang admitted. After saying this, he stretched out his hand and pressed it against the sealing pillar while aggressively employing the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ a dozen times.","He hoped this would accelerate the growth of his affinity with the sealing pillar.","The next day, at dawn, in the main world’s space, the water droplet of the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ finally started merging.","The scattered water droplet-shaped bodies began gathering in the center.","The suppression effect of the Heavenly Dao Laws on the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ began diminishing.","The disposable flying sword that Senior White had left behind was monitoring this scene and promptly relayed the images.","At the same time, Song Shuhang, who had already reached the vicinity of the Limitless Demon Sect, quietly found a spot to observe. Even if he couldn’t lure the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ over, it wouldn’t hurt to keep an eye on the Limitless Demon Sect.","Right at that moment, an image was transmitted from the virtuous lamia.","It depicted a scene in the main world’s space.","The shattered body of the ‘Heavenly Dao Remnant Ball’ had started reassembling.","Song Shuhang’s scalp tingled.."]},{"number":2311,"title":"Chapter 2311: The Arrival","paragraphs":["Chapter 2311: The Arrival","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang felt his scalp tingling.","So, his hair transformed into twenty little hands and used various pressures that combined hardness and softness to massage his scalp to relief his stress. “What are you doing? What are you doing? Give me a heads-up before you use the ‘Braid Blade Hair Control Technique’ Pavilion Master Chu complained.","She was still perched on top of Song Shuhang’s head. As he scratched his head with his twenty tiny hands, she looked quite uncomfortable.","“What’s happening?” The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword, hanging at his waist, asked at the same time.","Except for the virtuous lamia which was still attached to Senior White’s body, the other pendants belonging to Song Shuhang had all returned. The virtuous lamia still had a mission to fulfill—she needed to open the Inner World for Senior White so that he could continue collecting the evil energy of the Netherworld and transfer some treasures into his Inner World.","“The body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball in space has begun to fuse again, ” Song Shuhang said in distress.","Black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from the shadow and reminded him,","“Senior Song, contact Senior White. Senior White, Senior Seventh Cultivator of","True Virtue, Senior Skylark, and my father are studying the structure of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball to see if they have discovered any weaknesses. Did they find any weaknesses in the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball?”","Song Shuhang nodded and immediately used the private chat function in the ‘cultivation’ chat to contact Senior White.","The call connected. Before Song Shuhang could say anything, Senior White had already responded, “I saw the fusion of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball in space. My research has just begun, and there’s no progress yet. We’ve tried all kinds of methods. Virtue power, elemental spells, physical attacks, witchcraft, and other abilities—but they’ve all had limited impact on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. Right now, we’re out of ideas to stop the water droplets from returning to it.”","Senior White’s laboratory was set up on a small planet in outer space, and he hadn’t used the Wielder’s Small Black Room yet.","Senior White continued, “I’ve contacted members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group and my friends on Earth. They’re ready to evacuate.","Shuhang, you should also transfer important people to the Inner World.” “I understand,” Song Shuhang replied solemnly.","At this point, he had set up surveillance in several key locations in the modern world. His hometown in Wenzhou City had also sent coordinates using his life-bound magical treasure.","“This time, you mustn’t hide in the Inner World,” Song Shuhang said softly.","In the face of a world-class disaster, the Inner World was his greatest support.","Song Shuhang looked at the Limitless Demon Sect’s headquarters not far away.","Since he was here, why not give it a try?","Although the ‘Tyrannical Song War Boots’ were in Senior White Two’s hands, perhaps the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ still had a way to lock onto his position?","Let’s give it a try.","If he wanted to do it, he would do it.","Song Shuhang first opened his Inner World and concealed half of his body inside, just in case something unexpected happened and the Inner World suddenly couldn’t open.","Then, he put away the Almighty Merchant’s blanket. The aura on his body was no longer suppressed. He also removed the ring that Senior White Two had given him.","The aura unique to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was released.","At Limitless Demon Sect, regional headquarters, the disciple responsible for guarding the mountain gate suddenly sensed a powerful aura not far away.","Had a powerful senior come to the Limitless Demon Sect?","At the same time, over ten sword lights flashed from within the regional headquarters. These were all Peak Masters of the Limitless Demon Sect, each possessing the strength of a Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperor.","The ten sword lights landed near the mountain gate and activated a large-scale magical treasure equipped with a ‘monitoring’ function.","Soon, Song Shuhang’s figure appeared on the surveillance screen.","“Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!” “Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar!” “Ancient Sage Tyrant Dragon!”","“Lord Tyrant Demon! ”","The ten Peak Masters exclaimed in a jumble.","“Why has Profound Sage Tyrannical Song appeared at our Limitless Demon Sect?” one Peak Master asked in puzzlement.","Among them, the face of the Peak Master of Moho Peak changed. He was Young Master Hail s guide, and at this moment, Young Master Hai was cultivating on his peak.","Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had come here for Young Master Hai?","“Eh? Where’s the other half of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song? Why is he only showing his upper body?” someone asked in doubt.","“I remember hearing that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song cultivated a peculiar secret technique. Rumor has it that he can separate his head and body...” someone replied.","“Should I go and communicate with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?” another Peak Master suggested.","Since he were already at the Limitless Demon Sect’s headquarters, it was clear that he knew the location of the Limitless Demon Sect.","“Who will go?” The Peak Master of Moho Peak hit the nail on the head and pointed out the most critical issue.","That’s right... Who would dare to make contact with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","Everyone present was a Peak Master of the Limitless Demon Sect, and they were all renowned figures in the cultivation world. However, when faced with an existence like Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, they were all flustered.","Just as the Peak Masters of the Limitless Demon Sect were hesitating,","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song made another move on the surveillance screen.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song looked up at the starry sky. His gaze seemed to pierce through the atmosphere and reach out into the vast universe.","After a while, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song let out a sigh, and his figure gradually disappeared, inch by inch.","“What is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song doing?”","“Maybe it was just a coincidence?”","“Wait, the method Profound Sage Tyrannical Song used to disappear just now... It must be spatial power!”","“Tribulation Transcender! That’s the spatial technique of a Tribulation Transcender.”","“The rumors are true. Last time on the moon, it was said that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song fought against a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is a Tribulation Transcender!”","The Peak Master of Moho Peak fell silent for a moment before sending this message to Young Master Hai.","From this day on, the fact that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was a Tribulation Transcender was witnessed by everyone in the Confucian, Daoist, and demonic cultivation world.","In the cultivation world, as long as information wasn’t sealed, all cultivators began to believe this fact.","On the other side of things, Song Shuhang returned to his Inner World.","Without the Tyrannical Song’s War Boots, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had lost interest in him.","‘In that case... should I first retrieve the ‘Tyrannical Song’s War Boots’ from Senior White Two and then play a trick on the Limitless Demon Sect?’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","‘Come to the world of the black lotus first.’ Just as he was deep in thought, Senior White Two’s voice echoed in Song Shuhang’s ear, ‘I have an experiment that requires your cooperation.’","An experiment?","Could it be an experiment related to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball?","‘I’ll be right there.’ Song Shuhang replied.","With a thought, he summoned his Core Assistant.","He had already set coordinates for Wenzhou City and the Jiangnan area.","Thus, he wanted the Core Assistant, Soft Feather, and Fairy Creation to help him transfer his parents and friends into his Inner World.","From the images transmitted by the virtuous lamia’s eyes, it was evident that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had already regenerated and transformed into a massive sphere.","At this moment, it was slowly descending towards Earth!"]},{"number":2312,"title":"Chapter 2312: Two Experiments","paragraphs":["Chapter 2312: Two Experiments","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If the Core World could be a bit larger, it would be large enough to hold all the creatures in the disaster-stricken area where the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had landed.","Then, it could wait for the disaster to pass and release them.","But the current Core World couldn’t do that.","So it would be best to deal with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball while in space—was what Song Shuhang thought.","Coincidentally, a group of informed cultivators on Earth in the present world had the same idea.","They began to take action.","Most cultivators were proactive.","Inside the Core World, after giving instructions to the Core Assistant, Song Shuhang quickly entered the Evil Lotus World.","Senior White Two had asked for his cooperation in experiments, and most of them were likely related to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Once inside the lair of the Fat Ball Boss, “Senior White, did you find anything?” Song Shuhang asked while keeping an eye on the trajectory of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","“Yes, I found something. For example...” Senior White Two took out two spirit stones and threw them toward Tyrannical Song’s boots.","“Spirit stones!” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","“Who told you to look at the spirit stones? Look at the strand of the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ attached to your boots,” Senior White Two said.","The strand of the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ attached to Tyrannical Song’s boots wrapped around the two spirit stones and quickly devoured and assimilated them.","In the blink of an eye, the strand of the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ had grown a bit larger.","“The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball can grow stronger by devouring spirit stones?” After witnessing this scene, Song Shuhang knew that this thing was definitely his mortal enemy.","It was a prodigal that actually ate spirit stones.","Speaking of which... Spirit stones were really versatile. They were just like electricity; they seemed to have applications everywhere.","Song Shuhang concluded, “So, we absolutely can’t let the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball touch spirit stones, right?”","“That’s not what I meant. Watch this,” Senior White Two said calmly.","With that said, Senior White Two extended his finger and made a delicate cut on his fingertip with his black longsword and created a small wound. A drop of blood from the ruler of the Netherworld slowly dripped out.","Though the amount was small, this drop of blood was from the true body of the ruler of the Netherworld. If not for ‘heavenly punishment,’ this drop, when it landed on the main planet, would likely cause a natural disaster and spread throughout the entire planet while causing various changes.","So, it wasn’t unreasonable for the ruler of the Netherworld to bring down heavenly punishment as soon as he entered the main world. To the main world, the ruler of the Netherworld was far too terrifying.","When Senior White Two’s blood landed on Tyrannical Song’s boots, white smoke rose from them.","The strand of the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ that seemed to have been corroded and melted by more than half!","This was the reason why Senior White Two had fed it spirit stones earlier. Only by making it stronger would he be able to show Song Shuhang how to corrode the molt with a drop of blood.","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded as he watched this scene.","“See?” Senior White Two said.","“I saw it,” Song Shuhang replied with amazement. “Two substantial spirit stones vanished, just like that.”","Senior White Two was speechless.","As the youngest Seventh Stage Venerable in history, couldn’t you aim higher? “In other words, your blood has a restraining effect on the strand of the","Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s body?” Song Shuhang lightly coughed and concluded.","“That’s right,” Senior White nodded.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up. “Then, I only need to spray your fresh blood on the","Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and destroy it?”","“That could work, provided that you actually have a way to lure the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball to the Netherworld Realm. Otherwise, before you can use my blood to spray the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, you will be struck to death by the heavenly punishment of the present world,” Senior White Two said indifferently.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“In addition, this is also the reason why I called you over. I need your help to do two things. First, contact that Senior White in the main world and ask him to provide some blood to sprinkle on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball to see if it works,” Senior White Two said.","“So that’s the case. If Senior White’s blood is also lethal to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, does that mean that this function is due to the identity of ‘White’? I’ll immediately contact Senior White,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Senior White also had the raw materials for the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, so he could directly carry out this experiment.","If this plan really worked, then Senior White would be the ultimate counter to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball!","Song Shuhang used the private chat function of the ‘cultivation’ chat as quickly as he could to tell Senior White Two about his speculation.","Next, he would have to wait for the results of Senior White’s experiment!","“What’s the second thing?” Song Shuhang raised his head and asked.","Senior White Two also fed the strand of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball on Tyrannical Song’s boots two more spirit stones and allowed it to regrow its consumed body.","“The second thing is that you need to open the sealing pillar. I’ve studied it before. There’s a pseudo undying bone inside this sealing pillar. It’s the source of the sealing pillar. It was made from the Fat Ball’s own raw materials. It could be regarded as the Fat Ball’s ‘blood’. I need to see if the Fat Ball’s ‘blood’ will have any effect on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, ” Senior White Two speculated.","Before summoning Song Shuhang to help, he had also let the hamster and gorilla try their blood, but it didn’t work.","In other words, the Heavenly Dao Relic was afraid of his blood either because of his identity as the ruler of the Netherworld or because of the Heavenly Dao White.","Therefore, apart from letting ‘White of the Present World’ do the experiment, he also wanted to use ‘Fatty Ball’ who was also a ruler of the Netherworld","Realm.","Moreover, with the relationship between the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and the","Fat Ball, perhaps something more interesting would happen when the two came into contact?","“I understand,” Song Shuhang said with a nod.","He stretched out his hand and pressed it on the sealing pillar to cast several rounds of the Sword Nurturing Technique.","The sealing pillar emitted a joyful treasure light.","Song Shuhang took the opportunity to pass on the idea of opening a back door to the sealing pillar.","With the enhancement in affinity between Song Shuhang and the sealing pillar as a result of the Sword Nurturing Technique that Senior White Two had obtained, the sealing pillar’s favorable impression of him had grown even stronger.","He gave an order, and a small door opened on the sealing pillar.","Beside him, Senior White Two stretched out his slender fingers and pinched the Heavenly Dao Relic. It split in half.","Then, he flicked half of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball into the sealing pillar.","The back door of the sealing pillar closed.","After the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was thrown into the sealing pillar, it let out a soft cry.","After that, it stopped completely and lost its vitality, as if it had really died.","“The bone didn’t react?” Senior White Two said in disappointment.","“However, the sealing pillar seems to be able to make it lose its vitality!” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","He pressed his hands on the sealing pillar and started to use the Sword Nurturing Technique again.","I hope it’s not too late!","This was because he saw many cultivators stepping into space and facing the slowly descending Heavenly Dao Molt Ball through the images transmitted back by the virtuous lamia’s eyes.","These cultivators came from various cultivation systems, such as Daoism, Confucianism, Buddhism, witchcraft, Holy Light, and witchcraft.","Most cultivators were proactive!"]},{"number":2313,"title":"Chapter 2313: Right or Wrong?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2313: Right or Wrong?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Perhaps the cultivators were not charming enough, but the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ continued its descent steadily while remaining unperturbed by them. It descended at its own pace with unwavering determination.","At this stage, the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ displayed a heart-wrenching obsession with its target. Even after losing ‘Tyrannical Song’s Battle Boots’, it remained fixated solely on Song Shuhang.","Faced against this colossal liquid metal sphere, most of the cultivators from the modern world and Earth dared not approach too closely. Those with lower cultivation levels felt as though their bodies might crumble and shatter if they got too close. The robust physique of these cultivators seemed as fragile as ordinary porcelain.","Getting any closer caused even their spiritual energy, holy light, and wizardry to run amok.","All this was happening even though the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ was being influenced by the laws of the modern world and had been suppressed accordingly.","If the nomological suppression on the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ were to completely disappear, it wouldn’t need to take any action. As it descended, the attribute of ‘destroying all things’ would spread outward from its center and cause apocalyptic destruction.","Even on a relatively large planet, it would only need to roll across it a few times to achieve world-ending devastation.","“Let’s figure out how to slow it down first, and ideally, we can block its descent,” suggested a Buddhist Supremacy with a resolute tone.","Following this, a massive lotus throne materialized with the Buddhist Supremacy at its center. This was the power of a Seventh Stage Venerable—an illusion turned into reality.","This illusion was an incredibly potent ability for cultivators. According to Senior Three-Eyed, theoretically, it shouldn’t be something a Seventh Stage Venerable could control. It transformed illusions into reality and created an illusory world unique to the Seventh Stage Venerable. The larger their heart, the larger the world they could create. This was a way to turn the void into reality.","In the Seventh Stage Venerable’s illusion, even if the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball descended several kilometers or tens of kilometers, it might only move forward by one or two centimeters once the illusion was dispelled.","The Buddhist Supremacy initiated his illusion and created a realm known as the Lotus Platform Buddhist Kingdom, which enveloped the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball within it.","Behind him, two Supremacies stood ready to take over once the first Supremacy’s illusion was exhausted.","Further back, a group of Fifth Stage cultivators held shields radiating ‘holy light.’ These were combined magical treasures. However, they were ordinary combined magical treasures, not genuine magical treasures. This magical treasure set was called Mountain Paradise. When all the shields were activated, they could project the shadow of Mountain Paradise to resist the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Although it was a holy light-type treasure, cultivators from various factions, including Daoists, Buddhists, and scholars, could just barely activate and use it.","The Mountain Paradise was backed up by magical battleships and ancient cultivation immortal boats. These ships adjusted their cannons and locked onto the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, ready to provide support when needed.","Following that, sorcery practitioners began casting various strengthening spells on the cultivators at the front.","The methods and spells employed by these cultivators were diverse and dazzling.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song watched the battlefield through the virtuous lamia’s eye. He couldn’t help but feel envious. When would he reach such a level and possess so many spells, divine arts, magic tools, and divine weapons at his disposal?","With that thought in mind, his hands, hair, and arms moved even faster on the sealing pillar.","Four minutes later.","The illusion created by the Buddhist Supremacy shattered. His face paled, and veins bulged on his forehead. The illusion proved to be an effective way to delay the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball,’ but it shattered much faster than anyone had expected.","“I’m taking over,” announced a Daoist Supremacy as he stepped forward to assume control.","Venerable Xi Chong of the Buddhist Sect nodded and communicated through mental transmission, “It’s in your hands now, my dear black-bellied Venerable.”","The Daoist Supremacy couldn’t help but feel speechless. Who was the real black-bellied one here? Not only were the Buddhists black-bellied, but their belly buttons seemed to be too!","Nonetheless, there was no time to waste, and the black-bellied Venerable quickly took over the position previously held by Venerable Xi Chong. He unleashed his illusion and enveloped the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball once more.","“I hope this black-bellied Venerable can hold on a little longer,” Venerable Xi Chong muttered as he swallowed a pill. His tone was tinged with regret.","The Holy Light Venerable nodded in agreement.","“By the way, if we allow this metal ball to continue descending, where will it land on Earth?” the Holy Light Venerable suddenly asked.","“It should land near China, but I can’t pinpoint the exact location,” replied Venerable Xi Chong. He secretly hoped it wouldn’t land anywhere near his cave abode.","“As for China, I recall that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song resides in the Jiangnan region, right? Has Profound Sage Tyrannical Song arrived yet?” The Holy Light Venerable inquired mentally.","This was primarily due to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s recent surge in popularity. Mention China, and cultivators from all over the universe would instantly think of him. Even the charismatic Sage Monarch White paled in comparison to Tyrannical Song’s current fame, thanks to his frequent television appearances.","Venerable Xi Chong shook his head and replied, “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is an enigmatic figure. He even appeared on the moon not long ago, and for some reason, the universe ‘forgot’ about him. It was only a few days ago that he regained recognition. A being of his caliber can traverse the world with ease, thanks to Spatial Energy.”","“Unfortunately, Sage Monarch Winter Melon is still talking about him,” the Holy Light Venerable sighed.","“Is Sage Monarch Winter Melon present?” Xi Chong Venerable’s eyes brightened.","Due to the lack of time, only the three of them, the most formidable cultivators present, had ventured into space. If a Saint Monarch were to join them in defense, they would feel much more confident.","“Sage Monarch Winter Melon will be here shortly,” the Holy Light Venerable assured.","Boom!","The black-bellied Venerable’s ability to hold on proved longer than Venerable Xi Chong’s. However, it lasted only about six minutes before his illusion was shattered.","“I’m taking over!” The Holy Light Venerable rushed forward and immediately activated his illusion.","“This is bad. I sense that this metal ball is becoming more and more agile,” the black-bellied Venerable noted. His voice tinged with concern as he swallowed several pills. He felt that when he swept the metal ball into his illusion, it had become more agile. It was as if the metal ball was using his illusion to recover.","Perhaps using illusions to deal with it hadn’t been the best choice.."]},{"number":2314,"title":"Chapter 2314: Unexpected Experimental Results","paragraphs":["Chapter 2314: Unexpected Experimental Results","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As expected, the illusion of the Holy Light Venerable lasted even longer.","It actually persisted for a full ten minutes and was still going strong... It seemed like he could hold on for even longer.","“Am I really this weak?” Venerable Xichong began to doubt himself. He had taken the lead because his illusion was the most powerful among the three Venerables. However, he ended up lasting the shortest time.","“No, there’s definitely something wrong here. End the ilussion. That strange ball is using our illusions to adapt to the laws of the present world!”","While he was speaking the illusion shattered.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball emerged from the illusion. Although it was still chubby, it now appeared more agile.","The venerable was sent flying backward as if he had been hit by a truck. He had clearly suffered a significant setback within the illusion.","The black-bellied Venerable quickly reached out to catch him.","“Black-bellied Venerable... be careful... Ball,” he transmitted with a trembling voice.","The black-bellied Venerable was left momentarily speechless.","In mid-air, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball descended at a considerably faster pace now. It eschewed any special skills and simply used its body to plummet.","“Prepare for impact!” Venerable Xichong shouted via group voice transmission. The group of Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperors below hoisted their shields high.","The Mountain Paradise braced for the collision.","The immortal vessels and magic warships on both sides locked onto the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. The cannons, primed and ready, began bombarding it.","Boom!","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball slammed into Mountain Paradise, and a muffled sound reverberated in everyone’s minds. It wasn’t a tangible sound but rather a mental assault.","Mountain Paradise boasted formidable defenses. The more in sync the shield-wielding cultivators were, the stronger its protective capabilities.","Conversely, discord among the Fifth Stage cultivators weakened Mountain Paradise’s defenses.","Under the mental assault from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, the Fifth Stage cultivator manning the shields felt as if water had infiltrated their minds. Their heads grew heavy, and they could even hear the sound of flowing water when they shook their heads.","In an instant, the cohesion among the Fifth Stage cultivators was disrupted.","Mountain Paradise wavered.","The cannon barrage from the immortal vessels on both sides proved as effective as a drizzle against the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. Although it was dense, it was futile.","Even though it was still under the influence of the Heavenly Dao laws of the present world, its strength remained intact.","To harm it even slightly, one would need power at least at the Eighth or Ninth Stage. To pose a genuine threat, one would need something akin to a ‘Krypton Gold Strike.’","“Mountain Paradise is about to collapse,” the black-bellied Venerable mentally projected.","“Don’t panic,” Venerable Xichong called out simultaneously. “The Lotus Demon-Subduing Scroll behind you is up next.”","Similar to Mountain Paradise, the Demon-Slaying Lotus Scroll was a magical item used collectively by many. However, it wasn’t a combined magical treasure but a large scroll. Several Fifth Stage Buddhist cultivators positioned themselves to activate the power of the scroll.","At the same time, Venerable Xi Chong extended his hand and produced a small golden staff. It landed on the Lotus Demon-Subduing Scroll and became the epicenter of the formation.","“Sage Monarch Winter Melon is here!” An excited voice called out.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon had challenged Profound Sage Tyrannical Song three times. Although he was a newly minted Profound Sage, his defense was extraordinarily robust. Even Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had commended Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s defensive capabilities.","A towering golden figure emerged from the void.","It was a giant formed from Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s virtue light.","After the giant’s appearance, it extended its arm to block the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Virtue light was an incredibly versatile power. Regardless of the type of adversary it confronted, it seemed to be effective.","With the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball in tow, Sage Monarch Winter Melon retrieved his life-bound magical treasure and began constructing layers of defensive formations.","Indeed, he was a specialist in defense.","In a short span, Sage Monarch Winter Melon had established twelve defensive layers.","The descent of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball slowed once again.","In terms of defense, Sage Monarch Winter Melon was undeniably dependable.","Upon witnessing Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s arrival, Song Shuhang breathed a silent sigh of relief.","At the same time, Senior White’s response came through to his mind.","“It’s working. I’m attempting to conduct experiments on the Heavenly Dao","Molt Ball using the blood of Fellow Daoist Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue,","Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly, Fairy Skylark, and myself. Among them, Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly’s blood has minimal effect, while Fellow Daoist Seventh","Cultivator of True Virtue’s blood is slightly more potent. As for my blood and","Fairy Skylark’s blood, they inflicted the most damage on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.”","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","Not only Senior White, but the blood of the other three seniors had also inflicted damage on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball?","Could it be that the blood of all cultivators in the current world had an effect?","Song Shuhang quickly raised his head and addressed Senior White Two. “Senior White Two... I got a reply!”","Senior White Two raised an eyebrow.","“Senior White performed some experiments on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s body, and the blood of the four seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One","Group, including Senior White, caused some damage to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, ” Song Shuhang quickly conveyed.","“The blood of all four individuals caused damage to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball?” Senior White Two was taken aback.","This result exceeded his expectations.","Could it be that the source of damage to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball wasn’t Senior White’s identity as the ruler of the Netherworld or Heavenly Dao White?","Contemplating this, Senior White Two fed two spirit stones to Tyrannical Song’s boots, which were in contact with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Then, he said to Song Shuhang, “Shuhang, try dripping your blood.”","“That’s exactly what I was thinking. Senior White, you and I are on the same page!” Song Shuhang chuckled and retrieved the Sage Ape Master’s Sharp Sword from the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure, then lightly cut his finger.","Sparks flew between his fingers.","A white scratch appeared between Song Shuhang’s fingers, but no blood flowed.","Senior White Two was rendered speechless.","Song Shuhang, on the other hand, wore a puzzled expression. “Since when did my defenses become so strong? Haven’t I reached this level in my body tempering technique?”","Senior White Two observed closely and then replied, “It’s that sealing pillar. The seven-colored radiance enveloping you is silently bestowing you with a strengthening aura.”","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","That sealing pillar was indeed something special. He extended his hand toward it and performed twenty consecutive Saber Nurturing Techniques.","The radiance surrounding the sealing pillar grew even more brilliant. It emitted a pleased hum as if it was enjoying itself. “As expected of an evil technique,” the hamster muttered.","Senior White Two remained speechless.","Song Shuhang retreated from the area covered by the sealing pillar’s aura and once again lightly cut his finger with the sharp sword to create a shallow wound.","A drop of blood fell onto the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball within Tyrannical Song’s boots.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s body did indeed sustain damage.","However, compared to the blood of Senior White Two, the damage caused by Song Shuhang’s blood was minimal.."]},{"number":2315,"title":"Chapter 2315: I’ll Believe You","paragraphs":["Chapter 2315: I’ll Believe You","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“How did that work?” Senior White Two blinked in surprise.","This was the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, after all. It was closely related to the concept of the Heavenly Dao, yet it couldn’t withstand even a drop of Song Shuhang’s blood.","Moreover, based on the experiments in the modern world, it seemed that the blood of any cultivator had an effect on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","The aura of grandeur surrounding the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball dissipated instantly.","“If the blood of any cultivator is effective against the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, why don’t everyone donate some blood and splashes it on its face?” Song Shuhang pondered.","“It can’t be that simple. If the blood of all cultivators is effective against the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, that would be ridiculous. Is there anything special about the three human cultivators?” Senior White Two inquired.","“Senior White conducted experiments with Senior Skylark from the Xuan Nu","Sect, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, and Senior Seventh Cultivator of True","Virtue. If we’re talking about something special...” Song Shuhang began, “Senior Skylark is the owner of the Bone of Eternity. Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was once the wielder of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. I can’t recall what’s special about Senior Spirit Butterfly.”","“Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly is Soft Feather’s father, right?” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword asked.","“Yes,” Song Shuhang confirmed.","“I believe Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly must be quite special to have fathered a daughter like Soft Feather,” Scarlet Heaven Sword commented in a deep tone. It felt the need to defend the black-skinned Soft Feather’s honor.","After all, if everyone else was special and Soft Feather’s father was ordinary, how embarrassing would that be for Soft Feather?","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Senior White speculated further, “Perhaps it’s the blood of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage or higher, or the blood of a cultivator with special abilities, that has an effect on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. The specifics require further experimentation to verify.”","Furthermore, there might be a prerequisite—the blood donor had to be a living being of the current world, not a denizen of the Netherworld. Even the blood of the gorilla general, once a living creature of the present world but now transformed into a Netherworld creature, proved useless.","“Then I’ll go find a few fellow Daoists and seniors to give it a try,” Song Shuhang said.","As they discussed this, the situation in space suddenly shifted.","Through the eyes of the virtuous lamia, Song Shuhang witnessed the Heavenly Dao Relic Molt Ball, previously descending vertically, suddenly alter its course.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s defensive measures were extremely reliable, stacked one upon another. The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, suppressed by the laws of the present world, struggled to break through.","Even when the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball managed to breach one layer of defense, Sage Monarch Winter Melon would reinforce it with two or three more layers.","The defensive expert lived up to his reputation.","However, before anyone could celebrate, a pair of enormous wings suddenly extended from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon was left dumbfounded.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball flapped its wings and took flight with agility.","It circled around and evaded Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s layered defenses while altering its trajectory to continue its descent.","“Just as I suspected, this fellow must have employed some unknown method to become even more agile after experiencing the illusions,” the black-bellied Venerable gnashed his teeth.","“Fellow Daoist Winter Melon, spray it with blood!” Song Shuhang’s voice echoed in Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s mind.","The voice of Song Shuhang had been conveyed to Sage Monarch Winter Melon through the virtuous lamia.","“Tyrannical Song?” Sage Monarch Winter Melon was taken aback.","The voice was unmistakably that of Tyrannical Song!","“Spray it with blood!” Sage Monarch Winter Melon spread the word.","He charged forward and pursued the Heavenly Dao Relic Molt Ball. He expelled a mouthful of blood toward it.","Spitting out blood was a basic technique for high-level cultivators. After all, many desperate spells and talismans required a spurt of blood essence.","Upon hearing Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s voice transmission, a large group of cultivators chased after the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. They expelled their blood at the ball from the closest distance they could withstand.","The scene was surreal and grotesque.","A massive, winged ball led the way.","A large group of cultivators behind it expelled what appeared to be liquid, but was actually fresh blood.","The blood took on various forms—arrows, pillars, threads, or webs, each displaying their unique abilities.","Each mouthful of blood contained spiritual power. It congealed in space and shot forward.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s posterior, as inferred from the position of its wings, was stained red with blood.","The scene was incredibly bizarre.","Song Shuhang struggled to put it into words.","The outcome was soon revealed, however.","There was no effect!","Be it the blood of the Eighth-Stage Sage, Sage Monarch Winter Melon, or the blood of the various elemental cultivators present, none had any effect on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","In fact, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball flew even faster after being showered with blood.","In the blink of an eye, it crashed into the atmosphere.","As it descended, it adjusted its landing trajectory several times. Its destination was the Jiangnan region of China.","These were the last coordinates it had locked onto before losing the boots.","Unable to lock onto Song Shuhang’s coordinates any longer, it headed straight for this area.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon was frustrated and muttered, “Tyrannical Song, what was that about?”","“Wait... the landing coordinates for the sphere are in the Jiangnan region, which is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s dojo!” the black-bellied Venerable suddenly exclaimed.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon was stunned upon hearing this. “Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song wanted me to spit blood at the ball to mark it and lead it to his own dojo?”","Considering Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s enigmatic nature, it might just be possible!","In the world of the Black Lotus, Song Shuhang was pondering his next move.","“It’s futile. The blood of ordinary cultivators and Profound Sages has no effect on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball,” Song Shuhang urgently exclaimed as he desperately applied the Saber Nurturing Technique to the sealing pillar.","By now, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had already touched down in the Jiangnan region.","Time was of the essence.","“As expected... both you and the three human cultivators are special,” Senior White Two commented.","“Shuhang, are you in the Jiangnan region? I’ll transfer my blood and Fairy Skylark’s blood to you,” Senior White’s voice sounded in his mind.","Senior White’s reinforcements couldn’t have come at a better time.","“I’ll have Fairy Creation receive it in the Jiangnan region!” Song Shuhang swiftly replied.","Simultaneously, he extended his hand toward Senior White Two and said,","“Senior White, let me touch you!”","Senior White Two stared at him dumbfoundedly.","Song Shuhang did his best to raise his arm and make contact with Senior White Two’s arm.","In the next moment, hundreds of wounds erupted across his body, and blood gushed forth—the result of the secret appraisal technique.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood on end as she collected all of Song Shuhang’s blood.","“I’ll have to trouble you,” Song Shuhang said weakly. Meanwhile, the radiance of the Saber Nurturing Technique showed no sign of abating.","“Leave it to me. I’ll deliver your blood to Fairy Creation,” Pavilion Master Chu replied.","As long as the blood of Senior White, Senior Skylark, and Song Shuhang proved effective against the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, they could at least delay it for a while in the Jiangnan region.."]},{"number":2316,"title":"Chapter 2316: The Pendant Has Arrived. Will the Main Body Follow?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Above the Jiangnan region, a colossal liquid metal sphere with wings descended from the sky and cast a vast shadow over the area.","Over twenty cultivators from various traditions who resided in the Jiangnan region raised their heads and gazed up at the sky. Ever since they learned that the Jiangnan region was the training ground of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, some wandering cultivators and practitioners had relocated here. As a result, over twenty cultivators were now gathered in the Jiangnan area.","However, the cultivation levels of these twenty individuals were not particularly high. Faced with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball descending from the sky, most of them struggled even to remain standing in the face of the overwhelming aura emanating from the ball.","“What on earth is that?” A wandering cultivator leaned against a wall while staring at the slowly descending sphere with a sense of despair.","Even without launching an attack, the aura emanating from this colossal sphere was enough to cause the world to crumble. The sky seemed to distort around it with the sphere at its center.","While ordinary people couldn’t see the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, they felt a sense of gloominess and mild oppression in the sky. As long as the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball didn’t descend to the danger line, the impact on regular folks would remain relatively minimal.","In a hospital near Jiangnan College Town, Joseph stood beside his wife’s hospital bed while peeling an apple. Suddenly, he looked out of the window with a serious expression. Although he hadn’t opened his Eye Aperture yet, he could vaguely discern a shadow looming in the sky—the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","“What’s going on?” His wife inquired.","Joseph nodded with a faint smile on his face. He handed the peeled apple to his wife. “I need to make a call.’","“Sure,” his wife replied with a smile.","Joseph stepped out of the ward and swiftly dialed Song Shuhang’s number. This time, there was no signal interference.","“Hello, who’s this?” Song Shuhang’s voice came from the other end of the line.","Joseph was momentarily speechless.","“Uh, what’s going on?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Master, there seems to be a highly unsettling presence in the sky above Jiangnan College Town,” Joseph whispered. “I can’t see what it is, but it’s likely the same kind of threat we faced last time. Master, are you in Jiangnan College Town!”","Joseph seemed to equate the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball with the same type of menace they had encountered previously.","“Don’t worry, I’m aware of the situation. Leave it to me,” Song Shuhang reassured him.","Joseph heaved a sigh of relief.","Since the incident with the evil spirits, Joseph had developed a deep trust in his master’s Chinese martial arts prowess. When it came to dealing with supernatural phenomena, Chinese martial arts seemed almost omnipotent in his eyes.","After ending the call with Song Shuhang, Joseph returned to the ward with a smile.","“Is the issue resolved?” his wife asked.","Joseph paused for a moment, then nodded. “Master said he’ll personally handle it, so it should be fine.’","“Master? Is this related to what Snowy said?” His wife leaned against the bed while nibbling on an apple. She didn’t dwell on the matter.","Meanwhile, back in the sky, the cultivators were flustered.","“This is bad. If we keep descending like this, we’ll reach the danger zone,” Sage","Monarch Winter Melon said as he desperately chased the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. However, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had become incredibly agile while continuously evading Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s attempts to intercept it.","“Senior, do you have any other tricks up your sleeve? Time is running out. Evacuating the people in Jiangnan College Town is impractical,” the black-bellied Venerable said through gritted teeth.","“If only Venerable Tornado were here. His spatial cutting treasure might have been useful,” another cultivator lamented.","“Is there anyone who can contact Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?” Sage Monarch Winter Melon shouted.","All the cultivators shook their heads.","Suddenly, a spatial gate opened beside the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and captured everyone’s attention.","Their eyes widened in anticipation.","“Look at the size and brightness of that spatial gate. Has a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender come to assist?” one cultivator mused.","A tiny foot emerged from the spatial gate.","Fairy Creation stepped forth with two large buckets in her hands.","“Eh? It’s Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s pendant fairy!” a Venerable recognized her immediately.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had often brought two pendant fairies to various public events.","One pendant was the embodiment of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s virtue’s light. She had revealed her divinity on previous occasions, so everyone was familiar with her.","The other was Fairy Creation, a studious fairy.","Seeing Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s pendant fairy, the cultivators speculated if his true body was nearby.","Fairy Creation began to sing with a lilting voice. She threw the two buckets toward the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Instinctively, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball tried to evade the incoming buckets.","But no matter how it maneuvered, it couldn’t escape the inevitable.","When Fairy Creation hurled those two buckets, the outcome was already predetermined.","“Ball! Dummy!” Fairy Creation exclaimed smugly. An eye on top of her head emitted an aura that made cultivators from all over the universe feel a pang of nausea.","Under the calculation of the Scholarly Sage’s eye, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, despite being suppressed by the laws of the Heavenly Dao, couldn’t hide its movements.","“Stupid!” Fairy Creation added.","The two wooden buckets exploded upon impact. The red blood within splattered all over the Heavenly Dao Relic Molt Ball.","One bucket contained the blood of Senior White and Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark, with the majority being Skylark’s. She had been quite generous when donating her blood.","The other bucket held Song Shuhang’s blood. He had contributed a significant amount.","Hissing sounds emanated from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball as white smoke rose from its body. Upon contact with the three types of blood, its form began to vaporize continuously.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon and the other cultivators were left speechless.","Though it was still fresh blood, the lethality of these two buckets was astonishing.","“What kind of blood is this? What vintage is it? Where is it from?” echoed in the minds of all the cultivators.","Sizzle.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball let out a cry of agony. Its body continued to shrink. It no longer descended; it simply hovered in midair.","“It stopped!” Sage Monarch Winter Melon exclaimed softly.","They had achieved stability, or at least they had stabilized the massive ball.","Sizzle. The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball emitted scorching sounds.","Finally, a layer of ‘outer shell’-like material peeled away from its body. This shell, infused with an aura of destruction, carried away the remaining blood as it fell to the ground.."]},{"number":2317,"title":"Chapter 2317: Indebted!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Sage Monarch Winter Melon couldn’t believe his eyes as he witnessed the unfolding scene. With a thunderous roar, he charged toward the falling ‘shell.’","It wasn’t the sight of blood on the shell that bothered him. Rather, it was the lingering aura of ‘destruction’ still attached to it. If it were to crash into the city below, the consequences would be nothing short of catastrophic.","The massive shell fragmented into various-sized pieces during its descent.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon swiftly closed the distance to the falling shell.","His virtuous giant extended its colossal hands and made a desperate attempt to grasp the bloodstained shells.","Pieces of the outer shell, both large and small, came to rest in the palm of the virtuous giant. Even if there were any missing fragments, they were likely minuscule bits obliterated by the blood during the fall.","“Seal!” Sage Monarch Winter Melon activated several seals in succession and imprisoned the shells within the grasp of the virtuous giant.","Inside the sealed enchantment, the outer shell of the sphere continued to corrode under the influence of the blood... Until it eventually vanished.","“This blood is truly formidable. Regrettably, there isn’t enough of it,” Sage Monarch Winter Melon mumbled softly.","He released the seals, and the blood and the shell met their end together. Sage Monarch Winter Melon faintly sensed that his virtuous giant had grown a bit stronger!","The energy generated as the blood and the shell perished together seemed to enhance the power of virtue.","“If only the owner of this blood could release more of it,” Sage Monarch Winter Melon sighed wistfully.","Upon hearing this, Fairy Creation cast a sidelong glance at Sage Monarch Winter Melon from a distance.","She tilted her head while trying to recall Song Shuhang’s condition. If she could coax a bit more blood from Song Shuhang, he wouldn’t die, right?","“The sphere has temporarily stabilized... But somehow, it feels even more perilous,” a Venerable frowned.","He and the other two Venerables took advantage of the momentary pause in the ‘sphere’s movement to erect various sealing barriers around it. At the very least, they could delay the sphere when it resumed its activity.","“Black-Belly, you sense it too, right?”","The black-bellied Venerable found himself unable to disagree and silently nodded.","Fairy Creation stood by silently. She was responsible for transmitting the live broadcast to Song Shuhang this time.","As time ticked away and the sun began to set, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball finally underwent a transformation.","Its shape began to shift.","A ‘drill’ emerged from the bottom of the sphere, and the sphere began to retract.","In a matter of moments, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball transformed into a slender drill, which commenced spinning. The advantage of its liquid form was evident. It could change its shape at will. It could become thin or thick, long or short.","“Fairy, where’s Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?” Sage Monarch Winter Melon fortified his defenses and called out to Fairy Creation.","Fairy Creation tilted her head while giving him a wink in response. “Please, Tyrannical Song... Ah!” Sage Monarch Winter Melon hadn’t even completed his sentence before he let out a wretched cry.","The drill formed by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball punctured through all the painstakingly laid barriers of the cultivators almost instantaneously and ruthlessly assaulted Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s defenses.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon’s layered defenses crumbled upon contact.","It wasn’t a question of the strength of his defenses. The gap between him and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was simply too vast and further exacerbated by the difference in their realms.","Fairy Creation moved swiftly and landed beside Sage Monarch Winter Melon. With a wave of her hand, she pulled him to safety.","At the same time, she used her finger as a brush to draw scholarly runes in the air. One by one, these runes formed a barrier that barely withstood the assault of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s drill, if only for a moment.","Seizing this precious moment, Fairy Creation successfully rescued Profound Sage Winter Melon.","“Has Profound Sage Tyrannical Song not arrived yet?” Sage Monarch Winter Melon inquired.","Fairy Creation reached for a wooden sword hanging from her waist.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon raised an eyebrow. “Huh?”","“Yes,” Fairy Creation confirmed as she grasped the wooden sword and nodded.","She then hurled the wooden sword towards the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball with a controlled sword technique.","This wooden sword wasn’t an ordinary Sage-Sealed Wooden Saber, but a special model that Song Shuhang had asked Senior White Two to reinforce.","Originally a saber, Senior White Two’s strengthening had transformed it into a sword.","In a flash of swordlight, the Sage-sealed Wooden Sword ruthlessly impaled the Heavenly Dao Molt Drill.","Crack!","Half of the wooden sword embedded itself into the body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Drill. This sword, personally enhanced by the Ruler of the Netherworld, possessed the might of a divine weapon!","The Heavenly Dao Molt Drill winced in pain and thrashed about wildly.","A surge of collapse and chaos emanated from its body which exploded like a bomb.","All cultivators below the Sixth Stage Realm in the air were affected by the wave of chaos and lost their ability to ‘walk in the air. They started tumbling from the sky.","Simultaneously, among the ordinary people on the ground, a group of individuals also fell victim to the chaos. Those who resided on the 30th floor or higher happened to be within the range of the chaotic aura.","Disturbed, the ordinary people clutched their heads and huddled on the ground. They felt as though an earthquake were imminent.","Screams and cries filled the skies above the cities in the Jiangnan area.","Fairy Creation observed the unfolding events calmly. She had done everything within her power.","With her strength yet to fully recover, she felt powerless in the face of the current situation.","Within the Inner World, Song Shuhang fought a battle of his own.","“Sealing pillar! ” Song Shuhang ground his teeth while diligently practicing the Saber Nurturing Technique. However, the favorability of the sealing pillar was still slightly short of the mark. It would take at least half a day to build up this favorability further.","Half a day later, the temperature in the Jiangnan area had cooled considerably.","Time was running out.","Senior White’s research clone had already emerged from the sealing pillar while holding Tyrannical Song’s battle boots. He stood to the side.","Senior White Two perched on the tip of the sealing pillar and rested his chin on his hand as he gazed at Song Shuhang.","He wanted to see Song Shuhang resolve this matter on his own.","However, just as a precaution, his ‘projected clone’ had quietly infiltrated the Jiangnan area.","His projected clone didn’t intend to assist Song Shuhang with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball but was stationed there to prevent the fat ball from causing any further trouble.","“No, there’s no time... I’ll owe you the rest of the Blade Nurturing Technique for now. I’ll make it up to you when I return, okay?” Song Shuhang called out to the sealing pillar.","The seven-colored light of the sealing pillar flickered slightly. Ultimately, its body levitated on its own.","Though it hadn’t yet birthed a tool spirit, it seemed to agree with Song Shuhang’s proposal.","It consented to defer the remaining Blade Nurturing Technique for now.","“Thank you!” Song Shuhang seized the sealing pillar and, with a thought, leaped back into his Inner World.","Senior White Two lightly hopped off the sealing pillar and landed gracefully on the ground just as Song Shuhang was about to take it away. He couldn’t allow Song Shuhang to bring him into the mortal world, lest it attract heavenly punishment.","“Let’s go!” Song Shuhang clutched the sealing pillar and utilized the Inner World as a launchpad. Then, while using the wooden sword as a point of reference, he initiated a spatial transfer.","A spatial portal opened on the Heavenly Dao Molt Drill.","Song Shuhang’s figure emerged from it.","He brandished the sealing pillar in his hand and swung it towards the Heavenly","Dao Molt Ball.."]},{"number":2318,"title":"Chapter 2318: Using One Man’s Treasure To Stab Himself","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As Song Shuhang emerged from the core world and materialized in the main world, the plummeting Heavenly Dao Molt Ball suddenly came to a jarring halt.","It had detected his presence and was now certain that he was the person it had been tirelessly pursuing. Emitting a peculiar linguistic note from its form, this marked the first time the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had expressed itself with meaningful language since its appearance.","Unfortunately, none of those present could decipher its meaning.","Simultaneously, Song Shuhang, with his two hands and twenty braided arms, seized the sealing pillar of the seven-colored divine artifact and forcefully struck the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","There was no need to question the potency of the sealing pillar—it could imprison even the ruler of the Netherworld for ten millennia. With the exception of its top section, the sealing pillar was equipped with a lightning barrier effect. Anyone not on friendly terms with the pillar, like Song Shuhang, would be met with a fearsome lightning strike upon contact.","Electric arcs surged.","A portion of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s form caved in as the paralyzing effect of the lightning barrier coursed through its body. Lightning erupted from its entire being.","“Profound Sage Tyrannical Song! Senior Tyrannical Song has finally arrived!”","“We’re saved. This city is saved.”","“Keep your eyes on it, make it regret the day it encountered the name Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!”","“I wonder if this colossal ball will give birth to a smaller one?”","“Give it an abortion after it gets pregnant!”","Upon seeing Song Shuhang, a multitude of complex and somewhat bitter sentiments filled the minds of the cultivators trailing behind him.","Regrettably, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song refrained from employing his expertise in identifying the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball—having already done so to no avail.","The paralyzing effect of the lightning barrier appeared to be affecting the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball to some extent.","Frozen mid-air, it crackled with electric discharges.","“This time, we absolutely can’t allow it to unleash that black hole-like skill!” Song Shuhang thought urgently.","Recognizing Song Shuhang’s intentions through their telepathic connection, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet concurred. Upon being wielded by Song Shuhang to strike the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, it sprang from his waist and exerted pressure on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Pavilion Master Chu was swift to respond as well. Her hair stood on end and enveloped the surrounding space with a containment effect.","She had previously witnessed the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s black hole technique and had been the one to transport Song Shuhang into the Inner World when they were caught within the small black room. Consequently, she initiated spatial containment. In the event of any mishap, she could instantly relocate the contained space while transferring the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and Song Shuhang randomly to outer space.","Simultaneously, Fairy Creation took hold of the Scholarly Sage’s Eye and elegantly entered Song Shuhang’s body. Upon entering, she even removed Song Shuhang’s eyes and replaced them with those of the Scholarly Sage—an action with which she was quite familiar.","“Seniors, your cooperation is remarkable!” Song Shuhang exclaimed internally, his current circumstances affording no time for conversation. A single thought prevailed in his mind.","Without delay, his twenty-four hands unleashed twenty-four rounds of the Saber Nurturing Technique upon the sealing pillar.","“Activate, Sealing Pillar!” Song Shuhang telepathically communicated with the sealing pillar.","After absorbing twenty-four rounds of the Blade Nurturing Technique, the base and the lower half of the sealing pillar opened. It now resembled a shovel save for its upper section.","“Retract!” Song Shuhang grasped the sealing pillar and swept it toward the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, constructed from liquid metal, proved ideal for the shovel’s embrace. Half of its form was scooped up with a gentle sweep of the shovel.","“It’s secure!” Song Shuhang’s eyes gleamed.","With all his might, he manipulated the shovel. A mere shake would plunge the entire Heavenly Dao Molt Ball into it.","At that point, the sealing pillar’s structure would close, and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball wouldn’t emerge for at least ten thousand years.","Subsequently, Song Shuhang intended to transport it to the world of the Black Lotus for Senior White Two’s scrutiny—a stroke of genius that might even earn him some rewards.","Perhaps he could learn something new from Senior White Two...","Elsewhere, in the Netherworld Realm, at the precise moment Song Shuhang began dragging the ‘sealing pillar’ into the main world, the fat ball boss, currently refining the dragon-shaped commander’s seal left behind by the Third Wielder of the Will, suddenly froze. Moments later, it scuttled out of its private treasury.","The fat ball had been in the process of refining the dragon-shaped commander’s seal to merge its pseudo-undying bone prototype with the commander’s seal. This union would enable it to directly channel its power into the main world for a designated period during which it could seize the ‘Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’ and fuse with it.","However, at this juncture, it experienced a disconcerting unease.","This disquiet had two sources—one from Bai Youyou and the other from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","“Bai Youyou, what have you done?” The fat ball boss hopped restlessly on the ground.","Its gaze fell upon the dragon-shaped commander’s seal it clutched. Though it had not yet achieved perfection, it had become functional.","Now was not the time for perfection; circumstances demanded immediacy.","With a thought, it opened a spatial rift connecting the Netherworld and Earth’s main world. Simultaneously, it locked onto the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s coordinates and dispatched the empowered dragon-shaped commander’s seal.","The seal manifested as a smoky dragon and roared as it entered the main world. As it crossed the threshold, the smoky dragon morphed once more.","A surge of Netherworld malevolence surged from its form as it transformed into a miniature version of the Netherworld’s ruler—the fat ball. In this configuration, the boss’s power was channeled directly through the dragon-shaped commander’s seal.","Combining the commander’s seal with the incomplete pseudo-undying bone made it possible to briefly conceal the corpulent ball’s aura. Even when entering the main world, it wouldn’t be instantaneously ensnared by Heavenly Dao laws.","As long as it acted swiftly, it could return to the Netherworld before Heavenly Punishment rained down.","When the fat ball boss projected its consciousness into the main world, it witnessed Song Shuhang using the familiar sealing pillar to scoop up half of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","The fat ball boss was flabbergasted.","Why did that sealing pillar look so familiar?","Could it be that it was mistaken due to the sheen of the seven-colored divine artifact?","At that moment, the fat ball boss teetered on the brink of insanity.."]},{"number":2319,"title":"Chapter 2319: Bursting with Fury!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Why is this sealing pillar here?” the fat ball wondered aloud.","“Where’s Bai Youyou? Where was Bai Youyou, who was originally sealed? Why has he disappeared? Logically speaking, this seal should have kept Bai Youyou sealed for at least 5,000 years!","“Why was my sealing pillar transferred to the main world? How was it actually used to deal with my Heavenly Dao Relic body?”","A hundred possibilities and doubts instantly flooded the fat ball’s mind. However, it didn’t have the luxury of time to contemplate them.","If it had been just a moment slower, the entire Heavenly Dao Molt Ball might have been scooped up into the sealing pillar and taken away.","“Stop!!!” the fat ball roared in anger.","Since it was the creator and owner of the sealing pillar, it could control it remotely. A liquid metal arm extended from the fat ball’s body and reached out to grasp the seven-colored sealing pillar in Song Shuhang’s hand from a distance. “Stop! Ahhh!”","But before the fat ball could complete its action, it let out a series of screams.","From its own shadow, a despicable figure suddenly emerged. A dagger made of the Holy Light Element was brutally thrust into its body.","This dagger was clearly no ordinary weapon. It easily pierced through the projection of the fat ball boss.","“Hahahaha, Fellow Daoist Fatty Ball, I’ve been waiting for this moment for so long!” a malicious voice came from behind the fat ball.","The fat ball boss didn’t need to turn around to know who it was—the only person capable of such a despicable act was Bai Youyou.","In fact, the fat ball boss didn’t even have a head to turn.","“Holy Light Dagger, you filthy bastard,” the fat ball boss exclaimed, flustered and infuriated. It had never expected that Bai would use a Holy Light Element weapon to harm it.","It squeezed its body, and a dragon’s roar emanated from within. It activated","the power of the Third Wielder of the Will’s magical treasure, the dragon-shaped commander’s seal. The Holy Light dagger was forcefully ejected, corroded by the fat ball’s Netherworld evil energy and reduced to ashes.","It was a pity that such an exceptional Holy Light Dagger had met such an end.","Senior White Two chuckled while removing his gloves and incinerating them into ashes with the Nine Netherworld Devil Flame.","Then, Senior White Two stretched his arms and stood in front of the fat ball while speaking with an air of righteousness. “With me here, if you want to cross over today, you’ll have to do it over my dead body.”","“If I could step over your corpse, I would have turned it into meat paste long ago!” the fat ball boss nearly went mad.","While Senior White Two and the fat ball confronted each other, Song Shuhang made a decisive move.","In this critical moment, Song Shuhang’s mind remained clear. After rolling up the shovel in his hand, he swiftly activated the Saber Nurturing Technique to reseal the pillar.","The sealing pillar’s body and base merged rapidly—song Shuhang acted swiftly with the understanding that the sealing pillar was the fat ball’s creation.","If the fat ball boss seized the opportunity, it could have taken the sealing pillar and nine-tenths of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball within.","So, Song Shuhang made the immediate decision to close the sealing pillar and swiftly stowed it within his Inner World.","Inside the Inner World, diligent assistants were already prepared. As soon as the sealing pillar entered, it was expedited to the world of the Black Lotus and handed over to Senior White Two’s primary body for safekeeping.","With Senior White Two around, the sealing pillar and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball inside it were absolutely secure.","As for the remaining portion of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball in the main world,","Song Shuhang planned to offer it as another blood sacrifice.","“Bai Youyou,” the fat ball roared.","“Yes, yes, I’m here,” Senior White Two responded cheerfully.","The fat ball boss was so infuriated that it nearly exploded.","“Thank you for the compliment,” Senior White Two accepted the fat ball’s praise without hesitation. As the ruler of the Netherworld, he should be an entity both hated and feared by others.","Senior White Two felt exceedingly delighted watching the fat ball explode in anger. Such moments of pleasure were rare and precious, so one should savor them.","Unfortunately, Senior White Two forgot to record this scene. Otherwise, when the fat ball disappeared in the future, he could relish this pleasure by watching the video.","While Senior White Two and the fat ball confronted each other, Song Shuhang suddenly clenched his teeth and used his hand to touch the remaining body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","He activated the secret appraisal technique. Under Song Shuhang’s deliberate control, the blood loss was still extremely significant. A large amount of","Tyrannical Song’s precious blood sprayed onto the remaining Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Buzz, buzz, buzz—corrosive white smoke billowed from the last portion of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. As it corroded, the white smoke came into contact with Song Shuhang’s body and transformed into the power of virtue.","Seeing that Song Shuhang had dealt a fatal blow to the last part of the","Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, the fat ball’s rationality was on the verge of collapse.","“Bai Youyou, I’ve said it before: whoever makes me unhappy for a moment, I’ll make them unhappy for the rest of their life.” The fat ball’s clone suddenly expanded.","Simultaneously, the fat ball’s will spread out, and a powerful spatial seal extended and instantly froze the surrounding space.","This time, it wasn’t playing games; it was determined to destroy this precious clone.","“Not good, the fat ball is really going to explode,” Senior White Two transmitted his voice to Song Shuhang.","If the fat ball exploded, all the cultivators present and the entire Jiangnan area below would be flattened. In fact, if the Heavenly Dao Law didn’t intervene in time to stop it, the explosion of the fat ball’s clone could be like a real-world map-altering device and wantonly smudge the world map.","“Let’s go!” Senior White Two’s body moved, and he appeared next to Song Shuhang. He picked him up and fled into the distance—As for the other cultivators, they weren’t within the range of the Netherworld ruler’s power, so they could only hope for the best.","Boom- The fat ball’s body exploded.","However, the explosion’s force wasn’t as powerful as Senior White Two had anticipated.","At the moment of the explosion, the dragon-shaped commander’s seal turned into a stream of light and rushed into the remaining Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and scooped it up.","“I was actually tricked by the fat ball. That fat ball is getting craftier,” Senior","White Two remarked.."]},{"number":2320,"title":"Chapter 2320: I’m Tyrannical Song, and I’m Handsome","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I thought the fat ball was really going to explode,” Song Shuhang said as his heart still raced","If the fat ball had truly exploded, it would have had catastrophic consequences for the entire Jiangnan area and the nearby cities, unless the Heavenly Dao intervened immediately.","Also, he couldn’t help but notice that the fat ball’s personality had undergone significant changes over the past few months. If it had been the fat ball that Song Shuhang had encountered initially, it would have been unable to endure such grievances and would have exploded long ago.","“I won’t forget this, Bai Youyou. When we return to the Netherworld Realm, I’ll settle the score with you,” the fat ball’s clone controlled the dragon-shaped commander’s seal and thrust it into the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. It started to assimilate the remaining remnants of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball from within.","Fairy Creation had poured two buckets of blood onto the originally massive","Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and melted it down until only the core remained. Song Shuhang had then used the sealing pillar to scoop away 90% of the body and leave only a pitifully small portion.","“Fat ball, we’re not dating,” Senior White Two waved dismissively, replying,","“Forget about me once you’re back in the Netherworld.”","The fat ball scoffed furiously. “I’ll remember this!”","In the end, it fixed its gaze on Song Shuhang and etched the image of this annoying human deeply into its memory. This little pest, who could have been crushed easily, had unknowingly evolved into a troublesome adversary.","Its rate of growth had exceeded the Fat Ball’s expectations. Therefore, if there was an opportunity, it had to crush him as soon as possible and prevent him from continuing to grow. Otherwise, he might become another Bai Youyou, who would pose a threat in the future.","Just as this thought crossed the fat ball’s clone’s mind, the remaining body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball it had assimilated suddenly trembled with excitement. It resonated with the fat ball and shared the same desires.","The fat ball wanted to eliminate Tyrannical Song, and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had the same target in mind. They began to actively cooperate. Their synchronization rate reached its maximum.","In the next moment, the Fat Ball’s clone and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball completed their assimilation.","However, this kind of assimilation wasn’t what the Fat Ball had in mind. Its clone didn’t directly devour and absorb the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. Instead, it seemed to have entered a state of equal fusion.","Although it might not appear different at first glance, the difference to the fat ball boss was substantial.","“You annoying rat, you’re ruining my plans again!” the fat ball gnashed its teeth at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang pointed at himself with a dumbfounded expression. What had he done? Could it be that he inadvertently caused some damage to the fat ball just now?","“You just stood there and attacked the big boss? How did you do that?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked in astonishment.","“Maybe the fat ball is referring to me sealing most of the Heavenly Dao’s metamorphosis?” Song Shuhang suggested.","“Alright...” Senior White Two said, “The synchronization between me and my main body has been completed. Stand back; I’ll leave this clone of the fat ball here!”","With a push, Senior White Two moved Song Shuhang aside and drew a pitch-black sword. Whatever the fat ball wanted to do, Senior White Two only needed to focus on destroying it.","“Senior White, should we change the battlefield?” Song Shuhang quickly reminded him.","They were currently in the sky above the Jiangnan area, and the two Netherworld ruler clones were battling. If they weren’t careful, the ordinary world below could be destroyed.","“I’m the ruler of the Netherworld,” Senior White sighed, but he still wielded his sword and prepared to send the merged form of the fat ball and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball into outer space.","“Bai Youyou... You would still try to provoke me today? I’ll blow up your clone today and deprive you of the means to enter the main world,” the fat ball declared as its new body transformed into a massive space war fortress with countless cannons locking onto Senior White Two.","“Bring it on, if you can’t beat me today, I’ll beat you to death. Whoever flees is a paramecium,” Senior White Two challenged it.","The sword’s brilliance soared, but it wasn’t a sharp slash; instead, it emitted a repulsive force.","The space war fortress that the fat ball had become was sent hurtling into space by the repulsive force.","“Paramecium, where are you going?” Senior White Two laughed as he pursued it.","The fat ball was too furious to even speak.","Am I fleeing? You swatted me away like a baseball bat!","In its anger, the fat ball unleashed a relentless barrage of attacks.","Within the giant fat ball fortress, thousands of cannons locked onto Senior White Two and the firepower rained down like a storm.","The entire scene was filled with artillery fire, and each strike had the potential to obliterate the world.","“Everyone, retreat!” Sage Monarch Winter Melon shouted.","Even an Eighth Stage Profound Sage would risk severe injury or death from such an attack. Even with his formidable defense, Sage Monarch Winter Melon was uncertain if he could survive an attack at full strength. Moreover, the sky was swarming with firepower.","All the cultivators present had no choice but to flee for their lives. At this moment, resisting was futile; it would only lead to certain death.","Just then, Senior White Two’s sword light traced a circle, and the black sword radiance transformed into a ring.","Senior White Two’s sword light intercepted the torrent of attacks from the giant fat ball fortress.","However, the shockwaves from the clash between the two Netherworld ruler avatars penetrated the sword ring and cascaded downward.","These shockwaves were still deadly to the cultivators below!","Sage Monarch Winter Melon immediately activated his most robust defense, the ‘Iron Fortress,’ to withstand the shockwaves.","Song Shuhang willed it, and two sets of the Combined Magical Treasure flew out of his life-bound spiritual lake, forming two Impregnable Holy Cities. He temporarily released the Eighth Stage seals on the magical treasures, causing the two Holy Cities to expand rapidly.","The two colossal holy cities shielded all the cultivators and the city below.","Song Shuhang’s main body donned a complete set of life-bound magical treasures and crossed his arms in front of his chest, confronting the shockwaves resulting from the battle between the Netherworld rulers.","Under ordinary circumstances, even an Eighth Stage Profound Sage would find it challenging to withstand such violent aftershocks. Yet, Song Shuhang stood firm, resembling a rock amidst raging waves. Only his Jade Rabbit Fairy Cloak billowed in the wind.","To the onlookers, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song appeared incredibly dashing at this moment.."]},{"number":2321,"title":"Chapter 2321: I Got It Wrong, My Last Memorial Day Was on November 27, 2019","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At that moment, the cultivators below were utterly in awe of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","If the cultivation world had a ranking board of its own, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would undoubtedly be among the top three.","Meanwhile, right at the forefront, Song Shuhang found tears nearly welling up in his eyes.","This was all thanks to the timely assistance from fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and his other assistants.","The aftermath of the battle between the Ruler of the Netherworld, albeit one stirred up by the residue of the combat between its avatars, still carried terrifying power. Especially since it was interwoven with the secondary damage from the laws of the Ruler of the Netherworld.","Such harm was more excruciating than physical injuries.","It had been quite a while since Song Shuhang had experienced such intense pain that it brought tears to his eyes.","If it weren’t for the timely protection, he would probably be left with just his head and rely on the foundational principles of the ‘Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique’ to rebuild his body.","Sensing his discomfort, Fairy Creation extended her small hand from the side of Song Shuhang’s helmet and gently wiped away the tears from the corner of his eyes. She didn’t want the cultivators behind him to witness his tears and tarnish his image.","This was one of the benefits of having plenty of accessories.","In the sky, Senior White Two was taking on the attacks from the Fat Ball head-on. After a series of fierce clashes, the space fortress that the Fat Ball had transformed into was hurled into space.","The battle between the two avatars of the Ruler of the Netherworld was capable of annihilating worlds. Once they moved into space, Senior White Two could really let loose.","Gradually, they fought further and further away until they arrived at an unknown planet.","“We’re safe now, ” Sage Monarch Winter Melon said slowly.","“I survived... I seriously thought I was a goner this time,” sighed the cunning Venerable.","Meanwhile, Venerable Xichong from the Buddhist sect secretly formed a hand seal and retrieved a Buddha Bead containing his will. He had thought that he would die for good this time, beyond the reach of even the resurrection array. “This time, it’s all thanks to Senior Tyrannical Song and his friends.”","When it came to Senior Tyrannical Song’s friend, a chill ran down the spines of all the cultivators present.","Although Senior Tyrannical Song’s friend had been smiling and was quite handsome, an unexplainable feeling of terror, death, and violence washed over everyone who laid eyes on him.","In the presence of Senior Tyrannical Song’s friend, none of the cultivators dared to speak too loudly.","Indeed, he was the first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song—or rather, Tribulation Transcender Tyrannical Song. His circle of friends was equally terrifying.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, was that Sage Monarch White just now?” suddenly, a nun from the Holy Light sect asked.","Her question triggered a lightbulb moment among all the cultivators.","After being overwhelmed by the terrifying pressure exerted by Senior Tyrannical Song’s friend, they hadn’t paid much attention to his appearance. They had just registered that he was remarkably handsome.","Now, the Holy Light nun’s question made everyone recall that Tyrannical","Song’s formidable friend bore a striking resemblance to ‘Sage Monarch White’!","However, Tyrannical Song’s formidable friend seemed even more powerful than Sage Monarch White, and their temperaments were notably different.","“Was that Sage Monarch White just now?” Sage Monarch Winter Melon inquired.","Tyrannical Song’s terrifying friend wasn’t Sage Monarch White. Nevertheless, when his name came up, all the cultivators shuddered.","Even though Senior Tyrannical Song’s friend appeared amicable, handsome, and charming, he exuded an aura of terror that none of the cultivators could ignore.","Once Senior Tyrannical Song’s friend appeared, everyone refrained from speaking too loudly.","The Holy Light nun’s question led to further speculation.","“Hey, I heard there was an Earthly Dao treasure that could alter a person’s appearance. Could that be what Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s friend used?” whispered one cultivator.","“That might explain it. His resemblance to Sage Monarch White is just too uncanny,” agreed another.","While these speculations circulated quietly among the cultivators, Song Shuhang, who stood at the forefront, remained focused. His attention remained fixed on the ongoing battle above.","As the aftershocks of the clash between the Netherworld rulers subsided, Song Shuhang did not immediately remove the defenses of the two ‘Holy Cities’ behind him.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon seized this moment to ask, “Senior Tyrannical","Song, is your friend confident in dealing with that fat ball?”","Song Shuhang turned his gaze back to the battlefield above. “In the vast myriad of worlds, there is no one who dares to claim they can handle that Fat Ball boss.”","Senior White Two’s strength was on par with the Fat Ball. However, because the Scholarly Sage had taken a bite out of the Fat Ball, it wasn’t in perfect condition. Consequently, in their countless clashes, the Fat Ball always managed to outmaneuver Senior White Two.","At that moment, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song suddenly launched an attack! With a sudden leap, he ascended into the sky atop the Black Lotus and charged toward the east.","Raising his right hand high, a mysterious rune materialized in his palm.","Crackling sounds of electric arcs filled the air as the power of lightning condensed within Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s hand as it formed a formidable lightning sphere.","Sage Monarch Winter Melon was momentarily dumbfounded.","“The Palm... Lightning Palm?” inquired the black-bellied Venerable.","“No, this is definitely not the Lightning Palm. It’s undoubtedly a potent, unique spell, albeit with a slight resemblance to the Lightning Palm!” Xichong confidently declared.","When Profound Sage Tyrannical Song launched an attack, there was no way he’d use a basic spell like the ‘Lightning Palm’.","After all, with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s cultivation level at the Tribulation Transcender Realm, a simple palm strike was far more potent than using the Lightning Palm for an attack.","As they conversed, the lightning sphere within Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s palm underwent a transformation!","In the blink of an eye, the lightning sphere expanded.","From ten meters in diameter to a hundred, a thousand, and ultimately reaching five thousand meters.","It had become a Town Level Lightning Palm.","But that wasn’t the end of it.","Behind Song Shuhang, a massive Virtue Tree adorned with shimmering lightning emerged and merged with the Town Level Lightning Palm.","This Virtue Tree contained the power of heavenly tribulation lightning. After merging with the Lightning Palm, its potency was enhanced significantly.","In the eyes of the cultivators, it was as if a second miniature sun, composed entirely of lightning, had appeared in the sky.","This was no ordinary Lightning Palm; it was a newly developed technique by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","What a terrifying technique.","“Where are you hiding?” Song Shuhang bellowed.","The Town Level Lightning Palm in his hand bore down fiercely upon a specific point in the void.","Crackling sounds reverberated as if space itself was about to rupture under the might of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s assault.","The Town Level Lightning Palm pressed against a focal point in the void but encountered an invisible force opposing it.","An equally enormous defensive force field obstructed the massive lightning sphere.","In the end, the Town Level Lightning Palm exploded.","The colossal defensive force field disappeared along with it.","Behind the defensive barrier stood a figure—a miniature Fat Ball.","Inside this diminutive Fat Ball was a dragon-shaped command seal, faintly visible.","“Tyrannical Song,” the miniature Fat Ball greeted him.","“Big Boss Fat Ball,” Song Shuhang responded solemnly.","“The fused state is more intriguing than I anticipated. I used a portion of my body to deal with Bai. The other part was reserved specifically for you, Tyrannical Song. Your death anniversary is coming next year on this day,” the miniature Fat Ball waved gently while summoning hundreds of shrunken cannons on its body.","“I’m sorry, Big Boss Fat Ball,” Song Shuhang responded calmly. “My last ‘memorial day’ was on November 27, 2019.”","As he spoke, glowing text appeared on the stone tablet behind him.","The miniature Fat Ball was momentarily stunned.","However, before it could react, Song Shuhang turned and fled without hesitation. The Inner World once again went into turmoil.","It was precisely because the Inner World was in turmoil that Song Shuhang deduced the presence of a formidable enemy nearby.. In the end, he located the alternate account of the Fat Ball!"]},{"number":2322,"title":"Chapter 2322: It’s Thrilling To Run After An Insult","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Senior White Two had brought the fat ball into space, Song Shuhang wanted to ask the Inner Assistant to find a time to secretly transfer his family and friends out of the Inner World.","At that time, when the Core Assistant and the black-skinned Soft Feather had brought Song Shuhang’s family and friends into their Inner World, they had used an illusion to envelop them and cause them to fall into a deep sleep before transporting them.","Given the urgency of the situation, there was no time for lengthy explanations. Utilizing illusions was the simplest and most effective solution.","However, just as Song Shuhang was about to open his Inner World, he discovered that something was amiss—it was as if the Inner World had cowered in fear. He immediately surmised that a formidable figure had sealed off this space.","Thus, he embarked on a clandestine search and quickly pinpointed the hiding place of the fat ball boss’s ‘smurf’ account. It wasn’t due to the fat ball’s lack of discretion in hiding; rather, the ‘dragon-shaped commander’s seal’ within it had exposed its location.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","This dragon-shaped commander’s seal originated from the Third Wielder of the Will, Striped Dragon, and Song Shuhang had a close relationship with him, as well as Striped Dragon Two.","His Inner World, his ghost spirit, and Lady Onion’s treasured saber were all linked to Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon. Given these circumstances, Song Shuhang was fortunate to have discerned the coordinates of the fat ball boss’s alternate account.","And then... Song Shuhang went on the offensive against the fat ball boss’s smurf account!","Afterward, he made a hasty escape.","He was aboard the Divine Lobster’s Chariot, with Chu Daifa adding an","‘Acceleration Formation’ above his head, propelling him at lightning speed.","Even while fleeing, Song Shuhang couldn’t resist taunting the fat ball boss’s ‘smurf’ account. “Come on, fat ball! If you want to change my ‘death anniversary’ to December 8th, come and chase me! Let’s see if you have what it takes to catch up!”","In reality, Song Shuhang didn’t want to engage in such unbridled mockery.","However, Sage Monarch Winter Melon and a group of cultivators were still below.","The fat ball boss was targeting him, so he couldn’t involve this group of allies in his feud with the fat ball boss. Moreover, this group of allies wouldn’t stand a chance against an opponent of the fat ball boss’s caliber.","The most prudent course of action was to lead the fat ball’s alternate account to a remote location in space. After escaping the spatial confinement area, he could then utilize the Inner World to counterattack.","If the Inner World remained inaccessible, Song Shuhang still had the two disposable flying swords that Senior White had provided him.","As a last resort, he could activate the disposable flying sword and enter the Wielder’s small black room.","By then, the fat ball boss would have forgotten all about him.","All grievances would be temporarily set aside.","After some time had passed, he could exit the Wielder’s small black room. At that point, he would still be Tyrannical Song.","“How naive, do you think you can escape from me?” The ‘smurf’ raised its cannons without hesitation, and over a hundred cannons unleashed a barrage at Song Shuhang.","Without even glancing back as he fled, Song Shuhang seized the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet in his long-fingered grasp while brandishing them vigorously.","A fierce flame ignited on the sword’s surface. The energy that the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword had accumulated for over half a month had all transformed into the power of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique. He swung it fiercely backward.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet also activated his suppression ability and quelled the onslaught of arrows.","Boom!","A melodious explosion resounded behind him.","Being a ‘smurf,’ the power of this barrage was considerably weaker than the bullet screen attack from the main account.","However, even with reduced power, it was still an attack from the ruler of the Netherworld. Getting hit would result in severe injury if not death.","The remaining half of the cannon fire pierced through the blockade of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique and Stone Tablet Suppression.","While desperately urging the Divine Lobster’s Chariot, Song Shuhang inquired,","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, do you have any other methods?”","“Pay up. As long as you pay up, I can block all the attacks with my Monolith, ” confidently replied Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","“I don’t have any money, but I only want my life,” Song Shuhang stated.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remained silent, and the ‘Song Shuhang’s tomb’ inscription on the stone tablet gleamed brightly.","“Activate [Illusion Reality] and use that ‘Desert Illusion’ to block the next wave,” Daifa Chu reminded at that moment. With the Inner World sealed off, energy transmission between Pavilion Master Chu’s Daifa and her main body had been cut off. She could no longer serve as the primary combat force and could only offer various forms of support.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang promptly activated ‘Illusion Reality: Fake Desert World.’","The Divine Lobster Chariot rushed into the desert world.","The artillery fire, equipped with navigation, followed closely behind.","“Despicable fat ball boss, to actually use an absolute lock-on cheat,” Song Shuhang muttered as he glanced behind him while clenching his right hand. A phantom image of an inverted high platform quietly materialized.","This was the projection of the Throne of Wealth. At the platform’s end was a small wooden door leading to the lair of a three-eyed young senior.","If he truly couldn’t evade the cannon fire behind him, Song Shuhang was prepared to venture into the Throne of Wealth and see if the three-eyed young senior would accept the treasure of the fat ball, ruler of the Netherworld.","It would be ideal if he did. After Song Shuhang advanced to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, he had yet to fulfill his promise to the three-eyed young senior. Now, he could potentially use the fat ball’s clone as a wager and engage in a thrilling bet with the three-eyed young senior.","Just as Song Shuhang was deeply contemplating, a figure appeared on the Divine Lobster’s Chariot.","It was Whitey from the fake desert world.","“Give me the sword.”","Song Shuhang handed over the ‘Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword’ to Whitey.","“I can only block this attack for you. You’ll have to figure out a way to deal with the other attacks from the fat ball,” Whitey declared expressionlessly.","“Understood,” Song Shuhang affirmed earnestly.","Whitey raised the sword and swung it.","As the sword descended, the entire world seemed to dance with it. All the power of heaven and earth converged into this single sword, making the world itself the sword.","The sand in the desert world surged and transformed into a sandstorm.","The attacks from the smurf all struck the sandstorm and were deflected one by one.","The fake desert world couldn’t hold up any longer and dissipated into a cooldown period. Song Shuhang wouldn’t be able to summon it again for a short while.","After the illusion faded, Song Shuhang continued to steer the Divine Lobster’s Chariot and fled into space.","The smurf rapidly closed the distance behind him.","Without hesitation, it abandoned those ordinary cultivators. Its sole objective was to squash Song Shuhang, the pesky rat.","As his nemesis swiftly caught up, Song Shuhang inquired, “Senior Chu, is there any way to increase my escape speed?”","“Yes!” The hamster’s voice interjected suddenly, akin to an advertisement in a TV series.","Shortly after, a magnificent immortal shuttle appeared before Song Shuhang— it was Senior White Two’s Myriad World Piercing Shuttle.."]},{"number":2323,"title":"Chapter 2323: Welcome Aboard, Fat Ball","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The hamster, wrapped in a flashy red cloak, remained invisible as it silently hid inside Song Shuhang’s pocket.","However, when things started to go south, the hamster came to the rescue.","Having anticipated that fat ball might interfere during his confrontation with the ‘Heavenly Dao’, Senior White had entrusted hamster with the shuttle. In the event of a dire emergency, they could use the shuttle to make a quick getaway.","The shuttle was renowned for its speed, crafted before the sixth celestial ascension. Senior White had later acquired it in a trade.","Just recently, after Senior White reclaimed his leg, he also gained possession of the shuttle.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","The shuttle had been pre-programmed.","Once activated by the hamster, its hatch opened, drawing Song Shuhang and the hamster inside. As the doors shut. the shuttle launched into sDace at t0D speed.","The shuttle was so swift that it left fat ball trailing behind.","Fat ball’s smurf account tried desperately to accelerate, but the gap widened. If things continued this way, the shuttle would soon escape its radar.","To prevent this, fat ball disabled its Spatial Lockdown and used its spatial abilities to chase the cruiser. If it didn’t act, who knows where in the cosmos Song Shuhang might end up?","The universe was vast. If Song Shuhang managed to make a substantial jump, even fat ball wouldn’t be able to pursue him anytime soon.","Meanwhile, back on Earth, in the southern states, the sages exchanged worried glances.","“Do you think Tyrannical Song’s gonna be alright?”","“He’s on the brink of his celestial ascension. He’ll pull through. He probably took the fight to space to keep us out of it.”","Their conversation was interrupted as the two ever-standing celestial cities, right before their eyes, faded into thin air. The core assistants had recalled them.","As the sages continued to gaze at the sky, one of them remarked, “Looks like he’s taking the fight to space.”","In outer space, Song Shuhang checked the distance between them. “Have we shaken it off yet?”","Hamster replied, “That’s a ruler of the netherworld. What do you think?”","Fat ball was hot on their trail. Each time it used a spatial jump, it came closer.","Feeling trapped, Song Shuhang tried to connect with his inner world. For a fleeting moment, there was a connection, but it quickly fizzled out.","Dejected, Song Shuhang turned to Daoist Stone Tablet. “Is fat ball considered a treasure?”","The tablet nodded, “Most definitely. At least the Dragon Token inside him is.” With this confirmation, Song Shuhang formed a plan.","Reassured, Song Shuhang addressed the hamster, “Hide in my pocket. On my count, retract the shuttle.”","The hamster, dubious, retorted, “You sure about this?”","Song Shuhang, with conviction, assured him, “I have a plan.”","With mutual agreement, they proceeded. “One, two, three!” As Song Shuhang shouted the final count, he activated the Throne of Wealth Scattering.","This unique magical artifact provided access to Senior Three-Eyed’s wooden door world. Unlike other spatial techniques, it functioned as a VIP passageway immune to spatial imprisonment.","As soon as they were safely on the throne, the hamster stowed away the shuttle.","Without hesitation, the fat ball boss crashed into the throne.","Song Shuhang, with a sly smile, greeted him, “Welcome, Fat Ball.” He then turned and opened a wooden door.","Senior Three-Eyed, sounding rather unenthusiastic, asked, “Back for another bet, Little Tyrannical Song?”","“Exactly, ” Song Shuhang confirmed.","“And your stake?”","Song Shuhang gestured behind to reveal the fat ball boss and said, “Right here.”","On catching sight of the fat ball, all three of Senior Three-Eyed’s eyelids twitched noticeably.."]},{"number":2324,"title":"Chapter 2324: It Can’t Be Helped. Just Watch Me Shine.","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Suddenly, the sky behind the wooden door shifted dramatically.","What had been a sunny sky now melded into a downpour that would catch anyone off guard.","Song Shuhang had anticipated a weather change, but the storm’s intensity was unexpected. He couldn’t even raise his shield before getting soaked.","Normally, given Song Shuhang’s stature as a Venerable, a storm wouldn’t dampen him. But the rain in the three-eyed youth’s world was different. Even Senior Three-Eyed had gotten soaked, so it was no surprise Song","Shuhang had too.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Only the eyeball butler remained unaffected.","As Song Shuhang made his appearance, the butler had already procured a large steel umbrella, opening it in silence. It protected against both rain and hail. Its only drawback? Its weight.","Outside the door, the fat ball boss’s smurf ascended to the Wealth Throne’s pinnacle, just outside the door.","Even though the fat ball lacked simulated eyes, the three-eyed young senior felt the fat ball’s ‘gaze’ connecting with his.","As someone sensitive to gazes, he trusted his instincts.","The two leaders locked eyes through the door while maintaining a heavy silence.","After a few moments, Senior Three-Eyed cast three glances at Song Shuhang.","Despite the rain smearing his face, Song Shuhang met his gaze with composed defiance, albeit slightly diminished by his drenched appearance.","“I underestimated you, Little Tyrannical Song,” the three-eyed youth whispered using a secret sound transmission technique, ensuring the fat ball remained oblivious to their exchange.","Wiping away the rain, Song Shuhang responded in kind, “Thank you for the compliment, Senior. But to gather this ‘bet’, I’ve put in considerable effort.” The three-eyed youth frowned internally. ‘When did I praise you?’","“Bet, my ass! I’m well-informed, even here. The fat ball is the ‘Ruler of the Netherworld’, corresponding to the current Wielder of the Will. That’s quite the bet.”","Unsurprisingly, Senior Three-Eyed identified the fat ball as the Netherworld","ruler. Realizing the senior viewed him as a trickster, Song Shuhang could deduce the rest.","He then opened the door and transmitted, “Listen, Senior Three-Eyed. My bet is the alternate account of the Netherworld ruler, Fatty Ball. Possessing it will give you the opportunity to study avatars wandering in the main world’ Plus, this avatar has a potent dragon-shaped commander seal. It’s a relic from before the Third Heavenly Dao affirmed the Dao and holds immense value.”","“It’s a fair bet,” Senior Three-Eyed remarked as his fingers sunk into the recliner’s armrest.","The storm intensified and reflected Senior Three-Eyed’s souring mood. His changing emotions were transparent, even more so than Song Shuhang’s ‘face-reading technique’.","“I accept your wager,” Senior Three-Eyed declared while focusing all three eyes on Song Shuhang. Then, through a voice transmission, he added, “But since you’re betting, ensure it enters this realm. If it doesn’t cross the threshold, the bet’s off.”","Song Shuhang glanced at the fat ball.","For a long moment, the fat ball boss’s smurf bore into the three-eyed youth with a demonic intensity, momentarily forgetting even his sworn enemy, Song Shuhang.","After an extended pause, the fat ball finally remarked in a deep tone, “Ruler of the Netherworld.”","It had believed that the previous Netherworld rulers vanished with the Wielder of the Will’s abdication. Only Bai Youyou remained and usurped the power meant for the ball. Yet, here stood another.","The discovery was both unsettling and thrilling.","Bai Youyou aside, other rulers had left the Netherworld to conceal themselves in the main world.","Song Shuhang and the three-eyed teenager shared a silent exchange.","Breaking the hushed atmosphere, Song Shuhang addressed the ball, “Big Boss Fatty Ball.”","Having silently joined Senior Three-Eyed, Song Shuhang now found himself within the senior’s protective circle.","The fat ball turned its attention to Song Shuhang.","Gathering courage, Song Shuhang posed a question, “Is the anniversary of my death still set for this day next year?”","“I’ll spare you today,” the fat ball boss responded coldly. “If you can, hide here.","Permanently.”","With that, the fat ball seemed poised to exit the Wealth Throne.","“He didn’t come in after all,” Song Shuhang muttered.","“Do you really think this ball ruler is irrational? If it were, why would it enter?” Senior Three-Eyed posited while looking squarely at Song Shuhang. This former Netherworld ruler was protecting this small world.","The Netherworld Sphere’s ruler had only sent a clone here. Even without much thought, one could deduce it shouldn’t venture into this small world. It’d be like a fish awaiting the cleaver.","“I wish you’d concealed your identity,” Song Shuhang mused while smacking his forehead. “I was overly optimistic.”","It’s human nature to sometimes be too sure of themselves. Even when facing inevitabilities, there’s always a sliver of hope.","Feeling cornered, Song Shuhang admitted, “I had a plan I didn’t want to use.” Rising, he approached the wooden door.","It was time to showcase his true capabilities.."]},{"number":2325,"title":"Chapter 2325: Near Yet Far","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang clearly wasn’t giving up. He even ran to the wooden door in hopes of detaining the ball.","Senior Three-Eyed Young Man leaned back in his rocking chair and calmly said, “Little Tyrannical Song, there’s no need to keep pestering it. No matter how much you taunt it, it won’t come in. According to our agreement, since it won’t enter, we’ll have to let go of this wager.”","The rain continued to fall from the sky.","For some inexplicable reason, even after witnessing Song Shuhang lose his gambling stake, Senior Three-Eyed’s mood didn’t improve.","“My Lord, our old friend has passed away. No matter how much you miss them, they can’t be brought back,” the eyeball butler holding the umbrella offered gentle consolation. But then, it suddenly added, “So, please, My Lord, put an end to this storm. It has been raining excessively lately, and I fear my rheumatism is about to flare up.”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Senior Three-Eyed was speechless.","“Which eye of yours saw me yearning for my old friend?” he retorted.","“Senior Three-Eyed, as long as we can lure the fat ball into this small world, we can consider the bet established, right?” Song Shuhang looked at the smurf account of the fat ball, who was descending from the Throne of Wealth, and secretly transmitted his thoughts.","“As long as you have the ability,” the three-eyed youth replied.","Song Shuhang nodded vigorously.","“Hey, Tyrannical Song, you’re not thinking of using yourself as bait to lure the ball, are you?” the eyeball butler asked.","As he spoke, the large metal umbrella in his hand tilted slightly towards the three-eyed youth and caused a deluge of rainwater to drench him.","The three-eyed youth was rendered speechless.","“Don’t worry, Senior. I won’t do anything that suicidal,” Song Shuhang assured. The risk of being bait was too high. After all, the prey was too enormous. He might be snatched away by the fat ball boss as soon as he exposed half of his body and leave nothing behind.","“This is an opportunity we can’t afford to miss. So, at this moment, I have to take a gamble.” Song Shuhang secretly formed a hand seal just in case.","Then, he shouted to the fat ball, “Fat Ball, please wait.”","Song Shuhang could tell that the fat ball’s smurf could move freely in the main world because of its fusion with the remnant body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and the presence of the dragon-shaped commander’s seal inside it.","A magical tool left behind by the formidable Striped Dragon before his Dao vindication was truly extraordinary.","If he could extract the dragon-shaped commander’s seal, the fat ball’s mobility in the main world would undoubtedly be severely hampered.","So, even though it was a bit risky, it was worth a shot.","The fat ball on the staircase of the Throne of Wealth didn’t even turn its head when it heard Song Shuhang’s voice.","It had already made up its mind to ignore Profound Sage Tyrannical Song today.","No matter how much the other party provoked or mocked it, it remained steadfast.","It continued to descend the stairs at its own pace while leaving a mark on the Throne of Wealth with each step.","“Fat Ball... Do you still remember the part of you that was bitten off by a very famous saint in ancient times?” Behind him, Song Shuhang dropped a bombshell.","This was precisely what the fat ball was most concerned about!","Unlike the other Wielders of the Will, the fat ball’s primary form was forced to resign, not voluntarily. After the battle with the Scholarly Sage, its ‘existence’ was incomplete, and it left behind a hidden danger when it advanced to the Wielder of the Will.","The moment this topic was brought up, the fat ball boss’s smurf, which had been hopping around, suddenly turned around.","“You know about it?” the fat ball boss said while clearly enunciating each word.","“Actually, I have a huge secret,” Song Shuhang began. “Actually, I...”","“You are indeed the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage!” the fat ball boss exclaimed suddenly.","Song Shuhang’s expression turned into one of bewilderment.","“I’ve been closely monitoring the scholarly faction in the main world. Although I can’t directly spy on them, I’ve been gathering information about them through indirect means. I never expected you to hide so deeply, Scholarly Sage. In such circumstances, you managed to employ a secret technique to reincarnate and live another life while deceiving my Heavenly Dao and the myriad worlds,” the fat ball’s smurf declared gravely.","“Wait, Fat Ball. That’s not the secret I’m talking about,” Song Shuhang clarified.","Something was amiss with the script.","He wanted to use his dramatic operation to lure the fat ball boss closer, but just as he began, the fat ball boss took over the stage.","“You don’t need to say anything. Once you step out of this small world, I will undoubtedly devour you,” the fat ball boss stated firmly.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“Even though I initially planned to crush you to death, after doing so, I still intend to devour you and leave no trace behind. This time, you won’t have the chance to reincarnate, Scholarly Sage,” the fat ball remarked.","“I’m not the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage,” Song Shuhang quickly clarified.","“It doesn’t matter whether you are or not; the outcome will remain the same,” the fat ball responded slowly.","In any case, it intended to crush them to death.","“Even if you crush me to death or devour me, you won’t gain any information about the existence that the Scholarly Sage bit off,” Song Shuhang stated with a smile.","The fat ball boss’s smurf froze.","“Actually, Big Boss Fatty Ball, you know better than anyone else whether I’m the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage. You don’t have to deceive yourself. You can see that I’m not anyone’s reincarnation,” Song Shuhang continued.","“Do you want to know where that existence you lost is? Do you want to know where that existence is now?” Song Shuhang inquired slowly.","His voice held a seductive allure, akin to that of a devil.","At least for the fat ball, this temptation was irresistible. After all, it had been searching for that ‘existence’ for tens of thousands of years.","“You know where that thing is?” A solitary eye manifested on the fat ball, locking onto Song Shuhang.","“Yes, I know. I know precisely where that thing is,” Song Shuhang affirmed.","“I’ll wait for you outside this throne,” the fat ball’s smurf declared in a determined tone.","With that, it continued its descent without looking back.","“No need for that, Fatty Ball. In fact, I can tell you right now where the thing you lost is,” Song Shuhang said calmly, devoid of emotion.","The fat ball was taken aback.","“That thing is distant, yet it’s right in front of us,” Song Shuhang pointed at Senior Three-Eyed and said, “The Throne of Wealth has a rule. Whenever you make a bet with the throne’s owner, you stand to gain a substantial treasure if you win. Conversely, if you lose, you have to pay with both hands.” The fat ball boss’s single eye immediately fixed on the three-eyed youth.","“As for me, Senior Three-Eyed and I had two bets,” Song Shuhang added.."]},{"number":2326,"title":"Chapter 2326: Heavenly Dao’s Eye Drops","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“So, you mean the ‘existence’ that the scumbag bit off from my main body is now in the possession of this unknown former ruler of the netherworld?” The single eye on the fat ball boss’s spherical form stared intensely at the three-eyed youth.","In the single eye of the fat ball, there was a mixture of desire and barely restrained impatience.","The three-eyed youth on the other side was being stared at so intensely that it gave him a headache. Despite his fondness for gazes, having the single eye of the fat ball fixated on him so passionately was still enough to send shivers down his spine.","Senior Three-Eyed rubbed his temples. Little Tyrannical Song was truly unscrupulous. He was tricking him right before his eyes.","Since you’re heartless, don’t blame me for being unjust.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","However, it had to be done without breaking the rules and promises... In other words, the fat ball had to become Little Tyrannical Song’s wager first.","“Do you want to retrieve your treasure? Do you want to obtain what you desire from me?” Senior Three-Eyed slowly stood up from his rocking chair and addressed the fat ball smurf.","As he spoke, the storm in the sky subsided.","Sunlight pierced through the thick clouds and bathed the three-eyed youth in its warmth.","Moreover, since the three-eyed youth’s body had just been drenched by the torrential rain, the sunlight reflected off him and created a rainbow-like glow.","Why did he seem so happy?","The eyeball butler silently closed his large iron umbrella. The storm had passed, and the master had found a new source of joy.","Song Shuhang looked at the three-eyed young man in surprise.","He had initially thought that as long as the three-eyed youth remained silent, that would be the greatest support. He never expected that Senior Three-Eyed would actively cooperate with him and entice the fat ball boss.","“If you want the opportunity, step inside boldly and place a bet with me. I’m always happy to create opportunities for the younger generation,” the three-eyed youth continued.","When Song Shuhang heard this, he hesitated for a moment. Something didn’t seem right. It felt like the script was about to deviate from its intended course again.","“You’re setting a trap. You want to deceive me,” the fat ball boss finally broke its silence.","Every time Bai Youyou secretly set a trap to harm it, it always happened in such a strange atmosphere.","“No, to be precise, it’s Tyrannical Song who wants to deceive you, I want to deceive Tyrannical Song, and Fellow Daoist Fatty Ball, you want to obtain what you desire from me. The three of us have formed a complete loop,” the three-eyed youth declared and raised his arms dramatically, as if he were a multi-level marketing boss giving a presentation.","“I’m not called ‘Fatty Ball, the fat ball retorted after a moment of silence.","“That’s not the point. Besides, I have no interest in knowing your Daoist name or personal name. What’s important is that if you want to reclaim what you desire, step in and bet with me!” The three-eyed youth waved his hand, and a ‘betting ceremony’ appeared in front of the fat ball.","At the heart of the ritual was a radiant divine eye.","This gambling ceremony was the core of the three-eyed youth’s ‘gambling agreement.’ With the help of this ceremony, the three-eyed youth could extract various ‘concepts’ and convert them into gambling capital, such as Saber Intent, Sword Intent, and Chef’s Heart.","“With your insight, Fellow Daoist Fatty Ball, you should be able to discern the uniqueness of this ‘betting ceremony,’ right? The rules of the bet and the process are all transparent, with no deceit. In fact, my relationship with Little Tyrannical Song is that of gambling partners who have engaged in two wagers,” the three-eyed youth explained.","As long as the ‘betting ceremony’ was laid out in the open, the ruler of the netherworld would naturally discern the many rules contained within it. Once it understood the rules, there was a 50% chance it would choose to enter the small world.","The small account of the fat ball boss fell silent as it carefully calculated the potential gains and losses.","“I’ve given you a chance. Whether you seize it or not is up to you,” the three-eyed youth added. “Whether it succeeds or not depends on how attractive that ‘bitten existence’ mentioned by Little Tyrannical Song is to Fellow Daoist Fatty Ball.”","“Humph, ” the fat ball boss snorted coldly. Eventually, it leaped into the wooden door world. After all, this was just a clone. Even if the clone was destroyed, the losses would be manageable. If it could recover the ‘existence’ of the ‘Heavenly Dao Ball’ bitten off, it was worth any cost.","“Welcome back, Mr. Fat Ball,” Song Shuhang greeted with a smile. He was providing top-notch service.","At that moment, a glint of light flashed in the fat ball’s single eye.","Boom!","The fat ball descended directly onto Song Shuhang’s body. It knew that in this small world, it might not be able to kill Tyrannical Song, but it could at least exact some interest.","Song Shuhang, who was below, didn’t attempt to evade, nor could he. The light from the fat ball’s eye resembled a ‘body immobilization technique.’","The fat ball’s body crushed Song Shuhang’s body.","In a burst of flames, ‘Song Shuhang’ exploded into sparks. This was the Flame Substitute Technique that Song Shuhang had learned but had never had the opportunity to use.","The one that had exploded into sparks had yet to take form. Before it could transform, it was crushed into sparks by the fat ball boss.","Simultaneously, another Song Shuhang materialized beside the three-eyed youth. He was still trembling. “Senior Three-Eyed, did I almost die just now?”","“Yes, indeed,” Senior Three-Eyed replied with a slight nod.","“Senior, aren’t you going to stop him?” Song Shuhang asked.","“My promise to you is contingent on ‘Fellow Daoist Fatty Ball’ entering my wooden door world...and the moment of its leap was outside the wooden door, which falls beyond the scope of our agreement. Therefore, if you were crushed to death just now, I would have to reconsider our wager,” Senior Three-Eyed explained with a sly smile at Song Shuhang. “This is the nature of human cunning, Little Tyrannical Song. You still have much to learn.”","Song Shuhang remained silent for a while before muttering to himself.","At the same time, the fat ball boss discovered that it couldn’t move. It was firmly restrained and couldn’t budge or speak.","“As expected, you still aimed to deceive me... I can’t believe I fell for the promise of another ruler,” the fat ball scoffed.","“You’re already my wager, Fellow Daoist Fatty Ball,” Song Shuhang said with a gentle smile. “As per my agreement with Senior Three-Eyed, once I lure you into this small world, you become my wager.”","The fat ball fell silent.","“That’s correct. Since time is of the essence, let’s commence the wager, Little Tyrannical Song. Your wager is a living clone of the ruler of the netherworld, complete with a precious magical treasure from the Third Will’s Wielder. In that case, my wager for you must be equally valuable. I have prepared an exceedingly precious elixir for you — the Heavenly Dao’s Eye Drops,” the three-eyed youth declared.","Without wasting any time, the three-eyed youth promptly initiated the gambling session. He was clearly in a hurry. After concluding the first round, he had to proceed to the second round without delay. He was quite busy.."]},{"number":2327,"title":"Chapter 2327: The Strongest Summon","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but raise an eyebrow upon hearing about Heavenly Dao Eye Drops. “Eye drops? I thought the Heavenly Dao was immortal. What’s with the eye drops?”","Seeing Song Shuhang’s puzzled expression, the three-eyed youth understood his thoughts. Talking to Little Tyrannical Song was surprisingly effortless. It was like having a chat while looking at pictures.","“Why would the Heavenly Dao need eye drops? It’s probably just a habit. Once someone gets used to taking care of their eyes, even if they ascend to the Wielder of the Will, they still habitually develop new eye drops to maintain their eye health. After all, eyes are the most precious treasures. No amount of care is too much,” the three-eyed youth sighed.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","So, these were products created by the Wielder of the Will corresponding to the three-eyed youth?","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","It seemed that this Heavenly Dao had quite a unique personality, just as expected.","Senior Three-Eyed continued, “Let me give you a brief overview of the functions of the ‘Eye Drops of the Wielder of the Will.’ Apart from using them to nourish the eyes of the Wielder of the Will, their greatest function lies in enlightenment and empowerment. You see, the eye drops of the Wielder of the Will can be considered the focus of their eyes, and their nourishing effects are astonishing. Therefore, they can be used to awaken the spiritual intelligence of plants or to enlighten and give a degree of consciousness to magical tools and make them highly effective.”","After explaining this, he glanced at Song Shuhang’s Scholarly Sage’s eye and added, “As for you, Little Tyrannical Song, if your Scholarly Sage’s eye ever gets overloaded and overheated, a drop of the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops can have an unexpected effect. Are you satisfied with my wager?”","“So, my Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure can also be enlightened with the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops?” Song Shuhang inquired.","If that were possible, he could first use the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops to awaken the spiritual intelligence of his life-bound magical treasure, similar to Senior White’s Meteor Sword. Then, in the future, he could explore an instance dungeon with Senior Yellow Mountain and potentially enhance the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure to another level. If he were lucky, he might even be able to give birth to a few weapon spirits.","Additionally, Senior Three-Eyed’s suggestion to apply the eye medicine to the Scholarly Sage’s eye was tempting to Song Shuhang.","“Are you underestimating the capabilities of the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops?” Senior Three-Eyed inquired.","Anything related to the Wielder of the Will would undoubtedly be top-notch.","Song Shuhang accepted without hesitation. This was what he currently needed the most!","Senior Three-Eyed truly was a considerate senior. Each time he made a wager, he selected a treasure that was most suited to the other party.","“Senior, what shall we wager on, this time?” Song Shuhang inquired again.","“This time, I’m prepared. Ever since I learned that Little Tyrannical Song had advanced, I’ve been preparing new methods for our wagers. I’ve made several preparations to ensure fairness.” The three-eyed youth smiled and snapped his fingers.","Beside him, the eyeball butler turned around and produced a large box. It opened to reveal a complex racetrack model.","Inside the box was an intricate racetrack model... kit.","At the starting line, there were ten toy horses with wind-up keys. Each waited for their owners to wind them up.","Song Shuhang raised an eyebrow and looked at the three-eyed youth.","‘Do you intend to determine the outcome of our wager through a horse-racing toy’?","If that were the case, this grand gambling ritual would take an unexpected turn.’","“Why the constipated look? Do you despise my meticulously crafted magical item?” The three-eyed youth remained seated in a rocking chair while lightly tapping his fingers on the armrest.","“No, no,” Song Shuhang hastily responded. “Senior, I didn’t expect you to have this kind of taste. Next time, I’ll bring more sets of toys from the main world.","Perhaps you’d prefer ship models?”","“Appearances can be deceiving, but I have the heart of a child,” the three-eyed youth remarked dryly.","The three-eyed youth was exasperated.","He looked at his eyeball butler and gestured for him to explain the effects of the meticulously crafted magical treasure to Song Shuhang.","“Ahem, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, you’ve misunderstood,” the butler coughed lightly. “Next time, when you come, please bring ship model toys. My master will probably appreciate those.”","As soon as the butler finished speaking, a totem pole suddenly rose from the ground and impaled the butler at its pinnacle.","Simultaneously, a roaring flame engulfed the tip of the totem pole and caused the butler to cry out in pain.","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback. He clasped his hands together and made a wish to the totem pole. “May I live safely until tomorrow...”","The three-eyed youth sat up from his rocking chair and extended his hand. The box in the eyeball butler’s hand fell from the top of the pole into the three-eyed youth’s hand.","The three-eyed young man reluctantly began explaining the magical treasure to Song Shuhang. With this magical treasure, one could summon 108 different races. The ten horses at the starting line possessed various attributes—some excelled in endurance, others in speed, some were suited for short sprints, while others were skilled at overcoming obstacles.","“Alright, so we each select a horse, wind it up, and compete?” Song Shuhang nodded.","“Winding the spring is the final step. My personally crafted magical items aren’t that simple. This is known as the Divine Horse Race. Its primary function is to summon divine horses through these horse racing embryonic forms. Throughout history, all the divine horses in the universe can be summoned and appear on this racetrack. To ensure fairness in the competition, these summoned horses will be bound by the attributes of the original horse racing prototype and greatly enhance the element of strategy,” the three-eyed youth explained with a sly grin.","Song Shuhang nodded in understanding. As expected, the three-eyed youth had a playful personality.","“There are two methods to summon a divine horse,” the butler chimed in. “The first method involves using a summoning medium for a targeted summoning and allows you to summon the specific divine horse you desire.”","“What if there’s no medium available?” Song Shuhang asked.","“In that case, you can use the second method—random summoning. Without any summoning medium, you can summon by pressing your hand on the spring. This method can summon incredibly powerful horses, but it can also result in weaker ones being summoned,” the eyeball butler answered amidst his cries of pain.","“Fair, yet not entirely so. It truly embodies Senior Three-Eyed’s style,” Song Shuhang remarked. He didn’t have any summoning medium, so the second method was his only option.","After some contemplation, he reached out and selected a prototype of a godly horse known for its explosive power. He could only use the second method for summoning.","As his fingers made contact with the toy horse, the game commenced. Song Shuhang’s consciousness was drawn into a vast horse racing arena.."]},{"number":2328,"title":"Chapter 2328: Hold Your Horses, This Isn’t a Horse Race!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was taken aback. Had the game started just like that?","“In this world, there’s no such thing as absolute fairness. I can only provide a relative kind of fairness,” Senior Three-Eyed said with a slight smile. “It seems, Little Tyrannical Song, that you can’t wait to kick off the bet. That’s just what I wanted. So, let the wager begin! In the Divine Horse Battleground, the horse summoned by you and me will race to reach the finish line first, and the winner takes it all!”","He casually clapped his hands, and the wagering ceremony commenced.","The stakes for both sides were one Netherworld Domination Sphere Avatar and one large bottle of Heavenly Dao Eye Drops.","The result of the first round, whether it ended in victory or defeat, was bound to put a smile on Three-Eyed’s face. Therefore, he was in quite a good mood.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","With the bet now officially established, Three-Eyed reached out to select a ‘prototype horse.’ After he made his choice, the remaining eight horses simultaneously entered ‘random mode.’ Countless phantoms of ‘divine horses’ from various realms and times floated above their heads.","In the end, eight divine horses with bloodlines of divine beasts appeared at the starting line.","There were warhorses covered in dragon scales, horses engulfed in fiery flames, elemental warhorses made of lightning, nine-tailed demon horses, peculiar horses with just a head but the body of a Qilin Beast, and even heavenly horses and unicorns. They all appeared one after another.","Eight different racehorses were randomly summoned and continuously neighed at the starting point of the track. Their presence was extraordinary.","Simultaneously, numerous copies of the Eyeball Butler appeared in the audience. Each of them cheered loudly to hype up the atmosphere. Some chanting slogans like “Go, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song” could be faintly heard.","“Random summoning. Let’s hope we get a good horse,” Song Shuhang said as he extended his hand.","Summoning an ordinary horse would be a disaster.","‘Senior White, please bless me and let me summon the best one!’","Above his head, a wave of holy apes appeared, singing the song “Lucky 666” to boost Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s luck.","“Don’t worry, the worst I can summon is at the ‘God’ level. Like I mentioned earlier, I’ll ensure it’s at least ‘relatively fair.’ That way, it’ll be enjoyable and challenging,” the Three-Eyed youth said leisurely.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath. While winding up, he suddenly felt a connection between himself and the clockwork horse in his hand. Information about his horse seemed to be extracted and placed onto the racetrack. Even though it was a random summon, it didn’t seem entirely random. When he summoned randomly, it seemed to try its best to relate to the summoner, unless the summoner had never encountered a horse in their life. In Song Shuhang’s mind, many images of ‘horses’ flashed by.","Finally, a pitch-black warhorse stopped.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","It was him!","The exotic stallion spirit from the organization ‘All the Monsters of the World Should Unite and Become a Family’ appeared to be at the Fifth Stage Realm.","In the world of cultivators, the Fifth Stage Realm was considered a great demon.","However, in the ‘whatever competition ground’ of the Three-Eyed youth, it was definitely at the bottom.","If he really summoned this stallion spirit... he might as well go on stage and run himself!","‘I can’t have this!","‘Change, change.’","Song Shuhang silently chanted in his heart.","Buzz...","At that moment, the summoning ritual completed.","The silhouette of a horse took shape before Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He silently looked up at the sky. His face was filled with despair.","Should he give that stallion spirit a good beating later? But after some thought, he decided against it. It wasn’t the stallion spirit’s fault. Even if he wanted to slap it, he couldn’t use this as a reason.","“From your expression, it seems you didn’t summon Ruyi’s horse,” Senior Three-Eyed quirked a smile, saying, “Actually, I wanted to remind you earlier. I was going to say that if you didn’t want to ‘randomly draw,’ I could provide you with two summoning mediums. You could choose one of them. But before I could say anything, you started the summoning.”","“Senior, could you speak up sooner next time?” Song Shuhang sighed.","“No, because I’m very happy,” Senior Three-Eyed said cheerfully.","He took out a horsewhip and placed it into a formation. Then, he wound up the spring of the ‘horse’ and put it in the core of the formation. “Come forth, and blind Little Tyrannical Song! Presenting the king of all horses in the universe,","Emperor Ma! ”","In the next moment, a handsome horse leaped out of the array.","No exaggerated dragon scales, no flames, no whirlwinds, no lightning, no horns or wings—it looked like a regular horse with no mutations.","However, the moment it appeared, it exuded an aura of uniqueness.","It raised its head and neighed. The other eight horses on the field appeared somewhat intimidated. The neighing served as the background music for the horse’s grand entrance.","As it stepped forward and walked, flowers blossomed among the grass seeds on the grassland as if welcoming its arrival.","In addition to the background music, there were also background effects.","It received the treatment of a main character.","How was Song Shuhang supposed to compete?","He looked at his entirely black warhorse... It was the stallion spirit.","It was over.","Just as he was lost in thought, the stallion spirit, upon seeing the horse emperor, happily trotted towards it without fear.","‘Don’t tell me you’re in heat right at the start of the game!’ Song Shuhang thought.","“Senior Three-Eyed, can I take the place of the warhorse?” Song Shuhang asked with a despairing expression.","“Are you a horse? If you are, then I’ll agree to let you participate,” Senior Three-Eyed said merrily.","By this time, the stallion spirit had already joyfully bounded to the side of the horse emperor, as if trying to gain its favor.","Emperor Ma raised its head slightly. As the king of horses, it couldn’t even tolerate the presence of eight random horses with a single neigh. Naturally, it had its pride.","Just then, Song Shuhang’s black horse suddenly stood up and stamped its hooves on Emperor Ma.","Pa!","Emperor Ma was slapped to the ground. It struggled and howled in pain.","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted.","The Three-Eyed youth stared in shock.","All the eyeball butlers in the audience were also stunned. Even their cheers ceased.","Everyone, including the horses, fell into silence. But the black horse didn’t cease its rampage. After knocking Emperor Ma to the ground, it continued to stomp on the horse emperor’s body with its front hooves.","“Stop, stop! We’re here for a horse race, not a horse brawl,” Song Shuhang urgently pleaded.","At the same time, he had a premonition.","The stallion spirit definitely wasn’t this audacious.","“Hiss, hiss...” The black horse stood upright like a human. Its two front limbs stretched out to the sides like a white crane spreading its wings, while its rear legs defied joint structure and assumed the stance of a lone-standing golden rooster.","Song Shuhang covered his forehead with a palm.."]},{"number":2329,"title":"Chapter 2329: The Real Show Begins","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was indeed the mischievous horse from the Bai family of the Heavenly Dao!","Song Shuhang hadn’t expected that this time, the mischievous horse would make a grand entrance by dyeing itself black to resemble a stud horse spirit. It had even managed to deceive him.","If it was indeed the mischievous horse, maybe there was a chance to win this round!","“What kind of horse is this? Isn’t that too cruel?” The three-eyed youth was left dumbfounded. He was taking quite a while to recover from the violent spectacle he had just witnessed.","Using the third eye on his forehead, he scanned Little Tyrannical Song’s large black horse, but the information he received was rather vague.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","The information indicated that this was a horse spirit from the “All the Monsters of the World Should Unite and Become a Family” Monster Alliance, with a special talent for being a stud horse.","But the three-eyed youth didn’t believe a word of this information.","Because if the information was accurate, then a mere ordinary stud horse spirit would be terrified when facing Emperor Ma.","How could it possibly dare to boldly challenge Emperor Ma like this?","Song Shuhang turned around while covering his face with both hands and began to rub it. He aimed to create an expressionless look in case Senior Three-Eyed could read the answer from his face.","After rubbing away the smile on his face with great effort, Song Shuhang put on a stoic expression and said to Senior Three-Eyed, “Actually, when I summoned it just now, I thought I had summoned a horse demon from the ‘All the Monsters of the World Should Unite and Become a Family.’ But now it seems that there must have been some changes in the summoning process.” “Then what is the identity of this horse?” Senior Three-Eyed asked.","“Senior Three-Eyed... The bet has already begun, and the following information is confidential. I can’t allow you to learn a way to restrain it from my information!” Song Shuhang replied seriously.","“That makes sense,” the three-eyed youth nodded.","“Everyone, please take your positions. The race is about to begin,” another eyeball butler, now dressed as a referee, announced.","“Senior Ma, whether we win or lose depends on you!” Song Shuhang shouted to the horse.","If he could win the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops from Senior Three-Eyed, he would have to distribute a considerable amount of wealth. The eye drops were ample enough for every member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group to have a small portion. There would still be plenty left.","At that time, he could use another trick in the ‘Wealth Distribution’ segment— first exchange some treasures with the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group using the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops, and then use these treasures to replenish the Wealth Distribution Throne.","The first two times he distributed his wealth, he had used a trick.","This time, he had to genuinely hold a Wealth Distribution Throne meeting. After all, this was an important part of the agreement with Senior Three-Eyed, and he couldn’t always avoid it.","Additionally, Song Shuhang had a suitable place to distribute his wealth—the Spirit River Su Clan’s annual meeting.","As the first Sage in a thousand years, he naturally couldn’t attend the Spirit","River Su Clan’s annual meeting empty-handed. When the Wealth Distribution Throne was opened, he would be able to keep his promise to the three-eyed youth.","Senior Ma approached Song Shuhang. It stood up on its hind legs and placed one of its front hooves on Song Shuhang’s shoulder while appearing quite mischievous.","After patting Song Shuhang, Senior Ma moved forward and took its position at the starting line.","“Little Tyrannical Song... Just a reminder, there are rules for horse racing. After the race begins, you are absolutely not allowed to kick other horses. Otherwise, you will lose your qualification and fail,” Senior Three-Eyed warned him.","He was concerned that the black horse summoned by Song Shuhang might suddenly attack the other horses during the race.","He had a feeling that this black horse would certainly do that.","“Don’t worry, Senior Three-Eyed. I’m familiar with the rules of the competition,” Song Shuhang nodded and secretly reminded Senior Ma.","“That’s good,” Senior Three-Eyed nodded. As long as the black horse didn’t show any black hooves during the competition, there was still a high chance that the Emperor Ma he had summoned would win.","The divine horses summoned took their positions. Emperor Ma stood in position 5, while the drama horse stood in position 8.","The gate to the racetrack opened.","No. 5 took the lead and galloped ahead.","The eight other divine horses, summoned randomly, followed suit while utilizing their divine abilities to trail closely behind.","However, the black horse seemed distracted and did not move immediately.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Soon, Emperor Ma was halfway through the race track.","Meanwhile, the black horse continued to follow the other horses at a moderate pace.","It was running normally and didn’t use its black hooves or any special abilities. It strictly adhered to the rules.","“I see. A horse that excels in fighting may not be good at running.” Senior Three-Eyed felt more at ease. “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, you can do it!”","“Don’t lose to a three-eyed brat!”","“Run and overtake Emperor Ma!”","All the Eyeball Butler clones in the audience cheered at the top of their lungs. “I’ll roast it on the fire later,” Senior Three-Eyed muttered through gritted teeth.","“You’re spoiling him too much, Senior,” Song Shuhang sighed.","“You’re going to lose,” Senior Three-Eyed said cheerfully.","“Don’t determine the winner or loser until the very end, ” Song Shuhang said calmly.","As he spoke, the horse began overtaking the others one by one. The horses that had originally been in front of him were left behind, one by one.","The horse was panting and sweating.","Senior Three-Eyed furrowed his brows. The third eye on his forehead squeezed shut.","There was something amiss with this situation!","As renowned divine horses from the universe, even if their attributes were limited by the ‘prototype of a racing horse,’ their endurance couldn’t be this bad.","It seemed like they were under tremendous pressure.","Senior Three-Eyed had guessed correctly.","At this moment, all the divine horses on the stage were indeed under immense pressure, both physically and mentally.","Heaven and earth were restraining their progress, and space felt frozen. When the divine horses ran forward, it was as if they were colliding with a solid wall.","At the same time, there was an indescribable pressure in their hearts.","The black horse appeared like a demon king and grew incredibly massive. They had all turned into tiny insects beneath the hooves of the black horse and were about to be easily crushed.","Two breaths later.","The eight randomly summoned divine horses had already fallen behind the drama horse. It continued to run behind Emperor Ma while maintaining a half-body length lead.","Emperor Ma couldn’t help but glance at the black horse, his eyes filled with panic.","“Heehee-” the black horse suddenly stood upright.","Emperor Ma screamed in fear and desperately rushed toward the finish line.","A human-like grin appeared on the black horse’s face.","In the next moment, it began to stride forward with all its might. Its two hind legs executed a mysterious footwork while maintaining its upright posture.","“The upgraded movement technique from the Virtuous Man’s Ten Thousand Mile Walk, Celestial Sprint?” Song Shuhang exclaimed.","The large black horse utilized Celestial Sprint and overtook Emperor Ma in the blink of an eye as it crossed the finish line first. It raised its hooves high and bowed to the audience.","The bet had concluded.","The winner was Song Shuhang.","“I lost again,” Senior Three-Eyed said disappointedly.","Nevertheless, it was better to lose this time. Winning meant that Song Shuhang would not only obtain the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops but also take away the Ruler of the Netherworld Orb.","Hence, whether he won or lost, it was advantageous.","If he won, he would take away his money.","If he lost, he could sit back and watch this fat ball chase after Little Tyrannical Song.","He was suddenly in high spirits.."]},{"number":2330,"title":"Chapter 2330 A Group of Drama Queens","paragraphs":["The betting ceremony came to a close.","The vast horse racing field began its recovery.","Simultaneously, a glass bottle appeared in Song Shuhang's hand. It was roughly the size of a canned beverage and contained a pale blue liquid.","This was the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops.","In the world of cultivation, this treasure was considered priceless. A magical tool with a spirit was an entirely different concept from one without. Injecting a soul into it would fundamentally transform the tool.","Song Shuhang raised the glass bottle and scrutinized the eye drops within. He couldn't help but feel like he sensed a faint trace of a law emanating from these drops.","Laws were something Eighth Stage Profound Sages aspired to comprehend. To advance from the Eighth Stage to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, they needed to undergo three essential stages: 'contacting the laws,' 'adapting to the laws,' and 'merging with the laws.' This process was exceptionally lengthy and spanned tens of thousands of years.","The initial stage, 'contacting the laws,' was the most challenging. Eighth Stage Profound Sages had to grasp the laws from scratch and create something from nothing.","However, if an Eighth Stage Profound Sage could experience the laws in advance, even a brief encounter could save thousands or even tens of thousands of years of arduous cultivation.","'The presence of even a weak 'nomological law' in these drops would be immeasurably valuable,' Song Shuhang pondered.","lightsnοvεl.cοm ...","At that moment, the mischievous horse trotted over to Song Shuhang.","Extending its right front hoof, it aimed it at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang gazed at it with confusion. \"What's going on?\"","The mischievous horse continued to wink at Song Shuhang with its right front hoof still raised. It kept glancing at the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops in Song Shuhang's hand.","\"Oh, Senior Ma, do you want some eye drops?\" Song Shuhang guessed.","The mischievous horse vigorously nodded its head. Song Shuhang seemed to have interpreted its wishes correctly.","\"No problem. After all, we owe this victory to you,\" Song Shuhang replied.","With that, he extended his left hand and opened the mischievous horse's enormous eye. With a puzzled expression, it allowed Song Shuhang to drop a drop of the eye drops into its eye.","The mischievous horse blinked.","In the next moment, it let out a resounding \"Aaah~!\" and swung its hoof.","The force behind the hoof was astonishing. Song Shuhang was sent tumbling through the air, somersaulting more than ten times before landing with a loud thud before leaving a sizable depression in the ground.","Lady Onion, who was inside Song Shuhang's pocket, exposed her sharp horn and spoke softly, \"Shuhang, Shuhang, let me translate for you. Senior Ma was saying, 'Shuhang, you fool! I wanted you to drop the medicine on my hooves, not in my eyes.'\"","\"I know, but I just couldn't resist dropping it in its eyes,\" Song Shuhang thought to himself. He got up from the ground while brushing dirt off his clothes.","The mischievous horse rubbed its eyes with its hooves, causing the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops to ooze out again. It stared at the drops with a baffled expression while studying them intently.","The three-eyed youth was left speechless.","At this point, the racetrack had already been put away. The other nine Mystical Horses had reverted to their original state and disappeared into the small box.","Only the rogue horse summoned by Little Tyrannical Song remained in its current form—a black horse within his small world. It was undoubtedly an immensely powerful entity to be capable of maintaining its 'horse' form even within his small world.","However, the three-eyed youth wondered if anyone in the previous Heavenly Daos had ever utilized the body of a horse as a means to fulfill their Dao.","At that moment, the eyeball butler on the totem pillar in the small world finally broke free from its confinement. It gently patted its body while shaking off the black dust that clung to it.","With great enthusiasm, the eyeball butler approached Song Shuhang while offering congratulations. \"Thank you,\" Lady Onion replied on Song Shuhang's behalf.","\"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, winning this horse race was within everyone's expectations. From the beginning, I knew that Fortune Fairy was always by your side. It's a world of difference from someone unlucky who lost over thirty times in a row,\" the eyeball butler continued.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","The three-eyed youth was equally dumbfounded.","Lady Onion considered for a moment before responding, \"You're too kind.\"","\"By the way, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, are you still looking for a butler? If you are, would you consider me? I've been wanting to change employers for quite some time,\" the eyeball butler remarked with a chuckle.","But before Song Shuhang could respond, he heard the sound of a sharp weapon slicing through the air. In an instant, a spear pierced through the butler's heart.","The three-eyed youth calmly walked over and skewered the eyeballs on the spear. He roasted them over the fire.","Seeing his adept handling of the situation, Song Shuhang couldn't help but feel a momentary sympathy for the three-eyed youth.","How many times had the butler been skewered and roasted before the three-eyed youth became so proficient at it?","The three-eyed youth glanced at Song Shuhang's direction. His third eye on his forehead narrowed. \"Instead of pitying me, you should be concerned about yourself. Don't forget, the bet ceremony has concluded, and the frozen betting funds have been successfully returned to you.\"","There were no more frozen betting funds?","Song Shuhang didn't hesitate at all. He frantically circulated the Virtuous Man's Ten Thousand Mile Walk and rushed toward Senior Three-Eyed. \"Senior Three-Eyed, can't you thaw the bet after I leave your small world?\"","\"Sorry, I don't have this service here,\" Senior Three-Eyed said cheerfully.","Behind him, the fat ball smurf account had already recovered its mobility.","\"Tyrannical Song, you're the first person to treat me as a wager. Even Bai Youyou didn't treat me like this!\" The fat ball was already extremely furious.","The fat ball's small body transformed into a diamond, and the tip of the diamond was aimed at Song Shuhang. \"This shot will pierce through your body. Stand still and die obediently!\"","\"That's terrifying. This shot carries the 'Piercing All Things' law, which specializes in breaking through various defenses, body protection techniques, and body tempering techniques,\" the three-eyed teenager explained as he roasted the eyeball butler.","As he spoke, Song Shuhang had already rushed to his side. In the next moment, he activated the Immortal Smoke Body and turned into a fist-sized puff of smoke behind Senior Three-Eyed.","\"If you want to use me as a shield, you are wrong,\" Senior Three-Eyed calmly said. \"In this world, I'm everywhere, but I'm also nowhere. You see me here, but I'm not actually here. If this cannon is fired, it will fire.\"","Boom!","The shot from the fat ball directly penetrated Senior Three-Eyed's body and hit Song Shuhang.","Pa!","Flames shot in all directions.","Song Shuhang's body exploded into a ball of flames.","It had been a substitute."]},{"number":2331,"title":"Chapter 2331 From Heaven to Hell, Just One Portal Is Needed","paragraphs":["The substitute hadn't even fully formed before it exploded into sparks again.","\"Huh? How did you perform that substitution technique again?\" Senior Three-Eyed raised an eyebrow in mild surprise.","Little Tyrannical Song's maneuvers were quite impressive. He managed to catch even Senior Three-Eyed off guard, not to mention fooling the fat ball.","'Wait a minute. Little Tyrannical Song couldn't pull off something like this on his own. Someone was definitely assisting him!'","Senior Three-Eyed couldn't help but sneak a glance at the big black horse that stood there with a perplexed look on its face. It was highly likely that this big black horse was secretly aiding Song Shuhang in concealing crucial information from both him and the fat ball.","At the same time, Senior Three-Eyed noticed that Song Shuhang's true self had already stepped out from the side of the wooden door. He was halfway through.","The fat ball also caught on. Its cannon swung around and locked onto the wooden door.","\"Hahaha, farewell, fat ball! Don't bother chasing me anymore because there are more important matters waiting for you.\" Song Shuhang laughed and leaped.","The fat ball seethed with anger, but it had to restrain itself for now.","This wasn't the moment to pursue Tyrannical Song.","It had to reclaim the 'existence' that had been bitten off from its main body by the former ruler of the Netherworld!","That portion of its body was more crucial than Tyrannical Song.","Given the choice between the fish and the bear's paw, it could only opt for the fish.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm The fat ball turned around with its gaze fixed on the three-eyed youth.","Senior Three-Eyed was left speechless.","\"My Lord, you've been duped once again,\" the butler on the barbecue rack quivered as he spoke.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had played him for a fool, time and again.","\"Despicable. During the few years I spent in seclusion, it seems human nature has stooped to such levels. It truly pains me,\" Senior Three-Eyed spoke through gritted teeth. \"Thankfully, I was prepared.\"","With those words, he snapped his fingers.","An invisible spatial gate, opened long ago but concealed, materialized beside him.","Meanwhile, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had already made it to the exit of the Wealth Throne.","Freedom awaited him.","He hummed a tune, a bright smile adorning his face. He leaped high into the air, his arms wide open as he welcomed the universe without the pesky tracking of the fat ball.","Whoosh~","As he leaped out of the Throne of Wealth, the world around him spun as the plane of existence warped around him.","Afterwards, Song Shuhang found himself with a radiant smile, his arms still outstretched, and he landed next to the eyeball butler skewered in the small world.","But that smile froze on his face.","As it turned out, the teleportation distance between the two points was minimal. From heaven to hell, only a single portal was required.","\"Welcome back, Mr. Tyrannical Song.\" Despite being skewered on the grill, the eyeball butler maintained his butler's decorum and politely greeted him.","Song Shuhang awkwardly turned his head to look at the three-eyed youth.","\"Oh, well met again, Little Tyrannical Song,\" Senior Three-Eyed smiled gently. \"Fate has a curious way of bringing us together.\"","\"Senior Three-Eyed... Why are you doing this?\" Song Shuhang asked with a tinge of anguish.","\"Because I'm feeling rather ecstatic.\" Senior Three-Eyed grinned. The sun hung high in the sky, and the weather was splendid.","This marked the first time in several years that Senior Three-Eyed felt such joy.","\"Tyrannical... Song...\" On the other side, the fat ball was a mix of happiness and anger.","It once again aimed its cannon at Song Shuhang.","'Let's see who can aid you this time!'","\"Oh well. You forced my hand. Heavenly Tribulation!\" Song Shuhang shouted.","The three-eyed youth was taken aback. Heavenly tribulation wasn't something you could just summon at will.","However, the fat ball on the opposite side suddenly paused. It believed Song Shuhang had the means to attract the heavenly tribulation. All he needed was a drop of blood from Bai Youyou. By using it now, he could draw down heavenly tribulation.","Just as the fat ball hesitated, a black horse's hoof struck its body and sent it flying.","The fat ball spun in the air and returned to its original spherical form.","\"Bai Youyou!\" The spinning fat ball roared in anger.","There was a faint white aura to the feeling of that hoof. There was no mistaking it.","The fat ball jumped up. Its gaze locked onto the black horse with vigilance.","The horse responded with a lively and playful smile.","The three-eyed youth sighed.","With that peculiar black horse in the picture, he couldn't watch the 'fat ball turning Tyrannical Song into mincemeat' scenario unfold.","If the fat ball and the black horse continued causing trouble, his small world wouldn't be able to endure it.","\"Let's put an end to this, everyone,\" the three-eyed youth clapped his hands and spoke in a deep voice. \"I have a suggestion... Why don't we settle our grievances at the gambling table?\"","The bet with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was just a warm-up act.","What lay ahead was the real top-tier gambling game spanning myriad worlds.","Song Shuhang, the fat ball, and the black horse all turned their attention to the three-eyed youth.","\"Let's have a four-person bet,\" the three-eyed youth proposed.","\"I only want the 'existence' that I've lost. What level of gambling capital do I need?\" the fat ball asked in a deep voice.","The three-eyed youth shifted his gaze to Song Shuhang.","\"My apologies, Senior Three-Eyed. I have no desires now. I've just won a bet, and I'm currently in sage mode,\" Song Shuhang said with a faint smile.","\"No worries, Little Tyrannical Song. Since you're in sage mode, I'll just inform you that the 'thing' the fat ball desires isn't with me, but with you, Little Tyrannical Song.\" The three-eyed youth smiled and sent a secret message.","Song Shuhang chuckled and replied, \"But, that thing isn't with me either.\"","\"It's okay, Little Tyrannical Song. What's important now isn't about the facts, but what the fat ball believes. And he believes you have it. Moreover, you know where that 'thing' is, right? So, your wager can be information on where that thing is,\" the three-eyed youth replied.","Song Shuhang gently shook his head.","He would never reveal the location of that thing to the fat ball.","It didn't matter even if he was chased by the fat ball all over the universe.","Even if this day next year was his death anniversary, he would not reveal a single thing!","This was a bottom line that could not be crossed.","Just as Song Shuhang was feeling excited, Fairy Creation's voice sounded in his mind.","\"Go for it, Shuhang.\"","Fairy Creation no longer acted cute. It was her other personality who spoke, and she sounded vastly different.","Song Shuhang was perplexed.","\"I just received an internal intelligence report that a few seniors are secretly planning to move that thing to a special area in the world of the golden lotus. After the transfer was successful, no one in the universe would remember that thing. So, take this opportunity to go up and take a gamble. If you lose, the scholarly faction will immediately make an emergency transfer.\"","The Wielder's small black room?","The world of the golden lotus had developed the function of a small black room?","This was wonderful!","Song Shuhang thought about it for a moment, then raised his head and said, \"Senior Three-Eyed, I've thought it through. How can I be missing in this top-notch gambling game of the myriad worlds?\"","\"In that case, what kind of wager do you want the fat ball to pay?\" Senior Three-Eyed asked.","Song Shuhang suddenly had a thought. \"Senior Three-Eyed, the gambling ritual can strip away things related to concepts, but can it strip away the 'spatial power' of the fat ball's clone?\"","If the fat ball lost its spatial ability, Senior White Two's shuttle would be able to leave it in the dust at any moment."]},{"number":2332,"title":"Chapter 2332 Inexplicable","paragraphs":["\"What a dirty idea, but I like it,\" Senior Three-Eyed replied.","\"Can it really be stripped?\" Song Shuhang's eyes lit up at the suggestion. The mental image of the fat ball losing its 'space authority' couldn't help but bring a smile to his face.","Sometimes, happiness was so easy to obtain. A sudden thought could make people happy for half a day.","\"There will be many restrictions if you can strip a portion of it... The main thing is that the other party is a ruler of the Netherworld. It's impossible to completely strip away its spatial power. My gambling ritual is not that powerful,\" Senior Three-Eyed replied in secret.","\"Moreover, I reckon that the 'gambling ritual' can only strip away its spatial power and authority in the main world, and then condense a 'spatial power seed' as gambling capital. However, it definitely wouldn't be able to affect its true form in the Netherworld Realm. In the Netherworld Realm, it was the ruler. Other than that... There's a time limit to stripping away its spatial ability. At most, it'll take a month. If it's less, it might only take seven or eight days before its spatial authority will be restored,\" Senior Three-Eyed added.","\"That's not worth it,\" Song Shuhang said while holding his chin. If he was only deprived of the authority of space for seven to eight days to a month, the stakes would no longer be equal on the surface.","\"In fact, you're not losing out on a Space Authority Seed,\" Senior Three-Eyed said, \"You can raise the price. You can take away a month's worth of 'spatial authority' as well as any other treasures you want. Just try to make the stakes equal.\"","Although the outcome of the bet was undecided, the stakes had to be equal before the bet started. This was the principle of fairness.","\"Alright, let's do that,\" Song Shuhang nodded in agreement.","...","...","On the side, the fat ball and the playful horse silently watched Song Shuhang and the three-eyed young man's exchange with curiosity.","These two guys had been using secret sound transmission for a long time. The fat ball was growing suspicious.","\"Don't worry, fat ball. My master is just confirming the bet with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.\" the butler had climbed down from the grill at some point in time. He had changed into a new set of clothes and began to serve tea to the fat ball and the horse. \"Fairness has always been the selling point of my master's gambling ceremony.\"","The fat ball was speechless.","At that moment, Senior Three-Eyed gently clapped his hands. \"I've come to an agreement with little Tyrannical Song. He's willing to give you detailed information about the location of the 'treasure' that you want as a wager. How do you feel?\"","The fat ball single eye widened as he stared at the three-eyed youth. \"The treasure is not in your hands?\"","\"I never said that the treasure was in my hands,\" the three-eyed youth smiled slightly. \"I just told you that if you want to get what you want, come in and gamble with me. Now, if you gamble with me, won't you have a chance to get information about the location of the 'treasure' from Tyrannical Song?\"","The fat ball turned and stared at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang expressionlessly said, \"From the beginning to the end, I never said that the treasure was in Senior Three-Eyed's hands. I only said that I knew the location of the 'treasure'. Then, I mentioned that I had made two bets with Senior Three-Eyed, but I never said that I had lost the bet... That's right, fat ball, I was playing you!\"","The fat ball silently bore this grudge in its heart. 'Today, No. Tyrannical Song had provoked him many times, so as long as he left this small world, he would definitely crush Tyrannical Song to death.'","The eyeball butler handed Song Shuhang a cup of fragrant tea and added, \"So, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, do you accept a butler? I like you more and more. I feel that you and I have a lot in common.\"","The stone tablet hanging on Song Shuhang's waist suddenly fell silent after hearing this. Not long ago, it had also felt that Song Shuhang and it hit it off very well. They had even agreed to fight against the big boss together after they came out of the forbidden area of the Jia 'er Sacred Mountain. But now, it didn't want to talk about dissing the big boss.","\"Hahahaha!\" A burst of laughter came out from the mouth of the horse. It almost sounded like a pre-recorded sitcom laugh track.","\"Then, do you agree to this wager?\" The three-eyed youth asked.","\"How can I guarantee the accuracy of the information?\" the fat ball said.","If it wasn't for the part that had been bitten off by the Scholarly Sage, it would have exploded long ago!","lightsnοvεl.cοm However, this concerned its future and whether it could continue to survive. Therefore, no matter how great the grievance was, it could only grit its teeth and endure it for the time being.","A little forbearance would ruin a big plan. It was not too late to take revenge in the future.","\"You've seen my 'betting ceremony' before, so you can trust me completely. After the gambling ceremony begins, all the gambling capital will be stripped off and handed over to the winner without reservation,\" the three-eyed youth said confidently.","After a moment of silence, the fat ball finally gave a stiff nod.","\"Good! Since you have agreed to Tyrannical Song's wager, Tyrannical Song has some requirements for your wager. No matter who wins or loses in the end, the stakes must be fair,\" the three-eyed youth slowly said.","\"What do you want?\" The fat ball coldly looked at Song Shuhang with its metallic eyes.","\"I want the fat ball boss's spatial authority for a month, plus... Yes, a dragon-shaped commander seal,\" Song Shuhang said. It would be easier to bargain after asking for an exorbitant price.","\"The commander's seal is out of the question. Don't even think about it. In return, I can use the information of a magic tool as a wager,\" the fat ball said slowly. \"The location of the Scholarly Sage's magical treasure, the 'Confucian Classic.'\"","Song Shuhang sighed. \"Big Boss Fatty Ball, you've hit my soft spot. Fine... I agree.\"","Just now, when the fat ball mentioned the 'Confucian Classic,' Song Shuhang clearly sensed Fairy Creation acting strangely inside his body. She couldn't control her emotions.","The three-eyed youth nodded in satisfaction. He then looked at the horse and said, \"As for you, what kind of wager do you want?\"","The horse opened his mouth wide and grinned.","In the next moment, it opened its mouth and spat out a rune.","The moment this symbol appeared, the fat ball and the three-eyed youth's expressions changed drastically. The two of them quickly retreated... However, the two of them quickly approached the rune and observed it carefully.","Their instincts told them that this rune was very dangerous, but they also felt that this rune was extraordinary. It contained something very, very important to the ruler of the Netherworld.","However, with their eyesight, they couldn't see through this rune at all.","I don't understand, but I feel it's very serious.","The three-eyed youth and the fat ball looked at each other. It was three eyes against one eye. The fat ball was completely defeated.","\"I agree with the wager.\" The fat ball was the first to speak. It suspected that this rune was related to the mystery of Bai Youyou. If it could obtain this 'rune', it might be able to continue staying in the Netherworld Realm like Bai Youyou, even if it didn't have to search for the' existence' that it had lost!","\"I have no objections either,\" The three-eyed youth said with a nod."]},{"number":2333,"title":"Chapter 2333 My Wish Is to Make the Fat Ball Experience My Pain","paragraphs":["At that moment, Senior Three-Eyed and the smurf of the fat ball boss simultaneously turned their gaze toward Song Shuhang.","\"Of course, I'm in agreement,\" Song Shuhang quickly responded.","The two rulers of the Netherworld fixed their eyes on him, one with a single eye and the other with three eyes. It created quite the imposing atmosphere.","Furthermore, the 'rune' in question had originally been staked by the horse. Song Shuhang would have agreed even if it were something as trivial as a horseshoe since it was, after all, his own horse.","\"Now it's my turn,\" the three-eyed youth said as he took out three seeds. \"Currently, I don't possess an item of equivalent value. If the quality is lacking, I'll compensate with quantity. These three seeds contain the blueprints for three special magical tools: one is a 'Planet-level strategic magical treasure,' another is a powerful consumable magical tool known as the 'Sky Opening Eye,' and the last is an 'Absolute Force Field Shield' capable of covering an entire planet. These three designs of mine should be sufficient as the wager for this occasion.\"","Upon hearing Senior Three-Eyed's description, Song Shuhang couldn't help but think of the dreaded big-eyed planet boss who had caused him so much trouble. The big-eyed planet boss was among the top three adversaries Song Shuhang hoped never to encounter, and the only one who had infiltrated his Inner World.","A Star Traveller-level body, a fearsome offensive magical tool, and an absolute force field shield covering the entire body—Senior Three-Eyed's three designs clearly resembled the prototype of the big-eyed planet boss.","It was astonishing that Senior Three-Eyed would offer this as a wager.","However, Song Shuhang had a nagging feeling that there was something missing from this three-in-one design.","He pinched his chin while deep in thought.","Moments later, he asked, \"Senior, do you happen to possess the blueprint for the Heart Drive Furnace?\" He had remembered a crucial detail and inquired.","Senior Three-Eyed appeared surprised by the question. How did Song Shuhang know about this closely-guarded secret?","\"The heart drive furnace is the cunning aspect of my master's plan. He revealed designs for strategic planetary magical equipment, weapons, and shield designs but kept the blueprint for the heart hidden, and that's quite underhanded,\" the eyeball butler muttered, its voice audible to everyone in the room while refilling their teacups.","The three-eyed youth was left speechless.","At that moment, the fat ball chimed in, \"Although the core blueprint is missing, the value of the three designs is sufficient.\"","It didn't require the core blueprint because it possessed advanced core technology from the power furnace that was enough to support this strategic magical treasure. It readily accepted the bet.","The horse concurred with a snort.","Again, the attention of Senior Three-Eyed's three eyes, the horse's two eyes, and the fat ball's single eye converged on Song Shuhang.","The pressure was palpable.","\"I agree,\" Song Shuhang affirmed. His decision was straightforward; Senior White Two had already mastered the core technique.","Senior White Two had managed to deceive the big-eyed planet's boss into handing over a heart power furnace, which he then incorporated into Little Sun T233. Along the way, he had conducted extensive research on it. Given Senior White Two's skills, replicating a 'heart core power core' was well within his capability.","Furthermore, considering Song Shuhang's present strength, financial resources, and manpower, constructing a magical treasure of this caliber was a daunting task. If luck wasn't on their side, they might never have the opportunity to build it within their lifetimes. Financial resources were the primary obstacle.","Hence, even if he won the bet, Song Shuhang would likely keep the design as a closely guarded secret or share it exclusively with Senior White and Senior White Two.","\"You three are quite straightforward. Were it me, I wouldn't be so quick to let go of my master's secrets,\" the butler quipped with a cheeky smile.","This time, the totem pole's appearance was remarkably different and resembled a torch.","lightsΝοvel.cοm The eyeball butler's eye fixated on the torch's central point as its form flickered into a blazing flame.","Song Shuhang covertly rubbed his forehead. He wondered if it was just his imagination, but when he had first met Senior Three-Eyed, the eyeball butler hadn't exhibited such mischievous behavior.","However, after multiple interactions with Senior Three-Eyed, he had noticed the eyeball butler growing progressively more unrestrained.","When in the company of more individuals, the eyeball butler's actions became increasingly wanton.","Was it familiarity that prompted it to shed its disguise and reveal its true nature? Or perhaps... infection?","\"At any rate, I certainly didn't infect it,\" Song Shuhang muttered to himself.","The three-eyed youth observed the burning eyeball butler and lightly touched his own chest. He, too, sensed that the eyeball butler was remarkably lively today. It was akin to a peacock flaunting its feathers, one that was eager to make an impression.","Could it be harboring thoughts of switching allegiances?","...","...","\"Now that the terms are settled, let the gambling ceremony commence. What shall we wager on next?\" the three-eyed youth inquired.","\"Rock, paper, scissors?\" Song Shuhang suggested a simple and straightforward game after having already engaged in one bet with Senior Three-Eyed.","Upon voicing his suggestion, a horse's hoof was extended toward him.","The horse shot a pointed look at Song Shuhang. If he couldn't fashion a rock-paper-scissors shape from this horse's hoof today, he'd consider serving it to him as an unconventional delicacy.","\"How about a duel to the death?\" the fat ball retorted while locking its cold gaze onto Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was unfazed by the challenge. \"If you're restricted to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, I should be able to manage.\"","During the previous bet with Senior Three-Eyed, he had evened the odds by suppressing his strength, level, and attributes to match his opponent's. Fairness was the hallmark of Senior Three-Eyed's gambling ceremonies.","As long as he constrained the fat ball to the Seventh Stage, Song Shuhang harbored confidence in his ability to withstand its assaults.","The playful horse emitted a long, resounding neigh.","\"Understood. I have a playstyle that should suit everyone,\" Senior Three-Eyed declared while extracting yet another box.","This time, the box was filled with pitch-black chaos. It was distinct from the toy models previously presented.","\"The game's rules are simple. The last survivor wins and may choose to withdraw at any time. It's called 'World of Wishes.' Before entering the game, each participant's most cherished wish will be realized and transformed into a talent upon entering the game,\" Senior Three-Eyed explained.","\"A wish, like world peace?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"It's a wish that can be materialized and turned into a talent. If your wish is world peace, the materialized talent might be a potent defensive ability,\" Senior Three-Eyed clarified.","\"Are you ready?\" he queried before opening the box.","Song Shuhang, the fat ball boss, and the playful horse exchanged glances.","\"Wishes... My wish is to obliterate the fat ball and make it experience the torment of being pursued by others.\" Song Shuhang contemplated, with the thought persistently recurring in his mind.","The fat ball, however, fixed a steadfast gaze upon Song Shuhang and concealed its inner thoughts.","Moments later, the game began.","Within the chaotic realm, Song Shuhang suddenly underwent a transformation. He became a ball."]},{"number":2334,"title":"Chapter 2334 An Elusive Little Rat","paragraphs":["Its body was round, devoid of hands, feet, a belly button, or any other organs.","But despite the lack of eyes, it could see. Despite the absence of ears, it could hear. Despite the dearth of a mouth, it could speak.","With a bit of concentration, it could achieve a 360-degree vision without blind spots. And with a mere thought, it could elevate its 'vision' to look down on itself and the distant surroundings from a higher vantage point. It was a remarkable convenience.","After transforming into this spherical form, Song Shuhang remained remarkably composed. Having accumulated ample experience entering dreams and changing appearances, he maintained an admirable calmness—so composed that it even pained him.","As he experimented with the second type of vision, Song Shuhang could 'see' his current appearance clearly.","It was a distinct and unique form—a spherical, chubby, liquid metal ball.","\"As expected, this is the body of the fat ball,\" Song Shuhang remarked as his body rolled through the air. His intent wasn't to be cute; instead, he was quickly adapting to this novel body by rolling, a valuable skill honed through numerous dream experiences.","\"But why would I take on his appearance? Could it be... because of the wish I made when I entered this world?\"","Song Shuhang recalled the wish he made upon entering this world—to blow up the fat ball and make it experience the pain of being pursued by him.","And so, he had transformed into the fat ball.","In that case, how would his previous wish manifest?","Now that he had become the fat ball, would he be beaten and pursued by others? Would the current Song Shuhang experience the torment of being chased and beaten?","Or perhaps... Now, he had turned into the fat ball, while the fat ball had become Song Shuhang? Would he then be able to chase after Song Shuhang and blow up Fatty Ball Shuhang and allow it to experience this kind of anguish?","\"It seems to add up.\" Song Shuhang contemplated and made his judgment.","However, Senior Three-Eyed had cautioned him when opening this game world that wishes would only materialize into certain talents or abilities, thus introducing many variables.","Perhaps the fat ball hadn't transformed into Song Shuhang and maintained its appearance as the fat ball.","Or perhaps the fat ball had become Ball Shuhang but still retained the ability to defeat him.","\"So, regardless of the answer, the key is whether or not I can locate the other Song Shuhang. If there is indeed another Song Shuhang, I can attempt to defeat him or be defeated by him,\" Song Shuhang concluded with a thought as he changed his vision from a bird's-eye view to 360-degree vision.","In essence, the first thing he needed to do was find the Song Shuhang that might exist in this world.","If the other party was the fat ball, it would likely be in a state of confusion. It was a good opportunity to take advantage of their confusion.","The thought of using his fat ball body to chase after Ball Shuhang excited Song Shuhang.","Perhaps it would be amusing to bully himself and witness his own chase and screams.","After rolling a few times in the air, Song Shuhang stabilized himself. He had already grown familiar with controlling the fat ball's body.","\"Transform!\" Song Shuhang called out lightly. His liquid body obediently reshaped into the form of a spaceship.","He promptly started darting through the starry expanse of the chaotic world.","As he flew, his divine sense scanned his surroundings.","This chaotic world was designed for gambling, so the map was unlikely to be infinitely large. There would always be a chance for the four contestants to encounter one another.","\"Where is the other 'me' in this world?\" Song Shuhang pondered as he flew.","After several minutes of flight, on a nearby barren satellite, Song Shuhang spotted a familiar figure.","It was a young man with a kind face, short hair, and dressed in ordinary attire. He didn't even wear a robe befitting his level, and his appearance evoked a sense of sympathy.","\"Shuhang, I've found you!\"","The existence of another Song Shuhang implied that his wish had indeed come true. He had transformed into the fat ball, and the fat ball had taken on the form of Song Shuhang.","The subsequent test would revolve around the extent of the changes in strength and realm.","To ensure fairness in the bet, the strength and realms of the four contestants would likely be suppressed to the same level.","Even if he couldn't overpower this young man, being on an equal footing meant he should be able to defend himself effectively.","Song Shuhang noticed the shabby young man across from him, and the young man noticed him as well!","Fear welled up in the young man's eyes.","Without a moment's hesitation, the young man swiftly turned and fled without looking back. Song Shuhang hadn't even launched an attack, and yet, the young man was already in full retreat.","\"There's no doubt about it. The current 'me' is indeed the fat ball. It has assumed my appearance and, upon seeing the liquid metal ball heading toward it, deduced that it's me, Song Shuhang. That's why it immediately fled.\" Song Shuhang grinned with satisfaction.","\"Fatty ball, you've met your match today!","\"Today, I'll let you experience how the pitiful and helpless Song Shuhang gets bullied, chased, and beaten by the relentless ball!","\"My liver aches, my pain. Today, I'll make sure you experience it firsthand.","\"Shuhang, don't go! Taste my cannon!\"","The delighted Profound Sage Tyrannical Song manipulated his liquid metal body to form a thick cannon barrel on the spaceship while locking onto Ball Shuhang in front of him.","With a thought, a formidable beam of light shot toward the fleeing Song Shuhang.","The fat ball's attack was straightforward, potent, easy to use, and came with a 'lock-on' feature—making it exceptionally thrilling to engage in combat.","Before him, Song Shuhang moved with the grace of a serpent and narrowly evaded the incoming attack.","Song Shuhang could discern that the other party wasn't yet accustomed to Tyrannical Song's body. As it evaded, its movements seemed disconcertingly out of sync.","\"You can't escape, Ball Tyrannical Song!\" Nine cannon barrels sprouted on Song Shuhang's body once more, and all ten cannons locked onto Ball Song Shuhang simultaneously.","Boom, boom, boom~","There were cannon beams, automatic tracking missiles, shotgun pellets, electromagnetic pulse blasts... A multitude of artillery fire was unleashed in unison. The once-flawless satellite now bore multiple craters.","Ball Song Shuhang could only evade in a sorry state, and it was even sent flying several times by the force of the artillery fire.","It was exhilarating.","Song Shuhang felt a sense of catharsis as he vented his frustrations.","Humans often ended up living in a manner they detested. Perhaps this was the case for Song Shuhang?","\"In one fell swoop, I'm taking you down!\" Song Shuhang extended five more barrels from his abdomen and increased the firepower as he unleashed a barrage against Ball Song Shuhang.","lightsnοvεl.cοm Ball Song Shuhang continued to evade. He was evidently growing more adept at navigating Song Shuhang's body in the process.","Its movements became increasingly agile, and its escape speed grew swifter.","Fifteen cannons fired simultaneously, but they still couldn't bring him down."]},{"number":2335,"title":"Chapter 2335 Look What The Horse Dragged In","paragraphs":["As Ball Song Shuhang grew more agile, he grew more elusive. He swiftly adapted to Song Shuhang's body after enduring a few blasts. He even learned to use defensive techniques with this body to counter the artillery fire coming from behind.","Both sides chased and countered each other, each employing their respective methods. It didn't take long for them to circle the bald satellite. The 15 cannons belonging to Song Shuhang left neat craters on the satellite's surface. Despite Ball Song Shuhang's ragged appearance, he was still bouncing around.","\"This won't do. If this continues, the Fat Ball will become more proficient and my advantage will gradually fade.\" Song Shuhang pondered.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Although he had taken on the appearance of the fat ball, he was not the genuine article. He lacked the knowledge of certain secret techniques and divine powers. If he couldn't take down his quarry, the tables could turn in no time.","\"It's time to switch forms... I should change into the fortress mode that the fat ball used on Earth.\" Song Shuhang made up his mind. His body transformed once again and numerous cannons emerged all over.","On the opposite side, Ball Song Shuhang sensed a significant surge in energy and halted his escape. He crossed his arms to summon the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure to create an Impregnable Holy City in front of him to shield himself.","The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure was a life-bound magical treasure and essentially became part of the cultivator's body. Just as Song Shuhang could use the transformation ability after becoming the fat ball, Ball Song Shuhang could take on Song Shuhang's form.","Song Shuhang felt a faint ache in his waist.","\"Full-screen attack!\" he ordered, determined to unleash maximum firepower.","Boom! Countless cannons illuminated the starry sky, and billions of turrets blazed gloriously. In this situation, more firepower was better, and scale was more impressive. The barrage was relentless and left no room for evasion.","\"Face your proudest attack, Ball Song Shuhang!\"","The artillery fire resembled a fierce and intense heavy rain. Ball Song Shuhang sought refuge behind the Impregnable Holy City in an attempt to withstand the onslaught. However, under such relentless artillery fire, the Impregnable Holy City couldn't hold out for long.","As the cannons continued to bombard, it eventually crumbled and the volley reached Ball Song Shuhang's body.","\"Now!\" Song Shuhang seized the opportunity and lunged toward Ball Song Shuhang's head amid the barrage.","His liquid body split into two parts—one maintained the cannon fire while the other expanded into a giant net in an attempt to ensnare Ball Song Shuhang. Song Shuhang intended to devour him and establish a karmic bond with the fat ball. Even if it failed, he had split his body to ensure a quick escape.","However, just as the net was about to ensnare the youth, a rushing sound of hooves filled the air. A pitch-black horse without horseshoes or a saddle appeared and charged across the path.","The horse collided with Song Shuhang's liquid metal body.","Pa! The part of Song Shuhang's body that was maintaining the battle fortress was sent flying by the hoof. The large net meant to ensnare Ball Song Shuhang quickly lost control and form.","Ball Song Shuhang extended his hand and quickly retreated to the side while clutching the large net formed by half of Song Shuhang's body.","Boom! The other half of Song Shuhang's body was sent flying by the horse's hooves and created another huge hole in the bald satellite.","Song Shuhang was left speechless. He gazed at the horse in the sky as his heart sank.","\"Wait! Hold on!\" he called out in a desperate attempt, \"Senior Ma, stop! I'm Shuhang!\"","The pitch-black horse in the air snorted in clear disdain. Then, it charged toward Song Shuhang.","The scene resembled a charging superhero at full speed that carried the momentum of a thousand galloping horses. The horse's hooves, in particular, emitted a seven-colored divine artifact light. Being hit by both hooves could spell the end of the bet.","At this moment, Song Shuhang had just crawled out of the hole. The horse was on a collision course with him. There was no way to avoid it.","Song Shuhang's heart turned cold. Did his wish require him to endure both branches at once? Did he wish to kill the fat ball, now transformed into Song Shuhang, and get kicked to death by Senior Ma?","With no way to dodge it, Song Shuhang transformed his body back into a liquid ball. In this precarious moment, he could only take a gamble and meet the incoming horse hooves with his soft form.","Just as the horse was about to hit Song Shuhang, a large net suddenly fell from the sky and covered the horse.","In an instant, Ball Song Shuhang activated the Instant flash technique and dashed to the side of the horse.","\"Ah!\" Ball Song Shuhang roared and rained a barrage of blows onto the horse. His fists were like meteors, each strike causing tremors on the bald satellite beneath.","The horse let out a wail as its charge was disrupted, but its body still collided with Song Shuhang due to inertia.","Ball Song Shuhang persisted in pressing forward while pummeling the horse relentlessly.","Ball Song Shuhang lay on the horse's body while delivering a barrage of punches. The horse lay on Song Shuhang's liquid body. It screamed in agony while Song Shuhang's soft liquid form endured successive heavy blows.","\"What a turn of events!\" Song Shuhang wondered. His head was beginning to ache."]},{"number":2336,"title":"Chapter 2336 Playing It Too Far?","paragraphs":["Once Song Shuhang had calmed down, he started to make some educated guesses. He suspected that the 'Song Shuhang Ball' and 'Drama Queen Horse' in front of him... were not their original selves!","It wasn't just him and the fat ball who had swapped bodies. It was possible that all four contestants who entered this small world had exchanged identities.","However, the problem was, apart from him turning into the fat ball, it was impossible to guess how the other three individuals had changed and what they looked like now.","If the person playing this game were Senior White or Senior White Two, it would have been easier to distinguish them. However, Senior Ma's words lacked the terrifying charm of the two Senior Whites and made it difficult to identify him.","Just as Song Shuhang was pondering this, Tyrannical Song, whom Song Shuhang had mistakenly thought of as Ball Song Shuhang while being pummeled by the horse, cupped his fists and shouted in the passionate tone of a movie protagonist, \"This is my final attack. Prepare to meet your end, black horse!\"","A thought immediately popped into Song Shuhang's mind.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Ball Song Shuhang wasn't the fat ball, but the horse?","This was getting complicated.","Tyrannical Song wasn't really Tyrannical Song, and Tyrannical Song wasn't a ball. Tyrannical Song was the ball, but the ball wasn't Tyrannical Song...","\"Boom!\"","A deafening explosion rang out.","Tyrannical Song clenched his fists and forcefully struck the black horse.","This attack was imbued with the power of the destruction attribute's laws.","The black horse let out an extremely pitiful cry. It sounded like a horse being slaughtered in a butcher's shop.","The fat ball, which was Song Shuhang in his current form, didn't feel much pain under the black horse. It only felt its body shake as a fist's force passed through the black horse, through its own body, and then through the bald satellite behind it.","A few moments later, there was an even louder explosion.","It was the small, bald satellite that Song Shuhang had been leaning against. It had been blown to bits.","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted.","Heavens, this was too exaggerated. Although the small satellite wasn't large, it had been obliterated by a single punch. How immensely powerful was that punch?","Even if Song Shuhang were back in his original body, used all his magical treasures, activated all his body-tempering techniques, and employed every defensive method at his disposal, he would still perish after taking such a punch.","The tremendous impact of the small satellite's explosion sent Song Shuhang, the black horse, and Tyrannical Song soaring.","However, right after the explosion, the small satellite suddenly vanished, along with the explosive force, as if it had been erased from existence.","It seemed like this was a rule of the game space.","Song Shuhang and the others were thrown into the starry sky.","During their flight, a massive hand suddenly reached out, grabbed Song Shuhang, hoisted him up, and placed him into a box.","\"A seal?\" Song Shuhang was taken aback.","He looked up and saw Tyrannical Song, now in the form of a liquid metal ball, cheerfully wrapping him up and tying a bow on the box.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","The person doing this was definitely not the fat ball. If it were the fat ball, Song Shuhang would have been squashed flat instantly.","This particular Tyrannical Song was either Senior Three-Eyed or the horse.","From the looks of it, it was more likely to be the horse.","After placing Song Shuhang in the liquid metal ball, Tyrannical Song began to undergo a transformation.","In the blink of an eye, it morphed from Tyrannical Song into a ball of liquid metal.","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted.","\"I'm invincible.\" The newly-formed ball of liquid metal pinched its throat and awkwardly recited a line with a sneer.","Then, it sealed the box containing Song Shuhang inside a meteorite.","With everything set up, its form began to roll in the void, all the while letting out a classic \"ah, ah, ah\" from Staying Alive by Bee Gees.","In the distance, the black horse finally steadied itself.","It turned its head and scanned the area, only to realize that the original Tyrannical Song had disappeared. Fortunately, the ball of liquid metal hadn't gone too far.","The giant black horse lowered its head slightly. Its body moved as it once more charged toward the ball of liquid metal that was suspected to be Song Shuhang.","Boom!","The massive black horse moved at lightning speed and appeared instantly in front of the ball of liquid metal. Its front hooves mercilessly struck down.","The ball of liquid metal seemed unable to dodge in time and took the hooves head-on. It was sent flying once again.","\"Senior Ma, stop! I'm truly Shuhang! I'm not lying to you! If you don't believe me, I know you have a mole on your right inner thigh! This secret is between you and me!\" The ball of liquid metal continued to scream as it was sent soaring.","However, the black horse remained unfazed. After catching up with the ball of liquid metal, it repeatedly swung its front hooves and dealt hundreds of thousands of blows in a single second.","When compared to the agony of being trampled by thousands of horses on a battlefield, the damage from hundreds of thousands of hooves per second was truly terrifying.","The ball of liquid metal's form exploded and turned into countless water droplets that scattered throughout the starry sky.","Nevertheless, the black horse didn't let up. It stood up and spewed forth a wave of flames as majestic as a dragon's breath.","These flames were incredibly formidable and capable of incinerating anything. As long as the target didn't die, the flames wouldn't extinguish.","Each and every drop of liquid metal carried flames with them. The entire starry sky turned into a sea of fire.","\"I know you're not Senior Ma. Who are you? Are you Senior Three-Eyed or the fat ball?\" In the air, the liquid metal droplets that had been blown up gathered together again to form a fiery ball.","The large black horse on the opposite side remained silent. It simply lowered its head and charged toward the ball of liquid metal.","Once again, a ball and a horse were locked in an entangled battle.","Song Shuhang while inside the box, was able to witness the entire battle through the special ability of the fat ball.","Now, he could be certain that the previous Tyrannical Song and the current fat ball were undoubtedly just putting on a show.","It appeared as if they were in a pitiable state during the battle, but from start to finish, they were simply teasing the viewer.","Song Shuhang wondered whether this black horse was Senior Three-Eyed or the fat ball.","However, regardless of who it was, they were probably at a disadvantage when confronted by the dramatic horse.","Song Shuhang contemplated and made his guesses.","But in the next moment, he received a figurative slap to the face.","The fat ball that had been teasing the black horse was pressed down to the ground by the black horse. It was unable to get up and seemed completely defenseless.","The black horse raised its head imposingly.","Beneath its hooves, the liquid metal ball had turned into a puddle. It was unable to even maintain its spherical shape.","The victory was clear!","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","Had they taken the play-acting too far?","\"What in the world is happening?\" He felt an excruciating headache coming on.","Meanwhile, just as the black horse raised its hooves and prepared to deliver the final blow to the liquid metal ball and secure victory, a figure quietly emerged from the shadows of the starry sky to launch a despicable sneak attack on the black horse.","The newcomer was none other than the Scholarly Sage!"]},{"number":2337,"title":"Chapter 2337 In the Future, I’ll Treat Senior Three-Eyed Well","paragraphs":["As soon as the Scholarly Sage made his entrance, he wasted no time in thrusting a poisoned blade toward the black horse. Simultaneously, he extended his hand and hurled another poisoned blade at the puddle of liquid metal.","He was extremely greedy. He was aiming to take down two adversaries the moment he arrived!","However, his timing was impeccable and coincided with the moment when the black horse and the supposed black horse fat ball were deciding the outcome of their battle.","It was the perfect opportunity for a sneak attack and potential double kill.","But just as the poisoned blade was about to pierce the black horse, the black horse suddenly sprang into action. While it had been vigorously pounding the fat ball with its front hooves, it abruptly stood upright and cleverly evaded the Scholarly Sage's sneak attack. At the same time, it raised its right leg high and executed a graceful roundhouse kick toward the Scholarly Sage.","Evasion and counterattack had occurred in an instant!","Observing from the sidelines, Song Shuhang, locked inside the box, keenly noticed something. There was no mole on the inside of the black horse's right leg.","Furthermore, the black horse's counterattack flowed smoothly, as if it had always been a horse.","...","...","The collision of the hooves of the black horse and the Scholarly Sage produced a deafening sound.","The Scholarly Sage was kicked back, but upon realizing that his sneak attack had failed, he wisely disengaged rather than pushing further. Using the momentum, he distanced himself from the black horse.","However, the liquid metal ball on the ground wasn't as fortunate. It had been struck by the poisoned blade thrown by the Scholarly Sage. Its form began to evaporate. It was now on the brink of death.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm \"I should take care of Tyrannical Song first, but unfortunately, this is just a small-scale game world,\" the Scholarly Sage remarked with a tinge of regret in his tone.","While locked inside the box, Song Shuhang immediately identified the Scholarly Sage's true identity. It was the actual fat ball.","The fat ball's wish likely had something to do with the Scholarly Sage...","Song Shuhang could make an educated guess about the nature of its wish. It probably sought victory and the retrieval of the entity bitten by the Scholarly Sage.","Hence, upon entering this small world, it took on the appearance of the Scholarly Sage.","Since the Scholarly Sage was the fat ball, it meant that the black horse was... Senior Three-Eyed?","After considering this possibility, Song Shuhang wiped his brow in relief.","Earlier, the black horse had been fervently attacking the fat ball, even using its hooves to stomp on it.","This was with the knowledge that the fat ball was Song Shuhang. In other words, Senior Three-Eyed had wanted to beat him up and literally stomp him to death with its hooves!","\"Maybe I should treat Senior Three-Eyed with more respect in the future. After all, Senior is the ruler of the Netherworld. I shouldn't push my luck too far. What if Senior Three-Eyed sneakily beheads me while we're having a drink and chat?\"","\"After this game ends, I should make amends with Senior Three-Eyed... he probably won't try to trick me again.\" Song Shuhang pondered to himself.","...","...","At this moment, the black horse and the Scholarly Sage, transformed by the fat ball, were already locked in an intense battle.","A myriad of spells, sword techniques, and divine abilities, incomprehensible and dizzying, were unleashed as easily as one's exhalation.","The entire star field was enveloped in the radiance of their spells. Stars shattered.","The two of them transformed into beams of light that were leaping, flashing, and colliding within the starry expanse.","The small world couldn't withstand the forces exerted by both sides and showed signs of collapse.","In comparison, Song Shuhang's imitation of the fat ball's fireworks cannon beams had been child's play.","Their battle grew increasingly fierce.","As they fought, they inadvertently returned to their starting point, where Song Shuhang was concealed within a meteorite. The pool of liquid metal had become the horse.","At this stage in the battle, both sides had committed nearly all their energy to the conflict. They couldn't even spare a thought for their surroundings.","Explosions and devastation became the predominant theme in this star field.","Between the Scholarly Sage and the black horse, countless laws clashed and annihilated one another.","In a trance, it was as if the illusion of an entire world was being constantly born and destroyed in the struggle between the two.","...","...","When the fat ball poured all its energy into this battle, it failed to realize that not far away, the liquid metal pool, which had been stabbed with a poisoned blade, was quietly reforming.","The corners of the black horse's mouth curled slightly.","In the next instant, it launched an attack. The charge it had been secretly accumulating for a long time slammed into the fat ball.","The fat ball was sent flying, but it remained focused on the horse.","An opportunity presented itself.","The liquid metal pool exploded and reshaped into a white horse. The front hooves of this white horse shimmered with nomological runes representing 'calamity,' and it delivered a ruthless blow to the back of the fat ball, who had taken the form of the Scholarly Sage.","In addition to the 'calamity' law's effects, there was also a faint trace of supreme power.","The identity of the horse had been confirmed!","The fat ball spat out blood and its body gradually turned transparent. After battling the black horse for so long, it wasn't seriously injured, but the blow from the pair of hooves on its back had taken its toll.","Two horses, one black and one white, confronted the fat ball.","\"So, Senior Three-Eyed is teaming up with the horse?\" Song Shuhang, inside the meteorite, was left dumbfounded.","Were they working together to eliminate the fat ball from the game?","The fat ball, transformed into the Scholarly Sage, once again coughed up blood, and its body gradually became translucent.","\"I underestimated your tactics. I didn't expect you to have such a clever scheme,\" it remarked, locking eyes with the two horses, one black and one white.","\"I never did,\" the white horse responded. Is voice carried the unmistakable tone of Senior White.","\"Were you running two accounts at once? There's no need to explain further. You and I are both rulers of the Netherworld, so a little cheating is perfectly acceptable. I can only blame myself for not being resourceful enough.\"","\"Allow me to clarify. The answer is quite simple... Fellow Daoist Three-Eyed chose to forfeit shortly after encountering me at the beginning of the match.\" The white horse sported a smile reminiscent of a human's. \"Before entering the game, my wish was to enhance my 'acting skills' to the next level. This wish materialized as Ultimate Acting, and one of its sub-skills is Two-in-One, which allows me to temporarily borrow Fellow Daoist Three-Eyed's body.\"","\"I find it hard to believe that Three-Eyed would be defeated by you so quickly. His strength is on par with ours.\"","\"That's why I mentioned the forfeiture. After forfeiting, he provided us with three incarnations. He willingly gave us three of them,\" the white horse explained slowly.","In essence, from start to finish, everything had been a two-player show!"]},{"number":2338,"title":"Chapter 2338 I Choose to Bite the Dust","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang made up his mind that after the gambling game ended, he'd get a trophy customized and present it to Senior Ma.","Apart from thinking that Senior Ma was an amazing actor, Song Shuhang had nothing more to say.","\"Why did Three-Eyed forfeit? There's no way he wouldn't be tempted by the treasures in the gamble... Wait, I get it now. You bribed him!\" The fat ball faded gradually. It was already out of the game and could only struggle to utter its last few sentences.","It had figured it out.","In this wager, Three-Eyed had put forth three magical treasure designs, Song Shuhang had contributed information about the existence of the bitten part of the ball, and the fat ball had staked its bet on the seed of spatial authority condensed from a month's worth of spatial energy and the whereabouts of the Scholarly Sage's magical treasure, the Scholarly Canon.","However, none of these treasures seemed to entice the three-eyed youth.","The seed of spatial authority, the saint's magical treasure, and the lost existence of the ball all appeared to be useless to the three-eyed individual.","Only Senior White's wager, the Supreme Talisman, had the power to entice Three-Eyed.","Therefore, if Big Horse White possessed more than one rune, it would be a straightforward task to bribe Three-Eyed.","\"You're even more cunning than I thought, Bai Youyou,\" the chubby ball reluctantly admitted.","As he spoke, the chubby ball's figure slowly vanished.","But it wasn't giving up.","Even though it had lost the bet, Song Shuhang was still in play.","As soon as he exited this space, it would make a comeback and take Song Shuhang down after wringing the information out of him.","The big black horse maintained its posture of standing on its hind legs and shrugged its front hooves.","The big white horse turned towards the meteorite where Song Shuhang was hiding and spoke in a deep voice, \"Come out, Tyrannical Song. I know you're hiding there. I can smell you.\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"Come out, my ass! I'm currently sealed in this box by your very hooves. How do you expect me to come out?\"","The black horse's front hooves landed, and then it moved gracefully to the side of the meteorite. It retrieved the box and opened it.","Song Shuhang had been compressed into a ball. He rapidly expanded like a balloon and returned to his original form.","Senior Three-Eyed had already forfeited, and the chubby ball had already tapped out. Now, only Song Shuhang and the horses remained in the game.","\"Go on,\" Song Shuhang said.","He wanted to ask the horse whether he should voluntarily forfeit to end the wager. He couldn't beat the horses, and with only them left in the game, it didn't really matter who won.","\"Pu~\" Suddenly, the white horse coughed up a mouthful of blood and its towering body slumped onto Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was confused.","What was happening? What had gone wrong?","\"Shuhang, I can't take it anymore,\" Senior White Horse said in a weak voice. \"During the battle with the chubby ball just now, I was stabbed with a poisoned blade. The poison isn't light, and now, my body feels like it's on fire, in excruciating pain. I believe I might be nearing the end.\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"Even though I'm only at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, I can still sense the vast vitality and vigor in your body.\" he thought.","\"Kill me. End my suffering and claim the ultimate victory. My life is drawing to a close, and you shall ascend the throne, crowned as king, upon my bones!\" Senior White Horse exclaimed with enthusiasm.","On the side, the black horse emitted some incomprehensible sounds... Listening carefully, it seemed to be singing a mournful tune.","It was providing background music for the scene to intensify the somber atmosphere.","Song Shuhang was left flabbergasted.","Should I summon the Holy Apes to heighten the atmosphere even further?","\"Tell me, will you do it?\" Suddenly, White Horse's lines underwent a change in style.","\"I choose to bite the dust,\" Song Shuhang sighed.","lightsΝοvel.cοm His response was too uncooperative. The atmosphere set up by the white horse and the black horse dissipated.","The black horse's mournful singing came to a halt.","\"Is that so? Is that your choice? What a bitter answer,\" the white horse said weakly. It extended one of its hooves and, with a trembling gesture, caressed Song Shuhang's form.","Just as its hoof was about to 'painstakingly' make contact with Song Shuhang, its other hoof moved like lightning.","A sharp blade dipped in poison pierced Song Shuhang's form.","\"Go, child. Your wish has been granted,\" the white horse said in a compassionate tone.","Song Shuhang let out a scream.","The wound felt like it was ablaze, and the poison instantly spread throughout his form.","The pain of being poisoned was a relatively new experience for Song Shuhang. After attaining the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm and mastering the three body-tempering techniques, ordinary poisons had lost their potency against him. During his weaker days, he hadn't encountered severe poisoning.","Song Shuhang was immersed in the agony of the poison coursing through his form, and his life gradually approached its end.","Today, he had met death once more.","\"The Eyeball Butler was truly not a god. When it was hung on the sealing pillar and burned, making a wish to it proved to be ineffective.\"","Before dying, this thought crossed Song Shuhang's mind.","Ultimately, the Eyeball Butler could only be considered a divine servant with limited magical power.","If Senior Three-Eyed were to hang himself on the pillar and set it alight, the wish's effect would be much more potent.","After 'dying' in the small world, Song Shuhang's consciousness plunged into darkness.","After almost ten minutes, he finally regained consciousness.","\"Does it take this long to exit the game within a small world?\"","Song Shuhang was perplexed. Ten minutes was more than enough for him to be resurrected from the resurrection formation!","Wait... Wait!","Don't tell me that I truly died in that game world, and the so-called 'game exit' was just Senior Three-Eyed using a resurrection formation to revive me?","Song Shuhang's eyes flew open suddenly.","\"Oh, the third one to awaken is Little Tyrannical Song. It appears that the ultimate victor is Fellow Daoist Ma,\" Senior Three-Eyed's lazy voice echoed.","\"Am I dead?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Of course. Don't you even know if you're dead or not? Were you killed by Fellow Daoist Ma?\" Senior Three-Eyed questioned doubtfully.","\"No, that's not what I meant. I mean, if I die in the game, will I also die in real life, and then you, Senior Three-Eyed, use a resurrection formation to bring me back to life?\" Song Shuhang touched his form, wary of any missing pieces.","\"You're overthinking it. Advanced resurrection formations aren't a dime a dozen, you know. Plus, considering the realms of Fellow Daoist Ma and the ball, where do you suppose I'd get the means to set up a resurrection formation for them?\" Senior Three-Eyed rolled all three of his eyes in exasperation. \"Use your noggin, will you?\"","\"Good point,\" Song Shuhang conceded.","Senior Three-Eyed had presented a reasonable argument, and Song Shuhang had no counterarguments."]},{"number":2339,"title":"Chapter 2339 I Want All The Adult Ones!","paragraphs":["In the realm of Sixth Stage and beyond, a cultivator's resurrection array had to be custom-tailored to their needs. Ordinary resurrection coins, crosses, and similar items were of no use.","The stronger a cultivator was, the more challenging it became to revive them.","And then there were beings like the horse and the fat ball at this level. Finding a suitable resurrection array in a short period of time was simply impossible.","\"So, am I overthinking this?\" Song Shuhang pondered while gazing intently at Senior Three-Eyed.","He had a nagging feeling that something was amiss, but at the moment, he couldn't quite put his finger on it.","\"Oh, by the way, where's the fat ball?\" Song Shuhang suddenly remembered something crucial.","The fat ball had been defeated by Senior Ma in a 2v1 battle before him and had exited the game earlier than he did.","So, where was the fat ball now?","\"It took a magic treasure design and left first. Don't worry, even though it left, the stakes are still here,\" Senior Three-Eyed assured him. After saying this, he retrieved two more designs and handed them to Song Shuhang.","\"Senior Three-Eyed, aren't these your stakes?\" Song Shuhang inquired. He looked puzzled.","\"Due to some special circumstances, I forfeited shortly after entering the bet. As a result of my forfeiture, these three blueprints of mine will be given to you, Fellow Daoist Fat Ball, and Fellow Daoist Ma. You can choose one of the designs, and the other one is for Fellow Daoist Ma,\" Senior Three-Eyed explained.","Song Shuhang examined the two remaining designs.","One was a blueprint for a planetary-type strategic magical treasure, while the other was a blueprint for a planetary-type absolute force field shield.","The fat ball had opted to take the blueprint for the super-powerful offensive magical treasure known as the Open Heavenly Eye.","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","The chubby ball boss was already formidable enough, and if it added the Open Heavenly Eye attack from the big-eyed planet boss, it would leave no chance for this helpless creature to survive.","\"Oh well, I wouldn't be able to create this thing even if you gave me the blueprint,\" Song Shuhang nonchalantly selected the blueprint for the Absolute Force Field Shield.","\"Then we'll just have to wait for Fellow Daoist Ma to come out and claim his reward,\" Senior Three-Eyed stated with a smile. Despite losing the bet, he appeared to be in high spirits.","The bright sunlight in the sky was a testament to Senior Three-Eyed's happiness.","\"Could it be, as the fat ball boss suspected, that Senior Three-Eyed made a deal with Senior Ma during the gambling game and obtained what he wanted?\" Song Shuhang mused to himself.","\"Heehee!\" At that moment, the horse beside him also awakened. It was the ultimate winner.","When it woke up, the light of the gambling ritual shone upon it.","There was also a Spatial Authority Seed, a memory crystal containing information about the Scholarly Sage's magical treasure, the Scholarly Scripture, another memory crystal containing information about the missing parts of the ball, and the Paragon Rune of the horse.","On the side, the three-eyed youth handed the last blueprint for the planet-level strategic magical treasure to the horse.","The horse nodded, and all the winnings from the bet floated in front of it and revolved around it like satellites.","Then, it squinted its eyes and looked at Song Shuhang.","\"Do you want it? Do you want it? Do you want it?\" Its horse-like face seemed to be able to speak, as if it were inscribed with the words \"Do you want it?\"","Song Shuhang finally understood how the top big shots of the universe felt when they saw his face. In their eyes, his face resembled Senior Ma's, as if it had words etched onto it.","\"Horse, I want information about the Confucian Classics,\" Song Shuhang handed over the design in his hand. \"In exchange, I don't need the design. Let's make the trade!\"","After all, the Confucian Classics was of utmost importance to Fairy Creation.","\"You're still too inexperienced, young man,\" Senior Ma said in fluent English. This time, it wasn't Bai's voice, but lines from a European movie.","The actor had always been learning and improving, never falling behind the times. It was evident that he had picked up this technique from Song Shuhang's virtuous lamia.","\"Only children make multiple-choice questions. I want all the adult ones!\" he declared once more.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","The horse stood up and let out a long howl.","At that moment, Lady Onion retrieved a green onion sprout from Song Shuhang's pocket and translated, \"Senior, what it means is, repeat after me. It wants you to recite its lines.\"","Song Shuhang replied, \"No, there's no need. It's too embarrassing.\"","The horse chuckled and turned to leave. All the treasures revolved around him as he departed.","\"Wait, wait, Senior. I was just putting on a show. I'm not actually shy. I'll recite it right away,\" Song Shuhang hastily called out.","After all, he had a thick skin.","He could put on a fa?ade when necessary, but he knew when to let it go.","Senior Three-Eyed held a teacup in his hands and took a sip. He looked quite pleased.","The wicked sometimes need to be met with wickedness.","Someone as shameless as Tyrannical Song occasionally required some dramatic flair.","\"Only children make multiple-choice questions. I want all the adult ones!\" Song Shuhang imitated the horse's tone and recited the line.","In reality, his acting skills were quite impressive. Otherwise, he wouldn't have been able to bring the detestable Senior Brother Gao Sheng to life.","The horse blinked and nodded in satisfaction.","It extended a hoof and patted the treasure beside it.","Except for the rune, all the other treasures from the bet flew over to Song Shuhang's side and landed in his hand.","Memories of the \"Confucian Classics,\" design blueprints, and even the spatial authority seed that had condensed from the fat ball's spatial authority for a month.","The horse stood up while adopting a knowing pose.","lightsΝοvel.cοm Then, its body dissipated and transformed back into a pony model.","The eyeball butler picked up the pony model, wiped it clean, and returned it to the three-eyed youth.","At the same time, it congratulated Song Shuhang, saying, \"Congratulations, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. You've become the ultimate winner! Quite the contrast to a certain three-eyed individual who was eliminated from the game as soon as he entered.\"","\"Thank you,\" Lady Onion accepted the congratulations on behalf of Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","\"Furthermore, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, when the fat ball left just now, it seemed as though he wanted to hide outside the Throne of Wealth and ambush you. So, before you leave the Throne of Wealth, why not try fusing with that spatial authority seed and see if you can awaken a small spatial talent? Perhaps you can use it to safeguard your virtue in the hands of the fat ball,\" the eyeball butler reminded.","\"The fat ball really doesn't give up.\" Song Shuhang sighed.","\"If it were me, I wouldn't give up either,\" Senior Three-Eyed said cheerfully. \"However, it has temporarily lost its spatial authority, so your chances of escaping will be much higher.\"","Song Shuhang remarked, \"A fat ball without spatial abilities. Hehehe.\"","\"But I must caution you. Although it has lost its spatial authority, some of the spatial sealing formations and spells may still be effective. Don't be careless,\" Senior Three-Eyed warned him.","He was in a good mood, which was why he offered this reminder to Song Shuhang to prevent any mishaps."]},{"number":2340,"title":"Chapter 2340 This is an Adult Ghost","paragraphs":["\"Thanks for the heads up, Senior Three-Eyed,\" Lady Onion expressed her gratitude on behalf of Song Shuhang.","The fat ball boss ruled over the Netherworld, and his unpredictable tricks could give anyone the creeps. It made sense to be cautious.","After some thought, Song Shuhang summoned the virtuous fat whale. Currently, the virtuous lamia was assisting Senior White in harvesting the Netherworld's evil energy.","So, Song Shuhang summoned the virtuous fat whale and instructed it to leave the Wealth Throne to explore the starry skies.","Like the lamia, the virtuous fat whale could be reborn within Song Shuhang's body even if it was dispersed. It was the perfect choice for scouting.","Upon receiving the order, the virtuous fat whale slowly floated out of the Wealth Throne and ventured into the starry abyss. Simultaneously, it continuously relayed the scenes it observed back to Song Shuhang.","Just as the virtuous fat whale's body squeezed into the starry sky, a sudden flash of cold light appeared before its eyes.","In the next moment, the virtuous fat whale was sliced into peanut-sized pieces and exploded, only to return to Song Shuhang's body and revive.","The cold light had come so fast and fierce that the virtuous fat whale hadn't even seen where the enemy was hiding or where the attack came from.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","It seemed that the fat ball was guarding the entrance. It intended to leave him with no chance to escape.","To some extent, it was an extraordinary honor for the ruler of the Netherworld to personally wait for someone.","\"Do you know? Back in the day, the ruler of the Netherworld personally squatted at the entrance of the mystic realm to guard me, all in an effort to kill me,\" the three-eyed youth boasted.","\"That's right, Senior Three-Eyed, could you slightly open the spatial restrictions in this small world of yours? Just a crack... Then, I can escape through the space slits?\" Song Shuhang turned to the three-eyed youth.","\"Yes, but the risk is too high. Even if I only open a small crack, my hiding place might be discovered by the current Heavenly Dao laws,\" the three-eyed youth smiled slightly.","\"Although I like you, little Tyrannical Song, I can't risk my own safety to help you. So, you can blame me as much as you want. I won't mind.\"","The eyeball butler added, \"It's mainly because Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, you're not a fairy, and your appearance doesn't conform to my master's aesthetic standards. If you can grow eyes all over your body, my Lord might be able to take a gamble for you.\"","Song Shuhang was left flabbergasted.","He couldn't help but think of that monster hunter whose arms were covered with eyes. That monster hunter might be very popular with Senior Three-Eyed.","At this time, the stone tablet reminded him, \"Therefore, Shuhang, you can first use that seed of spatial authority and see if you can obtain some useful spatial innate ability. Perhaps it can help you break through the barricade of the gloomy ball.\"","\"Gloomy Ball? Hahaha, wonderful,\" Senior Three-Eyed laughed out loud. \"If we call it that, would there also be a Faint Dragon besides the Faint Ball?\"","\"Old Master, it's too early for you to be happy. Because according to this name, you're called Spaghetti Eyes. But I prefer faint eyes. It sounds like a resentful woman in a boudoir,\" the butler said.","After saying that, he took the initiative to jump onto the barbecue rack at the side and was roasted until he sizzled.","He didn't even wait for Senior Three-Eyed to act.","The three-eyed youth was left speechless.","The originally clear sky was now covered in a haze.","Song Shuhang turned his head to deliberately avoid the gazes of the butler eyeball and Senior Three-Eyed.","He took out the seed of spatial authority and observed it carefully.","This seed contained the spatial power of a ruler of the Netherworld, which was even stronger than the spatial power of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. If Song Shuhang could fuse with it, he wouldn't have to worry about the spatial seal of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender for the next month, and he would be able to forcefully break through it.","\"Senior Three-Eyed, how do I fuse with this seed?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Why don't you try swallowing it?\" Senior Three-Eyed lazily replied.","Song Shuhang found himself speechless.","\"This is the first time I've seen something like this. Ever since I started the betting ceremony, you are the first person to think of taking the spatial authority from my opponent. Therefore, I have no experience in fusing with it,\" Senior Three-Eyed continued.","\"But in short, there are only a few ways to fuse a treasure. You can either eat it or directly extract the laws within and fuse them into your body.\"","Song Shuhang sighed. With a thought, his body turned into smoke.","Senior Three-Eyed narrowed his three eyes and sized up Song Shuhang's smoke form. To be honest, he was really curious about how a small-time cultivator like Song Shuhang, who had a complete mess of theoretical knowledge, could grasp such profound information about laws.","Song Shuhang stretched out his right hand and pressed it on the seed of spatial authority to activate the Secret Appraisal Technique.","A large amount of smoke exploded from his body. The originally human-shaped smoke exploded into a mushroom cloud.","After a long while, the smoke slowly gathered and transformed back into a human form.","\"It hurts, it hurts, it hurts...\" Song Shuhang screamed.","lightsΝοvel.cοm As expected, information regarding the ruler of the Netherworld could not be randomly appraised.","Senior Three-Eyed's three eyes lit up when he saw Song Shuhang screaming again and again. The haze in the sky quietly dissipated. The sky was clear and the sun shone brightly.","The price was huge, but so was the information he obtained.","\"Spatial Authority Seed of the ruler of the Netherworld: Condensed at the cost of a month's spatial authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. Possesses supreme spatial authority.","\"Absorption Method 1: Swallow it directly. There is a 30% chance of absorbing the power of the seed of spatial authority and comprehending a spatial talent ability. Or, you can use the power of the seed to achieve the effect of using spatial power for a short period of time. There is a 50% chance of exploding.","\"Absorption Plan B: The ghost spirit will swallow it and absorb it. There is a 50% chance that the ghost spirit will evolve, and a 20% chance that nothing will happen. (Strengths: No danger of exploding.)","\"Absorption Option III: Option III is still in the process of calculation. Please activate it later through the secret technique.\"","Song Shuhang was speechless. What happened to Method 1, 2 and 3?","For now, option III could be ignored.","Now, he had to choose between Method 1 and Plan B.","Although Senior Ma had taught him that as an adult, he needed everything... There was only one Spatial Authority Seed, so it was impossible for him to consume it together with the ghost spirit.","\"So... Plan B, of course,\" Song Shuhang declared.","Method 1 entailed a 50% chance of exploding.","He had just experienced the feeling of being poisoned to death, so he did not want to die again today.","Thus, Song Shuhang summoned a ghost spirit and handed the Spatial Authority Seed to her.","The ghost spirit opened its mouth and swallowed the seed along with Song Shuhang's misty palm."]},{"number":2341,"title":"Chapter 2341 Seizing the Time to Gain Strength","paragraphs":["An adult ghost spirits were voracious. She wanted both the palm and the seed.","\"Wait... My palm. You bit too big a piece. Spit out my palm,\" Song Shuhang quickly exclaimed.","*Gulp* The ghost spirit covered her mouth with both hands, afraid that Song Shuhang would snatch the food away. Then, she forcefully swallowed the seed and Song Shuhang's smoky palm.","After swallowing it, she looked at Song Shuhang expressionlessly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He had lost the connection with his palm. The palm and the seed seemed to have been digested by the ghost spirit.","Song Shuhang used his other hand to gently pat the head of the ghost spirit and praised her. \"Your digestive system is really amazing.\"","The ghost spirit remained expressionless and motionless as she digested the seed and leveled up on the spot.","He wondered how long it would take her to level up.","\"I hope it won't cause a mutation,\" Song Shuhang said with some concern. His palm had just entered the 'pseudo-eternal' state when the ghost spirit swallowed it along with the seed.","\"Aren't you going to return to your original state? If you continue to maintain the smoke mode, you might get bitten again,\" Lady Onion reminded him.","She felt that the ghost spirit might be hungry. Just now, when she looked at the smoky Song Shuhang, it was as if she was looking at a pile of food.","Song Shuhang sighed and, with a thought, he left his smoke form.","When he recovered his physical body, his right hand was missing.","Fortunately, he could regrow his severed limbs by circulating the Primary Instruction of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique. It was not a big problem.","Lady Onion silently took out Song Shuhang's phone and took a few photos of him and his stump.","Then, she logged into the Nine Provinces Number One Group and prepared to upload this photo to the group space. However, when she uploaded it, she realized that the internet was not working.","This area was a network signal blocking area.","Fortunately... There was also Song Shuhang's cultivation chat features and the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","The chat features had been upgraded.","This was Lady Onion's first time actively trying to use these features. After Lady Long Luo upgraded the features, the user interface was much simpler and more practical. Previously, only the top big shots could use the authority. After this upgrade, they were all opened to the members of the Golden Core QR Code.","After studying it for a while, Lady Onion opened the 'Moments' function and sent a message.","Title: [Tragic. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song accidentally lost his hand and became disabled.]","[Description: A man stumbles, a horse stumbles.] Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had accidentally made a mistake today and paid the heavy price of being crippled.","Then, she uploaded a few pictures—close-up shots of Song Shuhang's missing right hand and more shots of his stump.","At the same time, all the members in the universe who had added Song Shuhang's Golden Core QR code received a notification as long as they were free.","[Always Online Fighter] Northern River's Loose Cultivator quickly reacted, and he quickly replied to Lady Onion's message in her friend circle. \"The upgrade was completed? In addition, what happened to little Shuhang? How did he lose his arm?\"","[Blacklist] More Than Demon Emperor said, \"Hahahaha, Tyrannical Song, you have rough days too, huh.\"","[Blacklist] Immortal Lord followed up. \"Hehehe.\"","\"Damn... Heavens!\" Song Shuhang rubbed his eyes.","He focused his mind and checked Lady Onion's post on her Moments.","The \"hehehe\" seemed to echo in his mind.","Song Shuhang rubbed his temples. His head was throbbing with pain, as if his brain had been filled with fat ball liquid metal. It was very uncomfortable.","In theory, the Eternal Lord, who had been in eternal sleep since the beginning of the immemorial era, had actually woken up.","The problem was that this person's position was in opposition to Song Shuhang's.","This was not good news.","He had to keep a low profile and not attract the attention of these big shots.","Just as he was thinking, someone sent him a message.","It was Pavilion Master Chu's main body.","\"Shuhang, how's the situation on your side? Did you manage to avoid the pursuit of the fat ball? I can't contact that long hair. What happened?\"","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Under the restrictions of the world of the three-eyed youth, Pavilion Master Chu's main body and Dumb Hair had lost their signal synchronization, and she was unable to know what had happened. Therefore, she contacted Song Shuhang to ask about the subsequent developments.","However, Pavilion Master Chu was stunned as soon as she finished her question.","She saw that her nickname had changed again...","\"Shuhang, I feel that you've been living for too long recently.\" Pavilion Master Chu added coldly.","Even though it was just a few words, Song Shuhang could still feel the cold aura coming from Pavilion Master Chu's body.","\"Wait, Pavilion Master Chu. I didn't do it. I'm innocent. I really didn't change your nickname and title this time!\" Song Shuhang quickly replied.","Pavilion Master Chu coldly replied, \"Change it back.\"","Song Shuhang lightly coughed and pulled out the artificial intelligence Squirrel that hurts my hand.","A moment later, Pavilion Master Chu's nickname changed.","\"Senior Chu, it's done,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu silently sent Song Shuhang a full stop and checked her new title.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu went on. \"After your Inner World recovers, I'll give you a gift. It's a treasure that I no longer have any use for. I originally wanted to find an opportunity to give it to you, and now is the time.\"","In the Inner World, Pavilion Master Chu looked at a red crystal statue that looked like her and silently blew a bubble.","This red crystal figurine was something that she had temporarily stored in Song Shuhang's Inner World... It was a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender-level resurrection magical treasure that she had prepared for herself, and it was extremely precious.","At that time, she had yet to split into Chu Two and was still a complete individual. Before the new Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion was destroyed, she had left this red crystal magical treasure with Song Shuhang, just in case.","Now that she had already stepped into the Immortal Realm, this red crystal resurrection magical treasure was no longer useful.","\"It's time for you to come in handy.\" Pavilion Master Chu said softly.","\"Fairy Chu, do you plan to give it to little Shuhang? Can little Shuhang use this magical treasure?\" Senior Turtle asked.","This magical treasure looked like Pavilion Master Chu. If Tyrannical Song used this magical treasure to revive... Would he be resurrected in Pavilion Master Chu's appearance?","...","Within the world of the three-eyed youth, Song Shuhang raised his head and looked up at the sky. He had just received a reply from Madam Long Luo. The artificial intelligence was still underperforming, so he had to be as detailed as possible when giving orders.","In the future, when it slowly grew up, it would become a truly reliable assistant.","\"If I explain to Pavilion Master Chu now, will she still believe me?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"If it were me, I definitely wouldn't believe it.\"","Song Shuhang was speechless.","On the side, the ghost spirit was still in the state of evolution. After all, it was a seed of the ruler of the Netherworld, and it would not be easy to fuse with it.","Since there was still some time left, Song Shuhang decided to seize the time to increase his strength. After all, he was about to face the fat ball's attack.","Of course, he did not want to cram for cultivation at the last minute. Even if he used this time to cultivate, he would not be able to increase his strength by much.","Song Shuhang waved his hand, and two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts 'Combined Magical Treasure flew out of his spiritual lake.","He then took out the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops and opened the bottle.","Two sets of sixty-six life-bound magical treasures. If he could activate a wisp of consciousness from all of them, his strength would definitely increase greatly!"]},{"number":2342,"title":"Chapter 2342 The Epitome of Life-Bound Treasures","paragraphs":["lightsΝοvel.cοm ?","Sixty-six magical artifacts were neatly arranged in a single row, and every single one of them belonged to none other than Song Shuhang himself — they were his life-bound treasures. As soon as these artifacts appeared, a resonance formed between them and Song Shuhang.","Due to the fact that they were life-bound treasures, they shared a deep connection with Song Shuhang. In the faintest of senses, Song Shuhang could feel that the time for their transformation was drawing near.","The sixty-six pieces of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure were arranged obediently. They resembled hungry baby birds with their mouths wide open, each eagerly awaiting Song Shuhang's spiritual nourishment.","\"No need to rush; let's take it one step at a time,\" Song Shuhang said gently.","Artifact spirits were the cherished aspiration of every cultivator. Magical artifacts with and without artifact spirits were as different as night and day. The birth of an artifact spirit was an immensely challenging process that required not only unwavering dedication from the cultivator but also the alignment of auspicious circumstances. Even some transcendent treasures couldn't give rise to an artifact spirit. Most cultivators in the entire universe would never get to lay eyes on a divine weapon with an artifact spirit in their lifetime.","Song Shuhang was no stranger to artifact spirits as he had interacted with several senior artifact spirits.","For instance, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was an Immortal-level divine weapon with its own peculiar quirks. It had the odd habit of enjoying being swallowed by the virtuous lamia and participating in Song Shuhang's Saber Nurturing Technique. The bond between Song Shuhang and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was strong, and even after it had to return to Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven's possession, it left behind a Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword to maintain their friendship.","Then there was the recently acquired Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, a magical artifact crafted by Bai Chengdao, the Wielder of the Will. It occupied a realm between the ranks of a transcendent treasure and an Immortal divine weapon, but its power surged dramatically when made from gold which surpassed most Immortal divine weapons. It had the unique penchant for engaging in battles against the universe's heavyweights alongside Song Shuhang and recording Song Shuhang's 'death' anniversaries.","Additionally, there was the South Autumn Temple in Song Shuhang's Inner World, the palace of the Great Southern Emperor, one of the Four Great Emperors of the ancient Heavenly City. Now, it bore the surname Bai and resided in Senior White's custody. The South Autumn Temple possessed a tool spirit, making it the second most remarkable artifact spirit Song Shuhang had encountered.","As for the most significant artifact spirit, it belonged to the big-eyed planet. It was the most potent Dao Artifact and had the volume of a small planet. Its reputation as a catastrophe on the move was well-deserved, as it was a star-level magical tool. Song Shuhang hoped it could shed some weight; otherwise, facing it would be incredibly stressful.","Moreover, Lady Onion's Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber seemed to possess an artifact spirit as well. Like the big-eyed planet, it was also a Dao Artifact. However, its artifact spirit had a unique nature, resembling that of a pet. It might need to complete the Nine Transformations and ascend to the Nine Virtues realm to fully recover its capabilities.","Song Shuhang had two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure. If they each developed an artifact spirit, that would mean having a total of sixty-six artifact spirits. Cultivators across the realm would be envious to the point of tears at the mere thought of it.","On the opposite side, the eyeball butler silently descended from the grill, took a shower, and returned to stand next to the three-eyed youth.","\"My Lord, will Profound Sage Tyrannical Song succeed?\" the eyeball butler inquired.","The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure was an extraordinary treasure that would function both as a unified whole and comprising thirty-three individual magical artifacts. If all of these magical artifacts developed a hint of consciousness, could it lead to a qualitative change when combined? Could they merge into a true artifact spirit while in their combined form?","\"That's why I told you not to underestimate the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops. Regardless of how unreliable this product may seem, it is still a creation of the Heavenly Dao,\" the three-eyed youth commented. He suddenly raised his hand, producing a fresh bottle of Heavenly Dao Eye Drops. With a flick of his finger, a drop of it floated into the eyeball butler's body.","The eyeball butler was left bemused.","\"Do you feel anything?\" the three-eyed youth inquired.","\"I feel like crying. I suspect these Heavenly Dao Eye Drops have expired. They sting,\" the eyeball butler replied. \"It's like spicy food for my eyes.\"","The three-eyed youth was left at a loss.","He had thought that after administering the eye drops and cleansing the eyeball butler's eyes, it might become somewhat more normal. However, it appeared that hope was in vain, as the eyeball butler remained as eccentric as ever.","On the opposite side, Song Shuhang had just regrown his severed hand using the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique. Witnessing how effortlessly he could regrow his lost limbs, an audacious idea sprouted in his mind. However, he quickly suppressed it deep within himself. Despite having experienced Lady Onion's green onion life for hundreds of years, there was no need for him to mimic her skill of sprouting green onion shoots and unsheathing sharp green onions. Furthermore, offering his own body as sustenance for the ghost spirit was a grotesque notion he couldn't accept physically or mentally.","After regenerating his palm, Song Shuhang opened the bottle containing the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops. With a flick of his finger, he used telekinesis to extract a drop of the potion from the bottle. The Heavenly Dao Eye Drops were extraordinarily precious and not to be squandered, so he had to gauge the precise amount required to awaken the consciousness of his life-bound magical treasure. However, Song Shuhang was unsure about the quantity necessary to activate the magical treasure's consciousness.","As such, he decided to use the Defiant Whale Warrior's Glove on his right hand as a test subject. He applied a drop of the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops onto the glove to determine the amount needed to initiate the transformation of the magical treasure.","Among his life-bound magical treasures, the Defiant Whale Warrior's Glove was unique. It was the life-bound magical treasure that held the highest significance, akin to the queen in an imperial harem. This was because the Defiant Whale Warrior's Glove had merged with Song Shuhang's life, refined with his own body, and extracted a significant toll from his life.","Its attributes, functions, and strength far surpassed the other magical treasures.","A drop of the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops landed on the Defiant Whale Warrior's Glove. The blue liquid containing profound laws swirled around the glove. After a brief rotation, the drop was promptly absorbed by the Defiant Whale Warrior's Glove.","The glove emitted a low vibration, and the sound of a whale's cry resonated from within. While numerous fragmented wills existed within the glove, they began to intertwine into a unified consciousness with the nourishment of the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops. Soon, a fledgling consciousness emerged.","This process went far smoother than Song Shuhang had anticipated. Once this Defiant Whale Warrior's Glove developed a feeble consciousness, it appeared as though it had been awakened. All its seals vanished, and it seemed to anticipate further growth and strengthening.","\"Could this be the birth of an artifact spirit?\" The three-eyed youth asked in surprise as he sat upright in his rocking chair. Could the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops be so potent?","Boom!","The Defiant Whale Warrior's Glove suddenly exploded, and a phantom materialized on its surface. The phantom assumed a cross-legged sitting posture, and beneath it, a divine whale swam leisurely. Upon closer inspection, one could discern a faint resemblance to Song Shuhang, although the figure was adorned in elegant robes.","\"Is Shuhang cross-dressing?\" Lady Onion swiftly retrieved her phone and snapped a series of pictures."]},{"number":2343,"title":"Chapter 2343 Chatterboxes","paragraphs":["Lady Onion skillfully adjusted the camera angles and snapped dozens of consecutive photos.","She already had a headline in mind: Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's Ordeal: Forced into Crossdressing.","This news was far more exciting than something about stumps and missing hands and would surely capture the attention of the bigwigs in the cultivation world.","Lady Onion had plans to share more updates about Song Shuhang's misadventures in her cultivation chat circle of friends. Even if it meant risking her year-end bonus from her boss, which Song Shuhang hadn't even given her before, she didn't mind. She had a bigger target audience in mind.","For instance, the Demon Emperor, who always found joy in hearing about Song Shuhang's tribulations, was a potential target. Making him happy might lead to generous gifts and financial gain.","Compared to the tips from the wealthy, her boss's year-end bonuses seemed less important. Moreover, there was still some time left before the new year.","After capturing numerous images of Song Shuhang in female attire, Lady Onion carefully selected the perfect photo and began mentally drafting a news article.","Song Shuhang gazed at the illusory image of Fairy Song on his glove and fell into deep thought.","The Defiant Whale Warrior Glove's Fairy Weapon Spirit emitted a low whale-like cry.","The smile on the face of the three-eyed youth grew brighter, and the sun in the sky felt even warmer. Lady Onion sensed that her strength was increasing slightly, as if she were benefiting from photosynthesis.","Could it be photosynthesis?","\"Shuhang, I didn't expect you to harbor such an interest,\" Scarlet Heaven Sword remarked in a heavy tone.","\"It's alright. We won't judge your preferences,\" he continued. \"In fact, when my master was younger, he had a friend who excelled in crafting immortal clothing. My Lord once served as a model for that friend and wore women's attire. He looked quite stunning. Shuhang, although your appearance may not match up, it's fortunate that your Artifact Spirit resembles you by only 30%. Even with my discerning eye, she would still be adorable when dressed as a woman.\"","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","In a low-energy mode, Pavilion Master Chu's hair spun slowly. After a considerable pause, she remarked, \"When I was struggling to sustain the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, I was bored and learned the art of making immortal clothing. Shuhang, if you like, I can create a few sets for you. They would also offer decent protection.\"","\"Senior, Senior, I can also offer you clothing. My main body possesses many immortal garments that I've only worn once and never used again. I can have them sent to you next time,\" the dark-skinned Soft Feather chimed in, unwilling to be outdone.","\"Who do you think I am?\" Song Shuhang retorted. \"Besides, the appearance of the Artifact Spirit isn't something I can control.\"","\"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, it's not a problem at all. It's quite common for males to have unique interests. For instance, one of my master's good friends is obsessed with collecting eyeballs. He can't resist the urge.\" The big-eyed butler chimed in with a gentle tone.","\"Hahaha.\" The three-eyed youth didn't seem perturbed at all.","The butler's words punctured both Song Shuhang's and the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword's hearts. Yet, the emotional impact on Song Shuhang was more pronounced. Despite this, he didn't get angry; instead, he felt somewhat delighted.","\"Seniors, could we be a bit more serious? Is there a rule stating that an Artifact Spirit must have the same gender as its master? Moreover, it's uncertain whether an Artifact Spirit even has a gender,\" Song Shuhang argued.","The Defiant Whale Warrior Glove's Fairy Weapon Spirit continued to whimper.","Fairy Creation, squatting across from her, demonstrated 32 different singing styles in an instant.","The Artifact Spirit riding the whale couldn't keep up with Fairy Creation's pace and became increasingly agitated.","\"If I had a younger sister, she'd probably look like this,\" Song Shuhang commented while looking at the little fairy who bore a slight resemblance to him.","The little fairy on the whale puffed up her cheeks and let out a mournful cry.","Fairy Creation, seated opposite, displayed her musical talents with a diverse range of styles, further confusing the whale-riding Artifact Spirit.","\"When this Artifact Spirit was born, I had a feeling it was related to the concept of a little sister, which may have influenced her appearance,\" Song Shuhang mused.","\"Then why don't you use the tears of the Wielder of the Will to enlighten the other sixty-five magical treasures?\" Lady Onion suggested.","Would the other sixty-five Combined Magical Treasures also give rise to complete Weapon Spirits?","\"I'll try it now!\" Song Shuhang used his telekinesis to extract sixty-five drops of the potion from the bottle and distribute them evenly among the remaining magical treasures.","\"This is like sharing rain and dew equally. Tyrannical Song, you truly have a peculiar charm,\" Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword commented.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","He waved his hand and initiated the Saber Nurturing Technique on Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword emitted a soft sound, but it soon realized something terrifying. Perhaps it had been exposed to the Saber Nurturing Technique too frequently, but it had developed an immunity to the technique!","lightsΝοvel.cοm This was problematic, as it would affect its enjoyment of the Blade Nurturing Technique.","The other Combined Magical Treasures also rapidly absorbed the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops and began evolving. Tiny entities formed on their surfaces, though they were considerably weaker than the consciousness of Senior White's Meteor Sword.","Everyone held their breath, eager to witness the changes that would transpire among the magical treasures.","A few minutes later, the sixty-five magical treasures began to joyfully bounce up and down, each brimming with vitality. Unlike the Defiant Whale Gloves, they resembled energetic huskies that leaped about exuberantly, unable to contain their excitement.","\"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, you should try combining them now,\" the eyeball butler suggested.","Could a quantitative change lead to a qualitative transformation?","Song Shuhang nodded. He had considered this possibility earlier.","To merge the two sets of magical treasures, he needed to employ a combination method.","\"After the Holy City's destruction...I hereby call for a colossal entity capable of annihilating everything!\" Song Shuhang issued the command to the two sets of Combined Magical Treasures.","Though they were as lively as huskies, the magical treasures acted promptly upon Song Shuhang's directive. Since giving birth to a feeble consciousness, their ability to carry out orders had greatly improved, and their synergy with Song Shuhang had also grown stronger.","Amidst a series of cool transformation effects, a colossal Destruction Giant took form!"]},{"number":2344,"title":"Chapter 2344 Let’s Pay a Visit to the Fat Ball!","paragraphs":["When the giant appeared, even Senior Three-Eyed, who was standing nearby, was left dumbfounded.","It wasn't because he was surprised by the combination.","Rather, it was the overwhelming sense of despair that emanated as this giant took form. It was a kind of utter hopelessness, the feeling of losing everything — it was exquisitely wonderful!","\"It's been a while since I've witnessed despair of this magnitude,\" Senior Three-Eyed commented appreciatively. To him, as the ruler of the Netherworld, despair was like a masterpiece painting by a great artist. It was utterly captivating.","\"I never expected that beneath Little Tyrannical Song's exterior, such deep pain and despair would be concealed. One can't judge a book by its cover,\" the three-eyed youth recorded this scene while savoring the moment.","lightsnοvεl.cοm As long as he could witness such extreme despair every day, he believed he could easily consume an extra two servings of rice.","The giant stood up, reached out with a massive hand, and bent down to grasp Song Shuhang and placed him within its right fist—Song Shuhang's cockpit!","\"Senior Song, can't you move the cockpit to the chest or head?\" Black-skinned Soft Feather shouted loudly while cupping her hands around her mouth.","\"This isn't something I can decide, Soft Feather,\" Song Shuhang sighed rather helplessly.","Hearing this, Senior Three-Eyed's happiness increased by one point. To celebrate, a beautiful rainbow appeared in the sky.","Unfortunately, Senior Three-Eyed's jubilation was short-lived. He soon noticed something unusual.","On the chest of Song Shuhang's giant, there was a beating heart.","This heart was exceptionally powerful that steadily injecting kinetic energy on par with that of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. It served as the power core of the Destruction Giant and eliminated the need for Song Shuhang's energy when the giant moved.","\"Butler, have my eyes been deceiving me lately? Could you take a look at the heart core on the chest of Little Tyrannical Song's giant? Does its structure look familiar?\" the three-eyed youth inquired.","\"I'm sorry, my Lord, but my eyes are currently burning. I cannot see anything,\" the eyeball butler responded.","The three-eyed youth was left speechless.","\"However, even without using my eyes, I can still sense the core of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's heart. The technology used to create it is the core technology of our planetary strategic magical treasure,\" the old butler added.","Among Song Shuhang's magical treasures, one set belonged to Senior White Two. The Combined Sword of the End also possessed a core—a product of Senior White Two's research into the heart technology of the big-eyed planet. Currently, it could only release energy equivalent to that of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender that was far from its full potential. However, as Senior White Two's technology continued to advance, creating a core as powerful as the original was only a matter of time.","The three-eyed youth was left speechless.","\"So, in other words, Master, your devious act of concealing the heart blueprint was futile. Perhaps Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is secretly laughing at you as he considers you a fool,\" the eyeball butler reminded him.","The sky became shrouded in dark clouds, and what had been a clear sky turned pitch-black, accompanied by thunderous roars.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky. Senior Three-Eyed's constantly shifting moods was akin to that of a capricious young girl.","Soon after, however, the dark clouds dispersed, and the bright sunlight returned. Senior Three-Eyed quickly adjusted his mood once more.","The butler couldn't help but wonder what could make the old master maintain such an optimistic and cheerful demeanor.","Meanwhile, on the other side, Song Shuhang's ghost spirit finally opened her eyes.","She had successfully absorbed the Spatial Authority Seed and Song Shuhang's smokey palm.","What kind of spatial ability had she awakened?","Senior Three-Eyed pondered for a moment before snapping his fingers and granted her a limited portion of the authority to utilize her spatial ability within the realm. However, her abilities were confined to the realm and couldn't extend beyond its boundaries or connect to external realms.","The ghost spirit sensed the restraint on her had loosened and reached out to grab black-skinned Soft Feather.","In the next instant, she vanished into thin air and hurtled toward Song Shuhang's location.","She possessed spatial ability!","The ghost spirit had successfully awakened the genuine power of spatial manipulation.","For Song Shuhang, this was undoubtedly the best outcome.","This was because absorbing the Spatial Authority Seed didn't guarantee the acquisition of spatial powers. Unluckily, some individuals might only develop a minor spatial talent, and there were various types of these talents to consider.","\"Wonderful! With genuine spatial abilities, our chances of escaping from the fat ball just improved.\" Song Shuhang thought optimistically.","Just as he was contemplating this, he suddenly realized that he was standing on the ground outside the giant.","Even though the dark clouds had dissipated, a strong, slightly chilly wind persisted.","Song Shuhang was confused.","What just happened?","Wasn't I in the cockpit a moment ago?","Did the world line shift without my knowledge?","At that moment, Pavilion Master Chu, who was lost in thought, ventured a guess, saying, \"This might be the spirit's unique spatial ability. When she uses her spatial jump, she can directly swap positions with her target.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in, \"That's right. So the ghost spirit's position was swapped with yours. She is now in the cockpit.\"","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","Wasn't this spatial ability a bit tricky?","Just imagine.","One day, he would find himself in a situation where he would have to confront the fat ball alone, and there was no way out but to battle. He had summoned all his available tricks to fend off the fat ball during their intense combat.","In the midst of the fierce clash, the ghost spirit may suddenly find herself in the wrong spot. A furious attack from the fat ball may just find her in its path.","At that crucial moment, the ghost spirit could use her spatial ability to swap positions with Song Shuhang.","No, just thinking about this possibility made his liver ache.","Wasn't it a tad inhumane to possess a spatial ability that could deceive its master like this?","As he thought about it, the ghost spirit's figure suddenly materialized around Song Shuhang's... waist.","Her ethereal form wrapped around his waist like a belt.","Meanwhile, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, originally hanging from Song Shuhang's waist, was abruptly thrust into the cockpit of the giant.","The ghost spirit's ability to swap positions in space wasn't limited to her master, Song Shuhang.","\"So, this spatial ability can be used to deceive others?\" Song Shuhang mused while rubbing his chin as he considered the various ways to employ this newfound ability.","\"Alright then,\" he said with a chuckle. \"Let's go meet the fat ball!\""]},{"number":2345,"title":"Chapter 2345 I’d Rather Die By My Own Hands!","paragraphs":["The ghost spirit nodded, and she merged into Song Shuhang's body.","They became one entity. After she fused with Song Shuhang's body, he found himself suddenly equipped with some knowledge about 'space' and the ability to use the ghost spirit's spatial abilities.","lightsΝοvel.cοm However, this knowledge was like plugging in a USB drive. It only provided temporary access.","To truly master this knowledge, Song Shuhang needed to read and copy it all into his own mind.","\"Senior Three-Eyed, it's time for us to part ways,\" Song Shuhang said while bowing respectfully to Senior Three-Eyed.","\"Aren't you planning to stay a bit longer?\" Senior Three-Eyed had been waiting for this moment. Seeing that Song Shuhang was finally about to leave, a genuine smile appeared on his face.","Song Shuhang noticed Senior Three-Eyed's inviting smile. \"Alright, I'll stay for a few more days. It will also give the fat ball more time to guard the door. Having a ruler of the Netherworld willingly guarding the entrance is a rare opportunity. I doubt I'll come across it again in my lifetime.\"","The three-eyed youth was left speechless.","'Can't you see I'm just being polite?'","\"But after giving it some thought, I've decided not to stay longer. However, upon further consideration, I've decided to pay a visit to the fat ball. If I fail, Senior Three-Eyed, could you leave a crack in the door for me to escape back to this small world?\" Song Shuhang asked earnestly.","\"Don't worry, I'll replace the wooden door with a steel one and make sure it's securely sealed,\" the three-eyed youth replied in a gentle tone.","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","\"Next, we'll meet again when you reach Rank-Eight. Don't come looking for me before you achieve Rank-Eight,\" Senior Three-Eyed waved his hand.","\"Alright, when the day comes for me to truly reveal my divinity before others, I'll come looking for you!\" Song Shuhang waved back.","...","On the steps of the Wealth Throne, Song Shuhang stowed away Black-Skinned Soft Feather and Fairy Creation.","He cautiously approached the exit between the Wealth Throne and the outside world.","\"Are you finally willing to come out?\" The fat ball's voice resounded.","At the same time, the fat ball's form materialized in front of the Wealth Throne, and a menacing eye appeared on its body, similar to the one on the big-eyed planet.","\"Using the Heavenly Eye?\" Song Shuhang was genuinely surprised. Didn't the fat ball just obtain the blueprints not too long ago? How could it have developed the Heavenly Eye so quickly?","Could a ruler of the Netherworld do as they pleased?","\"I'll let you experience the power of this thing,\" the fat ball said viciously.","Instead of attacking directly, it waited for Song Shuhang to emerge from the vortex since the Wealth Throne was shielded by the power of the three-eyed youth.","Alternatively, it could rush into the Wealth Throne to capture Song Shuhang and deal with him outside.","Song Shuhang decisively waved his hand and said, \"I've thought it over. I should go back after all. Goodbye, Fat Ball.\"","\"It's alright. You can continue to stay inside,\" the fat ball replied.","Here, it was merely one of its small clones. Ten years, eight years, or even a hundred years were just a blink of an eye to it.","That being said... while it was speaking, a force from the fat ball concealed itself in the shadows and quietly moved toward the Wealth Throne in an attempt to seize Song Shuhang.","At that very moment, Song Shuhang suddenly grabbed the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and used the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique to slash at the entrance of the Wealth Throne.","The raging flames created an unquenchable bonfire at the entrance.","The energy that the fat ball had secretly extended was blocked by the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","\"Senior Fatty Ball, let me tell you, even if I have to die, I won't submit to you. Moreover, even if I must die, I'll do it by my own hand!\" Song Shuhang declared passionately.","As he spoke, the Heaven Burning Fire at the door burned more fiercely.","But it wasn't over yet.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair contributed the last of its energy. It curled slightly, and wooden thorns, imbued with the power of life and death, sprouted from the Heaven Burning Fire. These sharp wooden thorns were ferocious and terrifying. They caused one's scalp to tingle just by looking at them.","The stone tablet at Song Shuhang's waist naturally couldn't lag behind. It also unleashed all its power and discreetly condensed a suppression spell within the flames.","The fat ball watched Song Shuhang's actions in bewilderment.","\"Come on, Fat Ball. We Chinese aren't afraid of death!\" Song Shuhang shouted a medley of slogans while keeping his gaze fixed on the boss fat ball. At the critical moment, he activated the ghost spirit's spatial ability.","Whoosh~","In the next moment, Song Shuhang's body successfully swapped positions with the fat ball!","Although the fat ball was already close to the Wealth Throne and had set up a spatial sealing array using a magical artifact, it was still within the spatial sealing array. However, the strength and effect of the spatial sealing array established by the magical treasure couldn't compare to the one created by the fat ball itself.","Moreover, the spatial seal set up by the magical treasure couldn't lock the ghost spirit's spatial ability, which was derived from the fat ball's own spatial authority.","\"Ah~\" The fat ball was pierced through by the wooden spike imbued with life and death. Simultaneously, the flames from the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique reached their maximum power.","Meanwhile, the attack from the Heavenly Eye and the thousands of projectiles unleashed by the fat ball relentlessly bombarded him.","The resulting explosion resembled an exquisite work of art, similar to a breathtaking display of fireworks in the void.","Song Shuhang did not even turn back to witness the explosion.","It had nothing to do with whether he was a true man.","Song Shuhang knew that the Flaming Hell and the attacks from the fat ball weren't enough to kill it.","It would only serve to enrage the fat ball even more.","Therefore, the moment the swap was successful, Song Shuhang swiftly summoned the Demonic Hamster.","The Demonic Hamster immediately called forth the Myriad World Piercing Shuttle.","With great haste, the two of them—man and hamster—rolled into the shuttle.","In the next instant, the immortal shuttle activated. It quickly proved its status as the fastest entity in the realm of physics across the myriad worlds.","\"Long live Earth\" Song Shuhang shouted a mixture of slogans while locking onto the fat ball. At the critical moment, he utilized the spatial ability of the ghost spirit.","And with that, Song Shuhang and the Demonic Hamster disappeared from the scene while leaving behind the cataclysmic explosion and the infuriated fat ball.","\"Tyrannical Song!!!\" Behind him, the fat ball crazy roar came. This voice was absolutely demonic.","Behind him, Wealth Throne quietly dispersed and disappeared.","On the steps, a Flaming Sixteen also slowly dissipated—it was Song Shuhang's insurance. If he had jumped out of the Wealth Throne and failed to swap places with the fat ball, the Flaming Sixteen would have been his insurance.","Fortunately, he did succeed."]},{"number":2346,"title":"Chapter 2346 Most Pain in History","paragraphs":["The entrance to the Wealth Throne vanished, and the Flaming Sixteen Substitution Technique dissipated alongside it.","The fat ball found itself ensnared in a barrage of attacks and bellowed in agony.","In the face of the enraged ruler of the Netherworld, one should ideally be thousands of miles away. Unfortunately, they were in the mortal realm, not the Netherworld.","The fat ball tumbled to the ground and was harassed by a swarm of rats.","Helplessly, the fat ball boss could only watch as Song Shuhang and the hamster fled while it remained seething with both anxiety and fury.","lightsnοvεl.cοm Its anger today ranked second only to the rage it felt when that accursed Bai Youyou had swiped its nest from right under its nose.","\"I swear, Tyrannical Song, I won't let you off!\" the fat ball boss muttered. Its body burned with an unquenchable Heaven Burning Flame. Though the flame burned brightly, it paled in comparison to the inferno of its current fury.","...","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang and the hamster found themselves tumbling within the shuttle.","The shuttle was ridiculously fast. Their bodies were flung about as they rolled and collided inside the cabin.","\"This is way too fast,\" Song Shuhang muttered while struggling to speak coherently.","\"No, Tyrannical Song, you clumsy oaf, move closer to the edge. You're squashing my tail, and it's making me incredibly uncomfortable!\" protested the hamster.","\"Do hamsters even have tails?\" Song Shuhang questioned as his eyes flew wide open.","\"I'm sorry, that's my fault. My tablet is a bit hard and heavy. There's nothing I can do about it. After all, I'm so powerful.\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet offered.","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword wasn't one to be outdone. It stepped forward and declared, \"It might be because of me. In terms of hardness, I surpass Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.\"","As a divine weapon... Even as the inner demon of a divine weapon, it wouldn't be outdone in terms of 'toughness.' Since Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet claimed its body was harder, the sword insisted that its own body was even harder.","\"I think I'm going to be sick!\" Lady Onion cried out in pain. \"I'm going to be sick! Shuhang, can you stop this rolling?\"","\"Do you think I want to roll around?\" Song Shuhang said in despair. \"I can't help it. This is the fastest thing in the universe. If I don't roll a few times, how can I show off its incredible speed?\"","At this point, Pavilion Master Chu's hair suddenly stood on end as if it had been charged with electricity. \"The connection has finally been established, Shuhang. I have a gift for you.\"","\"Just hold on a bit, Senior Chu!\" Song Shuhang was about to plead for mercy, but being the fastest in the universe was no joke.","More importantly, in order to avoid being easily tracked by the fat ball, the shuttle didn't follow a simple straight path. After sprinting for a certain distance, it would suddenly change direction and continue in another one. This was why Song Shuhang and the hamster found themselves rolling about.","In the meantime, they reached a point where the shuttle made a 90-degree turn.","Song Shuhang felt as though his body was threatening to throw his spirit out.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair was securely wrapped around Song Shuhang's robust neck. When the immortal shuttle made the sharp turn, the hair cooperatively shortened.","\"Sob, sob, sob,\" Song Shuhang groaned.","His body was plastered against the roof of the shuttle while swaying wildly like a salted fish left out in the sun.","The universe's fastest speed coupled with the Immortal's hair was extremely harsh on a Seventh Stage Venerable like him.","However, Song Shuhang's act of foaming at the mouth and rolling his eyes was likely an exaggeration.","Apart from his fear of speed and heights, the pain on his neck wasn't as intense as it seemed.","\"I made you nod, I made you feel numb, I made you come up with such a rich vocabulary. What other titles do you want to bestow upon me? Tell me, and I'll give you the chance!\" Pavilion Master Chu lectured him like a strict teacher reprimanding a wayward student.","As the hamster continued rolling, it observed Song Shuhang hanging on the roof of the immortal shuttle and swallowed its saliva. When a female creature got angry, it was truly frightening.","Fortunately, the fat ball wasn't female. Otherwise, Song Shuhang would've been done for long ago.","However, as it continued rolling, the hamster sensed that something was amiss.","Tyrannical Song's expression of despair and fear didn't quite match the level of pain and despair it sensed. Could Tyrannical Song be disguising his true feelings?","At that moment, Fairy Creation suddenly fell from Song Shuhang's body. She reached out, plucked Lady Onion from Song Shuhang's pocket, and held her aloft.","In spite of her trembling body, the fairy's hands remained steady like a weathervane.","Lady Onion took several pictures of Song Shuhang, who was clinging to the roof like a fish out of water.","Then, she selected the most 'agonizing' ones and shared them on her 'Moments' using the cultivation chat function.","Title: [Disaster Strikes as Tyrannical Song is Chased by the Netherworld Ruler—His Most Torturous Hour]","[Description: December 8th, a day that will go down in history. We are facing the greatest crisis of our lives as the Netherworld ruler, the fat ball, pursues us relentlessly. Currently, we are desperately fleeing, and at any moment, the fat ball boss could catch up to us and crush us like insects. Compared to the mighty Netherworld ruler, the fat ball, we are insignificant and fragile. Just sensing its presence sends shivers down our spines. Below, witness the most excruciating pain ever endured by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.]","Picture: Song Shuhang in various unflattering positions x6.","Lady Onion had posted twice on her Moments today.","[Blacklist] Immortal Lord, [Hehehe.]","Then, a private message from the Immortal Lord appeared in Song Shuhang's mind. \"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.\"","Song Shuhang was confused.","For Immortal Lord to offer help?","Like I'd believe you!"]},{"number":2347,"title":"Chapter 2347 No Way Up to the Sky, No Way Down to the Earth","paragraphs":["Lately, Song Shuhang had been feeling rather confident. He knew he wasn't everyone's favorite, and he had a history of pranking the Immortal Lord numerous times. Now, the Immortal Lord was eagerly offering his help?","That would not happen unless the Immortal Lord had a peculiar taste for masochism and enjoyed being mistreated over and over while treating others like his first love. Otherwise, there was no logical reason for him to help Song Shuhang.","\"Thank you for your offer, Senior, but I don't require assistance at the moment. I believe I can manage on my own,\" Song Shuhang politely replied. He refrained from using the Retaliation Spell against the Immortal Lord directly. His desire to survive had surged recently, probably due to the lack of a reliable 'resurrection formation.'","Although Senior White Two had set up a resurrection array for him, it came with a catch – upon resurrection, he would become a demon of the Netherworld and bid farewell to his current life.","\"Your kindness is appreciated, Senior Immortal, but it's not necessary. We Chinese believe in helping others without seeking recognition. Doing good deeds is the essence of happiness, and you don't need to thank me,\" Song Shuhang replied promptly. He then shifted his focus back to portraying the role of of a beaten-up Shuhang who seemed utterly tormented by a strand of hair.","The more pained he appeared, the less angry Pavilion Master Chu would be.","Once Pavilion Master Chu's anger subsided, he would regain his playful spirit.","Just as Song Shuhang immersed himself in his act, the cultivation chat-virus warning function on his body sent him an alert.","The new function added by Lady Long Luo reminded him that someone was using a long-range locking magical technique to divine his location or possibly launch a long-distance mental attack on him.","The likely culprit? The Immortal Lord.","Given the temporary breakdown of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and the absorption of its remains by the fat ball, it seemed unlikely that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was responsible this time.","Song Shuhang quickly messaged Senior Demon Emperor.","Their communication had always been straightforward.","\"Are you there?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","On the other end, the Demon Emperor had just left a comment on Lady Onion's Moments: \"Fairy, do you have any more photos of Tyrannical Song in torment? Let's chat privately.\"","In response to the Demon Emperor's message, he received a swift private message.","Initially, he thought Lady Onion was being selfish.","However, upon opening the private chat, he discovered that it was Song Shuhang, the 'loser' currently hanging by a thread.","Hence, it wasn't just the Demon Emperor who replied with a wry \"Hehe.\"","Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm As long as Senior More than One replied, he had established a short communication channel with Senior More than One.","Soon after, the Demon Emperor responded, \"A spiritual scan? Trying to set me up? Are you luring the ruler of the Netherworld to me? Dream on!\"","It wasn't just the Demon Emperor who confidently rejected the spiritual scan. Despite his serious injuries, most of the damage was physical, and his spiritual power had mostly recovered. In terms of mental attacks, he was fearless.","Song Shuhang, hanging in a state of torment, played his part.","Senior was extremely cooperative.","Pavilion Master Chu rolled his eyes in disgust. Song Shuhang was on the verge of drooling, and she feared his saliva might land on her precious hair.","She contemplated whether she should release Song Shuhang.","...","Meanwhile, Lady Onion was checking the messages on her WeChat Moments.","[Golden Dragon Scarf] The white dragon said, \"Little Sixteen and I were only gone for a few days. What have you guys been up to?\"","[Bad Friend] Heavenly Emperor: \"Senior Song, after your death anniversary comes out, please tell me the date of your death in your dream~\"","After reading a few messages, she swiftly came across the Demon Emperor's reply.","The Demon Emperor not only asked her to chat privately but also seemed to be hinting at a transaction?","Was she about to rely on secret deals with powerful individuals to ascend to the pinnacle of onion life?","\"Should I respond to the Demon Emperor alone, or should I reply to others as well?\" Lady Onion pondered.","Just then, a new reply appeared on her Moments.","[Pet Owner (crossed out): Best Friend] Senior White Two: \"Shuhang, don't let your guard down while escaping. Don't forget that the fat ball is the ruler of the Netherworld.\"","Shuhang, Ruler White mentioned that you shouldn't forget that the fat ball is the ruler of the Netherworld. Though I don't know what that means, I thought I should convey the message to you.\" Lady Onion chimed in.","\"Argh, argh\" Song Shuhang called out a few times but found himself unable to speak. He had to use a secret sound transmission method to communicate, \"We've never forgotten that he's the ruler of the Netherworld. Even if it's just a clone, we treat it as the real deal.\"","\"Idiot, what my master meant was that the title 'ruler of the Netherworld' not only represents the fat ball himself but also his authority,\" the hamster explained.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld meant that all the demons of the Netherworld were effectively under the fat ball's control.","Would the fat ball boss summon his minions to pummel him?","As this thought crossed his mind, the shuttle abruptly came to a halt.","In front of the immortal shuttle, several spatial gates opened.","The fat ball's clone arrived with six Ninth Stage demons.","\"Tyrannical Song.\" the chill in the fat ball's voice sent shivers down the spine.","The fat ball had used divination techniques to calculate Song Shuhang's direction and effectively blocked his path.","The ruler of the Netherworld had personally divined, and his accuracy was terrifyingly high.","\"Shuhang, it seems you won't be able to escape the fat ball's grasp for the rest of your life unless you master a magical technique or magical treasure that can conceal your actions,\" the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword warned.","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth. \"Let's go. We'll enter the Inner World before it's too late.\""]},{"number":2348,"title":"Chapter 2348 Fat Ball: Was I Raised by a Stepmother?","paragraphs":["The formidable fat ball had just materialized through the spatial passage, and it hadn't had a chance to establish a spatial seal yet.","So, Song Shuhang had a brief window to open his Inner World.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Originally, Song Shuhang had planned to create a safe distance between himself and the fat ball using the shuttle, and then retreat into his Inner World for cover. However, he hadn't anticipated how quickly the fat ball would catch up.","His plans simply couldn't keep up with sudden changes...","With a thought, Song Shuhang opened an exit inside the shuttle to his Inner World.","\"Quick, they're about to start setting up spatial seals!\" his sword yelled.","Song Shuhang used his telekinetic energy to grab the hamster and Lady Onion, and Pavilion Master Chu's hair was tied around his neck as she tossed them all into the Inner World.","At the same time, the hamster cast a spell to stow away the shuttle, and the Inner World swiftly closed.","\"We're safe.\" Song Shuhang sighed with relief. Taking advantage of the small gap between the Inner World and the outside world, he glanced at the distant fat ball.","The fat ball didn't pursue; it had encountered some difficulties.","In the void, the heavenly tribulation condensed and targeted the group of Ninth Stage demons.","Ninth Stage demons had the ability to traverse between the main world and the Netherworld Realm, but they were subject to numerous restrictions when entering the main world. Moreover, the spiritual energy of the main world differed from the malevolent energy of the Netherworld Realm and caused a significant reduction in the strength of Ninth Stage demons in the main world.","This time, the fat ball had summoned six Ninth Stage demons to confront Song Shuhang, only to attract a terrifying heavenly tribulation that targeted and struck down the Ninth Stage demons.","The fat ball couldn't help but feel bitter. It suddenly remembered the three-eyed youth in the Wealth Throne and thought of Bai in the Netherworld Realm. Other people's Wielders of the Will cared for their Netherworld Rulers in every way possible. Even when the Wielder of the Will retired, they would make efforts to ensure the continued existence of their Netherworld Ruler.","Forget the heavenly tribulation; it was an unchangeable iron rule. However, every time it wanted to take action in the main world, the Heavenly Dao would create problems for it. This time, it had only summoned a few Ninth Stage demons, and the Heavenly Dao had directly sent a heavenly tribulation.","\"Was I raised by a stepmother?\" The fat ball couldn't help but exclaim. But after a moment, it forced itself to calm down. Even if it had forgotten what that 'thing' was, it knew it was definitely related to Tyrannical Song! Therefore, it continued to use the divination plate to calculate Song Shuhang's location.","In the next encounter, it would extend the distance, dodge through the spatial passage in advance, and prepare everything while waiting for Tyrannical Song to appear.","\"I must retrieve it from Tyrannical Song... Huh?\" While divining, it suddenly froze. Its memories became blurry.","\"What do I need to retrieve from Tyrannical Song? What is this strange feeling...?\" The fat ball wondered.","\"Could this be the effect of the Wielder's small black room? Erasing memories related to that 'thing' at the source?\" The fat ball quickly deduced. Someone had sent the thing it wanted to retrieve from Tyrannical Song into the Wielder's small black room? The fat ball angrily jumped in the air but calmed down shortly after. Even if it had forgotten what that 'thing' was, it knew it was definitely related to Tyrannical Song!","With that in mind, it continued to use the divination plate to calculate Song Shuhang's location.","In the universe, in a star field that had yet to give birth to life.","Senior White Two's projected clone and the main fat ball's avatar were locked in a fierce battle. All the planets in this galaxy had been destroyed by the intense energy of their avatars.","The main fat ball's avatar was at a disadvantage because it had lost its spatial authority. In a battle between equally matched opponents, the fat ball, without spatial powers, was restricted and found itself defending more than attacking.","Senior White Two didn't hold back. This time, he was determined to obliterate this avatar. He didn't want the fat ball to continue causing trouble in the main world.","Just as the two were engaged in their intense battle, the avatar suddenly became absent-minded. Senior White Two seized the opportunity and used a series of moves to shave off 1% of the avatar's body.","\"How is this possible? Did I really forget?\" The fat ball muttered.","\"Forget? What did you forget? Oh... Are you talking about information related to that thing?\" Senior White Two continued his relentless attack while verbally taunting the fat ball.","\"Why is this happening?!\" The fat ball roared and transformed into a metallic sea urchin. Countless destructive beams of light shot out from the spikes on its body and cut through everything they touched like tofu.","Senior White Two knew how powerful these beams of light were, so he had no choice but to retreat.","\"Maybe you're a special existence among the rulers of the Netherworld,\" Senior White Two remarked.","After the fat ball's destructive laser finished firing, Senior White Two once again advanced, not giving his opponent a chance to escape.","\"Was I really raised by a stepmother?\"","\"Sometimes... I'm really envious of you.\" This thought appeared in the fat ball's mind. The more envious it was, the more it frustrated it became.","\"Let's die together, Bai!\" The fat ball roared and directly crashed into Senior White Two, as if it was going to risk its life."]},{"number":2349,"title":"Chapter 2349 A Genius Idea","paragraphs":["\"Come on, fat ball,\" Senior White Two waved his hand and approached it. \"In the last moments of your life, I'll make sure to keep you company so you won't feel lonely.\"","\"If there's a next life, I never want to see you again!\" The fat ball roared angrily.","The battle between the two avatars of the ruler of the Netherworld escalated into its most violent phase.","Meanwhile, in the Inner World, Song Shuhang was suspended in mid-air while being held up by Pavilion Master Chu's hair.","He was planning to stay in the Inner World for a while.","\"Senior Chu, we've already returned to the Inner World and entered the safe zone... So, you can put me down now,\" Song Shuhang said.","The core assistant, the group of invisible sword insects, and the eight little tree-planting demon beasts that Fairy Qingluan had given him were all watching.","Song Shuhang felt that if he continued to hang like a salted fish, it would damage his dignity as the owner of the Inner World.","\"Wait, don't be anxious. I want to give you a gift,\" Pavilion Master Chu said.","\"What gift?\" Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Why was she in such a hurry to give it to him?","Was it a gift that would lead to his death?","Just as Song Shuhang was deep in thought, Pavilion Master Chu's hair pulled him to the side of the living spring in the Inner World.","\"Yo, Shuhang, what are you wearing today? It's really unique,\" Senior Turtle waved his hand.","Lady Onion gently jumped down from Song Shuhang's pocket and took the initiative to water the trees and feed the spirit beasts and magical beasts.","She had always been very diligent when she was working.","\"Senior Turtle, I'm training the muscles of my neck. You can try it too,\" Song Shuhang said calmly.","\"I don't need it. Turtles have very flexible necks,\" Senior Turtle said happily.","At that moment, Pavilion Master Chu's main body's long hair fluttered in the wind. She took the red crystal statue and placed it in front of Song Shuhang.","\"Isn't this your crystal figurine?\" Song Shuhang recognized this treasure at a glance. Was this not Pavilion Master Chu's resurrection magical treasure?","\"This statue is a means of resurrection that I prepared for myself a long time ago. But now that I've stepped onto the path of immortality, I can't use this crystal statue anymore,\" Pavilion Master Chu said slowly.","Daoist Stone Tablet at Song Shuhang's waist said, \"It can't be. There's still room for improvement with a resurrection magical treasure of this level. In addition, it's connected to you and has been nourished by your power for many years. As long as we add some more materials, we can upgrade it to an immortal-level resurrection method.\"","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","\"Maybe it's better if you don't send Shuhang off,\" Scarlet Heaven Sword said faintly. \"I feel that it's better if Song Shuhang doesn't have a resurrection magical treasure. This way, he will have more confidence and be more cautious.\"","After saying that, it added in its heart, \"He won't die so quickly.\"","Song Shuhang didn't expect that Pavilion Master Chu would actually want to give him a precious resurrection treasure at the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm...","\"Pavilion Master Chu, this statue is too precious. Pavilion Master Chu, you should upgrade it,\" Song Shuhang said calmly.","Although he really needed a resurrection magical treasure, he was currently a Seventh Stage Venerable. Using a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender-level resurrection magical treasure would be a bit of a waste.","\"Say no more. My decision to give it to you was also a decision I made after much consideration. Moreover, do you think that in your current state, a regular resurrection array can resurrect you?\" Pavilion Master Chu replied.","Song Shuhang's realm was at the Seventh Stage Realm, but if he really used the revival array of the Seventh Stage Realm to revive himself, he would definitely fail.","Putting everything else aside, just the three great body-tempering cultivation techniques he cultivated and the general principles of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique had directly pulled his physique to an off-the-charts level. The current Song Shuhang had already reached the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm in terms of physique.","In addition, Song Shuhang had seven small dantians and one original dantian, as well as so many Nascent Souls and the fat whale golden core.","In addition, many of his body parts were beyond the Seventh Stage.","Even ten Seventh Stage Venerable resurrection formations were unable to revive him.","\"In addition, with my current condition, I won't be able to come out of the living spring for another century. This statue is useless in my hands. On the contrary, if you really die, this Inner World will collapse... When that happens, I'll probably disappear again after losing the living spring,\" Pavilion Master Chu said slowly.","\"Don't be so wishy-washy. If you continue to refuse, do you know how many brain cells Pavilion Master Chu will waste if she wants to find a new excuse to give you the resurrection statue?\" Senior Turtle added.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"Accept it, Tyrannical Song,\" Daoist Stone Tablet said, \"After all, you're going to face the clone of the ruler of the Netherworld. If you're not careful, you'll die. Don't waste Pavilion Master Chu's good intentions.\"","\"Why do I feel that the moment I accept this resurrection artifact, I will die soon?\" Song Shuhang muttered.","In the end, he still chose to accept Pavilion Master Chu's gift. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was right; he was about to face the pursuit of the fat ball.","The chances of death would be very high.","Pavilion Master Chu removed the binding between herself and the crystal statue and guided Song Shuhang's spiritual energy and mental energy to leave a mark on the crystal statue.","However, it was not that easy for a ninth-grade resurrection technique to take effect.","Song Shuhang needed to bring it along and use his spiritual energy to nourish it. It would take at least seven days to completely transform it into his resurrection magic tool.","Under Pavilion Master Chu's control, the crystal statue shrank to the size of a pendant and hung on Song Shuhang's body. It would be convenient for him to nourish it day and night.","Song Shuhang looked at the small pendant, and his right hand suddenly became restless. He thought of a clever trick up his sleeve.","However, it was better not to use this trick in front of Pavilion Master Chu.","\"Shuhang,\" Lady Onion ran over from afar and said, \"Can you give me a drop of the Heavenly Dao's eye drop? I want to do an experiment... You can deduct the price from my salary.\"","\"You want to use the Heavenly Dao's eye drops to evolve?\" Song Shuhang asked curiously.","\"No, when I was watering Miruru's branches just now, I suddenly had an idea. Since the Heavenly Dao's Eye Drops can enchant magical artifacts, what will happen if I use a drop on Miruru?\" Lady Onion explained.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Wonderful, Lady Onion's idea was simply genius.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently tapped Lady Onion's head. \"Let's go. Let's give Miruru some eye drops. Maybe she'll wake up in advance.\""]},{"number":2350,"title":"Chapter 2350 Because Shuhang Is Good-Looking","paragraphs":["Miruru was once a young tree demon, a devoted fan of the first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. Before transcending the heavenly tribulation, she crossed paths with Song Shuhang, who had recently become 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.' She became the first fortunate soul to bear the Sage Seal of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","However, Miruru's attempt to transcend the tribulation ended in failure, and even her demon form succumbed to the celestial onslaught. All that remained was the Seal of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, and a new sprout emerged.","At that moment, Song Shuhang had been lost in thought. He transplanted Miruru's new sprout into his Inner World and nourished it with a blend of springwater and pure water while envisioning a day when Miruru would regain her consciousness and resume her journey of cultivation.","\"Let's pay a visit to Miruru,\" Song Shuhang said as he picked up Lady Onion and placed her gently on his shoulder.","Nurtured within the embrace of the Inner World, Miruru's remnant branch had flourished into a small sapling.","As if sensing Song Shuhang's presence, the branches and leaves swayed gently.","Her root was fashioned from the remnant of Song Shuhang's Seal. Even though she had yet to gain consciousness, she naturally felt close to Song Shuhang.","Extending his hand, Song Shuhang tenderly caressed the sapling.","The path of cultivation was fraught with harshness. He was currently pursued by the ruler of the Netherworld and had taken refuge within his Inner World, fearful of venturing outside.","\"The path of cultivation teems with both peril and serendipity,\" the sword remarked. \"Some succeed while others falter. Some can rise after falling, while others plummet indefinitely. Individuals like Shuhang, who can persistently rise after every fall, are few and far between.\"","\"The luckiest aspect of my life is encountering so many benevolent seniors. Without their assistance and the various resurrection artifacts, I would have perished long ago,\" Song Shuhang mused.","\"Actually, Shuhang,\" the Scarlet Heaven Sword chimed in, \"have you noticed that whenever you lack a resurrection magical treasure, you don't seem to die?\"","Song Shuhang was left momentarily speechless.","Daoist Stone Tablet interjected, \"Sword, you are mistaken. This is called survivorship bias. Because Tyrannical Song is still alive, you have the illusion that he wouldn't die without a resurrection magical treasure. However, in reality, without such a treasure, Tyrannical Song would have perished long ago.\"","Song Shuhang sighed. He extended his hand and laid it upon sword and tablet while executing ten strokes of the Saber Nurturing Technique. \"Seniors, I implore you to change the topic. Discussing death in such depth is inauspicious. Excessive discourse on this matter might deplete my luck. I intend to use the eye drops on Miruru and awaken her consciousness. Don't jinx it.\"","Song Shuhang retrieved the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops and unscrewed the bottle cap once more.","With a light tap, a drop of the eye drops floated up and gathered on his fingertip.","On the back of his hand, the Defiant Whale Tool Spirit Fairy, which bore a resemblance to Song Shuhang, appeared. She shrank to the size of a palm, cradled the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops with both hands, and then gently sprinkled them onto the tree demon Miruru.","Miruru instinctively absorbed the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops, absorbing their power.","Subsequently, a group of individuals encircled Miruru's sapling, witnessing her transformation.","Different from magical artifacts that could be imbued with spiritual enchantments, objects with 'life' underwent spiritual enchantment accompanied by peculiar phenomena.","A beautiful eye emerged at the tip of Miruru's tree. Through this beautiful eye, an inheritance was directly transmitted to the sapling.","Ten minutes later, the beautiful eyes vanished.","Miruru's sapling moved without any apparent breeze, each leaf radiating a subtle fluorescent glow.","Then, a feeble consciousness coalesced upon the sapling.","\"It's a success!\" Lady Onion exclaimed joyfully.","\"Yes, this is all thanks to you,\" Song Shuhang said, gently tapping the green onion sprout. He exercised caution, mindful of not exerting excessive force to avoid knocking her head off.","\"Nevertheless, Miruru has just gained sentience. It will take considerable time for her to evolve back into a demon,\" Song Shuhang remarked.","In the past, Lady Onion had been secretly guided by Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven and required hundreds of years to transform into a human. Miruru possessed inferior aptitude compared to Lady Onion. Her journey to regain her former self might be even lengthier.","\"Persist and persevere. When you tread the path of cultivation once more, I shall accept you as my disciple,\" Song Shuhang uttered softly.","He acknowledged that he wasn't the most qualified mentor, particularly in terms of knowledge. He remained far from being a dependable grand senior, but he vowed to give his utmost effort.","Miruru's sprout entwined affectionately around Song Shuhang's substantial hand, her roots beginning to extend.","The core assistant nearby blinked her eyes and proactively collaborated with Miruru.","Miruru's race bore unique traits. If her roots were fully extended, they would span hundreds of times the size of the tree above. Her roots possessed the capacity to manage and tend to the spiritual plants and trees within Song Shuhang's Inner World.","With proper nurturing, Miruru's tree could rival many spiritual plant masters. Furthermore, as her realm advanced, her capabilities would further escalate, potentially resolving Song Shuhang's Inner World's deficiency of spiritual plant masters.","The core assistant discerned Miruru's potential and actively guided her in cultivation and the display of her talents.","Furthermore, the core assistant awaited the return of Song Shuhang's other disciple, Virtuous Buddhist Swordsman Cai. Little Cai was a cultivator enthralled by cultivation, and progress in her practice brought her immense joy.","She had also taken up Song Shuhang's Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique. When combined with the Encyclopedia of Animal Taming, this technique functioned like a small spiritual beast cheat, which enhanced her strength while facilitating the taming of spiritual beasts. Additionally, it allowed her to augment her cultivation by consuming spirit beast crystals.","Properly nurtured, Little Cai would undoubtedly ascend to become a master beast tamer.","Miruru and Little Cai represented essential components in the core assistant's future plans.","...","...","Nightfall descended.","Song Shuhang leaned against the Gem Fruit Tree and closed his eyes in meditation.","Beside him, Fairy Creation plucked the strings of her pipa, while the black-skinned Soft Feather hummed a gentle tune.","The ghost spirit fairy perched on the fruit tree, and the diminutive demonic beast tasked with caring for the fruit tree presented her with ripe fruits.","lightsnοvεl.cοm Fairy Defiant Whale shrunk even further as she clambered onto Song Shuhang's arm, then slid down along his bracer before ascending once more.","Meanwhile, the hamster diligently honed its swordsmanship, its fur glistening with perspiration.","Moments later, Song Shuhang abruptly opened his eyes and sighed.","Simultaneously, a gleaming aura of virtue emanated from his body while scattering into starlight by his side.","Black-skinned Soft Feather furrowed her brow and distanced herself slightly from the virtue light. The sword shifted back and forth in tandem.","\"The virtuous fat whale dissipated again?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired lazily.","\"Yes, I discreetly deployed the virtuous fat whale to survey a coordinate within the cosmos. However, it shattered as soon as I released it... The fat ball boss is somehow deducing my location. This time, we're truly ensnared within the Inner World,\" Song Shuhang lamented.","He had strategically established coordinates for the Sage Seal Wooden Blade across many locations on Earth, but the universe featured only a limited number.","The few cosmic coordinates he utilized were all pinpointed and annihilated by the fat ball as soon as the virtuous fat whale explored them.","This implied that the fat ball had successfully deduced Song Shuhang's potential whereabouts.","The ruler of the Netherworld had personally imposed this blockade—a truly daunting prospect.","In truth, this time, the fat ball had nearly pursued the passageway into the Inner World created by the virtuous fat whale and invaded directly!","\"For the time being, we must avoid the Earth coordinates. If we converge there, the fat ball will obliterate Earth directly and cause catastrophic repercussions,\" Song Shuhang deliberated.","\"Why don't you borrow some spirit stones from Senior White, then forcefully detonate and suppress the fat ball's clone?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet proposed.","\"Do not underestimate the ruler of the Netherworld. Even if Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and I combine our powers for a simultaneous detonation, there's no guarantee we can subdue the fat ball. I have a different idea. I'm considering the possibility of directly opening an entrance to the Inner World and enticing the fat ball's clone inside,\" Song Shuhang mused.","The Inner World stood as one of his most potent assets. Under ordinary circumstances, he refrained from exposing it to enemies to prevent any potential harm.","Nevertheless, if no other recourse existed, he could contemplate luring adversaries into the Inner World. After all, the Inner World held a connection to Senior White Two's realm—the world of the black lotus.","Entering the Inner World equated to stepping into Senior White Two's backyard. The prospect of confronting the massive fist of the ruler of the Netherworld within such a domain was terrifying, but also useful.","\"What a missed opportunity. If only Senior Three-Eyed won the game,\" Song Shuhang lamented.","However, at the time, the allure of the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops was too compelling and aligned perfectly with Song Shuhang's needs. He admitted to being greedy and lacked the foresight to throw the game to the three-eyed youth.","\"Core assistant, prepare an empty space or extract the square from the Palace of Summer. We will directly open the entrance to the Inner World in the square and draw the fat ball to our location,\" Song Shuhang instructed.","\"Affirmative,\" the core assistant affirmed. \"Command confirmed. Transfer initiated.\"","\"In that case, I'll be heading to the world of the black lotus to confer with Senior White Two on our next course of action,\" Song Shuhang resolved.","He couldn't remain in hiding indefinitely. Continuing to reside within the Inner World was not a sustainable solution.","Within a private courtyard of Su Clan in Spirit River Su Clan, Sixteen opened her eyes and let out a soft sigh.","\"Another recurring dream?\" inquired the White Dragon.","\"Yes, I dreamed of the moment when I suffered severe injuries during the Fourth Stage heavenly tribulation,\" Su Clan's Sixteen confirmed. \"Back then, after sustaining grievous wounds, I roamed around Jiangnan University Town. I crossed paths with Shuhang numerous times, and he saved my life on multiple occasions.\"","\"While being a hero who saves a damsel in distress may sound cliché, it is indeed a swift method to gain favor,\" commented the White Dragon.","\"Moreover, Shuhang is quite handsome,\" Su Clan's Sixteen added.","The White Dragon was left momentarily speechless."]},{"number":2351,"title":"Chapter 2351 Let’s Go Have Some Fun","paragraphs":["The White Dragon extended her claws and gently opened Su Clan's Sixteen's eyes to meticulously observe her.","Su Clan's Sixteen was left speechless.","\"You don't have beauty-filtering contact lenses on,\" the White Dragon remarked.","\"Come on, White Dragon, cut it off,\" Su Clan's Sixteen gently swatted away the White Dragon's claws, got up, neatly folded the quilt into a small square, and then headed to the bathroom to freshen up.","While Sixteen was in the bathroom, the White Dragon unfolded the previously squared quilt while nodding in satisfaction.","\"Sister White Dragon, I've been reminiscing about that period. Is my trial nearing its end?\" Su Clan's Sixteen inquired from the bathroom.","\"Yes, that seems to be the case. We've already gathered quite a number of 'Little Sixteens,' and you've almost solidified your Fifth Stage Realm. After the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting concludes, I'll take you to the Time Mystic Realm once more. This time, we'll aim to access the next level of the Draconic Mystic Realm and pursue a grander path of fate,\" the White Dragon replied.","\"Very well,\" Su Clan's Sixteen agreed. She then added, \"Is Shuhang planning to attend the annual meeting? If I schedule it right, I should be able to meet Shuhang before the trial concludes.\"","\"And then what? Will you continue to impress him with your virtuous side?\" the White Dragon playfully suggested while scratching her chin with her small claws. \"Sixteen, I've been wanting to tell you this for a while. If you appear too virtuous in front of Shuhang, you might end up like Sister Sixteen... I'm a prime example.\"","\"Don't worry, Sister White Dragon. I know what to do,\" Su Clan's Sixteen assured. She emerged from the bathroom and sighed as she noticed the quilt had been transformed into a rectangular strip.","\"Additionally, is Shuhang's attendance at the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting confirmed?\" the White Dragon stated.","\"Shuhang?\" Su Clan's Sixteen was taken aback. \"Did something happen to Shuhang?\"","Having secluded herself to consolidate her realm in recent days, she had not kept abreast of the outside world's developments.","\"He's currently being pursued across the universe by the ruler of the Netherworld's fat ball avatar, who is quite relentless. Shuhang is holed up in the Inner World and unable to emerge. If he doesn't address the issue of the fat ball, it's doubtful he'll make it to the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting,\" the White Dragon replied.","\"The ruler of the Netherworld,\" Su Clan's Sixteen murmured as she rubbed her temples while feeling a headache coming on.","This term symbolized ultimate supremacy and represented half of the Heavenly Dao while ranking as one of the mightiest beings aside from the Heavenly Dao itself. Ordinary cultivators, let alone Immortals, might never encounter a ruler of the Netherworld in their entire lifetimes.","\"Is there anything we can do to help?\" Su Clan's Sixteen inquired.","The White Dragon shook her head and suggested, \"Why not contact our young friend Shuhang directly?\"","\"Yes, we have the QR code function,\" Su Clan's Sixteen replied as she attempted to activate the cultivation chat feature. She sent a message to Song Shuhang, saying, \"Shuhang, it's time to rest.\"","The White Dragon was left speechless.","\"Sixteen, you're awake. I haven't slept for several nights. I'm preparing for a significant endeavor now. If it succeeds, I'll be able to rest afterward!\" Song Shuhang responded swiftly. It hinted that he might require an extended period of rest if his mission succeeded.","Su Clan's Sixteen persisted. \"Do you require assistance?\"","\"Not necessary, not necessary. For now, I just need to locate a secure coordinate and taunt the enemy. It's a relatively straightforward task. If I don't deal with the fat ball's avatar, it will continue to use divination to pinpoint my location,\" Song Shuhang explained.","Su Clan's Sixteen raised her head after reading the message and looked at the White Dragon with anticipation.","After a brief pause, the White Dragon contemplated, \"Isn't Pavilion Master Chu within his Inner World? Perhaps Master Chu can cast a spell to conceal the heavenly secrets and thwart the fat ball's divination.\"","Pavilion Master Chu, being an Immortal, possessed the necessary capabilities.","Su Clan's Sixteen nodded and conveyed the White Dragon's suggestion to Song Shuhang.","In response, Song Shuhang swiftly replied, \"I've attempted that already. Pavilion Master Chu possesses several methods to disrupt the heavenly secrets, but none of them can deceive the fat ball. There's one method that proves effective, but it requires being within Pavilion Master Chu's Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion's illusory reality. Once outside the pavilion, the effect wanes. It's essentially trading cowardice in the Inner World for cowardice in the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion. I'd rather stay elsewhere.\"","\"It appears there's little recourse. The magical mechanisms designed to disrupt heavenly secrets are generally more effective when applied to oneself. When used on others, their efficacy diminishes. Therefore, Shuhang can either cultivate a technique to disrupt heavenly secrets or seek a magical treasure with similar capabilities,\" the White Dragon suggested.","Su Clan's Sixteen inquired, \"Would such a magical treasure be prohibitively expensive?\"","\"Any magical treasure capable of evading a ruler's divination would undoubtedly be exorbitantly priced,\" the White Dragon replied.","\"White Dragon, how about we head to the Dragon Mystic Realm ahead of schedule?\"","\"You don't want to wait until the conclusion of the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting?\"","\"We'll return before the annual meeting begins.\"","\"Very well, shall we depart now? Remember, finding a heavenly secrets-disrupting magical treasure in the Dragon Mystic Realm is not guaranteed. Don't be disappointed if we can't find one.\"","Meanwhile, in another part of the universe, within Senior White Two's evil lotus world, Song Shuhang had become quite accustomed to entering this realm, as it felt like returning home.","\"Senior White, I'm here,\" Song Shuhang said as he pushed open the entrance to the fat ball's lair.","He was greeted not by the fat ball but by the sealing pillar, which joyfully bounded over to him.","Inside the sealing pillar was the majority of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Upon seeing the lively sealing pillar, Song Shuhang suddenly recalled that he owed it a lesson in the Art of Saber Maintenance. Over the past few days, he had been evading the fat ball's relentless pursuit and left him with no time to fulfill his promise.","\"Sorry, I've been quite busy lately and couldn't find the time to visit,\" Song Shuhang apologized. With a thought, he used the hair growth technique to grow his hair out and condensed twenty palms which he held against the sealing pillar to intensify the Art of Saber Maintenance.","The seven-colored light emitted by the sealing pillar became even more dazzling.","Even the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball confined within the sealing pillar seemed to be affected.","\"Shuhang, you've come at the right time. Release a portion of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball sealed within the pillar so I can conduct some research,\" Senior White Two's voice echoed from behind him.","Senior White Two was now wearing a white coat, with his hands hidden in the sleeves.","\"Senior White, let's postpone our study of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball for now. It's still trapped here, and there's no rush. Instead, I plan to lure the fat ball's clone into my Inner World,\" Song Shuhang enthusiastically revealed. \"Once that happens, Senior White, you can take over and capture it. Then we can analyze the fat ball boss's clone!\"","\"Very well, go ahead. I'll be ready to capture it,\" White Senior Two eagerly agreed.","\"Senior White, I'll set off now!\" Song Shuhang promptly activated the Art of Saber Maintenance on the sealing pillar once more and then jumped back into his Inner World.","Senior White Two gazed at the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball encased within the sealing pillar as his smile gradually faded.","\"When I think about the fat ball's impending departure... I've lost some interest in flattening it recently,\" Senior White confessed.","lightsΝοvel.cοm \"After all, it's been a worthy adversary,\" Little Sun T233 chimed in.","\"However, precisely because the fat ball is nearing its end, I feel compelled to make my presence felt during its final moments,\" Senior White Two reasoned while finding renewed enthusiasm.","\"I can't let the fat ball be lonely.\"","In the depths of the universe, Song Shuhang found himself in the last remaining spatial coordinate.","He opened his core world.","The Great Whale of Righteousness leaped out, and Song Shuhang sat on its back—this Song Shuhang was his real body, but not quite complete.","To entice the fat ball, Song Shuhang had detached his legs and used the Light of Merit to form a semblance of himself.","It was an idea he had gleaned from Senior White—Senior White had split his body into two halves, with the upper half emerging from the Heavenly Tribulation Space while the lower half remained in the Heavenly Tribulation World to continue transcending the tribulation.","Song Shuhang had become quite skilled in these unconventional operations after reaching the Seventh Stage.","The false Song Shuhang, represented by his detached legs, was created so that even if it were caught by the fat ball, he would only lose two legs. Thanks to the Holy Ape Dragon Strength Divine Art, he could easily regenerate them.","As he materialized, he sensed the effect of Spatial Imprisonment taking hold behind him.","At the same time, a barrage of attacks flashed in, and the Great Whale of Righteousness beneath him once again exploded into merit fragments.","\"This is brutal,\" Song Shuhang muttered to himself as he quickly turned back toward his core world.","He originally intended to provoke the fat ball in some way, but now, he didn't even have the chance to speak.","There was no need for verbal provocation; his appearance alone was provocation enough for the fat ball.","Behind him, the fat ball's liquid form condensed into a massive hand which spanned nearly a kilometer, and grabbed hold of Song Shuhang.","Boom!","Song Shuhang exploded into a burst of flames while transforming into a fiery Sixteen.","While the fat ball was left dumbfounded, the real Song Shuhang had returned to the entrance of his core world.","The fiery Sixteen turned around and, in a sudden move, conjured a Flaming Saber. She thrust it into her own chest and promptly exploded.","This fiery temper tantrum left the fat ball in shock.","The flames dissipated, and the fat ball's gaze shifted toward Song Shuhang at the entrance of his core world.","Then, the fat ball teleported to the entrance to Song Shuhang's core world.","There... it paused."]},{"number":2352,"title":"Chapter 2352 In Pursuit of Victory","paragraphs":["The fat ball stopped at the entrance of the Inner World. It had no intention of chasing after him.","Song Shuhang's true body watched helplessly as the entrance to the Inner World began to close.","\"Do I have to use the ghost spirit's spatial ability?\" Song Shuhang thought to himself. The door to the Inner World was about to close. If he wanted to pull the fat ball in, he would have to use the ghost spirit's spatial ability.","At the entrance to the Inner World, hundreds of Immortal swords quietly appeared around the fat ball, and each of them carried the Laws of Destruction. However, the target of these immortal swords wasn't Song Shuhang, but the fat ball itself.","The fat ball continued to coldly look at Song Shuhang's true body.","Fool me once, shame on you. Fool me twice, shame on me.","If Song Shuhang really used the spatial position swapping ability to exchange coordinates with it, apart from the destructive damage caused by these treasured swords, it would also give Song Shuhang an even bigger surprise!","In the end...Song Shuhang's true body watched helplessly as the entrance to the Inner World closed without further incident.","He was not afraid of losing his detached legs. But the problem was that the fat ball boss was clearly prepared.","Moreover, when using the spatial spell of the ghost spirit, he needed to keep the ghost spirit and his legs in a state of fusion. At that time, the ghost spirit would also swap positions.","It would be a pity if he lost the ghost fairy.","\"Plan failed.\" Song Shuhang said regretfully.","His true body met up with his clone.","\"Sloppy, sloppy,\" said Pavilion Master Chu. \"It's not that easy to seduce a ruler of the Netherworld.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in. \"Moreover, you used the same method yesterday to lure the fat ball into the three-eyed youth's world. With its previous experience, how could it easily enter an unknown small world now?\"","\"However, after confirming that the fat ball doesn't dare to enter the Inner World easily, the space we can operate in will be much larger.\" Scarlet Heaven Sword reminded him.","Song Shuhang nodded. He stretched out his hand and grabbed his legs. The Primary Instruction of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique circulated, and his legs reconnected.","Then, he sent a message to Senior White Two. \"Senior White, the fat ball refused to enter my Inner World. The plan has failed.\"","\"Yes.\" Senior White Two only replied with one word, and he was very calm. It was obvious that he had already guessed that Song Shuhang's plan would fail.","\"Senior White, was our bait not enticing enough? Should we use the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball to attract the fat ball?\" Song Shuhang asked again.","\"If you want to die a little more happily, I can help you. You don't have to be polite with me,\" Senior White Two replied.","The threat level of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was higher than the fat ball's clone.","Moreover, the two could fuse together. If it was not handled properly, it would only empower their enemy.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment, and said, \"The fat ball has some concerns about the Inner World. Even if I use myself as bait, I couldn't attract it in. Senior White, do you have a way to disguise the entrance to the Inner World so that the fat ball will fall into it while chasing me?\"","\"I knew you would ask this! Up until now, I had used seventeen different traps to disguise myself, and only five of them had succeeded. The method that was used on the fat ball once would not be effective the next time. I'm currently researching the eighteenth camouflage trap...But I do not know where to begin,\" Senior White replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","No wonder the fat ball was so vigilant. It seemed that he had been tricked by Senior White Two far too many times. Last time, outside Senior Three-Eyed's small world, if it wasn't for the fact that the bait was big enough, the fat ball wouldn't have taken the bait so easily.","Senior White hadn't figured out the eighteenth plan yet, so it wouldn't be so easy for him to lure the fat ball into his Inner World.","He couldn't beat it, and he couldn't lure it over.","Even if he wanted to find the Almighty Merchant to buy a treasure to change the situation, he didn't have the money.","\"Senior White, do you have a magical technique that can block my aura and disrupt the heavenly secrets? So that I won't be targeted by the fat ball's divination?\" Without any other ideas, Song Shuhang could only continue to ask Senior White for help.","\"Yes, but after I use a spell to disturb your heavenly secrets, the fat ball's main body should be able to figure out a way to break it very quickly. I'm too familiar with it, and we understand each other's spell framework too well,\" Senior White Two replied.","Some enemies knew each other better than their closest friends.","\"Therefore, I recommend that you learn a concealment spell yourself. The effect will be better if you cast it yourself,\" Senior White Two added.","Senior White's explanation was very reasonable, but the problem was that Song Shuhang was currently holed up in the Inner World. Where could he learn such a magical technique?","As if he had read Song Shuhang's mind, Senior White Two said, \"Come to the world of the black lotus, and I'll read your fortune and show you a way out.\"","Song Shuhang beamed with joy.","Behind him, a string of pendants followed him in a grandiose manner as he went forth to admire the elegance of the ruler of the Netherworld with his own eyes.","One of the benefits of following Song Shuhang was that his horizons had expanded rapidly.","Tyrannical Song network was never lacking of big shots. There were enemies, neutrals, and allies.","Song Shuhang jumped into the world of the black lotus once again. At the same time, his long hair had already condensed into a palm.","The door of the fat ball's nest opened, and the first one to come out to welcome him was indeed a pillar-shaped figure.","Song Shuhang didn't hesitate to use the Saber Nurturing Technique 20 times in a row to meet the incoming attack.","\"Ah, ah, ah, ah ~\" A delicate voice sounded.","The beautiful seven-colored tree monster, who had come to meet Song Shuhang according to Senior White Two's orders, fell limply to the ground.","\"You evil asshole.\" The hamster pulled Shushu's body to the side and said in a deep voice.","Song Shuhang awkwardly withdrew his palm.","In the laboratory of the fat ball's nest, Senior White Two was frantically practicing the Saber Nurturing Technique on the sealing pillar.","After seeing Song Shuhang come over, he said to him, \"Come, it's your turn.\"","Song Shuhang stepped forward and used the Saber Nurturing Technique 20 times.","The light on the sealing pillar became even more brilliant.","\"Let it open a small door. I want to cut out a small part of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball for experiments,\" Senior White Two was wearing a white coat and a pair of special gloves for experiments.","Song Shuhang began to communicate with the sealing pillar and cooperated with Senior White to complete a series of experimental procedures.","After cutting out a small piece of the body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and putting it into a black box, Senior White Two said to Song Shuhang, \"I just divined for you, and I got a vague coordinate. That's your way out.\"","\"Are they the coordinates of the main world?\" Song Shuhang asked. \"However, once I leave the Inner World, the fat ball's clone will immediately use divination to lock onto my location.\"","\"Don't panic. I can temporarily disrupt the heavenly secrets for you. But you have to move fast, otherwise, once the fat ball breaks my spell, your position will be locked again. So, after I send you to the main world, time is of the essence. You'll have to race against time.\" Senior White Two replied.","\"I understand, Senior White.\" Song Shuhang said. \"But what would my 'exit' look like? Any clues?\"","\"There are no clues. Other than calculating that your exit is at these vague coordinates, I didn't manage to divine anything else. It's precisely because of this that I feel that this place is worth your visit.\" Senior White Two said confidently, \"If I can't calculate it, it'll be very difficult for the fat ball to calculate it as well. So there must be something you want there.\"","Song Shuhang lightly nodded.","A location that even Senior White Two couldn't predict was definitely not simple!","At that moment, two figures sat in a crater on the moon. This place was far away from the cultivator market, and the spiritual energy here was weak.","One of them was a tall figure with a beautiful beard that reached his chest. He stood quietly in the crater while stroking his beard with one hand and holding a book with the other. He nodded as he read.","The other figure beside him was floating gently, as if he was sleeping.","The sleeping figure could also be considered handsome. He wore an ordinary black shirt and had the aura of a recluse.","Moreover, he was clearly handsome and charming. However, as long as you looked away from him, you would subconsciously ignore him.","The sleeping shadow suddenly turned around and woke up.","He opened his eyes and looked at the void.","\"The moon?\" The man was dumbfounded.","Wasn't he resting in his cave abode? How did they reach the moon in the blink of an eye?","Have I been sleepwalking?","\"You're awake, Kuye.\" The tall, bearded man turned around and sent a secret voice transmission.","\"Please call me Drunken Yue, thank you.\" Scholar Drunken Yue sat up calmly and looked at the man who had brought him to the moon.","lightsnοvεl.cοm He didn't panic at all when he was brought out of his cave abode. In fact, he felt an indescribable warmth from the man in front of him.","\"You have indeed forgotten about me. I'm your father.\" The bearded man was heartbroken.","Scholar Drunken Yue was speechless."]},{"number":2353,"title":"Chapter 2353 The Fortuity of the Ghost Spirit","paragraphs":["The hermit and the bearded man locked eyes.","After a brief moment.","\"You're not reacting at all?\" the bearded man said with frustration.","\"And how would you like me to react?\" Scholar Drunken Yue, the hermit, replied calmly.","The bearded man's frustration caused his beard to curl in agitation. \"Ungrateful son!\"","Scholar Drunken Yue chuckled softly.","Rumors end with wisdom, and conversations cease with laughter. There was no point in continuing this discussion today.","So, the two of them maintained their gaze and cotinued their silence for a considerable time.","Staring at each other like this was not a productive course of action. Besides, prolonged eye contact between two grown men could become rather uncomfortable.","Scholar Drunken Yue had no choice but to break the silence. \"You brought me from my cave abode to the moon. What's the purpose?\"","\"You should have reached the Seventh Stage True Monarch realm by now, right?\" The bearded man sighed.","\"Seventh Stage,\" Sholar Drunken Yue replied calmly.","The bearded man was taken aback. \"How is that possible? How did you advance to the Seventh Stage realm so quickly?\"","\"Because of the pressure,\" Sholar Drunken Yue explained slowly. \"If you don't strive to cultivate and advance, you'll be overtaken by the younger generation.\"","\"I see.\" The bearded man stroked his beard and smiled. \"Actually, you needn't worry. Even if you're surpassed by the younger generation, it's quite likely they won't remember you.\"","Scholar Drunken Yue was left speechless.","Suddenly, he didn't feel like continuing the conversation. Silence seemed like a better option.","\"I thought you were only at the Sixth Stage, so I always felt I had plenty of time. I never expected you to advance 7 without my knowledge. Yue, I need to take you to a place for secret training,\" the bearded man said.","\"Why?\" Sholar Drunken Yue asked tersely.","\"After the Seventh Stage, it's time to prove yourself showcase your divinity. At that time, everyone in the world will recognize you. This should be what you look forward to the most, right?\" the bearded man asked.","Scholar Drunken Yue nodded.","Speaking of showcasing divinity before others, the hermit couldn't help but miss his friend, Song Shuhang. Despite their close relationship, Song Shuhang had repeatedly displayed his divinity in front of others without inviting Scholar Drunken Yue.","\"I understand. Displaying divinity is a precious opportunity for us. It's when we shine brightest,\" the bearded man added.","Scholar Drunken Yue was slightly surprised by this perspective. \"What about having everyone in the world know you?\"","\"That will still have some effect. Don't worry,\" the bearded man reassured.","Scholar Drunken Yue found the bearded man's reassurance somewhat unsettling.","\"Due to the importance of displaying divinity before others, I need to train you in secret for a period of time before you break through to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm. The Seventh Stage Realm involves the development of the Nascent Soul. I will teach you the Nascent Soul techniques that belong to our tradition. When you reach the stage of displaying your divinity, with my guidance and a secret technique, your presence will explode in an instant. You'll attract the attention of all cultivators in the universe,\" the bearded man explained.","Without the appropriate Nascent Soul techniques, cultivators might forget the new Profound Sage.","\"I see.\" Scholar Drunken Yue nodded. \"Let me prepare for this special training.\"","\"No need for preparations. I've already gathered all the pills and materials you'll need for your cultivation. Besides, if you go back to your cave abode to prepare, I'm afraid I'll forget about you,\" the bearded man hastily said.","Scholar Drunken Yue was speechless. Although it was a harsh reality, it was still the truth.","\"Then let's set off directly,\" Scholar Drunken Yue agreed. \"Shall we use an immortal boat or fly on swords?\"","As they conversed, a spatial gate suddenly opened above them.","Scholar Drunken Yue sensed a familiar aura descending from the sky.","The bearded man adopted a defensive posture.","\"Don't be alarmed. It's a junior from my group,\" Scholar Drunken Yue assured him.","The spatial gate closed, and a handsome young man landed unsteadily, apparently overwhelmed by the exhilarating spatial teleportation.","Scholar Drunken Yue reached out to steady him.","In his dazed state, the young man recognized a familiar face.","It was a senior from the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Specifically...","\"Let me check my phone to confirm.\"","Unlocking his phone with his passcode, he navigated to the contact list and quickly found a homophone for the senior's Daoist name—Scholar Drunken Yue.","\"Senior Yue, what a coincidence. Why are you here?\" Song Shuhang rubbed his temples while seeking to alleviate the effects of the intense spatial teleportation.","Scholar Drunken Yue smiled with delight. He glanced at the bearded man and said, \"Did you see that? My junior from the group remembered my Daoist name!\"","Brought from his cave abode to the moon, Scholar Drunken Yue was intrigued by Song Shuhang's presence.","Meanwhile, the bearded man observed Song Shuhang attentively.","\"Tyrannical Song?\" the bearded man inquired.","\"Yes, that's me. May I ask who you are, Senior?\" Song Shuhang greeted respectfully.","\"It's futile to reveal my Daoist name; you won't believe it,\" the bearded man dismissed.","Song Shuhang quickly realized the implication. He discreetly checked his phone and commented, \"So you're his fellow disciple.\"","lightsnοvεl.cοm \"No, I am his father,\" the bearded man revealed.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","He exchanged glances with the formidable Sword Saint.","At this moment, the bearded man's gaze shifted to Song Shuhang's... ghostly companion."]},{"number":2354,"title":"Chapter 2354 The Indomitable Scholarly Sect!","paragraphs":["The bearded man's gaze resembled that of a treasure hunter who had stumbled upon a gold mine.","Song Shuhang felt a shiver down his spine as he was scrutinized.","At this moment, Fairy Creation promptly appeared and came to Song Shuhang's rescue. Her ethereal face materialized over Song Shuhang's and created the illusion that he was wearing a beauty mask.","\"What are you staring at?\" Fairy Creation retorted, her voice rough and dangerous.","Song Shuhang was left bewildered.","Scholar Drunken Yue was equally at a loss for words.","However, the bearded man didn't seem to mind. Instead, he slapped his thigh and exclaimed, \"Fantastic!\"","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Song Shuhang was utterly perplexed. \"What's going on?\"","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, may I inquire about your relationship with this fairy?\" the bearded man suddenly asked.","\"Which fairy are you referring to?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","As he spoke, several fairies materialized behind him.","Fairy Ghost Spirit, Fairy Creation, Black-skinned Soft Feather, Pavilion Master Chu's hairy projection, Lady Onion in human form, and even a tool spirit fairy appeared on the Defiant Whale Warrior's glove. These six fairies resembled peacocks displaying their feathers while radiating dazzling beauty.","It was a pity that the virtuous lamia was still with Senior White. Otherwise, Song Shuhang could have boasted of having gathered seven fairies.","\"You sir, are a man,\" the bearded man greeted him with a cupped fist.","He had never encountered a cultivator adorned with as many pendants as Song Shuhang. Aside from the pendants representing the six fairies, he also noticed the small stone tablet on Song Shuhang's waist and the large sword hanging at his side—all potent talismans.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was indeed worthy of being the first Sage in a thousand years. While others were armed to the teeth, he was armed to the core.","\"I'm referring to the fairy who initially massaged your temples,\" the bearded man pointed at the ghost spirit.","\"Oh, you mean this fairy... She's my ghost spirit,\" Song Shuhang confirmed.","\"Ghost spirit?\" The bearded man was taken aback.","\"Yes,\" Song Shuhang affirmed. \"Although she's a ghost spirit, she's rather unique. To some extent, she can be considered an independent entity.\"","The bearded man furrowed his brow.","\"Even if she's a ghost spirit,\" he said after a moment, \"she's truly remarkable.\"","\"Senior... I'll sue you for harassment,\" the ghost spirit exclaimed.","After all, the ghost spirit was a part of him. If someone praised the ghost spirit, it was essentially praising him.","\"I'm talking about her condition,\" the bearded man clarified. \"You should be able to sense her nearly ethereal presence. It's extremely special. Moreover, she exists in a state between life and death, akin to a precious uncut gem. With her, success is practically guaranteed! Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I have an opportunity for your ghost spirit. Would you be willing to allow her to train with me for a period of time?\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","This scenario triggered a strong sense of déjà vu.","In his deep-seated memories, his first ghost spirit had undergone a similar experience. It was borrowed by the erudite scholar of the Scholarly Faction and never returned.","\"Don't even think about it,\" Song Shuhang waved his hand vigorously.","With the past as a lesson, he wouldn't allow anyone to take his ghost spirit away from him.","No matter what reason they used, it was simply out of the question.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, since she is your ghost spirit, no one can sever the connection between you two... I genuinely have an opportunity to offer her. When she receives this opportunity, I will also benefit from it. It's a mutually advantageous situation,\" the bearded man stated earnestly.","\"I used to think the same way,\" Song Shuhang remarked. \"My first ghost spirit was borrowed as well, and it has yet to be returned to me.\"","The bearded man was at a loss for words.","It seemed that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had learned from his past mistakes.","\"Therefore, if Senior truly possesses a remarkable opportunity for my ghost spirit, then I will accompany you. The ghost spirit is me, and I am the ghost spirit—we are one. If I accompany her, I will consider accepting this opportunity,\" Song Shuhang added.","According to the divination provided by Senior White Two, this location held both an opportunity and a path to escape for him. Within this opportunity, he might discover a method to shield himself from heavenly secrets.","\"If possible, I would also like to bring Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song to the secret realm where we'll be training... But Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, you won't be able to enter that place,\" the bearded man sighed.","\"Why not?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Because you are too conspicuous,\" the bearded man explained. \"You bear the four Sage titles: Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, and Tyrannical Demon. Your presence is so overwhelming that it's on the verge of exploding... You simply lack the qualifications to enter the special training mystic realm.\"","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted.","Unbeknownst to him, he, Song Shuhang, had unwittingly become a man of great notoriety.","In his own mind, he still considered himself a low-profile novice cultivator.","The bearded man continued, \"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, don't be hasty in refusing the opportunity. I'll show you the contents of this opportunity first, and then you can make your decision. How does that sound?\"","Song Shuhang looked up at the fairy maidens behind him.","\"Let's take a look first before making a decision,\" Soft Feather suggested.","After all, there was no harm in examining the opportunity.","Furthermore, with Soft Feather, Sword, and the stone tablet present, there was no need to worry about any covert actions from the other party.","Upon hearing Song Shuhang's agreement, the bearded man breathed a sigh of relief.","He extended his hand and stroked his beard with a smile, then drew a door in the air. \"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, place your hand on this door and read the contents of the 'opportunity' I mentioned.\"","\"Will I be sucked into it if I touch it?\" Song Shuhang asked warily.","The bearded man was left speechless.","\"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, please show some trust.\"","\"I'm sorry, but once bitten, twice shy,\" Song Shuhang said while stretching out his hand to touch the door.","The six fairy maidens behind him also placed their hands on the door curiously as they read its contents simultaneously with Song Shuhang.","\"Wait, don't press it yet.\"","Before Song Shuhang could respond, information flooded their consciousness through the door.","This sensation was strikingly similar to the information conveyed by Senior Three-Eyed's divine third eye, albeit significantly less efficient.","The 'opportunity' the bearded man mentioned was incredibly comprehensive, akin to a grand gift bag. It contained specialized techniques for harnessing the Nascent Soul's potential, tips on optimizing the Seventh Stage Realm, and guidance for steady advancement.","However, the most crucial aspect was the high probability that the ghost spirit would refine a unique divine body through this trial. Such a physique would be invincible and capable of influencing the 'heavenly tribulation' during transcendence by silently reducing its intensity.","Song Shuhang was astounded by this revelation.","Other than the power of virtue, which automatically offset a portion of the heavenly tribulation's strength due to great virtue, this was the first time he had encountered a method capable of weakening the heavenly tribulation's power.","Could it be that when the heavenly lightning struck, it either forgot or disregarded the transcender's existence which led to a reduction in the heavenly tribulation's potency?","If that were the case, the Scholar of the Holy Accord's faction was essentially invincible!"]},{"number":2355,"title":"Chapter 2355 Song Shuhang’s Daring Gamble","paragraphs":["\"This special divine body is like a divine weapon for transcending tribulations,\" said Song Shuhang.","If it were just weakening the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation, it wouldn't faze the formidable Song Shuhang. It's not that he underestimated the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation; it's just that he had recently faced incredibly intense challenges.","Especially in the past few days, his experiences would make even Su Kongyun's boasting seem insignificant. The relentless barrage of attacks from the ruler of the Netherworld, the world-shattering strike from the big-eyed planet, the devouring black hole of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, and the terrifying heavenly punishment.","Compared to those, the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation seemed rather lackluster. Even the current Song Shuhang wouldn't be intimidated by the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation. This was just an ordinary Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation.","However, the divine body that could be condensed through the cultivator's trial had the potential to weaken the power of all heavenly tribulations, not just those of the Eighth Stage but also those of the Ninth Stage in the future!","This was truly remarkable.","Considering his frequent encounters with formidable heavenly tribulations, which he met on average once a month, Song Shuhang found himself tempted for a moment!","It was impossible not to be tempted. After all, every heavenly tribulation he faced displayed exceptional enthusiasm, and this was after every heavenly tribulation had been mitigated by his substantial karmic virtue.","If he didn't possess such a vast reservoir of merit, the power of the heavenly tribulations he faced in each round would be several times more formidable!","Moreover, his clone was still trapped in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation's space while awaiting assistance from his main body.","If he could attain this special divine body, it would be an incredible advantage.","However, when he considered the prospect of his ghost spirit leaving him to cultivate with this senior, and recalled his yet-to-return first-generation ghost spirit, Song Shuhang couldn't help but feel apprehensive.","\"Senior Song, you seem tempted,\" remarked Black-skinned Soft Feather.","\"It's hard not to be tempted. After all, he has such a fateful connection with the heavenly tribulation. The heavenly tribulation always treats him with special enthusiasm,\" added Pavilion Master Chu's hair.","\"But I'm still concerned,\" Song Shuhang replied while shaking his head.","Sometimes, cultivators had to resist temptation.","The ghost spirit held immense significance to him... He had already lost one ghost spirit, and he couldn't afford to lose another. There wasn't a third high-grade ghost spirit waiting for him in this world.","However, at that moment, the ghost spirit suddenly extended her hands and pinched Song Shuhang's cheeks.","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted.","\"The ghost spirit fairy wants to try that 'fortunate opportunity.' She's interested,\" translated Black-skinned Soft Feather.","\"No, if something were to happen to you, how can I... explain it?\" Song Shuhang furrowed his brows.","The ghost spirit giggled.","Then, she suddenly flipped over and left Song Shuhang's body while heading toward the scholar's side.","She was different from ordinary ghost spirits. Although she was one with Song Shuhang, she possessed an independent will and could make some decisions on her own.","\"Goodbye, Shuhang. I'll return with my divine body,\" mouthed the ghost spirit while waving her hand at Song Shuhang.","She didn't utter a sound or use secret sound transmission.","Song Shuhang sighed and said, \"Remember to report your safety daily.\"","The ghost spirit fairy turned around and waved her hand without not looking back.","\"Why do I feel like I've become a human trafficker?\" The bearded man couldn't help but feel amused.","Despite the excellent opportunity presented to the ghost spirit, it seemed he was burdened with guilt.","And just like that, the ghost spirit fairy followed the scholar and the bearded man. They departed from the moon's crater.","Song Shuhang remained in the same spot, deep in thought.","\"What are you pondering? Reluctant to part with the ghost spirit?\" Pavilion Master Chu's hair inquired.","\"I was thinking that Senior White Two's divination might have been about the ghost spirit fairy,\" Song Shuhang mused.","After all, the ghost spirit was originally a part of him.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Senior White Two had calculated that he would find an escape route and a great opportunity at these coordinates.","Now, with the ghost spirit fairy leaving with the 'great opportunity,' he found himself alone...","\"Why don't you ask Senior White?\" Lady Onion suggested.","Song Shuhang nodded.","Then, he contacted Senior White Two.","\"I'm busy. If you have something to say, keep it under 50 words,\" Senior White Two promptly responded.","\"Senior White, after arriving, I encountered the scholar and his group. They offered her an opportunity and left with my ghost spirit,\" Song Shuhang carefully composed his message, making sure it was within the 50-word limit.","\"Oh,\" was Senior White Two's brief reply.","\"So, Senior White, the path and opportunity you mentioned in your divination earlier, could it be referring to me, the ghost spirit? What should I do now? Will I be left in the cold?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","As he spoke, his cultivation chat virus alert function suddenly activated again.","Someone was tracking his location!","It could be either the fat ball or the Immortal Lord...","\"Senior White, this is not good. The concealment technique on my body may have lost its effectiveness. Someone is tracking my location!\" Song Shuhang hastily informed him.","At the same time, he quickly took out a stack of marked wooden sabers and tossed them into the air.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair assisted him by striking one of the wooden sabers and sending it to various locations in the universe to leave different coordinates for Song Shuhang.","After completing this task, a spatial fluctuation appeared in the void.","\"Let's go!\" Song Shuhang didn't hesitate and opened his Inner World. He dove in with all his pendants. He also left the revived virtuous fat whale behind to monitor the enemy.","The entrance to the Inner World swiftly sealed shut.","In the void, the spatial fluctuation that had been forming gradually dissipated.","Song Shuhang couldn't help but feel a headache. The fat ball was relentless and left him with no room to breathe.","\"Yes, the fat ball is becoming increasingly adept at cracking my technique. This time, it broke through five minutes faster than I anticipated,\" Senior White Two noted.","Song Shuhang replied, \"What's our next move, Senior White?\"","\"Shuhang, are you feeling desperate right now?\" Senior White Two asked.","\"I'm not desperate. After all, I can still find refuge in the Inner World,\" Song Shuhang responded.","\"I can't assist you if you're not in dire straits,\" Senior White Two replied in silence.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"Forget it. I'll send you something that might help. Activate the cultivation chat authority for me,\" Senior White Two instructed.","Song Shuhang complied, granting Senior White Two access to the cultivation assistant.","[Ding! The Mini program 'White Two's Automatic Divination System (Three-day Trial Version)' has been successfully added.]","Song Shuhang was stumped.","A Senior White Two's automatic divination system?","Did Senior White Two actually approve of such a name?","He attempted to activate this small program.","\"Do you wish to use White Two's automatic divination system (three-day trial version)? [Each use consumes 10 Despair Points. Current Despair Points: 11.]\" the system inquired.","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted.","He suspected that Senior White Two hadn't been fulfilling his responsibilities properly lately.","After the fat ball terminated the space tunnel on the moon, it moved to a meteorite belt.","It concealed itself in the shadows and looked on as the two inconspicuous humans escorted a ghost spirit with an equally low profile into the asteroid belt.","\"Tyrannical Song, do you think you can elude me by creating diversions?\" the fat ball intoned ominously.","Subsequently, it quietly infiltrated the meteorite belt."]},{"number":2356,"title":"Chapter 2356 This Way, He Can Truly Grow","paragraphs":["\"White Two's Automatic Divination System (Three-day Trial Version) - costs only 10 Despair Points each time. You won't regret spending those 10 Despair Points; it's a real bargain.\"","Song Shuhang couldn't help but find several issues with this mini-program.","The phrase 'three-day trial version' in parentheses felt more like a curse that constantly reminded Song Shuhang to consider purchasing the VIP version.","However, to avoid the pursuit of the fat ball's clone, Song Shuhang had no choice but to rely on this cultivation chat mini-program.","\"Confirm usage,\" Song Shuhang declared. Senior White had provided him with 11 despair value points which essentially granted him a free opportunity to conduct a divination.","The mini-program activated and transported Song Shuhang's consciousness into a picturesque scene.","The scene depicted Senior White Two holding a divination plate. He was smiling with his head slightly bowed.","Regrettably, the cultivation chat lacked a screenshot function.","Subsequently, the divination plate in Senior White Two's hand began to spin rapidly, and ancient runes emerged and stopped before Song Shuhang.","When these ancient runes were separated, Song Shuhang could barely discern a few words. However, when pieced together, they formed a bewildering array of characters. It was as if he had just painstakingly learned all 26 English letters, only to be presented with an entire English manuscript.","It was a perplexing sight.","Fortunately, White Two's automatic fortune-telling system still featured a divination function.","[Little Ji, the ancient god is born. Offer sacrifices to all living beings. World 2:3:56.]","[In a small world fragment isolated from the rest, a dormant ancient god is about to awaken. There, you will obtain the treasure that sealed the fat ball's clone, along with substantial wealth.]","As Song Shuhang read the beginning of the divination, his eyes and the divine third eye, bestowed upon him by Senior Three-Eyed, gleamed with excitement.","Little Ji—","It was an auspicious sign!","Whether it was good fortune, middling luck, or bad fortune, it all seemed to lead to good luck.","Furthermore, the hexagram mentioned the treasure that sealed the fat ball's clone!","If he truly possessed such a treasure, he wouldn't need to continuously evade the fat ball's pursuit across the universe. Instead, he could turn the tables and relentlessly chase after the fat ball's clone throughout the cosmos.","Just the thought of it filled him with exhilaration.","Notably, the conclusion of the divination also alluded to immense wealth and caused a smile to grace Song Shuhang's face.","\"Let's remain focused for now. Even if we obtain this treasure, we shouldn't become overconfident. While the idea of pursuing the fat ball boss's clone across the universe is enticing... in reality, it's wiser to strike decisively and remove the fat ball's clone from its seal in one fell swoop. We can't afford to give it a second chance,\" Song Shuhang reminded himself while rubbing his face.","He was cautious, yet possessed the courage to act decisively when necessary. This attribute was his sole strength, one he couldn't afford to abandon.","\"Look at Shuhang's grin. I couldn't help but mirror it. It appears I've succumbed to the influence of his cheerful grin and temporarily lost my composure,\" Lady Onion whispered to the other fairy maidens.","\"Senior Song, that smile seemed rather whimsical,\" retorted Soft Feather.","\"Why do I sense a hint of malevolence in it? It's imbued with malice,\" added the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword in a hushed tone.","\"You're all mistaken. This is the classic smile of a villain boss. Whenever the villain boss in a TV series grins like this, it usually signals their impending demise. I don't think Tyrannical Song will be an exception,\" the hamster declared earnestly.","The nearby Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet promptly nodded.","Song Shuhang found himself at a loss for words.","With more individuals present, leading the group became increasingly challenging.","\"Any discoveries?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired lazily.","\"I've made progress. Senior White Two recently sent me a program for conducting divinations. The outcome of the divination is 'Little Ji,' which indicates a period of good fortune. Moreover, Senior White Two's divination provided detailed coordinates for a small world fragment at 2:3:56. Pavilion Master Chu, are you familiar with this location?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"These spatial coordinates are somewhat vague. There are numerous spaces that match these basic coordinates. Furthermore, it's a fragment of a small world. That only makes the search even more challenging. Later, you can create another clone from your legs and bring along my hair to the main world. I'll attempt to utilize my spatial abilities,\" Pavilion Master Chu responded.","The spatial coordinates provided by the hexagram seemed detailed, but were actually quite general. This was a fundamental characteristic of hexagrams.","The so-called divinatory images portrayed simple matters in a mysterious and intricate manner.","\"Thank you, Pavilion Master Chu.\" Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude.","Subsequently, he adeptly created another clone from his legs.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair lightly separated from her scalp and adhered to the clone.","\"Safe travels,\" Song Shuhang whispered as he cautiously opened the door to his Inner World.","\"Try not to tempt fate,\" Pavilion Master Chu responded, somewhat absentmindedly.","After allowing his clone to endure the chilly wind for 15 minutes, Song Shuhang silently returned to his Inner World.","Perhaps the fat ball had not appeared because his true body hadn't ventured out.","\"In that case, I'll have some leeway,\" Song Shuhang contemplated while stroking his chin.","He was gradually testing the fat ball's limits while preparing to seal the fat ball's clone when the opportune moment arrived.","In the realm of the Black Lotus, Senior White Two had placed a portion of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball's body within a high-tech magical apparatus and was initiating an analysis of its structure.","lightsΝοvel.cοm \"My Lord, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has already taken action,\" reported Little Sun T233.","\"Yes, continue to monitor him. This time, we shouldn't overly interfere with the fat ball clone's pursuit of Shuhang. Let him confront the fat ball clone on his own; that's the only way he can truly grow. Only intervene if he's on the brink of death,\" Senior White Two instructed.","\"Understood, my lord,\" Little Sun T233 acknowledged.","In truth, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song appeared to be progressing rapidly. Among the cultivators of the universe, there were scarcely a handful of Seventh Stage cultivators who dared to breathe in the presence of the fat ball.","...","...","Within the small world concealed behind the wooden door, the three-eyed youth continued to maintain his cheerful and optimistic demeanor.","The sunlight in the small world blazed brilliantly.","The Eyeball Butler found the intense sunlight uncomfortable, as it parched its hair. It longed for the soothing relief of a heavy rain shower.","At that moment, the three-eyed youth cradled the game space from earlier, his expression one of pure delight.","The Puppeteer Horse, the Nine Nether Fat Ball Sovereign, and a Song Shuhang who was just tagging along were all engaged in a game within the space. Thanks to the fat ball and the black horse, the rules of this world had been greatly improved.","Regrettably, finding another partner of the same caliber as the fat ball in the future would prove exceedingly difficult.","\"Has the fat ball caught up to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?\" the three-eyed youth inquired.","\"No news yet,\" the Eyeball Butler replied.","\"Continue to monitor the situation,\" the three-eyed youth instructed.","If Profound Sage Tyrannical Song found himself in dire straits, the three-eyed youth might consider lending a hand. In return, he sought information about the horse from Tyrannical Song.","Based on his observations, that hegemon appeared to possess unique qualities."]},{"number":2357,"title":"Chapter 2357 O, K","paragraphs":["In the inner world, Song Shuhang was seated by the side of a lively spring, attentively listening to Pavilion Master Chu as she explained the intricacies of magical techniques.","At that moment, Pavilion Master Chu's long hair spread out and floated on the water's surface—having long hair granted her the ability to manipulate it at will, with her long locks automatically emulating the effects of Holy Light and Shadow Priests.","Beside Pavilion Master Chu, Senior Turtle, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet occasionally contributed key pieces of knowledge.","While listening, Song Shuhang diligently recorded his own insights.","\"That's pretty much all I know about 'hair' control. There aren't many complex mysteries to it. Are you considering using the 'hair growth' spell on spirit beasts and magical creatures?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired.","Pavilion Master Chu was an authority in hair manipulation. One had to know that a single strand of her hair, when properly refined, could transform into a clone.","\"Yes, indeed. Additionally, I want to enhance one of my spells, 'Hair Growth,'\" Song Shuhang replied.","The hair growth technique he had learned from Dharma King Creation could instantly transform a bald person into one with beautiful, flowing locks. However, it was limited to self-use and couldn't be applied to others. Song Shuhang intended to improve this magical technique.","If this hair growth technique could be used on spirit beasts, a single spell could regrow the fur of a spirit beast that had been shaved. After repeated shearing, his Core World would have an endless supply of wool!","The fur from the spirit beasts he sheared could all be converted into spirit stones!","Senior Phoenix Slayer would surely appreciate it.","Besides its use on spirit beasts, this spell might also have unexpected applications in battles.","\"Please share the principles of your hair growth technique with me so that I may reference it,\" Pavilion Master Chu requested.","\"Senior, please wait a moment,\" Song Shuhang responded with enthusiasm. If Pavilion Master Chu was willing to assist, it would be a tremendous help.","However, before revealing the theory behind the hair growth technique, he needed to obtain approval from Senior Dharma King Creation, who had been the one to teach him the technique.","Song Shuhang found Senior Dharma King Creation in the friend list of the cultivation chat and sent a message. \"Senior Creation, there's something I'd like to discuss with you.\"","\"Do you want to hear a new song? No problem. I've just composed a few, one of which was specifically created for you and Soft Feather,\" Senior Dharma King Creation replied enthusiastically.","Song Shuhang and Soft Feather were two of his diehard fans in the Nine Provinces Number One Group. They were individuals who could truly appreciate his musical talents.","\"Cough, that's not it, Senior. I'm currently being pursued throughout the universe. We can discuss the song later once I return to Earth. What I'd like to request your permission for is to teach the hair growth technique to a fairy. In return, after we enhance and refine the hair growth technique, we'll provide you with the improved version,\" Song Shuhang swiftly explained.","\"No problem,\" Dharma King Creation agreed, albeit with a tinge of regret. He added, \"By the way, Shuhang, I'm working on a song related to 'The Flee.' I want to capture the emotions of fear, desperation, and hopelessness experienced during a pursuit. If you find yourself in dire straits during your chase, please share your experiences and feelings for reference.\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","After a moment of contemplation, he replied, \"Oh my, Senior Creation, aren't you concerned about my safety? You seem quite confident that I'll return safely.\"","lightsnοvεl.cοm He felt a mix of emotions while realizing that Senior Creation was already preparing a funeral song for him.","\"My condolences,\" Lady Onion chimed in.","At the same time, far away on Earth, Senior Dharma King Creation received private messages from Pavilion Master Chu, the hamster, the turtle, Lady Onion, and even himself. These were friends from the cultivation chat who rarely engaged in private conversations. They all shared the same request: to receive a copy of Song Shuhang's funeral song once it was composed by Senior Dharma King Creation.","Seeing this, Senior Dharma King Creation felt a warm sentiment in his heart.","+4 temporary fans for Dharma King Creation.","Unaware of these developments, Song Shuhang, after obtaining Senior Dharma King Creation's approval, handed over the runes and the theory of the technique to Pavilion Master Chu.","Pavilion Master Chu's expression remained unchanged as she delved into improving the technique alongside Song Shuhang.","On the other side, in the vast universe, a strand of hair continued to traverse through space.","It had been dancing through the cosmos for nearly 20 hours.","\"Why am I, an immortal, running around the universe like a market vendor?\" Pavilion Master Chu's hair sighed.","But she continued her mission while scouting hundreds or even thousands of spatial coordinates.","\"Not here. There are no hidden small worlds in this area. Next location, let's go!\" Pavilion Master Chu's hair opened another spatial portal and moved on.","As Song Shuhang and company worked on refining the technique, the strand of hair had already scanned numerous spatial coordinates.","\"By the way, why do I have to go through all this trouble to search for hidden small worlds?\" Pavilion Master Chu's hair complained.","Why was she, an Immortal, reduced to running around the universe like a market vendor?","After letting out a long sigh, she resigned herself to her task and opened another spatial portal.","After searching through a dozen more spatial coordinates, she finally found a clue.","\"There are traces of a hidden small world at this location!\" Pavilion Master Chu's hair stood on end with excitement.","With that, she used her hair to mark the spot and contacted her main body.","In the Inner World, Pavilion Master Chu, Song Shuhang, and the others had perfected the technique after nearly 20 hours of hard work. Pavilion Master Chu had done her best to ensure that the technique would be effective regardless of the target's level, whether it was an Eighth Stage Profound Sage or a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","Now, they were ready to test the improved technique.","At that moment, Pavilion Master Chu suddenly spoke up. \"Hold on a moment. My hair has located the coordinates mentioned in the hexagram.\"","\"A hidden small world where ancient gods awaken?\" Song Shuhang's mental fatigue instantly vanished.","\"However, it's deeply concealed, and we haven't found a way to open it and enter,\" Pavilion Master Chu explained.","\"Let me give it a try.\" Song Shuhang transformed into his smoke form and extended his smokey right hand.","He opened the Inner World and extended only his right hand beyond its confines. As long as his main body remained within the Inner World, the fat ball would not be interested in him.","Guided by Pavilion Master Chu, Song Shuhang's right hand made contact with the area of the hidden small world.","\"Secret Appraisal Technique!\" Song Shuhang activated the technique, which had previously caused him great pain."]},{"number":2358,"title":"Chapter 2358 A Fortuitous Magical Tool","paragraphs":["\"Pain makes a man grow.\" Song Shuhang thought as he endured the agony.","Every type of pain offered a unique experience, and a man who hadn't faced pain was incomplete.","This time, Song Shuhang encountered a new form of torment. Instead of his smoke body exploding, it underwent a slow, melting process that was akin to a candle liquefying under intense heat.","The wax torch transformed into ashes before his tears could dry up, and it felt like a slow knife slicing through flesh.","\"Hiss... I've never experienced this kind of pain before. Is it a new variant?\" Song Shuhang gasped as he endured the excruciating sensation.","Pavilion Master Chu and Senior Turtle were left in stunned silence.","After half a minute, Song Shuhang gradually acclimated to the pain of his body melting and managed to calm down.","Simultaneously, information from the secret appraisal technique began to appear in his mind, although it came in intermittent bursts, as if it struggled to convey the details.","[Unnamed man-made small world fragment: This is a man-made small world fragment with a long history dating back to the primordial era. It has since shattered and remains only a fragment. However, it still houses numerous life auras.]","The fact that it had existed since time immemorial explained the novel type of pain it induced.","[A formidable ancient god resides deep within this small world. It is on the brink of awakening or may have already awakened. Please exercise caution.]","[Hint 1: Your core world might resonate with this man-made small world fragment. If the terrifying ancient god doesn't exist, it's possible that your core world can establish a connection with the fragment.]","[Hint 2: You possess a lucky charm that can assist you in exploring this artificial small world.]","[Hint 3: If you experience pain, clap your hands. When you clap, retract your right hand to reduce the pain level.]","Song Shuhang withdrew his right hand from the void into his Inner World.","Pain? It had been quite painful, but it hadn't been enough to make him collapse. It was a unique type of pain, and he had gradually adapted to it.","Song Shuhang looked thoughtfully at his right hand. Fairy Defiant Whale made an appearance. She bit her finger and knelt on the glove's back while gazing at Song Shuhang with confusion.","\"It's okay, I didn't summon you,\" Song Shuhang managed to smile through the pain.","\"Have you obtained the information you needed?\" the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword inquired.","\"Yes, this small world is not a natural creation but a man-made one,\" Song Shuhang confirmed.","Pavilion Master Chu couldn't help but exhale in surprise. \"Does the information indicate how to access this small world?\"","\"I received a hint,\" Song Shuhang replied. \"It mentioned that I have a fortuitous lucky charm, which can help me access this small world. Additionally, there may be a connection between this small world and my Inner World.\"","\"A lucky charm? Does that refer to me?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in confidently.","However, the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword cast doubt, saying, \"Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, I don't sense any luck coming from you.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's arrogance had led him into conflicts with several formidable beings which included the remaining members of the ancient Heavenly City, Fairy Fengyi, the Heavenly Dao Remnant Ball, and the fat ball when accompanying Song Shuhang out of the Beast Cultivator World's Forbidden Area. His actions hardly seemed fortunate.","\"Do you have any ideas?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked.","\"Yes, I have some theories,\" Song Shuhang replied. He then twisted his body and caused his smoke-like form to melt into a puddle on the ground. However, he maintained his state and prevented any dire consequences.","He waved his hand, and a golden disk array emerged from his Inner World which landed in his palm. It emitted an aura of spatial laws.","\"This is a golden array Senior White gave me previously,\" Song Shuhang explained. \"It's related to luck and might be the lucky charm referred to in the hint.\"","\"Is this a magical tool?\" the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword inquired.","\"To be precise, it's an inherited magical tool. Senior White obtained a set of secret spatial techniques from the Almighty Merchant, and this array was left behind after the techniques were passed down,\" Song Shuhang clarified.","The golden disk array was a refined treasure. By carrying it daily, Song Shuhang had a chance to awaken a minor spatial talent, the nature of which depended on his character.","\"How do you use this golden array?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm \"It's possible that I need to comprehend a small spatial talent from it, which might then help me access the small world,\" Song Shuhang speculated.","\"Have you comprehended it?\" the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword questioned.","\"It's not that simple,\" Song Shuhang replied. As he spoke, his body began to melt again, this time more smoothly. The golden disk array fell to the ground.","\"Senior Song, your body... is melting again,\" observed Soft Feather.","Song Shuhang gazed down at the ground, then back up at the sky. \"Ah, I see it now, Soft Feather.\"","Fortunately, he hadn't exited his smoke-like form.","\"I have a daring proposal,\" the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword stated.","\"Me too,\" added Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","\"Please share your ideas,\" the puddle that was once Song Shuhang responded.","\"Saber Nurturing Technique,\" the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword declared.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet contributed. \"What if I integrate this golden disk array into Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song's body? It might yield miraculous results.\"","Different voices mentioned the same sentiment.","After their statements, the two artifact spirits exchanged glances.","\"I thought we had a rare moment of agreement,\" the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword mused.","\"I thought so too,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet concurred.","The Defiant Whale Fairy Artifact Spirit couldn't help but sigh.","\"Let's try both approaches simultaneously,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","With that, Soft Feather picked up the golden disk array and carefully placed it into Song Shuhang's melting body.","Song Shuhang managed to use his smoke-like form to envelop the golden disk array and activate the Saber Nurturing Technique. The black smoke enshrouded the golden disk array, and within the smoky veil, seven-colored lights intermittently flickered.","This scene hinted at the birth of an epic-level magical tool."]},{"number":2359,"title":"Chapter 2359 I’m Willing to Transform into a Metal Ingot","paragraphs":["\"Even though it's sorcery, I have to admit it's a pretty handy skill,\" observed the hamster while squinting at the dazzling seven-colored radiance of the divine artifact. The brilliance was a bit blinding.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet agreed. \"Tyrannical Song's Blade Nurturing Technique has definitely undergone some changes. I'm willing to bet that the original Blade Nurturing Technique didn't have such impressive effects.\"","The hamster immediately thought of its master in the Black Lotus World. Every time Tyrannical Song departed, Senior White would diligently practice the Saber Nurturing Technique on the sealing pillar, but it never seemed to work. Upon reflection, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's statement made sense.","\"Is it effective now?\" inquired Lady Onion, curiosity evident in her question.","\"I haven't felt anything yet... and the golden formation disk hasn't reacted either,\" replied Song Shuhang.","However, he remained patient. When he dedicated himself to powering up the sealing pillar, he had spent nearly a whole day on it. He was not lacking in patience.","Moreover, he still had the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops at his disposal. If the Blade Nurturing Technique proved ineffective, he could use a drop of Heavenly Dao Eye Drops to see if it triggered any chemical reactions.","Meanwhile, in a golden space distinct from both the earthly realm and the Netherworld, a figure was curled up in apparent agony, occasionally clapping their hands.","Another ghostly figure materialized while addressing the curled-up individual as \"Your Majesty\" and urging them to rise due to the cold ground.","\"Let me lie down a little longer... Hiss, it hurts so much,\" moaned the figure in distress.","\"Why are you clapping if it hurts, Your Majesty?\" asked the ghostly figure, baffled.","\"Because... you're supposed to clap if you're in pain, right?\" replied the figure while clapping in pain.","The ghostly figure was left speechless.","In the Inner World, Song Shuhang, shrouded in the golden disk array, continued to perform the Nurturing Technique. His body was in motion, but his consciousness had drifted into slumber.","Nearby, Lady Onion and the black-skinned Soft Feather leaned against each other and rested not far from Song Shuhang. The hamster nestled against Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and closed its eyes.","The Core Assistant fetched some sheets and covered them.","\"They must be exhausted,\" murmured Pavilion Master Chu softly.","Evading the pursuit of a Netherworld's ruler was no small feat.","Senior Turtle nodded in agreement. \"Indeed, considering that an ordinary Seventh Stage Venerable would be annihilated with a single breath by the Netherworld's ruler. The fact that Shuhang is still alive and kicking is quite remarkable.\"","Pavilion Master Chu nodded in acknowledgment.","At that moment, Song Shuhang, who was in a state of slumber, began to twitch, and his smoky body started to undulate.","Senior Turtle extended his claws and pressed down on Song Shuhang's body. \"Has the golden formation disk been activated?\"","\"No, not yet,\" replied Pavilion Master Chu.","\"Could he be having a nightmare?\" suggested Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet pressed down on Song Shuhang's smoky form and assessed his condition.","lightsΝοvel.cοm \"Don't worry,\" assured Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet after a brief examination. \"It's nothing serious. The pain from appraising the man-made small world fragment caused Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song's willpower to wane and result in these spasms.\"","\"Will he continue to experience pain?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired.","\"I had initially thought his pain perception had ceased,\" Senior Turtle chimed in.","Song Shuhang's spasms gradually subsided.","Meanwhile, within the dream realm, Song Shuhang found himself in a small fairyland teeming with immortal energy.","He felt as though his physical form was deeply buried in the earth, yet his consciousness could penetrate the ground and explore the surroundings.","\"Is this a dream?\" he mused.","Indeed, it was, and Song Shuhang recognized the familiar sensation of entering a dream, having had numerous experiences of it.","The question that loomed was, who was the subject of his dream this time?","Pavilion Master Chu met the recent criteria for entering the dream; she had been residing in the Inner World and had already regained a third of her physical form.","Then there was the three-eyed youth, or rather his counterpart, the Wielder of the Will. The connection between the two lay in the eye drops and the divine third eye.","Additionally, it was highly likely that not only the Demon Emperor but also fate itself had granted Song Shuhang a full array of power.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball also fulfilled the requirements for entering the dream.","So, who was it that had entered this dream?","Among these seniors, who had been deeply buried underground and immobile?","Could it be that, like Lady Onion, they were in the early stages of a plant-type demon realm, awaiting sprouting underground?","As Song Shuhang pondered, a Fairy Beast Immortal Cultivator appeared in the distance and stopped above his head. This Fairy Beast Immortal had the aura of a phoenix, and she stood like a blazing ball of fire.","Selecting a spot, she began to dig.","After a while, she unearthed Song Shuhang's target in the dream.","Then, she retrieved 'Song Shuhang.'","'Song Shuhang' was revealed in an unexpected form—a strange piece of metal.","Yes, it was a metallic fragment.","Song Shuhang found himself utterly perplexed. Why was a mere piece of pure metal the subject of his dream? What was there to see in this metal fragment?","As Fairy Beast Immortal inspected the metal, her gaze remained fixated on it for an extended period, her face eventually turning a shade of embarrassment.","Song Shuhang was left bewildered.","A decade could feel neither long nor short.","With Lady Onion's centuries of experience as a green onion, Song Shuhang had developed an immunity to this sort of uneventful and tedious existence. His Dao heart, as sturdy as an alloy, could endure a mere decade of monotony.","In the eleventh year, the dream's narrative finally took a turn.","Fairy Beast Immortal began to forge the metal fragment into a specific shape—a formation plate.","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","Eventually, Fairy Beast Immortal carried the disc array to a sunny spot beneath a towering tree.","Suddenly, her body erupted into flames.","The colossal tree, the array disk, and Fairy Beast Immortal were all engulfed by the blaze.","Once again, Song Shuhang experienced the sensation of his body melting."]},{"number":2360,"title":"Chapter 2360 Any Harvest?","paragraphs":["This beastly cultivator is venomous!","Song Shuhang, through the golden dream array, could sense that this raging fire was no ordinary blaze.","This fire was both terrifying and mysterious. It was capable of directly consuming spiritual energy.","The protective spiritual energy of the beastly cultivator and the spiritual energy coursing through her body all became fuel for the flames. The fire grew increasingly fierce and engulfed both the beastly cultivator and the towering tree.","Song Shuhang began to anticipate what would happen next. What had become of this melted golden array disc? Had it become the vessel for the spatial technique of the World Refining Holy Ape? In the end, did it end up in the hands of the Almighty Merchant?","This beastly cultivator exuded the aura of a fire phoenix. Could she be on the brink of rebirth from the ashes?","As Song Shuhang pondered, the towering tree that reached into the sky and the blushing beastly cultivator... both turned into ashes!","The envisioned scene of 'rising from the ashes' failed to materialize, and the towering tree displayed no special abilities.","Shortly after, the colossal tree and the beastly cultivator perished.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","It was a trick!","How dare it employ the ploy of immolation without experiencing rebirth?","However, the plot within the dream was not yet over!","Song Shuhang thought that things might take a positive turn...","But in the end, the remainder of the narrative was that after the strange fire consumed the giant tree and beastly cultivator, it gradually dwindled and began to die out.","As the last wisp of flame vanished, Song Shuhang's dreamland came to an end. He awoke from the dream that had spanned eleven years.","He opened his eyes in discomfort.","As he opened his eyes, Song Shuhang found himself gazing into a pair of bright eyes belonging to Fairy Creation.","Simultaneously, he realized that his head was resting on... a hard turtle shell.","At this moment, his body had fully recovered from the smoky state. He clutched the golden array disc tightly in his arms, and his palm instinctively executed the Blade Nurturing Technique.","\"Fairy, what are you doing?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","When he raised his head, he felt as though there were more than thirty strands swinging above him.","It was a braided hairstyle!","Fairy Creation had fashioned over thirty braids for him!","Song Shuhang couldn't decide whether to laugh or cry as he asked, \"Senior Turtle, Fairy Creation... Are you both that bored?\"","\"No, we're just conducting an experiment,\" Senior Turtle replied earnestly. \"Your Braid Saber Dao, currently allows for a maximum of twenty hair strands, correct?\"","Song Shuhang nodded and said, \"That's correct for now, but as my strength increases, that number will certainly rise.\"","\"In that case, I made a hypothesis. If I were to braid your hair into thirty strands in advance and then employ the Hair Palm Dao, could I condense all thirty in one go?\" Senior Turtle inquired seriously.","\"You're quite the ingenious turtle, Senior,\" Song Shuhang remarked with a smile.","With that, he extended his hand and placed it on Senior Turtle's shell.","\"Don't employ that sinister Saber Nurturing Technique on me. I'm not buying it,\" Senior Turtle protested. It was addicted to that dark art and didn't want to betray the Great Northern Emperor.","After the rebuke, it suddenly realized that it didn't feel right all over—it was as though it were being massaged. More strangely, it seemed that hair was sprouting from its turtle shell.","Senior Turtle was rendered speechless.","The experiment with the Hair Growth Technique: Enhanced Version was a success. With this technique, even Senior Turtle could sport luxurious, long locks. Song Shuhang waved his hand and instructed, \"Fairy Creation, go ahead and braid Senior Turtle as well.\"","\"Are you playing tricks on me?\" Senior Turtle protested. \"Besides, isn't your long hair on your back?\"","In the next moment, Fairy Creation had pinned it down and was busily braiding the fur on its shell.","Senior Turtle gazed at the sky with a look of despair in its eyes.","\"Cultivation assistant, little squirrel, send a copy of the revised Hair Growth Technique to Senior Creation. Additionally, send a copy to Chu Chu and Little Cai,\" Song Shuhang instructed the small assistant of the cultivation chat system in detail.","In the pond downstream of the living spring, Pavilion Master Chu expelled a series of bubbles and inquired, \"Did you gain anything?\"","lightsnοvεl.cοm \"I didn't gain anything substantial from the dream, except for an additional ten years of tempering my Dao-heart. This might be the least I've ever gained from a dream entry... Hmm?\" Song Shuhang's heart suddenly skipped a beat as he spoke.","He reached out and grasped the golden array disc to carefully inspect it.","\"Pow~ It seems you've gained something after all,\" Pavilion Master Chu quipped.","At this moment, Song Shuhang felt as though he had merged with the golden disk array. The array seemed to have become a part of him and ranked just below his life-bound magical treasure in intimacy.","A surge of information poured forth from the golden array disc.","It was knowledge related to space and information regarding the Holy Ape World Refining technique.","The spatial knowledge from the golden disc array triggered several of Song Shuhang's hidden abilities.","First, for the whale mount created by the light of virtue—the tribulation bone within it emitted a faint glow.","Soon after, the connection between Song Shuhang and the ghost spirit fairy began resonating. Even when she was absent, the connection between the ghost spirit and her master remained intact. Having merged with the 'one-month seed of spatial power' from the fat ball, the ghost spirit fairy continuously transmitted spatial information back to Song Shuhang's main body.","Subsequently, Song Shuhang received a message from the Steel Doppelganger, which had been unresponsive for some time. The Celestial Thearch had seized the Steel Doppelganger as spoils of war, and the connection between it and the main body had become intermittent. This time, the steel clone voluntarily broke through the various barriers to relay the information regarding space that it had gleaned from the Celestial Thearch back to Song Shuhang's main body.","Finally, there was the Inner World, a creation of the third Wielder of the Will, Striped Dragon. Among the three special spaces, the Inner World possessed greater potential for evolution than the worlds of the Virtuous Golden Lotus and Senior White Two's black lotus world. The Inner World also sent some information to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang cradled the golden array disc in his hand. Under the influence of the array, the thirty braids on his head began to spin.","The braids whirled faster and faster.","As they spun, Song Shuhang soared into the air.","Senior Turtle, Pavilion Master Chu, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and the stone tablet observed Song Shuhang with curiosity.","Lady Onion rubbed her eyes and was roused from slumber by the commotion.","She raised her head and witnessed Song Shuhang spiraling through the air with his braids. She was left dumbfounded. \"Is this a new flying technique?\"","In this manner, Song Shuhang flew in the air for over an hour before gradually descending.","The golden array disc in his hand transformed into a stream of light and entered the spiritual lake within Song Shuhang's original dantian, where it absorbed nourishment.","\"How do you feel, Tyrannical Song?\" the hamster inquired curiously, ready to report back to its master.","\"It's... something,\" Song Shuhang replied with a heavy nod. \"The roots of my hair are hurting. It feels as though they're about to fall out.\"","Pavilion Master Chu was left speechless.","Tyrannical Song might just go bald."]},{"number":2361,"title":"Chapter 2361 I Know Your Troubles, I Can Help You Resolve Them","paragraphs":["\"Who cares about your hair anyway? I'm asking if you've made any progress!\" the hamster exclaimed.","It felt that if it had the chance to meet the eyeball butler of the three-eyed youth next time, it would definitely encourage him to switch over to the Tyrannical Song's side. That butler who specialized in pricking its master's heart was a perfect fit for Tyrannical Song. The two of them were simply a match made in heaven.","\"Don't worry about the pain in your hair roots. I can shave them all off for you, and you can use the hair growth technique to grow new hair,\" the sword flew over. Its blade swept through the air and scraped Song Shuhang's scalp.","\"Thank you for your kindness, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword,\" Song Shuhang extended his hand and grabbed the sword. The twenty braids on his head transformed into small hands and pressed against the sword as it delivered the Blade Nurturing Technique twentyfold.","Reality proved that when one's cultivation level was not high enough, even if one tied thirty braids, only twenty of them could form hands.","Senior Turtle's deduction had failed because it couldn't withstand the test of reality.","Song Shuhang turned his hand and hung his sword, who was enjoying the moment, on his waist. Then, he said seriously, \"Yes, I did make a lot of progress.\"","\"You've comprehended the power of space?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked.","\"I've comprehended a portion of it. Although I can't travel through space yet, I can use a portion of the Space Authority,\" Song Shuhang replied. After Senior White, Senior Spirit Butterfly, and Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, he became the fourth member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group who could use a portion of his spatial ability while still at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm.","In the future, after Senior Yellow Mountain added a new member, Song Shuhang would finally be able to act a little more like a 'senior'.","The hamster asked, \"Comprehended part of it? For example?\"","\"For example, I can cultivate a portion of spatial spells,\" Song Shuhang stretched out his hands and made a stretching motion with his arms.","The core assistant quietly appeared. She took out a long robe with wide sleeves and put it on Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang, now in the long robe, unexpectedly looked rather handsome. His current body shape was very suitable for this style of clothing.","\"World in the Sleeve!\" Song Shuhang waved his sleeve at the hamster.","A powerful suction force emanated from the wide sleeves and drew the hamster in.","\"Squeak?\" The hamster cried out in alarm. Its petite body couldn't resist the suction force, and it fell into Song Shuhang's sleeve.","\"When did you learn World in the Sleeve?\" Lady Onion said in surprise.","\"After Senior White learned the World in the Sleeve, he gave me the secret technique. I've already memorized the theory behind it,\" Song Shuhang said with a faint smile.","\"Unfortunately, you still failed,\" Senior Turtle said.","\"This isn't the World in the Sleeve at all. It's just the sleeve producing a suction force that sucked me in,\" the hamster emerged from Song Shuhang's sleeve.","Song Shuhang wasn't embarrassed. He laughed and said, \"Isn't it normal to fail on the first try? I'm not a peerless genius, and it's impossible for me to be like Senior White, who can cast a spell with just a glance and improve it at the same time. If it were a saber technique, perhaps I would have some confidence.\"","\"Perhaps you can hypnotize yourself and tell yourself that World in the Sleeve is not a spatial spell, but a profound spatial saber technique? When you and I entered the state of 'becoming one with the monolith,' didn't you imagine yourself to be a saber? Weren't you then able to smoothly enter the state of 'becoming one with the monolith'?\" Song Shuhang said.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","\"What a pity. How good would it be if Senior Phoenix Slayer was already a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender?\" Song Shuhang suddenly said.","In that case, he would be able to borrow Senior Phoenix Slayer's CPU to practice the World in the Sleeve and familiarize himself with the use of spatial abilities.","\"Or perhaps, it would be good if the Scholarly Sage's CPU had a stable way to activate,\" Song Shuhang said regretfully.","Last time, he had borrowed the magical treasure borrowed by Senior Shadow Overlord to burn the Scholarly Sage's obsession and borrow the Scholarly Sage's CPU.","lightsΝοvel.cοm That feeling was unforgettable.","The Sage's CPU was extremely powerful. After using it once, he would want to use it a second time.","\"You just can't cultivate diligently on your own, can you?\" Senior Turtle said disdainfully. At this point, the hair on its back had already been braided into more than 20 cute braids by Fairy Creation.","\"I can. Actually, I don't neglect my daily cultivation of techniques, saber skills, spiritual spells, and meditation,\" Song Shuhang replied. He loved cultivating, and it brought him happiness.","Fairy Creation nodded.","She could attest that Song Shuhang was actually very diligent in his practice. As long as he had time to rest, he would practice the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique instead of meditating.","\"If I were to cultivate normally, wouldn't it take several months to master World in the Sleeve? Not to mention the World Refining Holy Ape, which is even more profound than the World in the Sleeve,\" Song Shuhang said.","If they wanted to enter the man-made small world fragment, they might need to rely on the divine power of the Holy Ape World Refining.","They didn't have that much time to waste.","\"Should we try to invite Senior White over?\" the black-skinned Soft Feather also woke up and suggested.","\"I'll ask Senior White,\" Song Shuhang said with a nod.","He opened the cultivation chat function and was about to contact Senior White.","At that moment, he suddenly saw a new notification from White Two's Automatic Divination System (Three-Day Trial Version).","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and opened it.","[System Notification: Despair Points +1. Current Despair Points: 2.]","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","When did this happen?","He looked at the time... Did this +1 despair point happen in the dream?","It was probably the despair he felt when he saw Fairy Beast Immortal and the giant tree turn into ashes.","\"So, the process of entering a dream can also produce despair points? If I had this system when I entered Lady Onion's dream, I would have already reached the peak of my life!\" Song Shuhang said regretfully.","After hundreds of years of growing green onions, being exposed to the wind and sun, and being alone on the mountain peak, Song Shuhang was so desperate that he wanted to die, but he couldn't even do it.","If the despair he felt at that time was converted into despair points, it would be worth at least a few thousand, wouldn't it?","His heart had been tempered beyond steel. Hundreds of years of loneliness or the small black room could no longer make him despair... He had lost 100 million yuan.","After sighing, Song Shuhang sent a message to Senior White. \"Can you make a trip to the Inner World?\"","With the virtuous lamia by Senior White's side, she could help him open his Inner World at any time.","\"I'm busy. Also, I already know about your troubles. I can help you solve them,\" Senior White replied.","Almighty Senior White, please grant my wish.\" Song Shuhang was moved.","At the same time, he silently made a few wishes in his heart.","\"This is my modified version of the Holy Ape World Refining. It's really simple. Try to learn it,\" Senior White sent a message to Song Shuhang.","It was a buy one get one free. Other than the World Refining Holy Ape divine power, there was also a simplified and modified version of the World in the Sleeve."]},{"number":2362,"title":"Chapter 2362 White’s Opportunity and Crisis","paragraphs":["The revised World Refining of Holy Apes and World in Sleeves, as Senior White put it, were \"really easy to learn.\" They were specifically tailored for cultivators like Song Shuhang who lacked a solid theoretical foundation.","In the realm of cultivation, Song Shuhang could be considered a specialized scholar. When he studied blade techniques, body-tempering methods, and martial arts, his innate talent shone brightly.","Apart from blade, fist, and physique techniques, he excelled at grasping Senior White's modified magical spells.","Most cultivators typically adapted themselves to their techniques. At most, they would wait until their strength, realms, and theoretical knowledge improved before making minor adjustments to their cultivation methods for better compatibility.","However, most of the cultivation techniques that Song Shuhang practiced were tailored to suit him.","Therefore, having a group of reliable and friendly seniors or guides was invaluable on the path of cultivation.","As long as these seniors or masters were powerful enough, one could easily outperform other cultivators at the beginning of their journey.","\"Understood. Thank you, Senior White. I'll start learning now,\" Song Shuhang replied enthusiastically.","\"Go for it, Shuhang. By the way, I need some of the spring water from the 'living spring'... preferably the part where Pavilion Master Chu has soaked. Shuhang, prepare a few barrels and place them at the entrance of South Autumn Temple. Later, Fairy @#%× and I will come to collect the living spring water,\" Senior White instructed.","\"No problem, Senior White. How many barrels do you need? I'll get them ready right away,\" Song Shuhang responded promptly.","As for the part involving spring water where Pavilion Master Chu had soaked... those words sounded a bit strange. However, it made sense. Pavilion Master Chu was a genuine immortal who had spent a long time immersed in the living spring. The downstream pond should have absorbed some of Pavilion Master Chu's aura of immortality and be potentially more effective than the upstream water.","\"I could make a fortune just by selling the secret Immortal Spring Water recipe!\" Song Shuhang thought while considering a money-making scheme.","In the small living spring, Pavilion Master Chu cast a glance at Song Shuhang. For some reason, she suddenly had the urge to hang him up and display him as a masterpiece.","Senior White replied, \"Help me prepare ten barrels for now. Ordinary plastic barrels will do. I've already prepared the materials here. Next, we'll enter the experimental stage of the God Creation Plan, and we'll need the spring water from the living spring.\"","For the past few days, Senior White had been studying the water droplet from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball in his hand. Additionally, he had obtained valuable experimental data from White Two.","Since the two Senior Whites had officially met, they had reached a consensus on many aspects and had begun sharing information.","Senior White Two was also actively participating in Senior White's God-Creation Plan and had provided substantial data about himself. The ruler of the Netherworld, Shadow Overlord, was also an essential part of their research. In many ways, he resembled the Netherworld's ruler.","\"Alright, Senior White. Moreover, I've made a bet with Senior Three-Eyed for a bottle of 'Wielder of the Will's Eye Droplet,' which can activate the weak consciousness of a magical treasure or enable its evolution. I'll leave a small portion of it near the 'living spring.' Senior White, your 'Meteor Sword' should be able to benefit from this eye drop,\" Song Shuhang informed.","\"That sounds promising. I'll gladly accept it,\" Senior White replied with a faint smile and added, \"Oh... Lend me your wooden body for experimentation. I'll provide you with an even more potent wooden body when we're done!\"","Song Shuhang didn't hesitate and responded straightforwardly. He figured that the ten buckets of living spring Senior White requested were for the wooden body.","\"No problem,\" Song Shuhang agreed. He had regrown his body and could continue to grow it like a lizard's tail, so he no longer required the wooden body as a substitute.","\"That's settled for now. I'll reach out to you if I need anything else...\" After conveying all this information, Senior White paused briefly. He remembered something else and added, \"By the way, Shuhang, if you have the time, please keep an eye out for any Plant Fairies that are about to form their sentience or have recently developed signs of waking. If you come across any, bring them to me. I want to provide them with an opportunity.\"","\"Is it related to the God Creation Plan?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","Senior White responded with a \"Yes.\"","\"Is it dangerous?\" Song Shuhang questioned while recalling the plant demon that was on the verge of forming a sentience. He immediately thought of Miruru.","However, Miruru was different from ordinary monsters. Song Shuhang intended to take her as his new disciple, and even the Daoist name 'Priest Mu' had been reserved for her. They shared a master-disciple relationship. If the situation proved too hazardous, it might not be suitable for her to participate.","\"There's a certain level of risk involved. If you're unlucky, the 'sentience' it has painstakingly gathered could scatter, and it might even lose all its cultivation and revert to an ordinary plant,\" Senior White cautioned.","\"Scatter?\" Song Shuhang mused. He held the eye drops in his possession. If Miruru's intelligence were to scatter, perhaps he could use the drops to help her recover.","His only concern was whether the newly condensed sentience and the scattered sentience would still be the same Miruru.","\"Do you have a suitable candidate?\" Senior White inquired.","Song Shuhang replied, \"There's a tree monster in my Inner World. It failed to transcend its tribulation back then and left behind only a new sprout. This new sprout has recently reassembled its sentience. There's a master-disciple karmic connection between us. Senior White, please wait a moment. I'll ask her and see if she can make a decision.\"","lightsΝοvel.cοm Although her sentience had just formed, she should be capable of making simple judgments.","With a thought, Song Shuhang's body instantly moved to the side of the tree monster Miruru's new sprout.","Sensing Song Shuhang's presence, the new sprout's branches and leaves rustled happily.","It was just like an adorable pet.","Song Shuhang gently tapped Miruru's new bud while being cautious not to apply too much pressure to avoid accidentally harming her.","\"Miruru, there's a significant opportunity—a life-altering one, but it comes with great danger. Are you willing to give it a try?\" Song Shuhang asked. The opportunity provided by Senior White was a genuine White Clan opportunity, where danger and opportunity went hand in hand.","Miruru's bud swayed gently.","After a moment, her bud gently tapped back and conveyed a weak affirmative response.","It was reminiscent of when Song Shuhang had typed his first message in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Even though the path of cultivation was fraught with danger, Song Shuhang had chosen this path and wouldn't pass up a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity just because of potential risks.","When it came to dangers like heavenly tribulations, inner demons, and cultivation mistakes, any of them could be a calamity that would annihilate one's cultivation.","After receiving Miruru's positive response, Song Shuhang breathed a sigh of relief. As expected, he and Miruru were on the same page."]},{"number":2363,"title":"Chapter 2363 Earth’s Projection","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang reminded Miruru, \"After you see Senior White, get closer to him. In particular, try to interact with him more during each experiment and take advantage of his good fortune. This way, you can greatly reduce the chances of encountering danger in the God Creation Plan.\"","Miruru might not fully comprehend his words, but Song Shuhang felt like a nurturing mother passing down her wisdom to her child. He shared insights about Senior White's unique attributes, such as his tendency to find opportunities amidst risks, the Bai family's special opportunities, and the nuances of interacting with Senior White. Song Shuhang covered everything from start to finish.","Unfortunately, Miruru's current state prevented her from absorbing this information directly. Song Shuhang wished he could activate his divine third eye to transfer this knowledge into her memory.","Miruru's young sapling nodded gently in response. He could not tell whether she truly understood him or simply knew how to nod like a sapling.","Song Shuhang continued to give instructions as he carefully prepared to transplant Miruru along with the soil.","\"Shuhang, what are you doing?\" Lady Onion grew anxious. Every plant in her Inner World was a close kin of hers.","Lady Onion had a grand plan to cultivate all the plants in her Inner World into charming little demons. Once achieved, she could enter a semi-rest state and leave tasks to her newly created siblings while she managed them.","Among all the plants, Miruru held a special place in Lady Onion's heart. She cared for Miruru like a younger sister. When Song Shuhang was about to uproot Miruru, Lady Onion became concerned.","\"Miruru is relocating her cultivation spot,\" Song Shuhang explained while gently catching Lady Onion, who had rushed over. He pointed at her green onion sprout. \"I'm going to send her to Senior White. He'll take care of her and provide her with an opportunity.\"","The mention of an opportunity from Senior White eased Lady Onion's worries. In her understanding, Senior White equated to extraordinary wealth, extreme luck, and an omnipotent wish-granting machine. She hadn't grasped Senior White's attribute of \"wealth coming from risk,\" probably because whenever she was around Senior White, Song Shuhang was there to shield her from the dangers associated with the Bai family's opportunities.","In her perspective, the trio of Senior Whites, Song Shuhang, and their team members represented the ultimate way to explore secret realms, ruins, and forbidden areas. Their teammates could win effortlessly while languishing like salted fish.","Song Shuhang gently placed Lady Onion on the ground and prepared ten ordinary water buckets, then headed to Pavilion Master Chu's side.","Pavilion Master Chu gazed up at him with curiosity.","\"Senior Pavilion Master Chu, please step aside. I need to collect water from the living spring,\" Song Shuhang explained.","Pavilion Master Chu obligingly moved aside and inquired, \"Aren't you supposed to collect water from the upstream living spring?\"","\"This time, we specifically need your water, Senior Chu. It's for a particular purpose,\" Song Shuhang clarified.","Pavilion Master Chu's response was a deadpan, \"Steamed Chu soup?\"","The sword couldn't resist unsheathing itself and added, \"As soon as you mention it, everyone in the Inner World looks at you differently.\"","Song Shuhang explained with a sigh, \"Senior Chu, Senior White requires it for his experiments.\" He then turned to the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and said, \"Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, in our future battles, feel free to be more active. I'll handle physical attacks while you focus on verbal assaults and psychological damage. Let loose. Don't worry about hurting our opponents' feelings.\"","The sword retorted, \"Only someone as black-hearted as you would come up with such a devious battle plan.\"","Song Shuhang was taken aback. \"Are you sure you're an inner demon with that attitude?\"","After delivering the ten buckets of Living Spring Water, the water level in the small living spring downstream decreased by more than half. Senior Turtle nonchalantly positioned itself between Song Shuhang and Pavilion Master Chu to obscure the view.","\"I'll be back soon.\" Song Shuhang telekinetically lifted the ten buckets of spring water and moved them to the entrance of South Autumn Temple.","\"Hello, Number Tyrannical Song,\" a rumbling voice emanated from South Autumn Temple.","Song Shuhang set down the Living Spring Water and Miruru with a smile while responding. \"Are you getting used to being in the Inner World?\"","\"It's quite comfortable, though there's occasionally a terrifying aura coming from next door,\" South Autumn Temple rumbled. \"Every time I sleep, it feels like someone might enter my body, but I'm not sure what's happening inside.\"","The next door likely referred to Senior White Two's black lotus world. Senior White Two had been visiting South Autumn Temple recently?","\"My master occasionally borrows the 'small time box' from South Autumn Temple for experiments,\" the hamster in Song Shuhang's pocket explained. \"At the same time, he removes some long-range locking formations within South Autumn Temple. It's why the Great Southern Emperor hasn't caused trouble here. He must have dismantled the formation that allowed him to locate South Autumn Temple.\"","Song Shuhang nodded and expressed his gratitude. However, the hamster emphasized that Senior White Two's actions were for the sake of experimentation and convenience, not to earn thanks.","After a brief exchange, Song Shuhang returned to the small living spring.","\"Senior Chu, is your hair still within the artificial small world fragment?\" he inquired.","Pavilion Master Chu nodded.","\"Then let's give it another try.\" Song Shuhang recollected the modified version of the World Refining Holy Ape technique that Senior White had taught him. He began to practice it step by step.","After several attempts, Song Shuhang finally grasped the intricacies of the divine art. The key was that, during the practice, the Holy Ape World Refining Technique seemed to resonate with the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique.","These two cultivation methods with \"Holy Ape\" in their names clearly had the same origin.","Having mastered the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, Song Shuhang found it much easier to learn the Holy Ape World Refining Technique.","\"Success!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed.","He opened his Inner World and extended his arms outward to reach beyond its boundaries.","Rustling sounds filled the air as 133 holy apes, each adorned with a true dragon scarf around their necks, appeared. They formed a large circle while holding hands and dancing in unison.","Every three steps they took, they uttered a harmonious syllable.","As the Holy Apes danced and sang, a small passage finally opened in the man-made small world fragment.","lightsΝοvεl ?οm Song Shuhang gazed at the small world.","Inside, he observed a blue planet remarkably similar to Earth. It seemed like a projection of Earth but possibly slightly smaller in size.","The planet's architecture resembled Earth's but with more advanced technology and a pristine appearance.","\"Who would like to accompany me to this small world?\" Song Shuhang turned to his companions.","Lady Onion, Pavilion Master Chu, Fairy Creation, Black-skinned Soft Feather, and the hamster returned to their original positions.","With determination, Song Shuhang positioned himself and leaped forward into the small world fragment from his Inner World and descended into the atmosphere of the blue planet below."]},{"number":2364,"title":"Chapter 2364 Explosive Welcome","paragraphs":["The structure of this ancient, well-preserved man-made world closely resembled Earth's current state.","So, when Song Shuhang leaped into the atmosphere and rapidly descended, the friction between his body and the atmosphere caused it to heat up.","lightsΝοvel.cοm Of course, this level of high temperature posed no threat to Song Shuhang. However, to ensure the safety of Lady Onion and the hamster in his pocket, Song Shuhang invoked the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure.","A gleaming suit of armor and cloak tightly enveloped him.","However, he chose not to wear the helmet—not out of stubbornness, but to maintain control over his hair manipulation technique. His twenty hair palms were in a state of readiness and were prepared to handle any unforeseen circumstances.","\"Shuhang, are you sure it's okay not to wear a safety helmet?\" Lady Onion asked via mental communication.","With a faint smile, Song Shuhang replied, \"It's fine. I've got a hard head.\"","Lady Onion was left speechless.","As they communicated mentally, Song Shuhang's descent speed increased further, and his body began to rub against the atmosphere vigorously. Eventually, he burst into flames.","Fierce flames enveloped Song Shuhang's face, followed by his thirty braids, and finally his neck.","The parts below his neck were protected by the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure.","\"Hey, Shuhang, your face is on fire,\" Pavilion Master Chu remarked in a daze.","The wword couldn't help but laugh. \"It's fine. He's thick-skinned.\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"It's a shame Song Shuhang still has hair; otherwise, he'd look just like the main character in a certain movie right now. So handsome,\" the sword remarked through mental transmission.","\"Song Shuhang, Ghost Rider,\" Lady Onion promptly responded while showcasing her proficiency in movies, TV series, and animations.","\"Yes, that's it! Ghost Rider!\"","Song Shuhang silently extended his hand, grasped the hilt of the sword, and unsheathed it. Then, he placed the sword above his head and firmly gripped it with his two braided hands. He adjusted his descending posture while positioning himself head down and feet up.","Whoosh! The sword's body also ignited with flames.","However, this was no ordinary fire; it was the regular version of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique that Song Shuhang had previously used to engulf the sword with a layer of true fire. With the sword leading the way, Song Shuhang felt his descent become more stable.","\"How childish!\" the sword mockingly sent through mental transmission.","Black-skinned Soft Feather giggled. \"Senior Song, you're still a child.\"","Being praised by Soft Feather only intensified the flames on Song Shuhang's face.","In fact, his initial intention had been to burn the sword as a warning.","After igniting the sword above his head, Lady Onion fell silent immediately. If Song Shuhang had placed her small body on top of his head and ignited it, she might turn to ashes instantly.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, can you still connect to the Inner World?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired.","\"It's no longer possible. This man-made small world is sealed off from the Inner World. However, I can still utilize techniques like World in the Sleeve and World Refining Holy Ape,\" Song Shuhang responded.","Spatially, this man-made world fragment resembled the Wielder's small black room. Techniques such as the Inner Small World and spatial teleportation, which could lead to an escape from the artificial world, were blocked. However, smaller-scale spatial spells like the World in the Sleeve, Spatial Bending, and spatial magic tools remained functional.","Song Shuhang surmised that opening his Inner World within the man-made small world would likely require waiting for the ancient god to leave the small world and release the seal.","\"If the 'Holy Ape Refinement World' can still be utilized, then I just need to locate the coordinates and reopen this small world to exit, correct?\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","Song Shuhang nodded. \"That's right. I've memorized our entry point's location. When we're ready to depart, we'll find that location and employ the World Refining Holy Ape technique to reopen the portal.\"","Just as they were conversing, Song Shuhang sensed a surveillance presence sweeping over him. It didn't feel like a cultivator's spiritual awareness; rather, it resembled some form of monitoring device.","\"You've been detected,\" Pavilion Master Chu alerted him.","Song Shuhang nodded. \"Seems like someone in this man-made world has locked onto my location. Pavilion Master Chu, please help me conceal my presence.\"","It appeared that the three-legged illusion technique couldn't hide him from the inhabitants of this small world.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, an intense beam of light pierced the sky and homed in on his location.","\"Goodness,\" Song Shuhang thought while summoning the 'Eight King's Walls' from the 'Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure.' These protective layers began to shield him from the concentrated fire of the city's defense system.","\"They're powerful!\" he estimated. \"Each attack seems to be at least seventh-grade or even stronger.\"","Pavilion Master Chu chimed in, \"This assault also carries a strange energy, an ability even I can't identify.\""]},{"number":2365,"title":"Chapter 2365 Constantly Probing at the Edge of Safety","paragraphs":["It was precisely these energies that even Pavilion Master Chu couldn't identify that enhanced the destructive power of the city's defense system below and made it so terrifying.","On average, attacks of Seventh Stage and above, and the power of some defensive weapons, could even approach the level of Eighth Stage.","Not only that, but guided by the unknown energy, the city's defensive attacks would resonate with each other and strengthen their effects, much like adding fuel to a fire.","The power of concentrated attacks could reach nearly the level of Ninth Stage at its peak! Moreover, the attack intensity was still accumulating and increasing.","As long as the combo continued, the attack value would keep on piling up.","In the face of such an attack, hiding became pointless...","\"If you don't release the seal, your Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure defense won't hold.\" The sword reminded him.","Half of the city was under a concentrated barrage, and the twelve layers of defense became vulnerable under such concentrated fire.","Song Shuhang's Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure was of eighth-grade quality. However, due to the influence of his seventh-grade realm, it still had a layer of seal on it. This seal could be temporarily lifted, but until then, the Combined Magical Treasure could only unleash the power of the seventh-grade realm.","\"Shuhang, it's time to use the Impregnable Holy City to block this wave!\" Lady Onion couldn't help but suggest, \"All this time, your Impregnable Holy City has kept you outside its door. I was thinking, what if you had your back against the enemy's attack and summoned the Impregnable Holy City? Do you want to give it a try?\"","After spending a long time with Senior Turtle, Lady Onion had also picked up some clever tricks.","\"That sounds quite reasonable, doesn't it?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet agreed.","The Impregnable Holy City had always appeared behind Song Shuhang. If he faced away from the enemy's attack and summoned the Impregnable Holy City, would the Holy City appear behind him and block all the attacks?","\"Wanna give it a try?\" Pavilion Master Chu was also intrigued. With her presence, Song Shuhang wouldn't die from this level of concentrated fire.","\"Let's experiment it next time,\" Song Shuhang replied.","In this strange world and amidst danger, Song Shuhang's cautious personality allowed him to remain calm.","He clenched his right hand and said, \"The giant that destroys all things!\"","Compared to the Impregnable Holy City, which was used to protect his companions, the Giant of Destruction was obviously more suitable for the current situation.","On Song Shuhang's right fist, the Defiant Whale Tool Spirit Fairy appeared, and she clapped her hands.","Two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure instantly appeared around Song Shuhang.","With the Defiant Whale Fairy at the center, the two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure quickly merged.","This was the benefit of an Artifact Spirit. After possessing an Artifact Spirit, one's life-bound magical treasure would be enhanced in all aspects.","In a dazzling light, the despair-inducing giant made its appearance.","The giant corresponded to Song Shuhang's Golden Core composition and represented destruction. After the Impregnable Holy City's collapse came the giant that destroyed everything.","Song Shuhang and all his pendants were transferred to his right fist.","Upon entering the right fist, Song Shuhang instantly felt a sense of security. It was much more stable than free-falling from the sky and more reliable than a guardrail.","He reached out his hand and wiped away the flames on his face. Despite burning for a long time, the flames hadn't even singed Song Shuhang's skin.","At the same time, within the chest of the giant that destroyed all things, there was a core of the big-eyed planet that served as a driving force. It began to pulsate and provided the giant with endless energy for movement.","The giant clasped its hands together, and two massive turtle shields appeared in front of it and resisted the onslaught of cannon fire.","With this, the giant stabilized its stance.","A black lotus emerged under its enormous feet, supporting its colossal body.","The eyes of the giant gleamed with ruthless red light.","Its appearance symbolized the destruction of the Impregnable Holy City, and the source of its power was the abyss of despair.","[System Notification: Despair Points +3. Current Despair Points: 5.]","In Song Shuhang's mind, a notification from White Two's automatic fortune-telling system appeared.","Despair Points?","\"I'm not in despair right now. I'm so ecstatic right now. Why would I be in despair?\"","However, he soon thought of the giant... Did the Despair Points come from the giant?","Just by summoning it, he could gain 3 Despair Points.","Song Shuhang felt that he had found a shortcut to accumulate points!","When he had some free time, he would recall the giant, summon it again, and recall it once more. He wanted to see if he could continuously harvest Despair Points.","In the void, the turtle shields dispersed.","The giant opened its mouth and let out a soundless roar, but no sound came out...","Its legs moved through the air.","At the same time, some strange and brutal attacks were released from the hands of the giant.","King's Guillotine!","Sword Punishment Tower!","Giant Bear Iron Lady!","Rat Demon's Killing Barb!","These bizarre attacks were directed at the city's defense system.","The light beams were extinguished, the physical cannon fire was severed, and the strange crystal material was pierced by the Iron Lady.","In this manner, the giant endured the defensive artillery fire from more than half of the city and forcefully descended onto the city!","\"Senior Song, are we going to keep this up?\" Soft Feather asked.","\"Let's tough it out first,\" Song Shuhang replied. \"We'll find a chance to sneak away.\"","Since he had already started, he shouldn't waste the opportunity. Song Shuhang decided to test the power of this strange world as long as he could guarantee his safety. He wanted to gather some information and see what kind of techniques this strange world had.","After that, he would use Pavilion Master Chu's method to escape and hide in this world.","\"Direct spatial travel is restricted in this small world. I'll prepare an escape technique for you. When necessary, we can use our secret escape technique to avoid them for now.\" Pavilion Master Chu replied absent-mindedly.","\"I estimate that it will land on the ground in three minutes at most,\" the sword calculated.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, \"Other than these air defense systems, the other party will definitely have corresponding ground defense measures. Fellow Daoist Tyrant Song, please be cautious.\"","lightsΝοvel.cοm Since the air defense systems were so powerful, the ground defenses must be no less formidable.","\"Don't worry, I'm ready to escape at any time,\" Song Shuhang reassured.","At this moment, deep underground in the city below, a group of uniformed giants calmly watched the surveillance footage.","\"Has it finally shown its true form?\" a blue giant asked as he looked at the Destruction Giant, his voice cold.","A green giant next to him said, \"Judging from its size, it's of medium size. But its strength is much stronger than previous medium-sized giants, both in attack and defense.\"","Behind them, a yellow giant nodded and said in a deep voice, \"God Slayer, take action! Bring it down and make it into a more powerful weapon!\""]},{"number":2366,"title":"Chapter 2366 The Ultimate Shield","paragraphs":["The Destruction Giant displayed sheer recklessness while enduring the onslaught of firepower from more than half of the city. It successfully landed and left massive footprints on the ground. Two colossal turtle shields floated beside it and intercepted all incoming artillery fire.","Upon touchdown, the effectiveness of artillery attacks against the Destruction Giant significantly diminished. Most of the city’s defensive artillery had been designed for anti-air combat, and with the Destruction Giant grounded, their attacks naturally lost their punch.","The Destruction Giant let out a silent roar and took its first step onto the unfamiliar terrain of the city. Each stride covered an incredible distance and made ordinary human steps seem insignificant.","Within the Destruction Giant’s right fist, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair acted like a detector. She adjusted it slightly and warned, “Something is rapidly approaching from underground.”","Song Shuhang nodded in acknowledgment. “It should be the ground defense mechanism of this artificially constructed small world.”","Fairy Creation held a book and chanted mechanically, “Hehehe ~ I hope your ultimate move won’t disappoint me.”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","“Isn’t that the line of a villain?” remarked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","“There’s nothing wrong with that line!” defended Fairy Creation.","Song Shuhang could only shake his head in response.","As they conversed, the ground trembled, accompanied by a deafening crash. Whatever was emerging from the ground was colossal.","Simultaneously, the city’s defense system ceased its attack.","“He’s here!” Lady Onion exclaimed with excitement.","Before the Destruction Giant, a colossal passageway appeared, and two figures emerged from it. One was gigantic, while the other was petite.","The larger figure stood at a towering height of over a hundred meters and was nearly twice the size of the Destruction Giant.","In contrast, the smaller figure was only half the height of Su Clan’s Sixteen and possessed a petite and delicate stature.","The Destruction Giant raised its head while gazing at the towering figure before it.","“A mecha?” Black-skinned Soft Feather blinked in surprise.","The hundred-meter-tall figure resembled a metallic mecha commonly seen in science fiction films and radiated an aesthetic of sheer power. Every metallic component on its body gleamed brilliantly from extensive polishing.","“Destruction Giant versus Mecha Warrior,” Lady Onion nodded in excitement. This spectacle rivaled the most thrilling moments in a movie.","“Why did that little one come out?” The sword was more interested in the petite figure.","The petite figure, also humanoid, stood atop a sleek flying device and hovered above the mecha giant’s head.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in, “Could it be similar to Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s Holy Ape?”","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but facepalm.","“Are we going to engage in a fight or cower?” Pavilion Master Chu inquired in a daze. “The escape technique is ready. If you’re hesitant, you can retreat immediately.”","“Let’s first assess the strength of this mecha giant,” Song Shuhang replied. “After exchanging a few moves, we can decide whether to retreat.”","This hundred-meter-tall mecha giant didn’t belong to the ‘cultivator’ category, so its strength was difficult to discern based on aura alone.","“If you decide to retreat, just shout,” Pavilion Master Chu reminded him.","...","...","Before them, the hundred-meter-tall mecha giant extended its four arms.","Several additional large tunnels opened on the ground nearby and released two peculiar-looking spear weapons.","The hundred-meter-long mecha giant deftly caught the spears and aimed their tips at Song Shuhang.","“Let’s strike first,” Song Shuhang decided.","Responding to its master’s command, the Destruction Giant initiated its ultimate move, the Steel Flying Fist and directed it at the hundred-meter-tall Mecha Giant!","BOOM!","Amid the thunderous roar of cannon fire, the Destruction Giant’s right fist ruthlessly collided with the Mecha Giant’s face.","Lady Onion was left speechless.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet quipped, “Why did you lead with your right fist? Isn’t that where the cockpit is located?”","“Indeed,” Scarlet Heaven Sword confirmed, “Even with the birth of a weapon spirit, the nature of this Combined Magical Treasure hasn’t changed!”","“Prepare for impact. 3, 2, 1—impact!”","The Steel Flying Fist connected with the Mecha Giant’s face with a resonating metallic clang.","The head of the hundred-meter-tall mecha was sent flying and caused its immense body to sway dangerously.","The Steel Flying Fist had succeeded in a single blow.","“A headshot? Is it that fragile?” Lady Onion was perplexed. Despite its impressive appearance, the Mecha Giant couldn’t withstand the Destruction Giant’s Steel Flying Fist. Was this hundred-meter mecha nothing more than a facade?","Though its head had been launched skyward, the hundred-meter mecha did not stop moving.","At that moment, the petite figure, originally atop the Mecha Giant’s head, began to take action. She stepped onto her flying device and gracefully spun above the Mecha Giant’s head.","A seven-colored beam of light emanated from her device.","Simultaneously, the petite figure began to sing, her melodious voice filling the air.","Though the language was unfamiliar to Song Shuhang and the others, music transcended language barriers.","The rhythmic beauty of the melody and the entrancing voice were captivating.","“It feels like a concert,” remarked the black-skinned Soft Feather.","“Could it be a War Priest?” Lady Onion proposed. “In the beast cultivation world, there are cultivators known as War Priests who use songs as incantations, each with different mysterious powers. They’re potent support practitioners.”","As the petite figure sang, the Mecha Giant’s body began to respond. Despite not understanding the words, the musical performance was top-notch.","Challenged by the petite figure’s provocation, Song Shuhang’s side naturally refused to back down.","A harmonious, nature-inspired melody resonated from the top of the Destruction Giant’s head.","Fairy Creation appeared atop the Destruction Giant, holding a pipa.","At the same time, Song Shuhang’s body experienced a slight tremor.","The 133 Holy Apes materialized and enhanced Fairy Creation’s aura!"]},{"number":2367,"title":"Chapter 2367 The Decisive Strike - Sword of Extinction","paragraphs":["Fairy Creation had been feeling somewhat lonely recently because she had lost a rival who was on par with her. The virtuous lamia had been very busy lately assisting Senior White in upgrading Song Shuhang's Inner World and helping Senior White with the God Creation Plan.","Today, she finally encountered an opponent who ignited her desire for a singing battle, and she was determined to give it her all!","The lute in her hand resonated with the aura of a champion. Her lips parted slightly, and the ethereal melody that seemed otherworldly filled the entire venue and left everyone in awe.","The 133 holy apes, under Song Shuhang's command, didn't disappoint.","The lead ape raised a scripture in its hand and waved it in the wind while transforming the Confucian scripture into sleek black sunglasses. The great holy ape calmly put on the sunglasses.","Then, it removed its Confucian robe and, with a flourish, reversed it and turned the robe into a stylish black tuxedo. The dragon phantom coiled around its neck transformed into a bowtie.","Behind the great saint ape, 132 smaller saint apes formed a square formation and executed synchronized movements.","One hundred and thirty-three dashing black-clad Holy Apes took the stage.","In the astonished eyes of their petite opponent, the 133 Holy Apes began to move in perfect synchrony while showcasing their impeccable attire, well-groomed bodies, and synchronized movements. Even when they all simultaneously performed the gorilla chest-pounding move, the precision of their actions had a significant visual impact.","With 133 holy apes dancing in perfect harmony, Fairy Creation's aura completely overwhelmed the petite Warsong Priest, her opponent.","Furthermore, Fairy Creation's singing had the effect of enhancing various auxiliary spells.","One unfamiliar supplementary spell after another rained down upon the Destruction Giant, courtesy of the melodious tunes from Fairy Creation's zither.","In the chest of the Destruction Giant, the big-eyed planet's core began to beat vigorously and supplied the Destruction Giant with an endless surge of power!","At that moment, the hundred-meter-tall mecha giant suddenly went berserk. A thunderous roar emanated from its loudspeaker, as if it were vehemently scolding something in the world's language.","Shortly after, the hundred-meter mecha giant, armed with shields and spears in its hands, charged towards Song Shuhang's Destruction Giant.","The Destruction Giant, not backing down, though smaller in size, held the upper hand in raw power. In terms of sheer physical strength, with the full support of the core, the Destruction Giant could unleash the might of a ninth-level entity.","Two turtle shields floated beside it, proactively intercepting the opponent's spear and laser attacks.","It swung its iron fist and advanced head-on.","Simultaneously, its body automatically generated various cruel torture weapons to assail the hundred-meter mecha giant.","The two colossal steel behemoths collided and engaged in combat.","The surrounding buildings rapidly retracted into the ground and created a battleground for the two giants. Some long-range defense system weapons in the distance began providing artillery support for the hundred-meter mecha.","...","...","\"This mecha giant seems to have been provoked, and its anger seems to have surged several levels,\" remarked the hamster. As a denizen of the Netherworld, it could sense the emotional fluctuations of living beings, be it despair, sadness, anger, or fear.","\"Could it be because Fairy Creation outperformed it in the musical competition?\" speculated the sword.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired, \"Could it believe that Fairy Creation was a hostage taken by Song Shuhang which explains its violent outburst?\"","Song Shuhang thought about it while maintaining an exceedingly composed demeanor.","\"It might be related to the activated core of that big-eyed planet. When the core was fully awakened, it seemed to have incited anger and outrage in the other party,\" Song Shuhang analyzed.","\"Why?\" inquired the inquisitive black-skinned Soft Feather.","\"Perhaps they've encountered similar powers before,\" proposed Pavilion Master Chu in a contemplative tone.","\"Could it be that the big-eyed planet once launched an attack here?\" queried Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","\"It's a possibility, but it's unlikely to be the actual big-eyed planet. It might be a creation akin to it,\" surmised Song Shuhang.","The primary body of the big-eyed planet was a planet of immense proportions. Its colossal size made it challenging to forcibly penetrate this fragment of a small world.","Had it forcefully entered this small world in the past and clashed with its intelligent inhabitants, this fragment would have been obliterated and left no trace behind.","\"Increase the firepower,\" commanded Song Shuhang. Simultaneously, he harnessed the energy of his eight Nascent Souls and one unique golden core and infused it into the Destruction Giant's physical strength while activating its ultimate technique. This was the final test, and after evaluating its effectiveness, he would be prepared to withdraw.","Upon receiving the order, the Destruction Giant executed a nimble leap and delivered a powerful kick to the hundred-meter mecha's knee. The critical juncture of the massive mecha was rattled and put a stop to its offensive maneuvers.","Capitalizing on this momentary respite, the Destruction Giant clenched its right hand and reached into its abdomen to produce a blade!","A blade exuding destructive energy and the power to terminate all things emerged from its body.","The Holy Sword of the End!","Full Name: The Holy Sword that Brings About the World's End.","It was Senior White Two's Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure.","Through fusion, the Destruction Giant could temporarily manifest the form of the Holy Sword of the End and unleash a formidable slash that made up for the ultimate skill of the Destruction Giant.","The giant grasped the sword with both hands and raised it aloft.","The aura and principles of the world's end enshrouded the blade and bore a trace of Senior White Two's Netherworld law aura that influenced all living beings upon contact!","Even the pendant beside Song Shuhang felt slightly uncomfortable.","The Holy Sword, thought to be lifeless, suddenly ignited in fierce flames.","The Destruction Giant swiftly pivoted its wrist.","A scorching saber light, brimming with destructive energy, surged forth.","A terrifying saber intent soared into the heavens.","It was the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","Song Shuhang was momentarily taken aback. Could the Destruction Giant wield the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique?","On the back of his hand, Fairy Defiant Whale clapped her flippers and emitted a joyful cry.","The reason the Destruction Giant could perform this feat was undoubtedly attributed to her!","Confronting this formidable blade, the hundred-meter-tall mecha giant raised its shield high to intercept the blade's radiance.","The enormous and weighty facial shield was cleaved in twain by the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","The remaining force of the slash showed no sign of diminishing and continued its trajectory toward the hundred-meter-long mecha.","Simultaneously, the Destruction Giant brandished the Holy Sword of the End and advanced. Its sword followed closely behind the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique, descending upon the hundred-meter mecha.","The petite Warsong Priest situated behind the hundred-meter Mech released a piercing scream.","The colossal Mech clutched its spear with both hands and crossed it before itself.","Simultaneously, a colossal defensive force field materialized around its form.","Absolute Force Field Shield. This was the ultimate defense capable of enveloping an entire planet.","Song Shuhang had recently obtained its blueprint and gained some insight into its workings."]},{"number":2368,"title":"Chapter 2368 Space Traffic Accident","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang dared to guarantee that he wouldn't make a mistake!","In terms of the blueprint, he had meticulously examined it from start to finish. Although he couldn't create such a shield and currently had no means to provide energy for a shield of this level, it didn't hinder his research on the design. He had absorbed knowledge and inspiration about 'defense' from it.","The force field shield on the hundred-meter tall mecha in front of him was undoubtedly the \"Absolute Force Field Shield\"... though the defensive range had been significantly reduced.","Originally, it could provide defense for an entire planet, but now it only enveloped the side of the hundred-meter mecha giant and formed a defensive force field.","With a sizzling sound, the blade of destruction unleashed by the giant was met by the force field shield, and it extinguished like a torch plunged into water.","Even the sword in the hands of the giant was blocked.","Between the sword and the hundred-meter mecha's intersecting long spear, there was an invisible force field that firmly stopped the sharp edge of the Holy Sword.","This invisible force field was distorted under the pressure of the sword... but in the end, it still blocked the sword!","\"The Absolute Force Field Shield... indeed, this place is related to Senior Three Eyes or rather, the corresponding celestial path of Senior Three Eyes.\" Song Shuhang said aloud.","The miniaturized Absolute Force Field Shield in front of him, along with the emotional outburst when the hundred-meter mecha sensed the core of the big-eyed planet, was also linked to the history of this artificial world fragment, which had a long history dating back to ancient times. In terms of time, it corresponded to Senior Three Eyes.","The giant of destruction exerted force with both arms and held the sword and pressed down relentlessly.","The headless mecha tightly gripped the two spears with its four hands while maintaining the Absolute Force Field Shield.","Both sides were in a stalemate.","The ground began to sink due to the brute force and the bursting energy from both sides.","Inside the right fist of the giant of destruction, Song Shuhang nodded slightly—it was time to stop probing, and he had gained some useful information.","It was time to slip away.","\"Pavilion Master Chu, it's time!\" Song Shuhang called out.","Pavilion Master Chu looked confused.","\"Time for what? Do you want me to coordinate with the giant to break the invisible force field shield?\"","\"I chickened out, I chickened out.\" Song Shuhang added.","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","Black Feather explained kindly, \"Senior Chu, didn't you ask Senior Song to give a shout when he's chickening out? Senior Song just gave a shout.\"","\"I'll strangle you, Song!\" Pavilion Master Chu skillfully wrapped around Song Shuhang's neck and tightened—Song Shuhang's tongue was almost squeezed out.","At the same time, Fairy Creation received a signal. She stopped playing the pipa and quickly retreated into the interior of the giant.","Pavilion Master Chu activated the secret escape technique that had been prepared long ago.","The light of the secret escape enveloped Song Shuhang, the pendant, and the giant.","In the next moment, the giant of destruction turned into light.","With a swish, the light transformed from the giant disappeared into the distance in the sky.","This escape technique was incredibly fast and was second only to the shuttle. It could be said that, apart from spatial means, it was one of the top-tier escape techniques.","It slipped away in the blink of an eye without giving the other side a chance to react.","The ninety-meter headless mecha stood dumbfounded while gripping the two bizarre long spears. It stood in place with a bewildered expression... Its opponent, who had just been forcing it down with a giant sword, suddenly turned into light and disappeared. It didn't even have time to adjust its mentality.","When it finally reacted, even if it wanted to pursue, it was too late.","Moreover, in terms of long-distance escape speed, it simply didn't have the same speed.","In the end, it could only swing the two strange long spears in a venting manner and shouted angrily through the loudspeaker. It was probably cursing with words like 'coward, come back and fight for three hundred rounds, whoever runs away is a *&^#$.'","In the deep space underground of the city, the group of colorful uniformed giants fell into a deathly silence.","\"Capture failed, but the operation can still be considered a success. You don't need to be so silent, everyone. At least, we once again protected this city.\" The blue giant sitting in the central position spoke in a deep voice.","However, even though his tone was light, it couldn't hide the heaviness in his heart.","\"The ancient god that descended this time is too unusual,\" the green giant beside him said slowly. \"In terms of intelligence, combat power, and equipment, it has made a significant leap. Moreover, it actually knows how to retreat.\"","\"More importantly, the ancient god has also developed a War Chant Ritual... this is something we've never encountered before. This information needs to be relayed to the other Godslayer Bases as soon as possible.\" The yellow giant next to him got straight to the point.","In the past, the invading ancient gods didn't have a high level of intelligence.","Even the equipment on their bodies mostly consisted of a few standard models.","They had killed several ancient gods and extracted their equipment for research and integrated it into their own technological systems.","Now, the main weapon they used to fight against ancient gods, the Godslayer, was made from the materials of ancient gods.","\"The ancient god has evolved once again, and this is a disaster for us,\" the leading blue giant clenched his fist. \"So, next, we need to confirm one thing. Is the ancient god that descended this time a special case, or could all future ancient gods evolve to this extent?\"","\"We absolutely must find the retreating ancient god and take it down. Relay this information to our comrades in other bases as quickly as possible. This is a life-or-death crisis. Also... make a copy of the battle footage against the ancient god this time and transmit it to everyone.\" The blue giant stood up.","Several colorful giants below quickly carried out the orders.","\"Also, let the Godslayers return. You've worked hard,\" the blue giant sighed. \"Remember to retrieve the head.\"","On the ground, the ninety-meter mecha quietly picked up its head and then stood on the giant lift to prepare for descent and return.","However, when the ninety-meter mecha was halfway down, the defense system in all four corners of the city suddenly sounded a piercing alarm.","The four air defense towers faced space, locked onto the coordinates, and unleashed a barrage of firepower.","Everyone was taken aback.","This was a signal that another ancient god was approaching.","\"Is ancient god that escaped returning?\" the blue giant furrowed his brow.","Outside the Earth's atmosphere, Song Shuhang, who had turned into light and was fleeing, rolled his eyes and transmitted in a pained voice, \"Pavilion Master Chu, wait a moment. It seems we've bumped into something?\"","The giant of destruction, now transformed into light, seemed to have brushed against a massive object during its escape.","However, due to their breakneck speed, Song Shuhang couldn't be sure of what they had collided with."]},{"number":2369,"title":"Chapter 2369 Encounter with White","paragraphs":["\"I'm not interested in what I bumped into. I'm busy now,\" said Pavilion Master Chu, her voice cold.","Then, the strand of hair coiled around his neck tightened even more.","Song Shuhang raised an eyebrow and replied, \"Well, aren't you efficient?\"","The sword cheered on the side. It seemed that Song Shuhang's resistance to its pricking had improved recently. However, he didn't use the Saber Nurturing Technique, which made the sword feel a sense of missed opportunity.","\"Senior Chu, if you continue to strangle him like this, Senior Song's head will fall off,\" cautioned the black-skinned Soft Feather.","As she finished speaking, Song Shuhang's head fell off with a thud and rolled twice on the ground like a rubber ball.","The scene resembled something out of a horror movie.","The sword was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu was also stunned. She had been controlling her strength from the beginning to the end, and theoretically, she couldn't have broken Song Shuhang's neck with this level of strangulation.","\"No. Tyrannical Song, what innate ability did you just awaken?\" inquired the hamster calmly. After all, it had witnessed a similar scene not long ago. Senior White had secretly decapitated Song Shuhang's head, and later, after being injured by heavenly punishment, Tyrannical Song remained as a disembodied head floating in the sky.","Song Shuhang's physical body calmly stepped forward, grabbed his braids, and lifted his head. \"This is a magical ability that I awakened after unlocking my spatial innate skill. It's the Headless Horseman Mode.\"","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","\"The reason why I awakened this divine ability should be related to my recent experiences. Senior White Two once separated my head from my body, and after that, my body was turned into ashes by heavenly punishment. Because of these reasons, my head can now be separated from my body at will,\" Song Shuhang explained. \"Similarly, as long as I put it back, I can naturally fuse with it. There's no need for any healing techniques.\"","\"Aren't there any decent divine abilities that you've awakened?\" sighed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","\"Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, you've got it all wrong. There are no useless innate divine abilities in this world. There are only cultivators who don't know how to develop their skills,\" said Song Shuhang with a faint smile.","He liked the Headless Horseman Mode because he knew the benefits of this mode.","With this mode, spells, attacks, and curses like beheading and twisting heads would have no effect on him. In the world of cultivation, many cultivators possessed similar offensive abilities. Some experts could cross several planes and directly cast curses to break other people's heads. They had to be wary.","Most importantly, he was able to separate his body from his head, which meant that he would not be so easily killed. As long as the 'insurance' of the Scholarly Sage's blood was still present, he could abandon his body and leave the important items in his body with the Scholarly Sage's blood when necessary. Afterward, he could rely on the General Principles of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique and Cheng Lin's Self-Healing Technique to grow his body back.","Now, it was becoming more and more difficult to kill him!","\"Is this why you've been so lively recently?\" Pavilion Master Chu's dazed hair silently shrank back.","\"Actually, I wanted to find an opportunity to let everyone see my new magical ability,\" Song Shuhang coughed lightly and changed the topic. \"Senior Chu, let's get down to business. I suspect that the thing I bumped into earlier was what the intelligent creatures of this world were really fighting against. I want to come into contact with the thing I just bumped into from afar to confirm my guess.\"","Was the thing he had bumped into a creation of the Wielder of the Will that corresponded to Senior Three-Eyed?","\"Mm. I'll stop the light in a while. Then, find an opportunity to sneak back to that city. Be careful not to be discovered. If we get dragged into the battle again, I don't have any energy left to escape with you,\" warned Pavilion Master Chu.","\"Fellow Daoist Chu, have you used up all your energy again?\" asked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","\"After all, I'm just a strand of hair now. I can't store much energy. Carrying a huge body like the giant to execute an escape technique consumed a lot of energy. After a while, I'll enter a dormant state and recover silently,\" Pavilion Master Chu reminded him. She was telling Song Shuhang not to be reckless.","\"Don't worry, Senior Chu. I'll remind Senior Song from the side to exercise restraint,\" said Soft Feather.","Pavilion Master Chu tapped Song Shuhang's forehead and said, \"Did you see that? Don't forget that Black Skin Soft Feather is an inner demon. You're already so miserable that you need the inner demon to remind you and make you exercise restraint. Aren't you heartbroken?\"","Song Shuhang forced a bitter smile.","\"Get ready. I'm going to stop my escape technique,\" Pavilion Master Chu continued.","Song Shuhang and the other pendants quickly prepared to face the sudden brake.","When the light arrived at the designated coordinates, it instantly stopped.","However, the expected impact did not come.","The giant instantly switched from extreme movement to extreme stillness without any buffer.","This was the technique of an Immortal. Even if it was just a strand of hair, the technique would still be incomparably profound.","After coming to a stop, Song Shuhang first put away the giant. The giant mecha below could sense the heart of the fake big-eyed planet, so if he wanted to sneak in, he had to put away the giant and hide its aura.","Moreover, Song Shuhang didn't enter the atmosphere directly this time.","He reached out and tapped his forehead to open his divine third eye.","Through this divine eye, even if he was in space, he could still 'see' the situation of the city below.","The third eye swept down and searched.","Soon, Song Shuhang found what he wanted to see.","At that moment, the city was once again bombarded with artillery fire!","Just like how the defensive artillery fire had been focused on Song Shuhang, it was now also focused on its target.","'As expected, the enemy we bumped into earlier was the enemy that the intelligent creatures of this world really had to defend against.' Song Shuhang thought to himself.","The divine third eye turned and began to enlarge layer by layer while capturing the creature that was being focused on.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang's divine third eye opened wide.","The creature that was being targeted had the appearance of a human.","He had long snow-white hair, and his hair was very long... It was on par with Pavilion Master Chu's, and it was hanging under her feet. When it was spread out, it could drag the floor.","However, this wasn't the main point. The main point was that Song Shuhang was extremely familiar with the face of this white-haired figure.","\"Senior White Three?\"","The creature that was being targeted had Senior White's face.","Why would this Senior White appear here?","Why did he become the enemy of this world?","Song Shuhang had many questions in his mind.",".cοm 'Wait... The thing that guided me into this small world was Senior White Two's divination. Does Senior White Two know about this?' Song Shuhang thought of another clue.","\"Shuhang, what did you see? Why are you so surprised?\" Lady Onion asked.","\"I saw it... A Senior White whose long hair finally reached his waist,\" Song Shuhang replied."]},{"number":2370,"title":"Chapter 2370 Overloading One’s Mind","paragraphs":["In the countless encounters he's had with various versions of Senior White, none have had hair that reached their waists.","In the modern world, Senior White would always trim his long hair back to shoulder length just before it could reach his waist, all due to a series of coincidences.","Senior White Two's long hair, from the moment he first met him until now, has never grown beyond its initial length.","As for the young Senior Whites he's encountered a few times, their hair was even shorter than that of their adult counterparts.","This time, it's quite rare to come across a Senior White with hair that cascades down to the ground. It's like stumbling upon a top-tier piece of equipment in a game, with attributes far superior to ordinary gear—a genuinely pleasant surprise.","\"Tyraniccal Song, are you saying we just had an encounter with Senior White? Even though we're not sure in what form Senior White appears here, his basic attributes shouldn't differ too much. Should we be worried?\" Black-skinned Soft Feather asked, her tone filled with concern.","In this world, running into Senior White usually spells trouble, and no one could stay carefree after crossing paths with him.","No, Senior White has never been the target of an attack from anyone else... Even if it's a thousand-mile-flying corpse delivering a magical treasure, it somehow always ends up hitting Song Shuhang, who's standing next to Senior White.","Song Shuhang hesitated for a moment.","He couldn't help but reach out and touch the red crystal pendant of Pavilion Master Chu hanging on his body. This recently acquired resurrection magical treasure that he hadn't had the chance to use yet—could it possibly come in handy so soon?","Below, the white-haired Senior White, who was currently the focus of everyone's attacks, seemed to have sensed Song Shuhang's gaze. He turned his head and glanced in Song Shuhang's direction.","Senior White Three's expression remained as stoic as the other Senior Whites. His pupils were unique, unlike the other Senior Whites. The depths of his pupils seemed to be formed by countless beams of light and contained an unimaginable amount of data.","When Song Shuhang's divine third eye met Senior White Three's eyes, he received an overwhelming deluge of chaotic information. The information was forcibly injected into his mind and left him with no choice but to reject it.","\"Ah, Senior Three-Eyed's billions of tons of garbage data attack!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed while closing his divine third eye in discomfort.","His brain throbbed and stung, but thanks to the training he received while with Senior Three-Eyed, he had developed a strong resistance to this kind of pain.","\"Is that Senior White or Senior Three-Eyed?\" Song Shuhang rubbed his temples as the pain subsided.","Senior White's appearance was evident, but the abilities he displayed were closely tied to Senior Three-Eyed. Even the remnants of this small world contained traces of Senior Three-Eyed.","Black-skinned Soft Feather stepped forward and offered to massage Song Shuhang's temples to help ease the discomfort in his head.","Song Shuhang tried to analyze the information sent by Senior White Three, but after struggling for a while, his brain felt like it was about to explode. There were hundreds of millions of fragmented data pieces, none of which formed a coherent whole. Each piece of data represented an individual, and there was no way to piece them together.","This seemed to be pure gibberish data.","Fortunately, Song Shuhang had only exchanged glances with Senior White Three. If he had gazed any longer, he suspected that his mind would have been filled with garbage data and burst!","\"Shall we descend?\" the sword inquired.","\"There's no rush. Let's observe what happens next,\" Song Shuhang replied while shaking his head and reopening his divine third eye.","In this artificial small world, traces of both Senior White and Senior Three-Eyed were apparent, and Senior White Three seemed to be utilizing Senior Three-Eyed's techniques. It was likely that Senior Three-Eyed's influence persisted in this world before its fragmentation, and Senior White had subsequently modified it to some extent.","He reopened his divine third eye and surveyed the entire city this time.","At that moment, a protective force field shield appeared around Senior White Three's body, courtesy of Senior Three-Eyed. This shield effectively blocked all incoming artillery attacks.","Descending to a certain altitude, several beams of light radiated from Senior White Three's body, summoning a total of thirty-three magical treasures around him.","\"Thirty-Three Divine Beasts 'Combined Magical Treasure!'\" Song Shuhang exclaimed.","Once activated by Senior White Three, the magical treasures gathered to form a massive steel lion.","The steel lion suddenly emitted a radiance akin to the sun.","The intense burst of light nearly blinded Song Shuhang's divine third eye and caused sharp pain.","The steel lion, like a rising sun, slammed into the ground. It shook the earth and creating a deep crater at the city's center.","In a nearby tunnel, the mecha, which Song Shuhang had previously decapitated, crawled out.","The launcher needed time to recharge after each use, so the mecha had to rely on its sheer strength to emerge from the tunnel.","Once stabilized, the God-Slaying mecha brandished its two spears and let out a triumphant roar to proclaim its imminent victory over the steel lion.","The steel lion, appearing like a miniature sun, refused to be outdone and roared back even louder.","Thus, the two titans engaged in a fierce battle. Their initial battle hymns still echoed.","Song Shuhang tried his best to keep his divine third eye open, though tears streamed down his face from the intense light.","\"Senior Song, are you alright?\" Soft Feather asked anxiously.","\"I'm fine. My eyes were just stung by the intense light,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Black-skinned Soft Feather nodded and carefully collected Song Shuhang's tears in a cup. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's tears were considered a valuable resource for refining artifacts.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"What's the situation down there?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired with concern. Regardless of whether it was 'Senior White' or 'Senior Three-Eyed,' it was still its master, so it naturally worried about Senior White Three's safety.","\"The steel lion is not faring well,\" Song Shuhang stated.","Down below, Senior White's steel lion had initially forced the mecha to the ground. However, they gradually lost their advantage in the battle.","It seemed Senior White was intentionally taking it easy.","Before long, the steel lion found itself completely overpowered. It was pressed to the ground by the mecha, its movement restricted by two peculiar spears.","The mecha, victorious and delighted, let out a triumphant roar toward the sky.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","\"Any change in the battle situation?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired again.","\"The steel lion is pinned to the ground and appears to be defeated,\" Song Shuhang reported.","\"Then, shall we descend and offer assistance?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suggested promptly.","As a magical artifact, its duty was to aid its master in crushing opponents, regardless of whether the intelligent creatures in this small world were aligned with the forces of good or evil.","\"Just give it a moment,\" Song Shuhang replied.","He once again locked eyes with Senior White Three, who was safely ensconced within the steel lion.","Their gaze met once more.","Seizing the opportunity, Senior White Three inundated Song Shuhang's mind with an avalanche of information."]},{"number":2371,"title":"Chapter 2371 Boundless Universe in the Sleeve","paragraphs":["But this time, Song Shuhang was well-prepared. His third divine eye suddenly shone brightly!","He wasn't attempting to flood Senior White Three with a barrage of 'junk messages.' Considering that every Senior White likely had their own 'luck' buff, bombarding them with useless messages would be a self-destructive move, akin to digging his own grave.","So, Song Shuhang's strategy was to establish a connection to bind himself with Senior White Three!","Regardless of whether it was the black and white, the plain white, the colorful white, or any other kind of white, binding any of them was the right choice.","As Senior White Three began forcefully feeding him information, Song Shuhang's third divine eye lit up and projected a Golden Core QR code.","\"Let's be friends, Senior White Three!\"","While Senior White Three was forcibly transmitting information, it was likely that he would use his mental energy for control over the connection. Mental energy was a tool for compelling the transfer of memories. By gently swiping Senior White Three's mental energy on the Golden Core QR code, Song Shuhang hoped to establish a connection.","\"Di-Ding ~ 'Unknown White23' has added you as a friend. You have created a friend list: Mysterious Friend.\"","Success!","Song Shuhang couldn't help but grin. Senior White Three was now part of his friend list and would grant him various capabilities.","\"In that case, let's have a chat with him first.\" Song Shuhang thought.","Just as Song Shuhang was preparing to employ various techniques, Senior White Three's eyes lit up even more and intensified the data transfer.","Song Shuhang's head throbbed intensely. The pain was excruciating.","\"Should I break eye contact?\" Song Shuhang pondered. Now that he had successfully added Senior White Three as a friend, there was no need for further visual contact.","A moment later, Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and chose to endure the influx of information. He wanted to take a gamble. He believed that the information forcibly transmitted by Senior White Three held more than mere trash data. There had to be something concealed within it.","The pain inflicted by the information was bearable, and Song Shuhang was no stranger to enduring discomfort. Even if Senior White Three had indeed fed him useless data, he could employ the memory-erasing technique to delete it afterward to eliminate any issues.","\"Fairy Creation, Soft Feather, please monitor my condition!\" Song Shuhang instructed.","The two fairies could serve as his safety net.","If anything went awry, Fairy Creation and the black-skinned Soft Feather possessed the means to sever the connection between him and Senior White Three forcefully.","With Song Shuhang's active cooperation, billions of messages were rapidly transmitted from Senior White and the other two.","As the incoming information began to accumulate, Song Shuhang gradually realized that his initial suspicion was correct: this data wasn't mere trash.","He focused on processing the information, akin to assembling countless pieces of a jigsaw puzzle in his mind.","This process continued for approximately fifteen more seconds before the information transfer abruptly halted.","There was nothing more to receive.","\"Huh?\" Song Shuhang was perplexed.","He felt that he could endure more, and his mind had plenty of space to accommodate additional information. Why had the transmission ceased?","Moreover, the information didn't appear to be complete. It was akin to downloading a file; it felt as though only 3% of the file had been acquired and left a considerable amount of content unretrieved.","Song Shuhang forcefully reopened his third divine eye and stared at Senior White Three's eyes in hopes that the data transfer would resume.","However, Senior White Three, situated below, had simply closed his eyes.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","The sensation of receiving a portion of the information but not its entirety left him with a sense of unease.","Deleting the incomplete information would be a waste and cause regret for the agony he had endured. However, preserving incomplete data in his mental storage would serve no purpose.","Below, the headless god-killing mecha dragged Senior White Three's steel lion and made its way towards the descending tunnel. Killing another ancient god was no easy feat, so they intended to make the most of it.","Within the steel lion, Senior White Three appeared to brim with energy. His body was unscathed. Nevertheless, he didn't resist and allowed the mecha to pull him along.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","The personality of Senior White Three, with his long hair, was distinctly different from the other two.","Attempting to employ the cultivation chat function to send a message to Senior White Three proved futile; he remained indifferent and unresponsive.","\"Let's descend and retrieve Senior White Three,\" Song Shuhang proposed.","Senior White Three constituted a significant lead, and they couldn't allow him to be taken underground.","\"I've been waiting for that,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet declared, \"Man and Stone Tablet as one, No. Tyrannical Song!\"","Song Shuhang placed his right hand on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's body and initiated the Blade Nurturing Technique. Their two forms resonated, instantly entering the 'monolith-man fusion' mode.","In the next instant, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's figure flashed and emitted all of his energy. He exploded with the speed of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender and hurtled toward the ground.","Song Shuhang reclined on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's body, his eyes closed.","\"Have you devised a plan to rescue Senior White Three?\" inquired the sword.","\"I have a plan,\" Song Shuhang confirmed, \"but I must first approach Senior White Three.\"","On the ground, the 90-meter Godslayer, burdened by the steel lion and preparing to return, halted once more.","The city's defense system issued a reminder that the ancient god who had previously escaped had returned.","This time, they were determined to defeat that entity!","The mecha which they called the Godslayer pivoted to face the sky, its intention clear.","This time, the city's defense system refrained from firing. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's speed closely approximated Pavilion Master Chu's escape technique.","Before the city's defense system could reactivate, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had already brought Song Shuhang to the vicinity of the Godslayer.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I entrust the rest to you!\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet called out.","\"Universe Creator!\" Song Shuhang, adorned in a windbreaker with flowing sleeves, extended his right hand toward the Godslayer.","Under the vigilant gaze of onlookers, the 90-meter-tall Godslayer vanished.","The entire city was dumbfounded.","Where had their Godslayer gone?","A mecha measuring ninety meters wasn't akin to a tiny caterpillar; how could it simply disappear?","Song Shuhang lay on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's body with a throbbing headache.","He had originally targeted Senior White Three's steel lion, but somehow, the mecha had been swept up instead.","A creature of such size exceeded?Song Shuhang's storage capacity.","Universe Creator was on the verge of collapse; after all, Song Shuhang had only recently acquired proficiency in this mystical technique.","At that moment, Senior White Three opened his eyes.","He casually patted his own body, then, like a 'spiritual body,' floated out of the steel lion and approached Song Shuhang.","Subsequently, he extended his hand. He lifted Song Shuhang's T-shirt and gently placed his palm on Song Shuhang's abdomen."]},{"number":2372,"title":"Chapter 2372 The Domination of the Godslayer Mecha","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang drew in a sharp breath. His body shivered as he felt the bone-chilling coldness of Senior White Three's palm.","\"Whoa,\" he exclaimed as the frigid touch sent shivers down his spine.","Could this be the legendary Ice Palm technique? The thought crossed his mind as he tried to make sense of the sensation.","As he contemplated, a strange energy, native to this artificial realm, flowed from Senior White Three's palm into Song Shuhang's body. Even Pavilion Master Chu couldn't identify the nature of this peculiar energy.","Song Shuhang's protective spiritual energy, body-tempering techniques, and the radiance of his virtues proved ineffective in blocking this foreign energy. Even the spiritual energy from the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique, which Song Shuhang was cultivating, came alive as it responded to this influx of energy.","The strange energy continued to pour into Song Shuhang's core.","Song Shuhang's core was anything but ordinary. Despite having ascended to the Seventh Stage and formed his Nascent Soul, his original spiritual lake remained intact. Within this spiritual lake, a baby and a whale coexisted harmoniously.","Senior White Three, with a puzzled look on his face, raised his head to examine Song Shuhang.","Never before had someone managed to preserve both a Fifth Stage Golden Core and a Sixth Stage Spirit Lake within their core upon reaching the Seventh Stage. It was a miraculous feat that Song Shuhang hadn't exploded from this unusual arrangement.","\"Don't be surprised, Senior White Three,\" Song Shuhang spoke while hoping his words would be understood. \"Thanks to the guidance of Senior White and Senior White Two from the main world, my core is rather unique. But it's perfectly healthy. There are no issues at all.\"","Senior White Three nodded, his expression suggesting he might have understood.","Then, Senior White Three's other icy palm pressed into Song Shuhang's body and transmitted another special energy into his core.","As the two streams of energy from Senior White Three stimulated Song Shuhang's core, the spiritual energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique surged, as if it had received a powerful boost. It automatically circulated throughout Song Shuhang's body.","After a few moments, a subtle change occurred in Song Shuhang's core.","Beside his Nascent Soul and the core of the spiritual whale, a small black lion shadow appeared.","Song Shuhang had encountered similar illusory figures in the past. When he was at the Fourth Stage Realm, before forming his Intrinsic Whale Core, he had condensed similar phantoms in his core. However, those phantoms from the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique back then were all golden. They exuded warmth and vitality.","The black shadow of the little lion before him, however, emanated an icy chill of death.","\"Is this some kind of supplementary technique of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique?\" Song Shuhang wondered aloud as he looked at Senior White Three with curiosity.","The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique had numerous supplementary cultivation methods. Song Shuhang's Whale Swallowing Technique was one of them and allowed him to cultivate by swallowing spirit beast crystals directly. The Encyclopedia of Animal Taming enabled the training of spirit beasts to reach the 'little ghost spirit' level.","Senior White Three remained silent, his expression serious. He had detected that, apart from Song Shuhang's original core, there were actually seven other small cores in his body.","Each of these cores housed a plump and adorable little Nascent Soul.","Senior White Three once again looked at Song Shuhang, his eyes filled with surprise.","It was as if his eyes were asking, \"How did someone like you not blow up yet?\"","\"I won't hide it from you, Senior White. In order to create these seven small cores, I've already blown up.\" Song Shuhang sighed faintly.","Senior White Three was left speechless.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Meanwhile, the city's defense system continued to unleash a barrage of attacks on Song Shuhang and Senior White Three.","The Godslayer had disappeared, and they couldn't allow the enigmatic ancient god to escape once more. Moreover, they couldn't let the steel lion on the ground be taken away. This steel lion represented their hope for forging a new Godslayer.","Senior White Three extended his hand once more and pressed it firmly against Song Shuhang's abdomen. He injected a surge of energy into it. He was seemingly intent on creating a small black lion beside each of Song Shuhang's cores and Nascent Soul.","This demonstrated Senior White Three's unwavering commitment.","At the same time, the two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure on Song Shuhang's body activated automatically.","Two Impregnable Holy Cities materialized to shield Song Shuhang and Senior White. Two knights in golden armor stood guard against the city's defense system's onslaught outside the Holy City.","When Song Shuhang witnessed this, he was overcome with excitement, tears welling up in his eyes. It was the first time the Impregnable Holy City had taken the initiative to protect him!","The subtle feeling of gratification—like a parent seeing their child mature—was indescribable.","After Senior White Three poured an enormous amount of energy into his hands, he divided it into seven parts and sent it to each of Song Shuhang's cores.","Song Shuhang shivered uncontrollably from the cold. It felt as though his bones were on the verge of freezing.","After some time, in Song Shuhang's body, beside each small Nascent Soul, a small black lion had condensed.","Senior White Three finally breathed a sigh of relief. This time, he didn't detect any new cores or Nascent Souls in Song Shuhang's body.","Senior White Three had expended a significant amount of energy. Condensing eight black lions for Song Shuhang in a single go had left him visibly drained.","Song Shuhang's hair, eyebrows, and eyelashes were all covered in ice crystals.","Gradually, the cold air turned him into an ice sculpture.","This condition resembled that of Song Shuhang's adopted daughter, Li Yinzhu. Whenever her condition flared up, the cold air would emanate from within and transform her into an icy statue.","Senior White Three retracted his palm from Song Shuhang's abdomen and exhaled a cold breath. Then, he clasped his hands together and returned to his usual stoic demeanor.","Under the watchful eyes of all, Senior White Three's form disintegrated into particles and dissipated like a fulfilled wish ascending to heaven.","The steel lion on the ground also vanished.","After Senior White Three's actions, Song Shuhang couldn't hold on any longer.","His body became an ice sculpture and he lost consciousness.","Lady Onion, the hamster, and all the other pendants were also frozen.","As Song Shuhang descended, the two sets of Combined Magical Treasures formed into a steel lion that protected him as they landed on the ground.","Simultaneously... Song Shuhang's World in the Sleeve could no longer endure it.","A burst of light erupted from the ice sculpture.","The 90-meter-tall Godslayer reappeared, covered in ice fragments.","\"Roar!\" The Godslayer's megaphone roared in anger.","Once again, he had been toyed with by that ancient god.","Fortunately... the ancient god's steel lion remained.","After venting his frustration, the Godslayer silently dragged the steel lion to the landing platform.","They would transform this steel lion into a Godslayer Mecha!"]},{"number":2373,"title":"Chapter 2373 Strengthening Across Different Species","paragraphs":["The Godslayer, lacking a head by ten meters, dragged the steel lion with ponderous steps towards the underground elevator.","However, this time, it didn't return immediately.","First, it mimicked taking a step forward, then clandestinely surveyed the sky. Although it lacked a head, it remained a Godslayer, and observing the outside world wasn't straightforward without conventional 'eyes'.","After an extended period of observation, the unique ancient god didn't descend again.","It wasn't clear if it had truly escaped or would repeat its pattern of sporadic appearances.","The Godslayer placed the steel lion on the elevator first and sent it on its way.","Meanwhile, it continued to guard the entrance of the passage. The elevator had limited capacity and necessitated a phased approach to transportation.","And so, the Godslayer waited outside for half a day. When it noticed the special ancient god didn't reappear, it sighed in relief.","Finally, it raised its massive 40-meter-long leg and stepped into the elevator. It descended beneath the city.","Approximately 50 minutes later, in Earth's time, the city's alarm was lifted.","The colossal city's armed defense system began to descend, returning to the underground. Buildings and bridge structures began to rise to ground level.","Once again, a bustling city emerged before the eyes of its residents.","After about fifteen more minutes, all the residents in the buildings began to return.","The city regained its lively atmosphere.","It had to be acknowledged that the inhabitants of this artificially created world possessed remarkable mental resilience!","Every individual seemed to embody the mentality of 'shrugging it off' after surviving a disaster capable of city-wide destruction.","This mindset transcended mere numbness or habit; it felt as though the city's residents were akin to age-old giants with unwavering determination.","Beneath the city's surface, after confirming the successful capture and transfer of the steel lion to the underground base, the uniformed giants collectively breathed a sigh of relief.","\"The modification of the steel lion shall commence immediately; time is of the essence. We should have a replacement head for the Godslayer. Let's install it first,\" declared the leader of the blue giants in a deep voice.","\"We've already transmitted information about that distinctive ancient god to the other Godslayer bases in the vicinity. All neighboring Godslayer bases will maintain vigilant surveillance and endeavor to locate and encircle that extraordinary ancient god as soon as possible,\" added the green giant.","\"That's correct,\" sighed the red giant in relief. \"Thankfully, it appears that only that ancient god possesses uniqueness.\"","Based on the battle between the steel lion and the Godslayer, it seemed that the steel lion, much like the ancient gods of old, exhibited recklessness, employed a singular attack method, and lacked high intelligence.","In essence, the only unique ancient god was the one that understood how to escape and make a comeback.","The other giants within the base nodded silently.","\"Nevertheless, we must remain vigilant. Where there's one, there might be another. We cannot discount the possibility of other unique ancient gods emerging,\" the blue giant declared as he rose from his seat. \"I shall leave the ancient god's monitoring to everyone; I will go check on the steel lion.\"","\"We've got it covered,\" assured the green giant.","With a nod, the blue giant departed from the control room. Apart from being the base's leader, he was also an expert in ancient god modification.","Transforming the steel lion into a Godslayer fell within his purview.","The following day, within a vast, modified space beneath the underground base.","The steel lion, transformed by the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure, lay motionless within a maintenance solution.","Inside the steel lion, Song Shuhang remained encased in ice from the inside out.","However, his Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique circulated within him more diligently than ever. It flowed incessantly and was even more vigorous than during seclusion!","Beside each of the eight Nascent Souls and the plump Nascent Soul Whale, a small black lion figure had materialized.","After each cycle of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique, the small black lion's figure solidified further, and Song Shuhang's strength continued to increase.","He was quietly leveling up.","Due to the stimulus of the cold environment, Pavilion Master Chu woke up and was examining Song Shuhang's physical condition.","\"He appears physically sound,\" she noted.","\"The cultivation technique is circulating very rapidly. Is this a forced seclusion mode?\" she mused.","The sword also examined Song Shuhang's body and added, \"Ever since Song Shuhang advanced to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, his rate of advancement slowed down. We, as Seventh Stage Venerables, cannot provide any assistance in this regard. Song Shuhang's advancement experience differs from that of ordinary cultivators after he condensed eight Nascent Souls. Now, it seems there's an opportunity for him to advance to the Eighth Stage.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired, \"Another advancement?\"","\"Simply put, this is an opportunity for advancement, not an immediate breakthrough. It might be a small realm increase... Additionally, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, you must get used to following Tyrannical Song,\" advised the sword while sharing its experiences with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet as a sword that had come before. These were the hard-earned lessons it had accumulated.","\"Even if it's just a small realm increase, it's still too rapid... Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you even stable?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet expressed his concern. If Song Shuhang's core was unstable, it could lead to uncontrollable power and be as dangerous as placing a lethal weapon in the hands of a child. Moreover, it could give rise to inner demons.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suddenly paused. He immediately thought of Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword and Fairy Soft Feather—these two were genuine inner demons!","All along, he had intentionally or unintentionally overlooked this point.","Tyrannical Song had never cared about inner demons.","In fact, inner demons were actually afraid of Tyrannical Song.","\"You've caught on,\" remarked the sword.","\"Me too,\" added the black-skinned Soft Feather.","Pavilion Master Chu said, \"If an inner demon truly appeared, Shuhang might be quite delighted.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was rendered speechless.","Just as Song Shuhang's pendants were conversing, the warehouse door opened.","A group of colorful giants entered.","These giants carried numerous instruments and equipment.","Pavilion Master Chu scanned the area with her dazed-hair divine sense and noticed some familiar items—the components of the Absolute Force Field Shield.","After Song Shuhang obtained the design drawings from the horse, she had also taken a look at them.","These colorful giants should be the intelligent beings of this world.","What were they up to?","At that moment, another door opened nearby.","The 100-meter-tall Godslayerfrom earlier strode in, now with a green head.","Subsequently, led by the blue giant, a group of giants held blueprints and began to communicate.","Not long after, the steel lion was lifted out of the nutrient solution. A group of giants operated various instruments and commenced the modification of the steel lion.","\"Are they trying to modify Senior Song?\" queried the black-skinned Soft Feather.","\"Haha, this is Shuhang's magical treasure, not a mech. They are different species. It's destined for futility. What a face-slap moment,\" grumbled the sword."]},{"number":2374,"title":"Chapter 2374 Hahaha, Are You Afraid of Me?","paragraphs":["\"Anyone who slaps my face must die!\" The sword's words were filled with anguish.","\"Calm down, Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet consoled him. \"You don't have a physical face, so you don't need to worry about being slapped.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's logic was sound, at least two months ago.","\"The problem is that I do have a face. I still have a second form,\" lamented the sword. Its primary form had evolved into a face, and as an inner demon, it had the ability to transform into its second form.","Its second form was rather impressive.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was left speechless.","As a sentient artifact, why did it now have a face?","\"If you can't handle it, then stab Shuhang,\" calmly suggested Pavilion Master Chu.","\"Shuhang wasn't the one who slapped my face, so why would I stab him?\" retorted the sword. \"If anyone should be stabbed, it's this group of colorful inner demons,\" it added.","Bullying the weak and fearing the strong was also a characteristic of inner demons. When a cultivator's mind had no weaknesses, inner demons wouldn't manifest. Inner demons only emerged when the cultivator was weakened. Miss Black Skinned Soft Feather was a unique case, and her circumstances provided no reference.","While the pendants conversed, the steel lion, transformed by Song Shuhang using the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure, underwent a thorough overhaul by the colorful giants.","These two systems and species were fundamentally different. Surprisingly, Song Shuhang's Combined Magical Treasure cooperated seamlessly with the giant engineers' modifications.","The giants divided the components of the Absolute Force Field Shield into sixty-six parts, attaching them to the corresponding sections of the steel lion. This allowed the sixty-six augments to be activated individually or combined to form the Absolute Force Field Shield.","Furthermore, the giant engineers strengthened and modified various aspects of the steel lion. The specifics were not fully comprehensible to Pavilion Master Chu, the sword, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, as they belonged to different elemental systems.","The above process was part of the giant engineers' preparations to transform the steel lion into a Godslayer.","\"The final step awaits,\" stated the blue giant with a solemn expression.","This step was the most critical—transforming the core of the ancient god into a protective Godslayer Mecha for the world.","The giant engineers had significant experience in transforming ancient god cores. It was not their first time converting an ancient god.","\"The core of this steel lion is located in its chest, following the traditional ancient god model,\" mentioned a pink female giant engineer.","The blue giant smiled and nodded approvingly.","Tradition was favorable!","The more traditional the model, the higher the success rate of conversion.","Subsequently, the giant engineers began to work on the steel lion's heart core, the most crucial step in the transformation.","\"Why do I feel like the Combined Magical Treasure is actively cooperating with these giants?\" inquired the sword.","\"I have the same feeling,\" agreed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Pavilion Master Chu suggested, \"Didn't Shuhang's Defiant Whale Gloves already condense a weapon spirit? Let her come out and inquire about the situation.\"","As soon as Pavilion Master Chu made the suggestion, the Defiant Whale Artifact Spirit Fairy's tiny form appeared.","\"Fairy Artifact Spirit, what is the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure doing now?\" inquired the sword.","The Defiant Whale treasure spirit raised her little head and emitted a howling sound that was similar to that of a wolf.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet shook his tablet and remarked, \"It seems we can't communicate with her effectively. She can barely express herself beyond whimpering.\"","\"Maybe Fairy Creation can communicate with her,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather suggested.","\"But the issue is...\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet pointed out, \"Fairy Creation can't communicate with us effectively either. Except for Song Shuhang, it's challenging for the rest of us to understand her strange lines. Her 'Song ~ Dumby ~' has dozens of different meanings.\"","\"Song ~ Dumby ~,\" the Defiant Whale Artifact Spirit Fairy suddenly uttered in a clear voice.","\"Is she trying to learn how to speak?\" Black-skinned Soft Feather wondered.","\"Say a few more words,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet encouraged the little fairy.","The Defiant Whale Artifact Spirit Fairy raised her head and tried her best to make sounds.","...","...","The giant engineers' modification of the steel lion's heart core continued for an entire day.","After the transformation, the giants placed the steel lion into the maintenance solution, allowing it to initiate the transformation process.","Normally, it would take about a month to transform an ancient god into a Godslayer. This artificial small world closely resembled Earth, with only a slight difference in the calculation of \"one day.\"","Following the modification, the blue giant left two engineers behind to monitor the steel lion and assess the progress of the transformation. The other engineers retreated and departed in single file.","The vast modified space fell silent once more.","Within the icy confines, Song Shuhang dreamed.","This time, it wasn't a supernatural dream but a regular mortal one. It was something he hadn't experienced in a long time.","In his dream, Song Shuhang found himself transformed into a small lion that was pursuing an unusual prey.","The prey was round and spherical.","Lion Song chased after it as the ball-shaped prey dashed ahead.","The cause of this dream was likely hunger.","\"Hahahaha, are you afraid of me? Are you afraid of me?\" Song Shuhang shouted as he pursued.","The ball-shaped prey hopped and fled, swift in its escape.","\"Are you afraid of me? Hahahaha!\" Lion Song pounced on the ball-shaped prey and pinned it beneath his body with sharp claws. He turned it over and playfully stuck out his tongue. \"Are you afraid of me?\"","The ball-shaped prey trembled.","Lion Song opened his mouth wide, about to swallow the prey.","However, at that moment, the ball-shaped prey radiated intense light.","The once-large ball transformed into a colossal tiger. It was much larger than Song Shuhang's diminutive lion form.","The enormous tiger casually swatted Lion Song away with a backhand swipe.","Dreams often defied logic. The more you wanted to eat, the less you could. The more you sought the restroom, the more elusive it became. Likewise, the more you yearned to escape, the more impossible it became.","\"Are you afraid of me?\" the immense tiger bellowed.","Lion Song was rendered speechless.","The tables had turned.","Now, Lion Song found himself running for his life while the colossal tiger pursued him, shouting, \"Are you afraid of me? Are you afraid of me? Hahaha!\"","As the giant tiger roared, it repeatedly reached for Lion Song's tail with its claws.","...","...","Below the city, the group of colorful giants gazed at the surveillance screens, utterly baffled.","Indeed, a premature Godslayer proved unreliable."]},{"number":2375,"title":"Chapter 2375 Ahh, My Right Hand!","paragraphs":["\"This combat strength...\" The green giant rubbed his temples.","\"Too weak,\" sighed the black giant.","\"Actually, it's not that feeble. It used to chase after the ball, but it's just a bit too timid,\" mused the lead blue giant.","The pink female giant sighed. \"After all, it was a premature birth. That's why I suggested having it stay in the culture fluid for another thirty days.\"","Under normal circumstances, it took a month for an ancient god to undergo technical transformation.","But this steel lion possessed exceptional aptitude. It woke up from its transformation in just a day and a half.","Furthermore, its transformation was quite successful. Judging from the data, it wasn't a failure.","The giant engineers had studied and pondered for quite some time, but they couldn't pinpoint the reason for such a rapid transformation.","Some experienced giant engineers speculated that the steel lion actively cooperated with the transformation process, which explained its swift change into the Godslayer.","However... condensing the thirty-day conversion time into one and a half days raised concerns about potential side effects.","The giants at the base hoped to test the Godslayer Lion Mecha to determine if its performance had been impacted by its premature birth.","It was worth noting that this mecha had an odd and challenging name - Tyrannical Song.","When the giants gathered around the mecha to contemplate its name, a particular name appeared inexplicably in their minds.","Tyrannical Song!","This name had an unusual pronunciation, and its meaning was unclear, but it gained unanimous approval from all the giants in the base.","The mecha was ultimately christened Tyrannical Song.","...","...","Coincidentally, as the giants in the base were preparing to test the performance of Tyrannical Song the Mecha, a distress signal arrived from the Godslayer base in the neighboring city!","Half an hour earlier, the neighboring city had been attacked by an ancient god — a peculiar ball-shaped one.","This ball-shaped ancient god possessed the unique ability to 'split' and dividing into three entities to engage more opponents. The Godslayer base in the neighboring city struggled to handle it, prompting them to send a distress signal to the nearby Godslayer base.","It was a rare opportunity!","So, in order to assess the capabilities of Tyrannical Song, under the leadership of the blue giant, the lion mecha was launched to the neighboring city to actively assist the in defending against the ancient god threat.","Upon Tyrannical Song's arrival at the battlefield, the subterranean giants observed its first battle against the ball-shaped ancient god through surveillance screens.","Initially, the freshly awakened lion mecha, Tyrannical Song, did not disappoint. It was highly active.","It proactively pursued the split bodies of the ball-shaped ancient god while emitting strange sounds from its vocal system.","The meaning of these strange vocalizations was unclear, but they bore some resemblance to the syllables Tyrannical Song.","The split-body ancient god seemed incapable of holding its own against the lion, constantly evading its attacks.","In the end, it found itself pinned under Tyrannical Song's claws and was on the brink of being torn apart.","When the giants at the base witnessed this scene, smiles spread across their faces.","\"Despite the premature birth, Tyrannical Song's data looks promising,\" crossed their minds.","But just as they were feeling optimistic, the ball-shaped ancient god suddenly transformed into a fierce tiger and delivered a devastating blow to Tyrannical Song.","Then, the scene played out on the surveillance camera.","The tiger began to pursue the lion while emitting the same nonsensical syllables that Tyrannical Song had earlier.","In fact, based on the data, Tyrannical Song had the power to contend with the ancient god.","The black giant remarked, \"But it immediately became timid after being knocked over.\"","\"Captain, the test is almost complete. Should we summon the lion back?\" suggested the pink female giant. She felt that their base's reputation had suffered enough, and Tyrannical Song's test had served its purpose.","The premature birth of Tyrannical Song had indeed revealed its flaws.","It would be best to let it remain for another thirty days to complete the transformation period, possibly ironing out those issues.","\"Don't panic. Tyrannical Song's data isn't much worse than the ancient god's. Right now, it may look pathetic, but it's not dangerous. With it around, we can at least stall an ancient god clone and create an opportunity for the Godslayer at the neighboring base to take down the ancient god,\" reassured the blue giant while maintaining a composed demeanor.","Just as the blue giant was engaged in a serious analysis, the fierce tiger suddenly pounced on Tyrannical Song.","\"Ahhh, I'm going to die, I'm going to die,\" Tyrannical Song let out a series of mournful cries.","\"What?\" The tiger, an ancient god, stuck out its tongue, lined with sharp barbs. \"Are you scared of me? Are you scared of me?\"","\"Aaah ~\" Tyrannical Song struggled intensely.","\"Are you scared of me? Are you scared of me?\" The fierce tiger, still in its ancient god form, didn't release its hold on Tyrannical Song and continued licking it.","The city's defense system locked onto the tiger and unleashed a barrage of fire.","However, the tiger paid no heed to the artillery fire and allowed it to pound against its body.","\"Switch to Tyrannical Song's control mode and give the order to release the steel flying claw to blast the target away,\" instructed the blue giant. The inspiration for this move had come from the steel flying fist of the mutated ancient god, and it was a surprising choice.","The Godslayer had three modes: automatic, semi-guided, and manual.","In manual mode, the pilot could enter the Godslayer and operate it.","The semi-guided mode allowed remote guidance for combat support.","Boom!","Tyrannical Song raised its right front claw and launched an attack on the tiger, formed from the ancient god.","The tiger transformed from the ancient god opened its mouth and leaped up to catch Tyrannical Song's steel claw like a frisbee.","With a gulp, Tyrannical Song's steel claw was swallowed.","The steel flying fist was not a skill just anyone could wield.","The scene became awkward and deathly silent.","After swallowing Tyrannical Song's steel claw, the fierce tiger, transformed from the ancient god, also ceased its assault.","Tyrannical Song also came to a halt, as if it had lost its core.","Inside the steel claw, \"We've been swallowed?\" Black Feather murmured.","\"Don't worry, both Chu and I have recovered and can leave at any time,\" said Stone Tablet slowly.","\"Ah, my right hand!\" Suddenly, Song Shuhang, who had been frozen, opened his eyes and exclaimed."]},{"number":2376,"title":"Chapter 2376 Unknown White 20-30 Missing 23","paragraphs":["In that ordinary dream of lions and tigers, Song Lion's right front claw was brutally bitten off by a ruthless tiger.","Song Shuhang was startled and woke up abruptly.","As he opened his eyes, the ice covering his body rapidly melted away and left behind cold, gem-like crystals.","The dark-skinned Soft Feather, after a brief thought, picked up some of the larger ice crystals with the thought they might come in handy in the future.","\"Hey? Where are we?\" Song Shuhang asked in confusion.","\"We're inside the newly transformed right claw of your Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure,\" replied the sword.","Song Shuhang brushed off the remaining ice crystals from his body and inquired, \"What happened after I passed out?\"","\"It's a long story.\"","\"We were swallowed by a ball-shaped ancient god,\" informed the black-skinned Soft Feather.","\"Your Combined Magical Treasure has undergone an upgrade,\" added the sword.","\"You were sent to the neighboring city to battle the ancient gods,\" chimed in Pavilion Master Chu while looking somewhat dazed.","Song Shuhang was left speechless. It seemed that a lot had happened while he was unconscious.","\"Is everyone okay?\" Song Shuhang extended his hand, and his entire body emitted a virtuous light that illuminated the entire space.","Black-skinned Soft Feather, Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Dumb Hair Chu, Defiant Whale Fairy, Fairy Creation, Lady Onion, and the hamster in his pocket—everyone was present.","However, along with Song Shuhang and his companions, there was also a human head floating in the space.","It was a figure with hair that reached the ground and a shimmering effect.","\"Senior White Three?\" Song Shuhang's heart skipped a beat.","The figure turned to look at Song Shuhang but remained silent.","After a while, it extended its hand and pressed it against Song Shuhang's waist.","\"Again?\" Song Shuhang was startled. It seemed like he was about to lose consciousness again.","Senior White Three's palm was as cold as before, but this time, it didn't transmit strength. Instead, it pressed against a mark on Song Shuhang's waist.","It was the Super Learning God System that Senior White had created in the main world.","Senior White and the other two Whites seemed to be extracting information from it. Their spell creation ideas were very similar, and they shared many similarities.","Back when Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, the creator of White Wielder of the Will, had read information from Song Shuhang's Academic Genius System, the situation had been similar.","Senior White Three was no exception.","A moment later, Senior White Three opened his eyes and said, \"Return Number 23 to me.\"","Song Shuhang was puzzled. \"Number 23?\"","\"Give Number 23 back to me,\" Senior White Three repeated.","Song Shuhang suddenly recalled the name 'Unknown White 23' that had appeared on his friend list when he added the Golden Core using the QR code.","A suspicion arose in his mind.","At the same time, he reached out and displayed the Golden Core QR code on his palm and handed it to Senior White Three.","Senior White Three lowered his head and examined the QR code of the Golden Core. He remained silent for a moment before sending his mental energy upward.","\"Ding! Unknown White 20-30 has added you as a friend. Friend list: Mysterious Friend.\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","So, Numbers 20-30 were looking for Number 23?","If taken literally, Senior White Three was composed of Numbers 20 to 30, but Number 23 was missing?","Was Number 23 the one who had left the lion phantom in his original dantian?","In other words, if they were separated, there could potentially be at least 30 similar Senior Whites?","Given the characteristics of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique, could there be 33 Senior Whites in total?","\"Now, return Number 23 to me,\" Senior White Three urged, his gaze fixed on Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang shook his head and explained, \"Senior White, I don't know where your 23 went. In fact, he disappeared after our last encounter.\"","\"In that case, I'll retrieve it myself,\" Senior White Three declared.","He reached out his hand and placed it on Song Shuhang's stomach.","A terrifying suction force emanated from his icy palm. Song Shuhang felt like his navel was about to be pulled out. But apart from that, he didn't experience anything else.","Unknown White 20-30, missing 23: \"...\"","He continued to apply suction, but there was no result.","After a while, he changed his approach.","A frigid energy surged directly into Song Shuhang's body from Senior White Three's hand.","Song Shuhang was familiar with this method!","His body didn't resist Senior White's energy, and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique even activated automatically.","Soon, illusory figures began to coalesce around Song Shuhang's nascent soul.","Elephant, camel, cat, tiger, shark, eagle, rat demon, gem mink, wild boar, giant bear...","Ten figures in total, including the small black lion from earlier, appeared in an orderly fashion.","After the natal Nascent Soul, ten beast shadows appeared alongside the fat whale Golden Core and the seven small Nascent Souls.","The aura surrounding Song Shuhang became increasingly profound, and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique became more active.","This time, there were no ice crystals forming on his body. It seemed that his body had grown accustomed to this change.","Unknown White 20-30 and White 23 released their hold on Song Shuhang's body after a while.","His body became somewhat translucent.","\"Senior White, are you alright?\" Song Shuhang extended his hand to support Unknown White 20-30 - 23. Simultaneously, his right hand secretly activated the secret appraisal technique, and his body entered the pseudo-immortal state.","He was very curious about the identity of Senior White Three.","In the main world, Senior White had a special status. Senior White Two had just become the ruler of the Netherworld, while Senior White of the Wielder of the Will was currently in a state of concealment and left behind only a stand-in.","So what was the identity of Senior White Three?","Was he the contingency plan? Was he the 'younger sibling' that Senior White had left behind for himself?","Moreover, these Senior White Threes seemed capable of merging and separating.","Bang! Song Shuhang's smoke-like body burst like a balloon.","Appraisal came at a high cost, which Song Shuhang had anticipated.","[Unknown White 20-30, missing 23: Appraisal failed.]","He had paid a hefty price, but he had gained nothing.","At this moment, Unknown White appeared deep in thought. Then, he reached out and seized something.","In the air, he grasped an eye—Song Shuhang's divine?third eye.","Unknown White's eyes brightened, and they transformed into countless data forms.","A wave of data in the hundreds of millions rushed into Song Shuhang.","It was precisely the data that Senior White No. 23 had cut off from the transmission.","Countless data flowed into the divine third eye and Song Shuhang's consciousness.","By combining the data of Senior White No. 23, a prototype of data was formed.","This massive amount of data contained detailed information about the composition of all living beings in this artificial world!"]},{"number":2377,"title":"Chapter 2377 Senior White’s Sense of Urgency","paragraphs":["The data was incredibly vast and detailed.","It encompassed the names of every resident giant in the artificial world fragment and their data from birth to the present. However, due to the incomplete data package in Song Shuhang's mind, the life data of these residents was intermittent.","Not only that, but the data also included even more information.","It covered both living beings and inanimate objects, including animals, plants, trees, and even the structure of the man-made small world.","One could say that this data package constituted an entire world!","But why would these 'unknown Whites' carry such data with them?","After transmitting all the data packets to Song Shuhang, Unknown White 20-30-23 retracted his divine third eye.","\"Senior White.\" Song Shuhang's reconstituting body began to recover. \"Can you enlighten me about your nature and purpose?\"","If the secret appraisal technique couldn't provide answers, why not ask him directly?","\"What kind of existence?\" Unknown White raised an eyebrow, appearing puzzled.","A moment later, he suddenly adopted a serene expression and joined his palms together, mirroring Number 23. His body disintegrated into particles and vanished, just like his counterpart.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","As Unknown White 20-30-23 disappeared, the ancient god in the external world vanished as well.","The steel lion's right front claw fell to the ground.","The crisis involving the ancient god was inexplicably resolved.","Beside a lake on Spirit Butterfly Island, Sage Monarch White slowly opened his eyes.","He had just awakened, and his vision was still hazy from sleep.","\"Senior White is awake.\" Soft Feather's voice echoed from a distance.","At the moment, she was frolicking on the water with the virtuous lamia. Upon noticing that Senior White had awakened, the virtuous lamia gracefully swam to the shore alongside Soft Feather while skimming across the waves.","\"I woke up just now,\" Senior White replied with a smile. \"I was experimenting with the God Creation Plan... but I drifted off to sleep midway.\"","Approaching them were Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue with hands held.","Behind them followed Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly and Xuan Nu Sect's Skylark.","The group settled beside Sage Monarch White.","\"Fellow Daoist White, do you have any progress regarding your plan to create a deity?\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue inquired with curiosity.","\"Yes, not long ago, I successfully established a connection with the Dream Realm. The Dream Realm is a tiny plane within the myriad worlds, well-suited for my plan. Presently, I've completed approximately eighty percent of the embryonic structure of the spell within the Dream Realm. Once the remaining twenty percent is done, I can proceed to the next phase of the plan,\" Senior White confirmed.","Since the plane designated for the creation of deities was the Dream Realm, Senior White needed to enter a deep slumber to carry out the plan.","\"Senior White, you woke up earlier than anticipated this time. Did something happen?\" Soft Feather inquired while making an effort to maintain her refined demeanor.","\"Yes, I was originally planning to construct all the structures within the Dream Realm in a single session, but I dozed off midway,\" Senior White admitted.","During his nap, he had inexplicably dreamed of Little Friend Shuhang... It was an embarrassing matter he preferred not to share with his fellow cultivators.","\"Senior White, are you not planning to rest a bit longer?\" Soft Feather asked.","\"I can't afford to rest any longer. It felt... urgent,\" Senior White replied with a slightly furrowed brow.","\"Urgent?\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue inquired with bewilderment.","\"Yes,\" Senior White nodded.","He sensed that time was of the essence. The faster the God Creation Plan was completed, the better.","\"Is there some impending danger, like the Heavenly Dao Molt?\" Lord Spirit Butterfly speculated.","\"I'm uncertain. I simply have this inexplicable feeling,\" Senior White confessed.","The expressions of the Saint Monarchs grew solemn.","What could be causing Sage Monarch White to feel a sense of urgency?","\"I'll contact Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain and have him notify the group members to be on standby. Spirit Butterfly Island will be on high alert,\" Lord Spirit Butterfly declared.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue nodded and added, \"I'll also inform our group members.\"","Soft Feather was perplexed. \"???\"","\"People, don't get too nervous. This sense of urgency is not really one birthed from a sense of crisis. Otherwise, I would have warned you long ago.\" Senior White quickly added.","When everyone heard this, they immediately heaved a sigh of relief.","\"I'll go to the Dream Realm again and try to finish drawing the prototype of the spell today.\" Senior White took out a bottle of medicinal pills, swallowed one, closed his eyes, and fell asleep while maintaining his meditating posture.","Soft Feather took out a large umbrella from her size-reducing purse and placed it beside Sage Monarch White.","\"Do we still need to inform Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain?\" Lord Spirit Butterfly asked.","\"It's best to inform the fellow daoists in the group to be prepared. I also have to inform my sect members.\" Xuan Nu Sect's Skylark said. She noticed that after Sage Monarch White woke up, he didn't actually rest. He only chatted with everyone for a while before taking a pill and entering the Dream Realm.","In other words, he probably woke up this time to give everyone a sense of urgency.","Therefore, no matter what the sense of urgency was, it was never wrong to let everyone be prepared first.","In the small world, the lion Godslayer was retrieved and brought back to the underground base of the city.","The right claw that had been shot out was also reassembled.","Song Shuhang didn't resist. He and his pendants were hidden in the right claw, and these colorful giants didn't notice them. In this way, he had successfully infiltrated them. He was too lazy to expose himself.","At that moment, Song Shuhang was having a meeting with the pendants.","\"Seniors, what do you think Senior White, who has appeared one after another among the ancient gods, is?\" Song Shuhang brought up the main topic of today's meeting.","\"First of all, let's go with the process of elimination. The White that appears one after another is definitely not a robot,\" the sword said seriously.","Song Shuhang waved his hand and shot twenty-two consecutive shots of the Saber Nurturing Technique, calming the sword down.","\"Let's go with the process of elimination. The White that appears one after another is definitely not the current Sage Monarch White.\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said.","As they were talking, a figure slowly took shape in the center of the crowd.","He had a handsome face, long hair that reached the ground, and was wearing a tight-fitting combat suit.","\"Eh? Why is it little friend Shuhang again?\" Senior White said.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless."]},{"number":2378,"title":"Chapter 2378 The Final Time","paragraphs":["The familiar tone and welcoming presence were unmistakable.","\"Senior White?\" Song Shuhang ventured to ask.","\"Headache.\" Senior White, who had just taken form, rubbed his temples. \"Though it's quite intriguing, I'm on a tight schedule.\"","Song Shuhang looked puzzled.","\"It's Senior White from our world!\" exclaimed Black-skinned Soft Feather, elated.","Meanwhile, the hilt of the sword transformed into an extended arm and lightly struck the surface of the stone tablet.","\"What are you doing?\" protested Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","\"The Great Monument Breaking Hand just touched your monument,\" chuckled the sword. Its actions were fitting for a Heart Demon, known for its immense power. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, despite lacking a face, had multiple tablet surfaces to contend with and made it a rather troublesome opponent.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was left speechless.","He was now certain that the sword was indeed a heart demon.","\"Whether this is the Senior White from our world or not, we'll find out soon!\" Song Shuhang declared with a heroic pat on his chest.","If he wanted to test Senior White, he had a twelve-word mantra.","The crucial point was that all the unknown whites before him had long hair that reached the ground.","The newly formed Senior White looked baffled.","He swept his hand behind him and felt the thick, long hair there.","Then he glanced at Song Shuhang and immediately felt a headache coming on.","\"No matter what you want to say... Just hold it in for now. Afterward, think it through before speaking,\" Senior White kindly advised him.","Taking heed of Senior White's advice, Song Shuhang reached into his pocket and retrieved a golden core QR code.","The newly formed Senior White used his mental energy to scan the two-dimensional code on the golden core.","\"Ding! Unknown White 1-19 has added you as a friend. Friend list: Mysterious Friend.\"","Song Shuhang remarked, \"Still an unknown White? And there are models 1 to 19.\"","Senior White was left speechless.","He rubbed his temples again.","Both sides fell into silence.","\"To be honest, I'm in a hurry right now. But as expected, this dream was a bit peculiar. So, I came here to confirm some things,\" Senior White sighed while reaching up to tie his long hair into a ponytail.","Song Shuhang, Black-skinned Soft Feather, Fairy Creation, and a string of pendants all sat in a row.","They could all sense that although this person looked like Unknown White 1-19, he was most likely Senior White from their world.","\"Shuhang, where are you right now?\" asked Ponytail Senior White.","\"I'm in a man-made world fragment. It's quite ancient, a small world that has existed since primordial times. I suspect it's related to the Second Wielder of the Will,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"I also suspect it might have something to do with Master White of the Heavenly Axiom, as there are traces of him here,\" added Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","\"Not the Dream Realm?\" inquired Ponytail Senior White. Having heard about the traces left by White Wielder of the Will, he already had a clue.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and then replied, \"It doesn't seem to be related to the Dream Realm. We entered this man-made small world directly from the entrance of our world. However, this world is indeed peculiar. In fact, I've come into contact with two unknown Whites here before—'Unknown White 23' and 'Unknown White 20-30, Missing 23.' They both possess extensive data and the unique energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique. Their data seems to encompass everything within this entire artificial small world. If we follow this data, we could potentially recreate an entire world.\"","\"Data? A unique Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique?\" Ponytail Senior White mused while pinching his chin in thought.","Then, his eyes lit up. \"Show me the data you have.\"","Perhaps he could use this data to construct an entire small world in the future.","Could it be a contingency plan left behind by Heavenly Dao White?","\"No problem,\" Song Shuhang replied, extending his hand and activating his divine third eye.","Senior White's eyes met Song Shuhang's divine third eye.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang's head began to throb.","As he transmitted the data to Ponytail Senior White, an immense amount of data also surged into his own mind from the eyes of Unknown White 1-19.","Information was exchanged.","The data package in Song Shuhang's mind became more refined.","This time, the contents of the data package were incredibly vast, and the exchange took a considerable amount of time.","Just as Song Shuhang felt like his head was about to explode, the contents of data packets 1-19 were finally transmitted.","However, there was still a discrepancy. Data packets 31 to 33 were missing.","\"Incomplete data packets?\" queried Ponytail Senior White.","\"If the unknown white in this world corresponds to the attributes of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique, then there should be data packets 31, 32, and 33,\" Song Shuhang explained.","Ponytail Senior White nodded. After a brief moment, he got up and approached Song Shuhang. \"I'm pressed for time. I'll use this body to complete the transmission of power. After that, I'll depart. You find a way to gather the remaining three sets of data and deliver them to me when you return to our world. My physical body is resting on Spirit Butterfly Island.\"","\"Senior White, what's so urgent?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"I'm not entirely sure of the details, but I sense that something very important is about to occur... I need to complete the God Creation Plan before that happens. Shuhang, don't neglect your cultivation,\" Ponytail Senior White reminded him.","Senior White's words instilled a sense of urgency and crisis in Song Shuhang.","Even Senior White, favored by the world, felt impending danger. Could it be that the universe was on the brink of destruction?","\"I will work diligently on my cultivation,\" Song Shuhang assured him seriously.","Ponytail Senior White nodded and placed his hand on Song Shuhang's lower abdomen to infuse him with a frigid, unique energy.","\"Huh? This energy...\" Ponytail Senior White murmured softly as he transmitted the energy.","\"Senior White, do you recognize this special energy?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","However, as he spoke, Unknown White 1-19 began to look confused. His expression gradually froze and rendered him almost paralyzed.","But his hand remained on Song Shuhang's lower abdomen, and the energy continued to flow in.","Song Shuhang could only grit his teeth and endure the changes in his original core.","Beast shadows began to form around his natal Nascent Soul and fat whale golden core.","Above Song Shuhang's head, Pavilion Master Chu began to spin slightly.","A sense of urgency enveloped him.","Song Shuhang's advancement was already pressing, and any further urgency would have been unbearable for other cultivators.","Furthermore, his next advancement would elevate him to a genuine Eighth Stage Profound Sage, right?","The next time would be his true display of divinity and Profound Sage's teachings.","It would also be the final time.","\"Oh, I almost forgot about the teachings,\" Pavilion Master Chu reminded him.","How should Song Shuhang approach his next teachings?","Song Shuhang had displayed his divinity four times, and each time had introduced something new. But this time, he had not prepared material for his teachings."]},{"number":2379,"title":"Chapter 2379 Love Through Fights and Scolding","paragraphs":["\"Indeed, if Senior Song advances again, it will officially be his seventh promotion to the Eighth Stage. At that point, it will be his true display of divinity and the Profound Sage Speech segment,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather nodded in agreement.","The practitioners from various realms across the universe were bracing themselves for the fifth appearance of Tyrannical Song on stage.","Fortunately, this would mark Senior Song's final speech as long as nothing unexpected happened.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired, \"Is the speech manuscript ready?\"","\"As for the speech manuscript, there's no need to worry. However, for the next speech, it's my last one, and I hope to deliver it using my true abilities,\" Song Shuhang pondered.","In his previous speeches, he had always been a 'counterfeit.' Since he was a counterfeit, using pre-written speeches or resorting to external aids to deliver the speech was perfectly acceptable.","However, for the upcoming speech, if he truly advanced to the Profound Sage stage, relying on someone else's speech manuscript would be somewhat inappropriate—it was not just any speech, but his final one. He wanted to deliver it using his own genuine abilities.","\"Let me tell a joke. Shuhang said he wants to deliver his speech using his true abilities,\" remarked the sword solemnly.","\"Hahaha, that got a laugh out of me. What about the rest of you?\" chimed in the hamster.","Fairy Creation sang, \"Song ~ Ah ~ Smile ~\"","\"...\"","Song Shuhang was left bewildered.","\"Why do you assume my speech will fail? I don't want to miss my last opportunity. If possible... I'd like to gather the final surge of powerful light of virtue to help the virtuous lamia evolve further,\" declared Song Shuhang.","This was his last Profound Sage Speech, an opportunity that couldn't be missed. Moreover, Song Shuhang had a gut feeling that this final speech was of utmost importance.","It might even be a turning point.","As his cultivation realm advanced, Song Shuhang's 'cultivator's intuition' came into play.","\"Well, actually... I believe that Shuhang's speech won't fail,\" said Pavilion Master Chu reassuringly. \"We may know that this is his last Profound Sage Speech, but the other practitioners in the universe don't.\"","\"That's a valid point. Since we don't know whether Profound Sage Tyrannical Song will deliver another divinity show speech, as long as Song Shuhang takes the stage... no one in the universe would dare to give him a bad review,\" the hamster agreed while stroking its whiskers with its paw.","What if someone gave a bad review and disrupted the appearance of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's speech? What if they suddenly used the expert appraisal technique to take revenge?","The ironclad rule of the Profound Sage Speech required the speaker to reveal their true face. However, this rule had already been blatantly disregarded by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song during the last speech.","Everyone in the universe knew that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had mastered the art of avoiding the Profound Sage Speech and could alter his age or even change his appearance at will.","Thus, as long as Profound Sage Tyrannical Song took the stage to deliver a speech, all practitioners in the universe would at least show him respect. Even if he didn't utter a word, everyone would still willingly offer the basic 'wish power.'","Even if Song Shuhang took the stage and announced that it was his final speech, there would probably be fewer than ten people in the universe who truly believed him.","\"When viewed in this light, Shuhang's speech is quite secure. It's truly enviable,\" commented the sword.","At this moment, Lady Onion suddenly had a thought and asked, \"Shuhang, you were so confident earlier. Do you already have a speech idea?\"","\"Yes, I want to talk to the practitioners in the universe about my cultivation chat ability.\" Song Shuhang clasped his hands together to produce a golden core QR code in his palm.","However, this idea was still in its infancy. To use the cultivation chat function as the content of his speech, Song Shuhang needed to refine and write a solid speech manuscript.","\"It's still early for me to advance to the Eighth Stage. I have plenty of time to prepare for this speech,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile as he dissipated the golden core QR code.","Currently, he had no clear plan for advancing to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm.","The phantom of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts, given to him by the unknown White, was a promising path to strengthen himself. However, Song Shuhang wasn't certain if he could elevate his realm further after gathering all the phantoms of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts.","\"Terrifying,\" unexpectedly remarked the sword.","\"Spine-tingling,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet added.","\"Only Senior Song would come up with such a terrifying speech idea,\" echoed Black-skinned Soft Feather.","Song Shuhang was perplexed.","What was there to be frightened of when using the cultivation chat as the basis for his speech?","\"Let's put aside the Profound Sage Speech for now and focus on how you plan to enhance your strength,\" suggested Pavilion Master Chu.","\"It appears that the next step is to locate Unknown White 31, 32, and 33.\" After saying this much, Song Shuhang opened his friend list.","At this moment, there was a change in the mysterious list within his friend list.","The three \"Unknown Whites\" in the list merged into one, becoming \"Unknown Whites 1-30, Separable.\"","To find the remaining three Unknown Whites, Song Shuhang would need to see if he could communicate with the Unknown Whites within his friend list.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and messaged Unknown Whites 1-30, Separable: \"Senior White, do you know the whereabouts of Unknown Whites 31, 32, and 33?\"","\"When the Ancient God sleeping within this world awakens, all living beings in this world will vanish. Numbers 31, 32, and 33 serve as the final safeguards to seal the Ancient God,\" replied Unknown White.","Seal safeguards?","The 33 Unknown Whites were all part of the sealing process to protect the inhabitants of this artificially created small world?","\"In that case, why did you attack the giants in this world?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","Did he have to occasionally beat up these giants to protect them?","Could this be the saying that 'love means tough love'?"]},{"number":2380,"title":"Chapter 2380 You Can Do It, Believe In Yourself!","paragraphs":["The deeper the love, the more intense the battle.","\"It's a responsibility,\" replied Unknown White 1-30.","Song Shuhang was puzzled. \"???\"","\"After each cycle of reincarnation, we descend in the form of the ancient gods to activate and maintain the concept of the ancient gods in this world to ensure that its inhabitants never forget. That's the purpose of our existence,\" explained Unknown White.","In a way, they acted like thorns and maintained a level of suffering to keep the world's creatures in a certain state.","Song Shuhang fell into a contemplative silence.","\"So, the beings in this world have been in a cycle of reincarnation all along?\" he asked.","\"Yes,\" confirmed Unknown White.","\"And how many cycles of reincarnation have we been through?\" inquired Song Shuhang.","\"We... I can't recall exactly,\" responded Unknown White wearily. The beings in this world had been cycling through reincarnations, and the Unknown Whites hadn't participated in the process.","...","...","\"Senior Song, did you learn anything?\" Black-skinned Soft Feather asked when Song Shuhang's expression turned grave.","Song Shuhang recounted his conversation with 'Unknown White' and the revelations about the seal.","\"It's becoming clear.\" Pavilion Master Chu nodded. \"Aside from these 'Unknown Whites,' all the living beings in this world are also part of the seal.\"","\"So, what exactly is this ancient god sealed in this world? Why did they have to pay such a high price to seal it? Couldn't even Master Bai deal with it?\" pondered Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet in confusion.","Perhaps this ancient god held significant meaning in its existence, which was why Heavenly Axiom White hadn't chosen to erase it but had gone to such lengths to leave behind 33 Unknown Whites to collaborate with the world's inhabitants in sealing it?","\"If that's the case, aren't the beings in this world quite pitiable?\" Lady Onion remarked softly.","Endless cycles of reincarnation while constantly living out a predetermined 'script.'","Lady Onion couldn't help but empathize with their plight.","\"They volunteered... Becoming part of the seal and entering an endless cycle of reincarnation was their own choice,\" Unknown White suddenly replied to Song Shuhang's message.","...It seemed that the Unknown White could hear the conversation between Song Shuhang and the pendants.","They appeared to be omnipresent.","\"Willingly?\" Song Shuhang nodded. Once a choice was made, one had to accept the consequences, no matter how bitter they might be. People were responsible for their actions, and if they courted their own destruction, they would meet it—a matter of karma.","\"Senior White, why did you choose to contact me? Is it fate?\" Song Shuhang inquired further.","Since the Unknown White was part of the seal, Song Shuhang wondered why they had contacted him and helped him elevate his Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique.","Was it fate?","Perhaps it was due to his frequent interactions with White, but Song Shuhang had a mysterious sense that all the Senior Whites in the universe were somehow connected to him by fate.","\"Fatigue. We're tired... Or I'm tired.\" Unexpectedly, it was Unknown White 23 who replied.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","It was like getting slapped in the face.","\"So, Senior White and the others want me to undertake the task of sealing the ancient god? You want me to stimulate the beings trapped in the cycle of reincarnation on your behalf?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"That's what Number 23 thinks. Some of our members may share the same thoughts,\" replied Unknown White 1-30.","\"But I have a nobler idea.\" Unknown White No. 1 chimed in.","If it weren't for the fact that the numbers after 'Unknown White' changed with each reply, Song Shuhang might have thought he was conversing with a Senior White with split personalities.","\"Senior White, please go on.\"","\"I am the only one who realizes that the seal on the ancient god is nearing its limit. The number of beings in the cycle of reincarnation is dwindling. After the last cycle, many beings entered an eternal slumber and didn't awaken,\" Unknown White 1 explained.","\"Why didn't we know about this?\" questioned Unknown White 2-30.","\"So, I'm 1, and you guys are 2-30,\" replied Unknown White 1.","Song Shuhang remarked, \"Indeed, the ancient god is about to awaken.\"","Upon entering this world, White Two's automatic fortune-telling system had provided a clear hint: the dormant ancient god in the small world was on the verge of waking up, and all the world's inhabitants would become its sacrifices. The method Song Shuhang needed to confront the fat ball's clone was hidden in this small world. It appeared that Unknown White 1-33 could potentially be his stroke of luck.","\"In that case, Senior White No. 1, what do you expect from me by contacting me?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"The revival of the ancient god is inevitable, which renders the seal meaningless... I wish to transfer all the beings trapped in this world's cycle of reincarnation. Their sacrifices have been sufficient. It's time to set them free,\" declared Unknown White 1.","It sounded... logical.","However, a thought suddenly crossed Song Shuhang's mind. Quick-witted individuals could entertain peculiar notions at times.","\"What if Unknown White 1 is the ancient god?\"","This notion lingered in Song Shuhang's mind.","If all the beings in this world were transferred, the seal on the ancient god would vanish and allow it to break free easily...","Song Shuhang's mind raced with possibilities, and he couldn't shake this unsettling idea.","\"Senior White, what can I do in this situation? I'm not powerful enough to transfer all the beings in this world,\" Song Shuhang replied with a composed tone.","\"No, you can do it,\" responded Unknown White 1 with unwavering confidence.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"That data is the source of all beings' reincarnations. You only need to obtain the complete data package to collect all the beings,\" Unknown White 1 explained.","As Song Shuhang contemplated this, his imagination ran wild. He envisioned a day in the future when heavenly tribulations would descend, and a university student named Song Shuhang would step forward, leading an entire world and billions of souls, confronting the heavenly tribulation head-on. The group would transcend the tribulation momentarily before being cremated, with over a billion participants. What kind of reaction would the heavenly tribulation lord have if the transcending group numbered over a billion?","As he visualized this scenario, Song Shuhang's heart trembled. He struggled to maintain his stoic expression as he replied, \"But aren't Numbers 31-33 the last part of the seal?\"","\"We have a way for you to contact Numbers 31-33,\" replied Unknown White No. 1."]},{"number":2381,"title":"Chapter 2381 Senior White, I’ve Found A Loophole!","paragraphs":["\"What's the plan?\" Song Shuhang asked cautiously.","\"With the combined power of us all, Numbers 1-30, we can temporarily create an interface and send you to the source of this world. There, you can meet Numbers 31-33 and obtain their data to acquire the complete data package,\" Unknown White No. 1 replied.","Unknown White 2-30 agreed. \"Sounds good. Let's give it a try.\"","Song Shuhang stroked his chin in thought and then said, \"Senior White No. 1, before we proceed, can I have a private conversation with you?\"","\"Why a private chat?\" Unknown White No. 1 asked in confusion.","\"Why do a private chat?\" Unknown White 2-30 also seemed puzzled. They wondered why Song Shuhang wanted to talk to No. 1 alone.","\"Because the question I'm about to ask might get me in trouble. If I were to ask all thirty Senior Whites this question at once, I'd have to endure thirty beatings. So, I'd like to question you one by one and only get beaten up once at a time. I think I can handle that,\" Song Shuhang explained seriously.","Unknown White 2-30 remained silent.","Unknown White No. 1 replied, \"I understand.\"","After a while, the entry for 'Unknown White 1-30 can be separated' in Song Shuhang's friend list split into two.","After the data separation, Unknown White No. 1 sent a single period to Song Shuhang: \".\"","Song Shuhang, with a mischievous grin, said, \"Senior White, have you ever truly been in love in your life?\"","Unknown White No. 1 responded with confusion. \"???\"","\"Because I saw you growing your long hair,\" Song Shuhang said with a straight face.","Unknown White No. 1 retorted, \"We were born with long hair.\"","Song Shuhang pondered while pinching his chin. It seemed that Unknown White No. 1 didn't mind discussing the topic of long hair at all.","Should he dig deeper into this?","Song Shuhang felt like he was standing at the edge of an abyss while reaching out hesitantly. However, after a moment of contemplation, he realized that pursuing this topic further wouldn't yield the answers he sought. The Unknown Whites might just be backup entities left behind by White Heavenly Axiom, and dwelling on the topic of long hair wasn't productive.","Continuing down this path wouldn't provide the information he needed.","Moreover, he couldn't use the 'Twelve Words of Truth' every time he encountered an unknown Senior White.","\"When you have questions, feel free to ask. Don't lay the foundation first,\" Unknown White No. 1 said.","Song Shuhang replied, \"Then let me get straight to the point. Senior White, as a crucial part of the 'seal,' is it possible for you to be influenced by the ancient god, like a system infected by a virus?\"","While conversing with Unknown White, Song Shuhang discreetly activated a simple illusion by his side. Under the illusion's cover, he replaced the 'steel lion' transformed by the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts 'Combined Magical Treasure' with the 'destruction giant.'","The despair-inducing Destruction Giant appeared with a resounding impact.","However, on the monitor screen, the Combined Magical Treasure still appeared as the steel lion.","At the same time, a notification sounded in Song Shuhang's mind. \"System prompt: Despair value +3. Current despair value: 8.\"","Song Shuhang couldn't help but think, \"Hehehe, Senior White Two, I've found a loophole.\"","While taking advantage of the unpatched hole, Song Shuhang swiftly put away the Destruction Giant and summoned it again.","\"System Notification: Despair Points +3. Current Despair Points: 11.\"","What a delightful way to accumulate Despair Points!","Exploiting loopholes was always satisfying.","With 11 despair points, Song Shuhang could use Senior White Two's automatic divination system once.","The timing was perfect.","Just as Song Shuhang amassed 11 despair value points, Unknown White No. 1 pondered for a moment and responded, \"In theory, we shouldn't be affected. We are divided into 33 distinct consciousnesses, and even if a specific 'individual' were influenced by the ancient god, the fusion process would purify the influence.\"","With Unknown White No. 1's response in mind, Song Shuhang quickly activated 'Senior White Two's automatic divination system' to divine his future!","The automatic divination system sprang to life.","Song Shuhang's consciousness entered the system and was greeted by a charming wallpaper featuring 'Senior White Two holding a divination plate and smiling with his head tilted.'","For a mere 10 despair points, the divination plate in Senior White Two's hand began to spin rapidly.","Ancient runes emerged from the divination plate. They bounced and landed before Song Shuhang to form a divination image.","Simultaneously, the system's divination function activated.","[Outcome: The enemy is weak, and I am strong. The enemy is old, and I am strong.]","[The recently awakened ancient god is in a weakened state. As long as it can't replenish its energy, it will remain vulnerable and easy to subdue. This is a golden opportunity... While it's weak, you have the chance to acquire the treasures and riches you desire. Just don't get too greedy, and you can emerge unscathed.]","Senior White Two's advice was to take the initiative and seize the opportunity.","It sounded like a solid plan.","Should he utilize this chance to accrue more Despair Points and conduct additional divinations? Song Shuhang pondered.","However, just as he contemplated this, 'Senior White Two's automatic divination system' in his mind unexpectedly delivered a message.","\"Ding! System Notification: The three-day trial period has concluded. The system is now closed. See you again.\"","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","He watched as Senior White Two's automatic divination system turned gray and became inaccessible.","He'd have to request the official version from Senior White later. The trial version was undoubtedly a scam.","\"Do you have any other questions?\" Unknown White No. 1 inquired once more.","\"No, Senior White,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"No, you must have more questions. I'm prepared. What's the question that might get you beaten up afterward?\" Unknown White No. 1 pressed.","\"We'll discuss that after I return alive from the source of the seal,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Unknown White No. 1 was rendered speechless.","\"Senior White, let's take action. Time waits for no one. The ancient god's revival is imminent. We can't afford to waste any more time. Send me to contact Numbers 31, 32, and 33,\" Song Shuhang messaged both Unknown White No. 1 and No. 2-30 simultaneously.","...","...","He closed his eyes and then opened them again.","Song Shuhang found himself at the source of the world, where the last ring of the ancient god was sealed.","It was a circular track.","On the track stood three statues which all resembled the long-haired Senior White.","Upon seeing these statues, Song Shuhang couldn't help but recall the time when he had roused Senior White from his seclusion."]},{"number":2382,"title":"Chapter 2382 Flipping the Table","paragraphs":["\"These three statues should be Unknown Whites 31, 32, and 33,\" remarked the sword.","As Song Shuhang's pendant, it had also been transported here.","Song Shuhang had initially thought he would be the only one transported, but having all the pendants here increased his safety.","\"Should we approach and make contact with them?\" Lady Onion inquired.","\"Since we're already here, it's only natural to approach and make contact,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","\"Be cautious,\" Pavilion Master Chu cautioned.","\"Of course,\" Song Shuhang replied as his gaze shifted from Unknown Whites 31, 32, and 33 to the core of the orbit.","There, a giant fossil egg pulsated like a beating heart.","Could this be the resting place of the ancient god?","If it awakened, it would possess the power to obliterate an entire artificial small world with a mere gesture. It was at least at the Immortal level.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and retrieved two wooden swords from the Universal Magical Bracelet.","These were life-saving items Senior White had left him in the main world—the disposable flying swords designed to break through small black rooms.","Both flying swords served a purpose: one to bring Song Shuhang into the Wielder's small black room for safety, and the other to escape from it. Senior White had full confidence in Song Shuhang's safety due to these two swords.","With the two wooden swords in hand, Song Shuhang advanced toward the giant fossil egg, maneuvering between the three statues of Senior White.","\"What's your plan?\" The hamster inquired curiously.","\"I'm planning an experiment,\" Song Shuhang replied.","He successfully navigated the track.","The last part of the seal, the three Senior White statues, didn't impede Song Shuhang's progress. After all, Song Shuhang's body contained the power of Unknown Whites 1-30.","Arriving beside the egg, Song Shuhang extended his hand and gently touched it to employ his secret appraisal technique.","He didn't wish to discern the origin of the giant egg. With his current realm, even if he tried, he couldn't harm it.","Instead, Song Shuhang utilized the secret appraisal technique to confirm one thing: was this enormous fossil egg an ancient god?","While he suspected the egg's identity, he sought confirmation to avoid mishaps.","Hence, he refrained from identifying the egg's origins but focused on the crucial piece of information: whether this gigantic fossil egg was, indeed, an ancient god.","[Success.] After paying a modest price, Song Shuhang obtained the information he sought.","The secret appraisal technique relayed a message—it confirmed that the giant fossil egg was, in fact, the sealed ancient god.","\"Pleased to meet you, Mr. Ancient God.\" Song Shuhang placed the two disposable flying swords on either side of the massive fossil egg.","He then stepped back and clasped his hands together.","\"My apologies, but my secret appraisal technique isn't advanced enough to determine your name. Nevertheless, it hardly matters. Soon, nobody in the universe will remember you~\"","This was Song Shuhang's daring plan.","It made no difference whether White No. 1 was influenced by the ancient god or not!","Empowered by Senior White Two's divination, Song Shuhang chose the unconventional path to leave others no alternative.","He rubbed his hands gently and activated both disposable flying swords—Small Dark Room Destruction!","Concerned that one flying sword might prove insufficient, he deployed both simultaneously.","\"Let's go~\" Song Shuhang extended his arms, and a white light shone.","Swoosh~~","A brilliant radiance enveloped the enormous fossil egg as the disposable flying swords broke through the constraints of space, transporting the egg to a brand-new Wielder's small black room.","\"No matter how many times I witness it, Senior White's 'disposable flying sword small black room-breaking edition' seems utterly unreasonable,\" Song Shuhang commented.","Regardless of the strength of the spatial seal or the efficacy of the small world's defenses, they all crumbled before the 'disposable flying sword small black room-breaking edition.'","The two wooden swords, one on each side, vanished into space along with the giant fossil egg.","In the ensuing moment, they entered a fresh Wielder's small black room.","It happened so swiftly.","Song Shuhang and his pendants stood in place, rendered speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu was astonished; she hadn't anticipated this course of action from Song Shuhang.","The hamster stared at Song Shuhang in disbelief. Was No. Tyrannical Song truly this clever? His behavior was entirely inconsistent with his former persona!","\"Black-skinned Soft Feather, we need to exercise caution in our dealings with Song Shuhang from now on,\" the sword advised.","While Tyrannical Song appeared outwardly simple and honest, his actions could be exceedingly cunning, especially in the dark.","\"Yes, you're right,\" Pavilion Master Chu agreed.","As they conversed, the memories of the giant fossil egg and the ancient god within the artificial small world began to fade and vanish.","Song Shuhang nodded in acknowledgement.","This indicated that Mr. Ancient God had been successfully relocated to the Wielder's small black room.","The Wielder's small black room was a unique space where not even the Netherworld's ruler could penetrate. Barring any complications, this 'Mr. Ancient God' would find himself within that space.","The two disposable flying swords would self-destruct after transferring the ancient god to the Wielder's small black room and prevent any attempts to study the flying swords.","Song Shuhang clapped his hands and returned to the track.","He then placed his hand on one of the statues.","Who was this Unknown White?","\"Senior White, awaken!\" Song Shuhang proclaimed firmly.","Yet, all that followed was a deafening silence.","\"Perhaps the voice you used to summon him lacked affection. Try calling him with more emotion,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","Song Shuhang sighed.","He initiated the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique and channeled his spiritual energy into the statue.","It proved effective!","Upon encountering the spiritual energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique, the statue promptly disintegrated. Within a few breaths, a long-haired Senior White emerged.","Unknown White gazed at Song Shuhang with a puzzled expression.","\"Hello, Senior White. Welcome back,\" Song Shuhang greeted. Simultaneously, he raised his clothing to reveal the 'Learning God System' at his waist. He then pressed Unknown White's palm onto the system.","Unknown White: \"!!!\"","Fortunately, this move bore fruit. In no time, Unknown White gained valuable knowledge and language from Song Shuhang's 'Learning God System.'","\"Hello, I'm Number 31,\" Unknown White introduced himself.","\"Senior White, let's get straight to the point. I'm familiar with the process,\" Song Shuhang reassured while patting his chest."]},{"number":2383,"title":"Chapter 2383 Special Energy...Ancient!","paragraphs":["Facing Song Shuhang's proactive approach, Unknown White 31 felt somewhat caught off guard.","He had just emerged from his statue-like state, and his body remained still, while his thoughts lagged a bit.","\"Senior White?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Wait... Let me take my time,\" muttered Unknown White 31. \"Young people these days are so forward.\"","With that, he turned around and glanced behind him.","There was nothing there.","Unknown White 31 looked puzzled and asked, \"I vaguely remember there should be something here?\"","\"Yes, there is indeed something. It should be something that Senior White and the others sealed,\" replied Song Shuhang. \"I sent it to the 'Wielder's small black room.' If nothing unexpected happens, it's not coming out in this lifetime.\"","\"Oh,\" Unknown White No. 31 scratched his head while furrowing his brow in thought.","The hamster, snug in Song Shuhang's pocket, chimed in. \"My master's model, even when you're frowning, looks good.\"","Lady Onion agreed, \"I'll be honest, I fell in love the moment Senior White No. 31 emerged from the statue.\"","\"I remember now. There should be a very useful treasure beside the thing we sealed. Although I don't even remember what this treasure is, I remember that it can affect the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation and change the Thousand Day Tribulation. Did you leave the treasure behind?\" Unknown White 31 inquired.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"No need to answer. Your expression tells me you didn't leave it. Forget it. It's just something that affects the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. It's not of much use,\" Unknown White 31 waved his hand dismissively.","Song Shuhang awkwardly smiled and made a mental note of this information. He planned to relay it to Senior White once they returned to the main world. If Senior White showed interest, they could venture into the Wielder's small black room to search for the treasure.","\"Now, shall we begin?\" Unknown White 31 asked.","Song Shuhang nodded.","Unknown White 31 extended his hand and placed it on Song Shuhang's abdomen to initiate the transmission of that unique energy.","Song Shuhang was already well-acquainted with the process of receiving this special energy and had developed immunity to the cold touch of Unknown White's hand.","\"Senior White, what kind of energy are you transferring into my body?\" Song Shuhang inquired curiously as he received the energy. After all, even Pavilion Master Chu couldn't identify the attributes of this energy.","\"This energy is called 'Archae.' It's understandable that you don't recognize it. In the era when I was born, this energy was already quite rare. It's a symbol of that era,\" Unknown White 31 explained.","After conveying this information, his gaze met Song Shuhang's, and he began transmitting the 31st data package.","It was an efficient dual-task approach that saved even more time.","During the process of infusing Song Shuhang's core, Unknown White 31 furrowed his brow twice. The first time was upon discovering that Song Shuhang had a Nascent Soul and a Golden Core in his dantian, and the second time was upon realizing that Song Shuhang still possessed seven small Nascent Souls.","The illusory beast spirit formed inside Song Shuhang's body by Number 31 resembled a 'turtle.' Perhaps it was due to psychological factors or the fact that the raw material for Song Shuhang's Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure. Tyrant King Expert's Shield was Senior Turtle's shell, but Song Shuhang couldn't help but see a resemblance to Senior Turtle in the 'turtle.'","\"Good heavens,\" Song Shuhang exclaimed.","Unknown White 31 looked confused. \"???\"","\"Do the last two Senior Whites represent the whale and the horse?\" Song Shuhang looked at the last two unknown white statues.","Whale was his main cultivation technique.","The horse reminded him of the black horse.","\"Yes,\" Unknown White 31 replied.","Song Shuhang looked at Unknown White No. 31 with some curiosity. After transmitting the cultivation technique and data, Unknown White No. 31 didn't turn into particles and scatter like the previous numbers 1-30.","\"Since the sealed thing is no longer there, you can wake Number 32 and Number 33 in one go,\" Unknown White 31 suggested.","Song Shuhang nodded. He went to the side of the 32nd statue and injected the spiritual energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique into it. Then, he turned around and went to the side of the 33rd statue.","The two statues split apart at the same time to reveal two unknown whites that looked exactly the same.","When three Senior Whites of the same style stood together, it was especially worth taking a photo as a memento. I wonder if the other unknown white numbers 1-30 will appear again?","If it was possible, the 33 Senior Whites would stand together in a row like students taking their graduation photos, while he would sit in the 'principal's' exclusive seat and take a photo together.","\"Yes,\" at this moment, Unknown White 31 suddenly said.","\"What?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Thirty-three people taking pictures together is fine,\" Unknown White 31 replied. He had read not only the written knowledge from Song Shuhang's Academic Genius System but also some information.","Song Shuhang was slightly startled, and then wiped his face.","\"Yes,\" he said. \"Sorry, your face is too readable,\" Unknown White 31 said. \"I only took a glance and read the contents.\"","\"It's okay. I'm used to it.\" After saying that, Song Shuhang took out a mirror and looked at himself.","He had always suspected that there was a 'sliding caption' on his face. Sometimes, a long caption would pop up randomly to explain his inner thoughts to others.","\"After the inheritance of No. 32 and No. 33 is over, I'll summon No. 1 to No. 30 separately. We'll take a photo together as a memento,\" Unknown White 31 suggested.","As they spoke, Number 32 and Number 33 opened their eyes.","Number 31 went up to Number 32 and Number 33 and started explaining in a special language.","Number 32 and Number 33 nodded as they listened.","Soon after, the two strangers came to Song Shuhang's side and pressed their cold palms on his stomach.","\"Speaking of which, Shuhang, after being pressed down on your stomach by the icy palm and receiving the ice-cold 'immemorial' energy, will you have diarrhea?\" the sword suddenly said.","If his stomach was cold, he would have diarrhea easily.","\"Senior, I'm a cultivator of the Seventh Stage. I don't have that ability.\" Song Shuhang's 'pricking resistant mental strength' had been increasing, and ordinary pricking had no effect on him.","\"Yes, you will soon advance to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm. At that time, not only will you lose the Five Grains Reincarnation ability, but you will also lose many other abilities,\" the sword said happily.","Song Shuhang was confused.","While they were talking, the two unknown whites opened their third eyes on Song Shuhang's forehead at the same time.","The final two 'data packets' of data were forcibly transmitted, with multiple threads synchronized transmission.","At the same time, thirty-three phantom beasts, like planets revolving around a star, circled around Song Shuhang's main Nascent Soul, following various trajectories.","After a while, the phantoms of the main whale and horse appeared around the main Nascent Soul to complete the thirty-three animal phantoms.","Song Shuhang's Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure technique began to operate at a high speed like a tractor with a Ferrari engine."]},{"number":2384,"title":"Chapter 2384 Something Feels Off","paragraphs":["The turbulent energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique raged within Song Shuhang's body.","\"Do you sense anything?\" inquired the sword.","\"It's uncomfortable,\" replied Song Shuhang.","He felt as though his body was on the verge of exploding, precisely at the critical point.","Without hesitation, Song Shuhang immediately turned into smoke. After all, he was well-versed in handling self-destruction scenarios. Pseudo-immortal mode was adept at managing physical self-destruction, but it couldn't shield him from the mental strain brought on by the data of the 33 unknown Whites now filling his mind.","This data included the entirety of an artificial world that encompassed not just mundane creatures, but every blade of grass, every tree, every mountain, every river, and even every grain of sand. It also contained information about the intelligent giants, their language, technology, hobbies, habits, and even their methods of reproduction.","Both useful and seemingly unnecessary data comprised this complete world. In a complete world, 'unnecessary' elements were not lacking.","\"Next, you'll need to go into seclusion for a while,\" advised Unknown White 31.","He reached out to lift the smoke-like Song Shuhang up and placed him at the 'core' of the seal.","\"What's Senior White up to?\" asked Lady Onion, puzzled.","\"This place is where we sealed that thing before... but it's also quite suitable for secluded cultivation,\" explained Unknown White 31.","He positioned Song Shuhang in the center of the core.","The smoke-like Song Shuhang struggled to maintain his humanoid form. He sat cross-legged and closed his eyes in a meditative posture.","However, Unknown White 31 found this posture unsuitable for channeling the energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique. He adjusted Song Shuhang's position and made him stand in a peculiar stance reminiscent of a golden rooster and a white crane.","In his meditative state, Song Shuhang had no resistance and could only be manipulated.","Unknown White 31 nodded in satisfaction, and Numbers 32 and 33 joined him.","Simultaneously, ripples appeared in the void, and the figures of Unknown White Numbers 1 to 30 reappeared.","A total of 33 unknown Whites stood together to form three rows with Song Shuhang in his peculiar posture at the center.","His arms held Lady Onion and the hamster.","\"I'm here to take pictures of Senior Song and the seniors,\" volunteered Black-skinned Soft Feather, eager to capture this moment, which would surely make Senior White Crane and Immortal Fairy Bie Xue envious.","Unknown White No. 31, 32, and 33 transformed back into statues and resumed their orbits.","As for Unknown White Numbers 1-30, they disappeared once more and left Song Shuhang as the sealed object.","Peace returned to the man-made small world.","\"Something doesn't feel right,\" Pavilion Master Chu suddenly remarked.","\"I'm not the only one who senses it?\" the sword added.","\"Yes, something is indeed amiss. Looking at the current scene, it seems as though Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song has been sealed,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet pondered.","Pavilion Master Chu was left bewildered.","She quickly scanned her surroundings with her consciousness.","In the next moment, she realized that Unknown White Numbers 31, 32, and 33 had reverted to their statue forms to form a 'sealing ring.'","Beyond these three statue seals, she could vaguely sense that the 'Wisdom Giant' and all life forms in the outside world had become part of a seal, firmly imprisoning Song Shuhang. Surrounding the Wisdom Giant were 30 other Unknown Whites to form the third seal.","It resembled the situation before entering the man-made small world.","\"Has Shuhang replaced the sealed object?\" Pavilion Master Chu's hair stood on end.","\"However, Shuhang is different from the sealed object. For instance, he has more pendants,\" noted the sword.","Indeed, these three seals were incredibly powerful. They were more than sufficient to contain Song Shuhang. However, given Song Shuhang's numerous pendants, his Cultivation Chat could bypass the seal and send a distress signal directly to the outside world.","This triple seal might not be sufficient to trap him.","\"Let's keep observing. At least, we'll discuss this after Shuhang completes his breakthrough,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested, her hair gently swaying.","\"Is Senior Song advancing to the Profound Sage realm? His advancement method is quite different from that of ordinary Sovereigns,\" remarked Black-skinned Soft Feather.","The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Technique within Song Shuhang's body continued to increase his strength.","\"His method of advancement is completely unconventional for a Sovereign. I can't even tell if he's about to reach the Profound Sage realm,\" added the sword.","In truth, with a combination of eight Nascent Souls and one Golden Core stepping into the Profound Sage realm, the outcome was unpredictable. Yet, it was happening to Song Shuhang.","\"Moreover, he hasn't fully mastered the ancient language yet,\" mentioned Black-skinned Soft Feather, concerned.","\"And his research on the illusory reality isn't thorough enough,\" Pavilion Master Chu added thoughtfully, being the most knowledgeable among them regarding the illusory reality.","Among everyone present, she had the deepest understanding of the illusory reality and had the most say.","In addition, the three-eyed youth had reminded Song Shuhang to study the illusory reality more when he was still at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm and to dig out the secrets within.","All the pendants were worried about Song Shuhang in all aspects, but no one was worried about him transcending the tribulation.","At this time, Song Shuhang's consciousness began to expand.","In his mind, the data packets sent by the 33 unknown Whites unfolded.","A complete set of data on the man-made small world appeared in his consciousness.","It was a complete one, and not this man-made small world fragment.","Song Shuhang looked at the data in puzzlement and felt that there seemed to be some secret hidden within.","After studying it for a while, he suddenly had a flash of inspiration.","He silently activated his illusory world. The chaotic space was formed by 0s and 1s."]},{"number":2385,"title":"Chapter 2385 I, Tyrannical Song, Ancient God, Havoc","paragraphs":["In addition to replicating Senior White's 'fake desert world' and the innate 'golden core composition: illusory reality' of various major Nascent Soul experts, Song Shuhang also possessed a genuine Seventh Stage illusory reality—the digital chaotic world.","This chaotic world, composed of 0s and 1s, was still a work in progress, but its potential for development was boundless.","Now, what Song Shuhang intended to do was to import the entire data package related to the artificial small world into his 'real illusory reality.' The data within this package was highly detailed, and if successfully incorporated, it would undoubtedly stimulate the growth of his 'real illusory reality.'","However, a question lingered: \"How can I import this massive data package into my illusory reality?\" After activating his illusory reality, Song Shuhang found himself at a loss for what to do next.","The real illusory reality and the data package lacked a means of data transmission.","While he could use his divine third eye to transmit information to others, he faced a challenge in using his divine eye on his own 'real illusory reality.'","Just as he contemplated this dilemma, a connection spontaneously formed between the real illusory reality and the extensive data package. Song Shuhang didn't need to fret over this issue; he only needed to ponder it, and the data package and the real illusory reality seamlessly linked.","The entire process occurred as effortlessly as clapping his hands.","...","...","The real illusory reality and the data package were now intertwined.","Beside Song Shuhang, the real illusory reality, a chaotic realm of data, expanded and filled the entire sealed space. Fortunately, the 'statues' of the three unknown Whites formed a sealing circle that prevented the real illusory reality from leaking out.","Within the real illusory reality, Song Shuhang served as the core that oversaw the formation of a complete blue planet. Every blade of grass, tree, mountain, river, numerous flora and fauna, and even colossal giants came to life within the illusory reality, each carrying out their daily activities.","The pendants on Song Shuhang's body became the first group of inhabitants in this illusory world.","\"This is... an illusory reality?\" queried Lady Onion, perplexed. She was no longer the na?ve little monster onion she once was and possessed a broader perspective. With a single glance, she could discern the authenticity of this world.","\"It actually constructed an entire world,\" remarked Pavilion Master Chu, her eyebrows raised. She had once constructed a complete Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion and knew the considerable difficulty involved in creating a full-fledged 'illusory world.'","\"It's likely influenced by the extensive data packets transmitted by the 33 Unknown Whites,\" speculated the sword.","The Hamster stroked its whiskers. \"For instance... if someone were suddenly pulled into this illusory reality, they might mistake it for transmigration and believe they've entered an entirely different world.\"","\"Yes, something similar has indeed occurred before,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in.","Once, there was a prominent individual whose illusory reality was patterned after the Elysian World. However, during a period of seclusion, a barrier malfunction resulted in the leakage of the illusory reality. Ordinary beings inadvertently entered it and were convinced they had entered the Elysian World. They luxuriated in it and experienced a joyous time within this alternate reality.","\"Seventh Stage Venerable is truly remarkable,\" Soft Feather mused, her chin resting on her hands.","Illusory Reality was an incredibly versatile ability. If her primary body could master this convenient skill, she would dedicate considerable effort to developing her own Illusory Reality. This way, her primary body might become a bit more composed.","The hamster gazed at the expansive illusory world before it and contemplated a question: Could this vast illusory reality be regarded as Song Shuhang's own 'illusory reality'?","\"It's challenging to say. After all, it's something borrowed,\" Pavilion Master Chu mused.","\"I feel that even if it's 'borrowed,' once absorbed and integrated into oneself, it becomes one's own. It's akin to knowledge; even if the knowledge is developed by others, learning it makes it part of your own understanding,\" the sword opined.","\"Perhaps this can help compensate for his shortcomings,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suggested.","Black-skinned Soft Feather sat beside Song Shuhang, her eyes envious as she observed him. \"I'm so envious. Senior Song's advancement speed is incredibly swift.\"","\"Jealousy is beneficial! As an inner demon, you must learn to be envious,\" encouraged the sword.","\"...\"","\"By the way, is it just my imagination, or has Song Shuhang become more handsome?\" Lady Onion suddenly remarked.","The hamster rubbed its eyes and shook its head.","It had seen Song Shuhang in various forms, but it found the typical Uncle Song Shuhang appearance to be the most endearing.","\"I think he has indeed become somewhat more handsome,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather murmured quietly. She secretly preserved the image of this 'slightly handsome Senior Song' in her memory.","Once she exited this small world, her long-distance connection with her main body would be reestablished. She intended to transmit this image to her primary self.","\"I still prefer the ordinary Song Shuhang. If he becomes too handsome, I won't be able to adapt,\" confessed the sword.","Speaking of which, did anyone else notice that Song Shuhang's current disposition resembled that of the three-eyed youth lurking behind the Throne of Wealth?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suddenly reminded them.","The pendants were taken aback and carefully observed Song Shuhang once more.","\"He indeed bears a resemblance!\" the sword affirmed.","While the discussion continued, the divine third eye between Song Shuhang's brows opened.","With wings spread like a golden rooster and white crane, he gazed up at the illusory reality's void.","As if sensing something, an immensely colossal 'eye' materialized in the void.","This massive eye resonated with Song Shuhang's divine third eye.","\"Song ~ Ancient ~ God ~\" Fairy Creation suddenly appeared and began to sing.","Song Shuhang, an ancient god?","Within the illusory reality of reality, the appearance of the enormous divine eye caused turmoil among all living beings within the miniature world.","They had never encountered such a situation before.","\"It's part of the plot,\" Pavilion Master Chu realized at this moment.","This was a segment of Song Shuhang's illusory reality, akin to the part where the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion was destroyed in her own illusory reality. It was a reenactment of a past event within the illusory reality.","Cracks began to form on the immense divine eye in the sky.","An aura of destruction spread throughout the area."]},{"number":2386,"title":"Chapter 2386 The Imperishable Lord’s Persuasion Towards Kindness","paragraphs":["\"Now, what's happening in the illusory world is a reflection of past events in the artificial realm,\" explained Pavilion Master Chu.","She gazed up at the shattered 'eye' in the sky.","\"What's going on?\" Lady Onion clutched her green onion sprout with both hands, her voice filled with panic. The sight of the broken eye in the sky filled her with a profound sense of unease, as if something immensely important was on the brink of destruction, and the world itself was about to shatter. She had no place to hide.","\"We just witnessed the Wielder of the Will disappearing. Such a projection will appear in all the worlds, even in some hidden places,\" Pavilion Master Chu explained while her voice wavered. Despite being an immortal, she was affected by the aura of destruction.","The 'eye' projected in the sky symbolized the Heavenly Dao that was about to be destroyed, specifically the Heavenly Dao corresponding to the Three-Eyed Sovereign. With the Heavenly Dao's disappearance, the Heavenly Dao laws crumbled and left the Immortal Throne vacant. It paved the way for supreme experts and secluded immortals from myriad worlds to emerge onto the stage.","\"Combined with Shuhang suddenly sporting the 'Handsome Three-Eyed' appearance, it suggests that the ancient god of this artificial world is linked to the Heavenly Dao of the Three-Eyed Sovereign. This is a relic of the Heavenly Dao,\" remarked the sword.","\"It's highly likely that the disappearance of the Wielder of the Will back then caused the ancient gods of this small world to go out of control and lead to the destruction of this artificial realm,\" continued Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet as he followed the group's speculation.","In addition to Song Shuhang, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt that he and Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword were growing closer. Perhaps in the future, they may merge as one.","As predicted by Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and sword, after the 'eye projection' in the sky completely shattered, the ancient god 'Song Shuhang' seemed to lose control and went berserk.","Hundreds of calamities instantly befell the artificial world: massive tsunamis, countless volcanic eruptions, falling meteorites, and violent ground tremors.","There was no escape.","The plot advanced rapidly. It was akin to watching a movie on fast-forward. In the face of unstoppable disasters, almost all living beings in the entire artificial world faced extinction.","Just as the world teetered on the brink of collapse and despair, the ancient god Song Shuhang split apart and gave rise to another massive entity.","It resembled a glutinous rice ball that was covered in tentacles with a massive eye at its center. Despite its menacing appearance, this glutinous rice ball embodied a facet of the ancient god's benevolence.","It set out to quell the rampaging ancient god and urged it toward kindness to prevent the destruction of the artificial world. However, persuading a berserk and irrational ancient god was futile.","Thus, Glutinous Rice Ball resorted to force to bring the ancient god to reason. Its tentacles were exceptionally potent, and despite being a fragment separated from the ancient god's body, its combat capabilities matched those of an ancient god. Moreover, it possessed wisdom and retained its rationality.","After a battle lasting years, perhaps decades, Glutinous Rice Ball finally subjugated the ancient god after inflicting severe injuries upon it. Eventually, it sealed the ancient god within the core of the artificial world.","To secure the seal, Glutinous Rice Ball drew upon the power of all living beings in the world, be it deceased or surviving, as they willingly became part of the seal.","The plot within the illusory reality reached a temporary conclusion. With the rampaging ancient god quelled, the surviving inhabitants of the artificial world began to take root and thrive.","...","...","\"This is thrilling. It's much more exciting than watching a movie,\" Lady Onion sighed.","No matter how realistic a movie might be, it couldn't compare to witnessing two world-destroying giants in action.","\"Soft Feather, did you notice something?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired in a daze while observing the black-skinned Soft Feather being lost in thought.","Soft Feather nodded whimsically. \"I find the tentacles on that ball very familiar. They resemble the tentacles of the Immortal Lord from the past, the ones Senior Song defeated.\"","Pavilion Master Chu was left bewildered.","The sword was speechless.","\"Could it be a coincidence?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet pondered.","\"I'm not entirely sure. It just seems that way,\" replied black-skinned Soft Feather.","As the 'plot' concluded, the entire illusory world entered a momentary state of tranquility.","\"Strange. Since the tentacle sealed the rampaging ancient god in the plot, why is the seal currently dominated by 'Unknown White'?\" the sword asked in puzzlement.","\"There was a considerable amount of time between my master's Dao vindication and this eyeball's appearance. It's possible that after my master's Dao vindication, something unexpected occurred in this artificial world and caused the ancient gods to go out of control once more. My Lord then arrived and strengthened the seal of this artificial world,\" speculated Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","The Inner World had been borrowed by the Immortal Phoenix Fairy of the beast cultivation world before White of the Heavenly Dao vindicated his Dao, and it was placed in the restricted area of Jia'er's Holy Mountain. Consequently, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remained oblivious to events that transpired after White of the Heavenly Dao's Dao vindication.","\"That might be the next arc. If Shuhang's 'illusory reality' continues, we might witness the appearance of White Heavenly Axiom,\" Pavilion Master Chu guessed.","As soon as she finished speaking, Song Shuhang, sealed within the nucleus, slowly opened his three eyes.","The illusory reality surrounding him dissipated completely.","\"Argh... My muscles ache,\" Song Shuhang exclaimed.","He realized that he had been frozen in the posture of a white crane spreading its wings and a golden rooster standing alone and was unable to move.","\"Has your seclusion ended?\" the sword inquired.","It knew that Song Shuhang wouldn't remain secluded for too long.","\"It's not over yet, but before I continue my seclusion, there's something I need to do,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"What is it?\" asked black-skinned Soft Feather.","\"Move this artificial world,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile as he reached out with his hands.","\"The World Refining Holy Ape was created by him.\"","The holy apes surrounding the True Dragon emerged one by one and formed a circle as they held hands.","\"Isn't this the sealed area of Unknown White? Will your World Refining Holy Ape be of any use here?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired.","\"It doesn't matter. I have the authority now,\" Song Shuhang reassured while patting his lower abdomen.","Around his 8 Nascent Souls + Gold Core, he had 33 'ancient' energies left by Unknown White that granted him special privileges in this world.","The World Refining Holy Ape was activated, and a passage opened at the core of the artificial world. Simultaneously, Song Shuhang willed the Inner World to create an interface within this passage."]},{"number":2387,"title":"Chapter 2387 Have I Lost My Appeal to the Fat Ball?","paragraphs":["Following that, just as the Illusory Reality willingly connected with the data package, Song Shuhang's Core World also actively engaged with this fragment of the artificial small world.","In this entire small world, there was nothing that Song Shuhang couldn't establish a connection with.","Satisfied, Song Shuhang nodded in approval. He then once again sat cross-legged and assumed a meditative posture.","\"Seniors, Black Skin Soft Feather, Lady Onion, Hamster, if you find yourselves getting bored, feel free to return to the Core World and take a break for a while. This time, my seclusion will be a bit longer,\" Song Shuhang addressed his pendants before closing his eyes.","The Core World had already been opened and allowed everyone to return at their convenience.","\"No need to rush. The entrance to the Core World is right above us. We can go back whenever we want,\" the sword remarked. It suspected that Song Shuhang's 'extended closed-door cultivation' would likely last no more than three days and two nights.","\"Would you at least remember my real name?\" Black-skinned Soft Feather weakly retorted. Her name wasn't 'Black-skinned Soft Feather,' but lately, all the seniors seemed to have forgotten her real name.","\"I'll join you in seclusion. I could use some alone time,\" the hamster chimed in. \"Watching Tyrannical Song's potentially explosive show here is far more interesting than returning to the Core World.\"","\"Then please, everyone, do as you wish,\" Song Shuhang said while exhaling a sigh of relief before entering closed-door cultivation once more.","The Illusory Reality unfolded once again, but this time, it only enveloped a one-meter radius around Song Shuhang.","Moments later...","The statue labeled Unknown White No. 31 on the track suddenly cracked open. With a graceful stride and flowing hair, Unknown White emerged from the statue and approached Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu, the sword, and Stone Tablet Fellow Daoist watched Unknown White with cautious eyes.","\"As expected of my master's template. He's so beautiful,\" the hamster praised.","\"I wouldn't mind having long hair like that,\" Lady Onion said earnestly.","'Would Lady Onion with long hair make the green onion sprouts taste better?' This thought crossed Black-skinned Soft Feather's mind, but she refrained from vocalizing it, as it could potentially hurt Lady Onion's feelings.","Arriving at Song Shuhang's side, Unknown White No. 31 reached out and lifted Song Shuhang, who was in a cross-legged position. Passing through the Illusory Reality, Unknown White's body and hands made contact with Song Shuhang's body and mandhandled him like a puppet.","Under the control of Unknown White No. 31, Song Shuhang was made to assume the horse-riding posture once again.","\"...\" The sword was left speechless.","Unknown White No. 31 circled around the elevated Song Shuhang while nodding with satisfaction. Then, with a light clap of its hands, numerous points of light appeared in the air and entered Song Shuhang's Illusory Reality.","These points of light were the beings of the artificial small world. One of them were the sentient giants.","Taking away these points of light and the complete data package from Song Shuhang's mind, the entire civilization of the small world now rested in Song Shuhang's hands.","\"I leave the past of this world to you,\" Unknown White said with a smile.","From this point on, the artificial small world would gradually fade away and ultimately cease to exist. The only remnant it left behind in the world was that vast data package, which Unknown White entrusted to Song Shuhang—the complete 'history.'","In reality, all the giants in the artificial small world that had fallen into 'infinite reincarnation' had long been reduced to mere data and no longer existed in the ancient times.","Afterward, Unknown White No. 31 turned around and returned to his pedestal, once again becoming a statue.","**********","The following day, the sword broke the silence with a sigh.","\"I don't know why. But seeing Song Shuhang seriously enter closed-door cultivation for an entire day left me feeling somewhat emotional.\"","\"It seems he can stay in closed-door cultivation a bit longer... Typically, after obtaining a tremendous opportunity in an entire artificial world, it's quite common for cultivators to enter closed-door cultivation for several years or even decades to digest their gains,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remarked.","\"I bet Shuhang won't be in closed-door cultivation for more than two days this time. He won't exceed three days at most,\" the sword predicted.","\"Why is everything limited to three days?\"","Three seemed to be a magical number.","\"I bet I can remain in seclusion for a month this time,\" Song Shuhang's voice suddenly resounded.","The sword was left speechless.","It rotated its hilt and glanced back, only to see Song Shuhang's primordial spirit leaving his body and talking in his sleep.","\"Shuhang, save the sleep-talking for when you're actually asleep,\" the sword sighed. \"I thought you could last at least three days and two nights, but you've only lasted a day and you're already cheating?\"","\"What's the plan this time?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked in bewilderment.","\"Yes, I need to make a trip to the main world before completely assimilating the fragment of the artificial small world,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu was left dumbfounded.","\"We'll be dealing with the Fat Ball's clone. Senior White Two's divination mentioned a method to deal with the Fat Ball's clone, and it lies right beneath us,\" Song Shuhang's primordial spirit pointed at the seal under his feet.","This seal harnessed the power of 33 Unknown Whites and had the capability to directly imprison the Fat Ball's boss's clone within an egg!","Thus, he had to contact the Fat Ball's clone before the fragment of the artificial small world was fully integrated.","\"My physical body must remain here, so I can only dispatch my primordial spirit to attract the Fat Ball's boss's attention,\" Song Shuhang explained, extending his hand. Two sets of life-bound magical treasures took flight to safeguard Song Shuhang's primordial spirit.","\"Isn't it risky for your primordial spirit to confront a Netherworld Ruler?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet leaped up with concern.","\"I've charged my body with electricity. I can assist you,\" Pavilion Master Chu offered while transferring herself to Song Shuhang's primordial spirit. This 'transfer' technique was certainly advantageous for those experiencing hair loss.","...","...","Using the Inner World as a launching point, Song Shuhang's primordial spirit employed the Sage Sealed Wooden Saber as a reference and appeared directly in outer space within the main world.","Now, all he had to do was wait for the appearance of the Fat Ball's boss's clone.","Song Shuhang believed that, given the Fat Ball's patience, its clone would endure the solitude.","During the few days he spent in the artificial small world, the Fat Ball boss's alternate account must have been divining his location.","Song Shuhang had confidence in his appeal to the Fat Ball.","Pavilion Master Chu and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet were also ready to confront the Fat Ball's clone.","Time ticked away.","Ten minutes, half an hour, one hour, two hours...","But the Fat Ball didn't make an appearance.","Song Shuhang was confused.","'Could it be that I'm no longer attractive to the Fat Ball?'"]},{"number":2388,"title":"Chapter 2388 Tyrannical Song. Wealthy, Profound Sage","paragraphs":["\"It's been quite a while. Why hasn't the fat ball's secondary avatar shown up yet?\" murmured Song Shuhang's primordial spirit.","'Am I no longer appealing to the fat ball?","'That can't be right. I possess something the fat ball desires... Wait, what was it again?","'What did the fat ball boss chase me across the universe for? What did it want to obtain from me?'","Song Shuhang's primordial spirit scratched his head.","Regardless, he had crossed paths with the fat ball numerous times, outwitted it, and even snatched its 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.' There was no reason for the fat ball to let him off the hook.","A mere few days couldn't possibly lead to his dismissal.","Song Shuhang had unwavering confidence in his 'aggro-sucking' nature.","Unless something unexpected happened on the fat ball's end... For instance, had its primary avatar in the main world finally been dealt with by Senior White Two?","Thus, Song Shuhang promptly activated the 'cultivation chat' feature and contacted Senior White Two. \"Senior White, have you eliminated the fat ball's primary avatar in the main world?\"","\"It's not that easy. The fat ball is also a ruler of the Netherworld, and it's still hanging on by a thread. It'll take some time for my projected clone to finish it off. Have you exited that small world of yours?\" Senior White Two replied.","\"Not yet. My main body is still in seclusion within the artificial small world... By the way, following your divination, I successfully acquired the means to seal the fat ball's secondary avatar. Now, my primordial spirit has slipped into the main world. I'm waiting for the fat ball's secondary avatar to come find me so I can seal it into an egg,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Senior White Two was left speechless.","In the entire universe, only Song Shuhang dared to frolic around and playfully provoke the ruler of the Netherworld.","\"Right, Senior White. The trial period for the 'White Two's Automatic Divination System' is over. Would you consider extending it?\" Song Shuhang took the opportunity to ask.","Anyone who had used White Two's automatic fortune-telling system knew how effective it was.","\"Hehe,\" Senior White Two replied with just two words.","Song Shuhang's body involuntarily shuddered—had the system informed Senior White Two about his use of the Giant of Destruction to earn points?","\"In any case, I'll handle the primary body of the fat ball's avatar. I can guarantee it won't spawn any smaller avatars. As for your alternate account, deal with it on your own. If you die, send me an SOS signal, and I'll handle the reincarnation process for you,\" Senior White Two replied.","He had been quite busy lately conducting experiments with White in the modern world. The God Creation Plan had reached a critical juncture.","White Two also felt a sense of urgency. He needed to complete the God Creation Plan as soon as possible!","...","...","After ending the call with Senior White Two, Song Shuhang looked at his primordial spirit's hands.","\"Oh right, could it be that because I'm currently in Primordial Spirit mode, the fat ball divination indicates that I'm in an incomplete state, so it's not bothering to come find me?\" Song Shuhang suddenly thought of a possibility!","Previously, when he only brought his arms or his lower half to the main world, he also failed to attract the fat ball.","\"It's possible,\" Pavilion Master Chu said thoughtfully.","\"If that's the case, we can't just wait here,\" Song Shuhang lamented.","His time was precious, and he couldn't simply sit around waiting for the fat ball to confront him.","\"Where are you headed next?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired.","\"Let's return to the main world, Earth.\" Song Shuhang decided.","He intended to exchange the Eye Drops he had obtained from the Wealth Throne and the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group for treasures.","Next up was the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting.","Since he had received an invitation, he would certainly attend.","At that time, in accordance with his agreement with Senior Three-Eyed, he would distribute the treasures he had acquired from the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group through the Wealth Throne ceremony.","Obtaining treasures was no easy feat, but he would have to endure the pain of personally giving them away... For someone as penniless as Song Shuhang, there was nothing more heart-wrenching.","It was akin to winning ten million dollars and being forced to donate four to five million. The agony was indescribable.","However, a promise was a promise.","This agreement was a rule that had been etched into the gambling ritual between him and Senior Three-Eyed.","If he didn't adhere to the agreement, the next round of gambling ceremony wouldn't commence.","If he wished to win more and better treasures, he had to give them away.","One thing was certain—the wealth distribution segment would undoubtedly benefit Senior Three-Eyed. But Song Shuhang wondered what the latter would gain.","Song Shuhang's primordial spirit jumped directly to the main world, Earth, and the Chinese region using the coordinates of the Sage Seal Wooden Saber.","He then took out his phone and gave it a gentle shake to restore the signal.","\"I feel like I haven't been online for a while,\" Song Shuhang opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","At this moment, the group chat was as lively as ever.","This year's Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting was a grand affair.","It was said that even the reclusive ancestor of the Su Clan, Su Clan's Knot, had returned to preside over this year's Su Clan's annual meeting.","Su Clan's Seven had also gained considerable authority and had invited all the members of the group, including Ah Cat, Ah Dog, and Ah Lang.","The group's current topic of discussion revolved around the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting, and it was as lively as Immortal Fairy Bie Xue's Immortal Feast.","\"Seniors, it's been a while. How's everyone doing?\" Song Shuhang sent a message in the group.","However, his messages were quickly buried under the flood of messages from others.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The Nine Provinces Number One Group's chat speed was so rapid that he couldn't interject.","He had no choice but to cut to the chase.","Song Shuhang retrieved the Eye Drops from his Inner World and snapped a photo.","Then, he sent the photo to the group with the caption, \"Heavenly Dao's Eye Drops.\"","The term 'Heavenly Dao' was highly significant to any cultivator, especially at this stage.","This time, all the members of the group immediately took notice of Song Shuhang.","\"Hey, Shuhang, you're here. Did you receive the invitation?\" Su Clan's Seven inquired.","\"What the heck?is this thing?\" Phoenix Rite Senior asked.","\"I've received the invitation. As for this item, as you can see, it's the Heavenly Dao's Eye Drops. It's the real deal,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"Is it a creation of the immortal Heavenly Dao?\" Saint Monarch Seven said in amazement.","\"It's not a creation of the current Heavenly Dao; it was crafted by one of the previous ones. Let me introduce this treasure. Just one drop of this treasure can activate a trace of intelligence in a life-bound magic treasure. If it's a magical treasure like Senior White's Meteor Sword that already possesses 'sentience,' it might even directly evolve into a tool spirit. This is a valuable item, and I'm willing to trade with you seniors if you're interested.\" Song Shuhang explained.","In any case, the items traded would be used for wealth distribution at the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting.","At that time, the name 'Tyrannical Song, Wealthy, Profound Sage' would shake the world."]},{"number":2389,"title":"Chapter 2389 Song Shuhang, You’re Looking Handsome as Ever!","paragraphs":["\"Is it effective?\"","\"I've personally confirmed its effectiveness. My Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure has now fully condensed a faint wisp of consciousness!\" Song Shuhang replied confidently.","He decided not to mention the fact that the Defiant Whale Glove had already given birth to a fairy artifact spirit to avoid disturbing the seniors. He had grown more mature and no longer wanted to upset others easily.","Yellow Mountain felt exhausted and was longing for retirement.","Just a short while ago, he had arranged with Song Shuhang to explore the Spirit Transformation Ruins in the universe in January of the following year. Their goal was to acquire an item capable of bestowing a weak consciousness on a magic tool or allowing a weak consciousness to give birth to an artifact spirit. Little did he expect that, in just half a month, Song Shuhang would achieve this on his own.","Seeing Senior Yellow Mountain online, Song Shuhang happily sent him a private message: \"Senior Yellow Mountain, I'll send you a bottle of the eye drops. When we explore the Spirit Transformation Ruins next year, if we obtain any treasures, we can use it to instantly give birth to an artifact spirit for our life-bound magic tools!\"","The eye drops were used to create a 'weak consciousness' in magic artifacts, and then the treasures in the Spirit Transformation Ruins would evolve this 'weak consciousness' into an artifact spirit. Just thinking about it brought him great joy.","\"Alright,\" Senior Yellow Mountain replied.","He could only hope that Song Shuhang's eye drops wouldn't overlap with the effects of the treasures in the Spirit Transformation Ruins.","After some thought, Yellow Mountain replied to Song Shuhang, \"Let's wait until January next year to use the items from the Spirit Transformation Ruins to evolve our magical treasures once. Afterward, you can use the eye drops for a second evolution. This is the most appropriate sequence.\"","The eye drops were creations of the Heavenly Dao, and their effects were undoubtedly stronger than those of the treasures in the Spirit Transformation Ruins.","This approach would minimize the chances of overlapping effects.","Song Shuhang quickly grasped the meaning behind Senior Yellow Mountain's words: \"Understood, Senior [Soft Feather's tearful expression], I've already used the eye drops.\"","\"Don't worry. The possibility of overlapping effects is just a hypothesis and may not actually occur,\" Senior Yellow Mountain consoled him. \"You can proceed with transactions with the fellow cultivators in the group first. I'll contact Dao Monarch Li and see if we can expedite our plan to visit the 'spirit transformation vestige' earlier.\"","Senior Yellow Mountain was always a dependable figure.","...","...","Song Shuhang unlocked his phone and switched to the chat interface of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue asked, \"This eye drop is quite valuable, Shuhang. What kind of treasure do you plan to exchange it for? It might contain Heavenly Dao information.\"","Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, who had once wielded the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, understood the value of an item containing Heavenly Dao information. Allowing a life-bound magical treasure to give birth to consciousness and evolve into a weapon spirit was just one aspect; its true purpose might be to nourish the Heavenly Dao.","\"Shuhang, what are you looking for? What do you lack right now?\" Fairy Lychee inquired. \"Is it spirit stones?\"","When discussing what Song Shuhang lacked, spirit stones were always at the forefront.","\"I remember you spent all your spirit stones and treasures last time,\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer added.","\"Under normal circumstances, I'd consider exchanging it for a sum of spirit stones since I'm quite short on them. However, this time, the treasure I want to exchange for has other uses.\" Song Shuhang replied, \"What kind of treasure do you think I can exchange for with these eye drops?\"","He wanted to use the 'Heavenly Dao Eye Drops' to exchange for treasures with the seniors in the group, but he hadn't given much thought to what he actually wanted or knew much about the market.","Exchanging for spirit stones was a good option, but it had its limitations, as wealth distribution only involved spirit stones, which seemed somewhat lackluster.","\"This kind of thing is usually priceless, especially since it relates to artifact spirits, which are incredibly important to cultivators,\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue explained.","\"Then let's set a friendly price, ensuring outsiders don't benefit too much,\" Song Shuhang suggested. \"I plan to use the eye drops to exchange for a batch of treasures and then host a 'wealth distribution' event, as you all know... I have control over the Wealth Throne now.\"","\"I see,\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and the others immediately understood.","Song Shuhang had obtained the eye drops from the Wealth Throne?","\"When it comes to distributing wealth, I'll choose a time when all the seniors are present. I'll do my best to share the benefits with everyone,\" Song Shuhang added.","Fairy Lychee chimed in, \"But what about the Spirit River Su Clan's annual gathering, Shuhang?\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","'Fairy Lychee, how did you figure it out so quickly? I was planning to surprise everyone.'","\"There are cards!\" Medicine Master chuckled.","During the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting, Song Shuhang had directly activated the 'Wealth Throne Scattering' function, and Tyrannical Song had made its appearance.","\"I see. I understand now. If it's a wealth distribution ceremony, then whether it's a first-grade treasure or a seventh or eighth-grade one, I'll use them all. So, everyone, do your best to make deals. If you have suitable treasures, bring them out for trade with Shuhang. Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly, Fairy Skylark, and I can gather a batch of Seventh and Eighth Stage treasures. As for the treasures used in the ceremony, Shuhang, you can use two or three eye drops to replace them. After all, acquiring a ninth-grade treasure isn't easy,\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue explained.","\"I also have a portion of Rank-6 and Rank-7 resources available for trade,\" Venerable Yellow Mountain offered. Even though it was only a portion, given Venerable Yellow Mountain's generosity, it was a substantial amount.","\"I can contribute a batch of seventh and eighth-grade treasures,\" Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman added. He represented not only himself but also hoped to exchange for more treasures if Song Shuhang had enough eye drops.","\"I have a revival array used by cultivators of the Fifth Stage here. In addition, I'll add a batch of treasures of the Fifth and Sixth Stage to make up the numbers,\" Northern River's Loose Cultivator replied.","\"I've also accumulated a large number of Rank-6 and","Rank-7 resources here. I've been thinking about how to use them,\" Immortal Fairy Moon in the Sky mentioned.","Fairy Dongfang Six said, \"If any of the fellow Daoists in the group lack 'treasures,' you can come to me for a loan. I've recently been promoted and can access a significant amount of resources in the sect's treasury. The only issue is we'll need to collect some handling fees and interest, but I'll try to secure the lowest possible interest within my authority.\"","After all, the Demon Sect wasn't a charity, and she could only provide assistance within her capabilities.","[Melody Immortal Fairy] Soft Feather suggested, \"Senior Song, do you have an internet cable? If so, I can send a deliveryman from Spirit Butterfly Island to assist with the deliveries. This deliveryman is highly paid and was hired from elsewhere.\"","\"Yes, is it the deliveryman who can hit people through the internet?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Yes, that's him! Senior Song, you've encountered them before?\" [Melody Immortal Fairy] Soft Feather replied.","Spirit Butterfly Island.","Soft Feather lay on her bed while swinging her legs gently.","In her mind, she was currently examining the images sent by Black-skinned Soft Feather.","Senior Song had indeed become much more handsome!"]},{"number":2390,"title":"Chapter 2390 The Proxy Purchase of Soft Feather","paragraphs":["After Song Shuhang returned to the modern world - Earth, Black Skin Soft Feather followed suit and emerged from the fragments of the man-made small world. Once the connection with her main body was reestablished, black-skinned Soft Feather began relaying information back to her core.","The last few scenes of Song Shuhang transmitted to Soft Feather's core were meticulously chosen. They had been captured from the most flattering angles. In these scenes, Song Shuhang appeared even more dashing than the real-life Tyrannical Song.","Furthermore, the information she relayed included recent experiences with Song Shuhang, the rigorous training she underwent as a pendant under the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation, and various insights she had acquired during her cultivation.","Among these insights were numerous revelations regarding cultivation. After all, Song Shuhang's collection of pendants was unbelievably potent, with Immortal-level pendants being standard fare. Black Skin Soft Feather silently hung by Song Shuhang's side and absorbed copious knowledge during her daily existence.","Soft Feather grabbed her phone, turned over, and assumed a prone position while her fingers deftly glided across the screen. \"I really want to go on an adventure with Senior Song.\"","The memories sent by Black Skin Soft Feather were nothing short of exhilarating.","Song Shuhang's recent life had been as fulfilling as ever. After the scholarly faction's clash with the fat ball and his loss of virginity during heavenly punishment, he ventured to the Saint Mountain of Jia 'er in the realm of beast cultivators to contest the fundamental principles of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique. During this period, he even encountered the small world left behind by the White Wielder of the Will. Along the way, he managed to squeeze in two gambling sessions with Senior Three-Eyed, and he was relentlessly pursued by the fat ball throughout the universe. He had only just emerged from the artificial small world today.","Ordinary cultivators would require at least one or two years to undergo such a wealth of experiences.","Setting aside everything else, an ordinary cultivator would spend a year preparing to enter the forbidden area of the Holy Mountain of Jia 'er in the world of beast cultivation, all in pursuit of greater rewards within the forbidden grounds.","While Black Skin Soft Feather could synchronize various memories from the black-skinned Soft Feather, the sensation of experiencing these events firsthand was irreplaceable.","Moreover, Black Skin Soft Feather had a rather gentle personality. If she were to embark on an adventure with Senior Song, she would undoubtedly add more dynamism and excitement to their exploits.","\"I heard that Doudou is about to be evicted by Senior Yellow Mountain and will establish another immortal cave... I've also reached the Fifth Stage Realm now. Can I go to the nearby sea area and create a branch island for the Spirit Butterfly Island?\" Soft Feather sat up when she realized that lying down wasn't conducive to her physical growth.","Should I propose this idea to my father?","After pondering for a while, Soft Feather hugged her knees and rolled to the right, her face filled with despair.","Because the idea of establishing a branch island wasn't as straightforward as finding a small island and digging a cave abode. It would involve managing various developments on the island, much like her father's dedication to the Spirit Butterfly Island.","Given her personality, she was destined to be ill-suited for the role of a competent island master.","In reality, if Soft Feather were to propose the creation of a branch island for the Spirit Butterfly Island, Venerable Spirit Butterfly would surely agree. Subsequently, Soft Feather would have to spend the next few years on the island while learning the ropes of being a capable island master and undergoing training.","\"If only my inner demon weren't Black Panther,\" Soft Feather lamented as she hugged her knees and rolled around on the bed. In that scenario, she could leave 'Soft Feather' at home to look after the household while she stealthily ventured out into the world.","\"Is there a way to change the color of inner demons to white?\" Soft Feather mumbled.","\"No, because that 'black' isn't as simple as skin. It can't be whitewashed,\" a pleasant voice chimed in Soft Feather's ears.","Soft Feather turned her head and witnessed the opening of a spatial gate beside her.","Subsequently, a pair of legs identical to her own stepped out of the spatial gate.","\"It's you,\" Soft Feather expressed her disappointment.","The Celestial Thearch emerged from the spatial gate, pulled out a computer chair, and took a seat. She appeared so at ease, as if she had returned to her own home.","\"When are you going to return the ghost spirit to me?\" Soft Feather asked.","It appeared that this wasn't the first time they had engaged in a face-to-face conversation.","\"I acquired it through my own abilities. Why should I return it to you?\" The Celestial Thearch chuckled.","Soft Feather was speechless.","She was extremely frustrated. If she could defeat the Celestial Thearch, she would have pounced on her long ago.","\"But... I can stay on the Spirit Butterfly Island on your behalf for a while. During this period, you can slip away and have some fun.\" The Celestial Thearch nonchalantly crossed her long legs and smiled.","Soft Feather sat up as stiff as a doll, her gaze fixed on the Celestial Thearch. \"What do you want?\"","\"I also want a portion of the eye drops Senior Song mentioned earlier. I can provide the treasure myself, but you just need to assist me in negotiating with Senior Song for it. In return, I'll stay on the Spirit Butterfly Island for a week,\" the Celestial Thearch stated calmly.","\"You peeked at my chat history?\" Soft Feather clutched her phone tightly.","\"Don't worry, I obtained the information from another source. I'm not so bored as to snoop around your phone's chat records,\" the Celestial Thearch proudly declared.","Soft Feather was left speechless.","The Celestial Thearch raised her index finger. \"What do you think? Take your time to consider it. You'll have a whole week to enjoy.\"","\"Can't you negotiate with Senior Song yourself?\" Soft Feather inquired.","\"He's quite wary of me. Furthermore, he's been under the watchful eye of the ruler of the Netherworld recently. It would be too risky for me to make contact with him right now. I have to avoid him for the time being,\" The Celestial Thearch replied.","Lately, Song Shuhang had been akin to a harbinger of bad luck to her, and she would evade him whenever possible.","Soft Feather began to consider it.","While contemplating... she discreetly contacted Song Shuhang through the cultivation chat, \"Senior Song, the Celestial Thearch is looking for me. She wants me to help you exchange for an eye drop.\"","She believed that it would be best to discuss this matter directly with Song Shuhang.","\"The Celestial Thearch is looking for you?\" Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback.","A moment later, he replied, \"Then let's make the exchange. Recently, my relationship with the Celestial Thearch hasn't been as tense as before. If it's just a transaction, it shouldn't be a problem for us to each get what we need.\"","\"Then I'll happily respond to her.\" Soft Feather narrowed her eyes.","This way, she would have a week to quietly slip away.","\"I agree!\" Soft Feather responded.","\"Happy doing business. As the middleman, you can take a cut. I don't mind it.\" The Celestial Thearch extended her right hand to Soft Feather.","\"My pleasure.\" Soft Feather shook hands with the Celestial Thearch and asked, \"Why are you staying on the Spirit Butterfly Island for seven days?\"","She couldn't believe that the Celestial Thearch would willingly waste seven days on the Spirit Butterfly Island if she had nothing to do!","For someone of her caliber, every day was precious.","\"Yes, I'm just passing through the Spirit Butterfly Island. I'm waiting for something to arrive on the Spirit Butterfly Island.\" The Celestial Thearch's lips curled upwards. \"As for what it is, I won't tell you. I don't want you passing the information on to Senior Song and causing trouble for me.\"","Soft Feather was left speechless."]},{"number":2391,"title":"Chapter 2391 The Fluttering Heart","paragraphs":["Soft Feather gracefully hopped off the bed and retrieved a large suitcase she had prepared in advance from under the bed. She waved and said, \"Don't worry, I won't breathe a word of this to Senior Song!\"","If what The Celestial Thearch was waiting for didn't pass by Spirit Butterfly Island, she would discreetly inform Song Shuhang and merrily engage in some mischief with him. After all, she was planning to slip away and explore the world to seek adventure in distant places. She didn't want to leave and end up causing trouble nearby with Senior Song.","A faint smile graced the corners of Celestial Thearch's lips. She reached out and handed Soft Feather a small box. \"This is the treasure I used to exchange for the eye drops with Senior Song. Would you like to open it and take a look? If you like it, you can take a small commission from it.\"","Soft Feather was speechless.","Why did she have to mimic my way of addressing others?","And why does she keep encouraging me to take a commission?","She extended her hand to accept the small box and stowed it in her size-reducing purse. \"Alright, I'll go find Senior Song and ask him to send the eye drops to Spirit Butterfly Island in a few days. Please make sure to sign for them.\"","\"No problem, I'll stay here for seven days on your behalf. Just remember to return on time. I'll leave exactly seven days from now, not a minute later,\" The Celestial Thearch responded while skillfully grabbing snacks from the table and enjoying them.","The snacks on Spirit Butterfly Island were all homemade delicacies, and she liked them very much. Perhaps it could be said that these snacks were tailored to Soft Feather's taste, and her ghostly spirit body also favored this flavor.","The longer one inhabited the body of a ghostly spirit, the more they would be influenced. It was an inevitable aspect.","\"I'll be back on time. Also, in a little while, Abba will send Little Dian over. Xiaodian is here to assist Senior Song in delivering the goods. When the time comes, please ask Senior Song to provide you with the port address, and let Xiaodian follow the network cable to find him,\" Soft Feather cautioned.","\"I understand. Don't worry,\" The Celestial Thearch replied. She didn't resemble the ruler of the ancient Heavenly City at all in her current demeanor.","\"Then, I'll make my escape. Be careful not to reveal your true identity,\" Soft Feather placed the large suitcase into her size-reducing purse, then retrieved a sheet similar to the one used by the Almighty Merchant. She draped it over her body to conceal her aura.","Afterwards, she transformed into a small, colorful butterfly.","As an adventurous young girl with a strong desire to roam the world, Soft Feather had dozens of plans for quietly leaving Spirit Butterfly Island. From the current situation, the success rate of these plans was quite high—though it was also possible that Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly secretly condoned them.","Now that Soft Feather had reached the Fifth Stage Realm, she had even more methods to escape from home. Today, she planned to use the 'spatial escape' technique to depart.","\"Please convey my regards to Senior Song,\" the Celestial Thearch got up and opened the window for Soft Feather.","Transformed into a colorful butterfly, Soft Feather tapped her antennae and flew out of the window.","The Celestial Thearch leaned against the windowsill and casually asked, \"Is the first person you want to find after leaving Spirit Butterfly Island Senior Song?\"","\"Because Senior Song's place is more enjoyable,\" Soft Feather replied before flapping her wings to fly further away.","The Celestial Thearch rested her chin on her hand and watched Soft Feather depart.","After the butterfly disappeared, the Celestial Thearch extended her hand and flipped her finger. A lotus projection materialized between her fingers.","She lowered her head and gazed at the lotus projection while lost in thought.","After a while, she smiled and sent a bit of energy to Song Shuhang with the caption, \"Senior Song, this is today's bit of energy~~\"","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was leading a fairy crackling with electric arcs towards the pavilion where Soft Feather was cultivating.","However, halfway there, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly suddenly halted and looked to the east.","The Invisible Sensing Barrier he had secretly set up had been triggered.","Was his daughter secretly sneaking out again?","\"Didn't she just ask me to bring Xiaodian to her? Why does she suddenly want to run away from home?\" Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was puzzled.","Just as he was pondering, Soft Feather's voice came from not far away.","In a small herb garden around the corner, Soft Feather was crouched down while tending to a few spirit plants.","Eh? Soft Feather didn't leave?","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly's expression remained unchanged. He approached Soft Feather and said with a smile, \"I brought you Xiaodian. What are you planting?\"","\"I noticed that these spirit plants were a bit injured, so I wanted to take care of them again,\" Soft Feather clapped her hands and stood up. She looked at the fairy crackling with electric arcs and giggled, \"Thank you, Abba, for lending me Xiaodian.\"","Lord Spirit Butterfly smiled and handed Xiaodian to his daughter.","Throughout, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly maintained his composure. But in truth, every time Soft Feather addressed him as 'Abba,' he experienced an inexplicable sense of palpitation.","Vaguely, he felt that with each time Soft Feather called him 'Abba,' his lifespan was being shortened.","Nevertheless, he was certain that Soft Feather was his daughter.","He could never be mistaken about that.","\"Cultivate diligently these next few days. As long as you don't slack off, I'll take you to the Spirit River Su Clan's annual gathering in a few days,\" Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly said softly.","\"I've been diligently cultivating these past few days,\" Soft Feather replied while sticking out her tongue.","Seeing that his daughter was as adorable as ever, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly felt much more at ease.","\"Since you're so confident, I'll assess your cultivation progress tomorrow. If you meet my expectations, I'll allow you to stay a few more days after the Spirit River Su Clan's gathering,\" Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly stated while placing his hands behind his back and maintaining his fatherly dignity.","\"Thank you, Abba. I'll definitely exceed your expectations,\" Soft Feather confidently declared.","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly nodded. After leaving Xiaodian behind, he turned and walked away with composure.","Something didn't seem right today. If Soft Feather continued to address him as 'Abba' a few more times, he might need to share a 'quick-acting heart-saving pill' with Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain.","The Celestial Thearch's lips curled into a faint smile. She reached out and lightly tapped Xiaodian on her shoulder. \"Let's go,\" she said. \"I'll send you to Senior Song.\"","Sending Xiaodian to Senior Song was a straightforward process.","Step one: Open a small portal.","Step two: Place Little Electric inside.","Step three: Close the portal.","**********","At China, Jiangnan College Town, Medicine Master's Building, Song Shuhang's primordial spirit had returned. He was handling a large delivery—a substantial shipment Senior Yellow Mountain had sent him a few days ago.","It contained puppet clones for communication.","Suddenly, a portal opened beside him.","A panicked elf crackling with lightning was thrust into his arms.","Pa pa pa~","Lightning crackled.","A potent electric current surged through the startled elf's body and caused the tiny hairs on Song Shuhang's body to stand on end. Unfortunately, the electric current was too weak to even singe the little hairs."]},{"number":2392,"title":"Chapter 2392 I Want to Touch Your Dragon Horn","paragraphs":["\"Stay calm, little guy. No need to be scared,\" reassured Song Shuhang's primordial spirit as he gently held the small electric fairy, who was emitting sparks all over. \"If my physical body were here, this amount of electric current wouldn't even tickle me. After all, the primordial spirit is a bit less resilient than the physical form.\"","Under his soothing touch, the tiny elf gradually regained her composure.","\"Are you Xiaodian?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","Although he didn't crawl through the internet cables, the recent appearance of a spatial portal and the glimpse of a white arm, combined with Soft Feather's mention of the Celestial Thearch during their private chat, gave Song Shuhang a good idea of what had transpired.","\"Yes, Senior Tyrannical Song, I'm Xiaodian,\" replied the petite fairy while casting her gaze downward to avoid making eye contact with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","When Soft Feather had suddenly opened a spatial portal and stuffed her inside, it had been a terrifying experience for the small elf. After all, manipulating space was a skill of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders, and Fairy Soft Feather of Spirit Butterfly Island hadn't yet reached the Ninth Stage Realm. The poor elf had almost believed she was facing certain doom.","\"It's a bit different from the delivery person I encountered last time,\" Song Shuhang remarked. On the previous occasion, the customer service representative who sold him the immortal shuttle had assigned a humanoid electric creature as the delivery agent, while Soft Feather had sent Xiaodian, who resembled a pet more than an elf.","\"Why did she come through the 'spatial portal'?\" emerged Black-skinned Soft Feather, her expression filled with confusion.","\"It must be the Celestial Thearch,\" Song Shuhang gently touched the tiny electric fairy and explained, \"Xiaodian, I'll need your assistance for a while. Once I've completed my transaction with the seniors, I'll choose a suitable treasure for you as a reward for your hard work.\"","\"Thank you, Senior Tyrannical Song,\" Xiaodian nodded slightly. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song didn't appear as fearsome as the rumors suggested, especially after his recent act of comforting her while she was in an electrified state.","\"I'm currently confirming delivery addresses with the seniors in the group. Shortly, I'll need you to begin delivering the goods. Time is a bit tight, is that acceptable?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Senior Tyrannical Song, leave it to me,\" the elf assured him while patting her chest confidently.","Song Shuhang smiled and nodded, then turned his attention to the computers behind him. Several 'Song Shuhang' clones sat in front of each computer. These were the puppet clones provided to him by Senior Yellow Mountain. With just a trace of his mental energy, they transformed into Song Shuhang's water clones.","Song Shuhang's mental prowess was substantial. Every use of his secret appraisal technique only served to further strengthen it.","At this moment, a portion of the water clone group was in communication with the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. They were coordinating and verifying delivery addresses.","Meanwhile, Lady Onion was diligently assisting Song Shuhang in packing the eye drops.","After the water clones and the group's seniors had confirmed the delivery addresses, Xiaodian retrieved his size-reducing purse and stored the eye drops. Then, he followed the network's path, swiftly heading to the cave residences of the Nine Provinces Number One Group members. His mission was to deliver the goods and return with all the acquired treasures.","As Xiaodian continued to shuttle back and forth, batches of treasures accumulated in the fourth-floor hall of Medicine Master's small building.","Lady Onion, Fairy Creation, and the black-skinned Soft Feather diligently organized the treasures.","\"By the way, Senior Song, it seems my main body is on her way,\" the black-skinned Soft Feather suddenly raised her head and informed Song Shuhang.","She had maintained contact with her main body throughout. Just now, she had received news that her main body had successfully departed from Spirit Butterfly Island and was currently en route to the Jiangnan area.","\"Did Senior Spirit Butterfly agree to let her go out?\" Song Shuhang inquired with a smile.","\"It appears she reached an agreement with the Celestial Thearch,\" Soft Feather replied, her tone tinged with a mixture of amusement and disbelief.","\"When did her relationship with the Celestial Thearch become so amicable?\" Song Shuhang wondered aloud. \"Well, it's quite fortuitous. When Soft Feather arrives, I'll gift her some eye drops.\"","Despite Soft Feather consistently addressing him as 'Senior Song,' he had been under her guidance in cultivation ever since he started. Soft Feather could be considered one of his mentors in the path of cultivation.","\"Agreed,\" the black-skinned Soft Feather nodded. In addition to Soft Feather, Song Shuhang also intended to reserve a portion of the eye drops for Su Clan's Sixteen during the Su Clan's annual meeting. It was the only gift he could offer.","As twilight descended, Xiaodian continued her deliveries and filled the room with treasures collected from the Nine Provinces Number One Group seniors. Song Shuhang stored the treasures in the Wealth Throne's spatial storage.","\"The distribution of treasures is almost complete. Now, we'll await the annual meeting to distribute the wealth,\" Song Shuhang noted as he took out a notebook and made occasional entries. This notebook contained his upcoming speech. He was diligently preparing for his Profound Sage Speech. He was aiming to deliver it based on his own abilities.","\"Lady Onion, you and the others should take a break. When Xiaodian returns later, allow her some rest as well. She's been quite busy all day,\" Song Shuhang suggested.","\"I'm not tired. I'd like to continue organizing the treasures,\" Lady Onion replied. \"If you feel fatigued, you can retire to your room and rest.\"","Lady Onion had never encountered such a vast array of treasures in her existence, and she couldn't help but marvel at them. However, the prospect of distributing these treasures during the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting weighed on her mind.","\"I'll stay and await Xiaodian's return,\" the black-skinned Soft Feather volunteered.","\"I'll handle it,\" the sword chimed in. Even though the fat ball had seemingly lost interest in Song Shuhang, precautions still needed to be taken.","\"Thank you for your hard work, Senior,\" Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude.","He then returned to his fifth-floor study while holding his notebook. Occasionally, inspiration struck him, all related to his upcoming speech. Song Shuhang diligently recorded these inspirations and later organized them into a coherent speech.","Pavilion Master Chu floated above his head, occasionally offering guidance. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet provided suggestions from time to time.","If this speech could be finalized, its quality would surpass that of an Eighth Stage cultivator.'s After all, it was crafted with the one-on-one guidance of immortals. Such a privilege was rarely bestowed upon Eighth Stage Profound Sages in the universe.","\"I have a feeling this speech will be a resounding success,\" Song Shuhang mused as he leaned back in his chair and stretched.","Looking ahead, he recognized the need for heightened caution during his upcoming tribulation. This time, he would face it alone and conquer the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage Realm as he advanced openly towards the Profound Sage Realm.","\"Shuhang, are you preparing for another tribulation transcendence?\" At that moment, a voice echoed.","A spatial rift materialized in the void, and half of Su Clan's Sixteen's body emerged. Her pair of little dragon horns on her head radiated an irresistible allure. It tempted anyone to touch them.","\"Sixteen, why are you here?\" Song Shuhang inquired while leaning closer to her. \"I'm just in the early stages of preparing for transcending the tribulation. It's too soon.\"","\"I've come to bring you a gift,\" Su Clan's Sixteen announced while raising her dragon horn and knocking Song Shuhang away."]},{"number":2393,"title":"Chapter 2393 The Dominant Youngster, Song Shuhang","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang found himself utterly bewildered.","Even though he was currently in his primordial spirit form that was not as robust as his original physical body, being sent flying by a gentle bump from Su Clan's Sixteen seemed rather unusual.","\"Oops, sorry, Shuhang. I can't quite control the power of the dragon horn right now,\" Su Clan's Sixteen lamented while reaching out to rub the small dragon horn on her head. When she saw Song Shuhang bending over in that flirtatious manner, she had intended to playfully nudge his chest with her head. She had not expected to send him flying.","\"Does it hurt?\" Su Clan's Sixteen asked with genuine concern.","\"It doesn't hurt at all. As long as the damage doesn't reach the level where I'd scream in pain instantly, it's not painful,\" Song Shuhang reassured her while confidently patting his chest.","Had Su Clan's Sixteen experienced some fortuitous encounters recently? The impact force of her dragon horn had increased so dramatically.","After regaining his footing, Song Shuhang sat down next to Su Clan's Sixteen and faced her while maintaining eye contact. \"Sixteen, aren't you planning to come out of the spatial tunnel?\"","At this moment, Su Clan's Sixteen was still partially inside the spatial gate, with her lower half still inside.","\"Yes, I can't come out for now. Once I leave, I won't be able to return. My trial isn't over yet, so I can't give up halfway,\" Su Clan's Sixteen replied.","Having explained her situation, she reached out and retrieved a silver mask. She handed it to Song Shuhang with a warm smile. \"This is a gift for you.\"","\"A gift? Why did you suddenly decide to give me a mask?\" Song Shuhang inquired, puzzled by the gesture.","Meanwhile, he discreetly recorded this scene with his mental energy and was planning to share the gift from the adorable Fairy Sixteen on his cultivation chat circle of friends, finally having something worth showing off.","Well, Tyrannical Song was still a young man, and like his peers, he enjoyed checking his social media. Unfortunately, he hadn't had much to showcase on his social platforms.","\"Yes, this mask is a treasure that conceals one's heavenly secrets and prevents divination from locking onto you. Plus, it's directly worn on the Essence Soul, so there's no need to worry about losing it... I think you should make use of it now,\" Su Clan's Sixteen explained while describing the effects of the magical treasure mask.","\"Concealing heavenly secrets?\" Song Shuhang raised an eyebrow, intrigued by the concept.","Humans often experienced a sense of déjà vu with certain things.","\"Let me think,\" Song Shuhang said while rubbing his chin.","His recent experiences had been quite extensive and diverse. Furthermore, when he was in the man-made small world, Unknown White 1-33 had fed him an entire world's data package. Right now, Song Shuhang felt a slight delay in his brain's reaction when retrieving memories.","After a moment, an image resurfaced in his mind.","\"It's Senior Copper Trigram's primordial spirit!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed, his eyes lighting up as he remembered.","Back in the Black Dragon World, a group of Nine Provinces Number One Group members had been swept into a heavenly tribulation, and each of them had been bestowed the title of 'Ancient Sage.' Even Immortal Master Copper Trigram was a part of the 'Ancient Sage Group.'","Song Shuhang recalled that Senior Copper Trigram's primordial spirit had worn a mask to conceal his true appearance.","\"Senior Copper Trigram? Then, we can confirm it with him during the Su Clan's annual meeting,\" Su Clan's Sixteen suggested.","Song Shuhang nodded, wearing a smile. \"Yes, Senior Copper Trigram should be attending the annual gathering, right?\"","The last time Senior Copper Trigram had emerged was during the holidays. Song Shuhang wondered if he was still in the main world this time or if he had been captured and taken back to the mysterious island.","\"Seven said he would invite all group members to the annual gathering, so Senior Copper Trigram shouldn't be absent. Well, it's about time for me to return to the mystic realm,\" Su Clan's Sixteen said while leaning forward slightly. She extended her hand to adjust the mask on Song Shuhang's face. \"We'll meet again at the annual meeting,\" she added.","\"Wait a moment, Sixteen,\" Song Shuhang said while reaching for an eye drop and presenting it to Su Clan's Sixteen. \"These are eye drops. When applied to your life-bound magical treasure, it can give rise to a weak spiritual intelligence. You should be able to make use of it.\"","He had initially intended to present the eye drops to Sixteen during the annual gathering. However, her unexpected visit through space prompted him to offer it to her now.","Su Clan's Sixteen accepted the eye droplets with a smile, clearly pleased with the gift.","\"You must attend the annual gathering. I have something important to discuss with you,\" Su Clan's Sixteen said after stowing away the eye drops. She knew that Song Shuhang was constantly busy.","\"Don't worry, I definitely won't miss it,\" Song Shuhang assured her.","As his cultivation level increased, he had an array of tricks up his sleeve. Even if unforeseen circumstances arose, he could divide himself in half if necessary—sending the upper half of his body to participate in the Spirit River Su Clan's annual gathering while using the light of virtue to handle any unexpected events."]},{"number":2394,"title":"Chapter 2394 Don’t Cling to the Wool","paragraphs":["After receiving a confirmed reply, Su Clan's Sixteen waved at Song Shuhang and, along with her sister, the White Dragon, retreated to the trial grounds.","The scene was picturesque, with a serene lake, lush green mountains, and a bamboo raft gently drifting on the water.","Su Clan's Sixteen stood on the bamboo raft while holding a bamboo pole with one hand while supporting her waist with the other.","\"How are you feeling?\" the White Dragon asked.","\"My back hurts,\" Su Clan's Sixteen replied.","The White Dragon was left speechless.","They had all learned from Song Shuhang, and their responses were intentionally tricky. It was challenging for others to continue the conversation.","Stretching lazily, Su Clan's Sixteen released the bamboo pole and settled down on the bamboo raft. She retrieved her small life-bound treasured saber.","The White Dragon asked, \"Are you planning to awaken its spirit?\"","\"Yes, in the upcoming trials, having the life-bound magical treasure awaken its intelligence will enhance efficiency,\" Su Clan's Sixteen nodded.","Both Su Clan's Sixteen and the White Dragon had no doubts about the effectiveness of the eye drops. Song Shuhang possessed an array of peculiar items, and it wouldn't be surprising if he could produce treasures with various effects.","Sitting cross-legged, Su Clan's Sixteen placed the treasured saber horizontally on her lap.","The White Dragon extended her claws and retrieved the eye drops given to her by Song Shuhang.","\"I wonder where he got these from. These eye drops alone have such a remarkable effect,\" the White Dragon commented as she opened the bottle to reveal only a single drop of the precious liquid, which seemed rather meager.","Su Clan's Sixteen took the small bottle and carefully dripped the eye drop onto her life-bound treasured saber.","As the eye drop dripped from the bottle, the entire body of the White Dragon suddenly tensed up.","\"Sister White Dragon, are you trying to kill me?\" Su Clan's Sixteen exclaimed while grabbing the ancestral golden dragon's body, which had wrapped itself around her neck.","\"It was a mistake, my mistake,\" the White Dragon hastily released her grip.","\"Is this eye drop really that extraordinary?\" Su Clan's Sixteen inquired, her curiosity piqued. She couldn't fathom why the White Dragon, with her status, would be so surprised.","\"It's indeed special. This potion contains an aura that far surpasses that of an Immortal. It's nothing short of a 'supreme treasure.' The only downside is its limited quantity. I wonder where Shuhang acquired such a treasure,\" the White Dragon explained.","While they conversed, Su Clan's Sixteen's life-bound treasured saber began to undergo a transformation. The originally small and delicate saber gradually elongated and became more slender.","Taking advantage of this moment, Su Clan's Sixteen retrieved some forging materials from her cosmos bag and placed them next to her life-bound treasured saber.","The White Dragon breathed out a stream of flames, using her dragon fire to refine the weapon directly.","In this day and age, not having a formidable life-bound magical treasure was rather embarrassing. With the White Dragon's assistance, Su Clan's Sixteen's treasured saber quickly underwent a transformation.","The initially petite treasured saber evolved into... an umbrella.","\"The form has changed,\" Su Clan's Sixteen observed as she raised the umbrella and unfurled it.","\"It's essentially an additional scabbard,\" the White Dragon remarked while blowing out two columns of smoke from her nostrils. \"I'm only assisting in the refinement this time. Its form changed because you and the treasured saber's nascent consciousness guided the process.\"","Su Clan's Sixteen reached out, grasped the umbrella handle, and withdrew a long saber adorned with ancient patterns carved into its surface.","The long saber quivered slightly.","Sixteen released her grip, and the long saber began to orbit around her, akin to Senior White's Meteor Sword.","\"Heartstrings, return to the sheath,\" Su Clan's Sixteen softly commanded.","With a swoosh, the long saber obediently returned to its scabbard.","Su Clan's Sixteen beamed with satisfaction as she stood up once more and propped up her bamboo pole.","\"Is your back no longer hurting?\" the White Dragon inquired.","\"It's no longer hurting as long as I'm in a good mood,\" Su Clan's Sixteen replied. She lightly pushed the bamboo pole, and the bamboo raft shot forward like an arrow.","With the strengthened life-bound magical treasure, her efficiency in overcoming the trials would significantly improve. This would allow her to return to the Spirit River Su Clan sooner and prepare for the upcoming annual meeting.","Upon her return, she needed to make a mental note of what she wished to discuss with Song Shuhang and organize her thoughts.","\"Are you prepared to reveal everything to him?\" the White Dragon hung around Sixteen's neck while fluttering in the wind.","\"Yes, I want to disclose everything about Su Clan's Sixteen to him,\" Su Clan's Sixteen declared suddenly, her bamboo pole thrown with all her might. It shattered a colossal illusory beast not far away.","*****","Song Shuhang first shared the news of his new mask gift with his friends in the cultivation chat.","Then, he initiated a private conversation with the Demon Emperor, who was on his blacklist.","\"Get lost!\" The reply remained icy and dismissive.","\"Not Only Senior, would you like to divine my location now? There's a surprise waiting for you,\" Song Shuhang responded.","The Demon Emperor was rendered speechless.","What did he mean?","Was he asking me to divine his location?","Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has already approached me?","In an instant, numerous thoughts raced through the Demon Emperor's mind.","\"Do you want me to divine Tyrannical Song's location?\" the Demon Emperor pondered.","A while later, the Demon Emperor clenched his teeth and decided to divine. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was known to be a crafty and ruthless individual, so it was safer to conduct a divination just in case.","After the divination, Demon Emperor frowned, troubled.","Regarding the whereabouts of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the heavenly secrets were shrouded and made it akin to searching for a needle in a haystack through divination.","Receiving such a divination left not only the Demon Emperor feeling a tad uneasy.","\"Not Only Senior, can't you determine my location, can you? Surprised? Are you surprised?\" Song Shuhang messaged once more.","The Demon Emperor remained speechless.","\"Well then, goodnight, Senior.\" With these parting words, Song Shuhang concluded the private conversation.","His primary aim was to test the effectiveness of Sixteen's mask. The experiment was a resounding success, as the mask's ability to conceal his heavenly secrets surpassed his expectations.","\"This way, when I attend the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting, I won't have to worry about the Fat Ball suddenly appearing at my doorstep,\" Song Shuhang mused.","At present, he found himself in a quandary. He hoped the Fat Ball boss would launch an attack sooner so he could trap the Fat Ball boss's alternate account in the?artificial small world and seal it into an egg.","However, he also harbored a wish that the Fat Ball boss would forget about him, an inconspicuous figure, and cease any thoughts of pursuit.","\"Don't hog all the good fortune,\" Pavilion Master Chu chimed in from above.","\"I concur,\" Song Shuhang replied. \"In fact, I'm considering adding a few more significant adversaries to my blacklist.\"","Pavilion Master Chu was left baffled.","\"Black-skinned Soft Feather, has your main body arrived?\" Song Shuhang called downstairs.","\"She should be here soon,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather replied.","\"Then, you all should get ready. Once Soft Feather and the goods are prepared, we'll set off for the Spirit River Su Clan!\" Song Shuhang announced.","It was Black-skinned Soft Feather's first time attending the annual event, so she felt a touch of nervousness.","She intended to arrive early at the Spirit River Su Clan and familiarize herself with the surroundings.","*****","At Spirit Butterfly Island,?The Celestial Thearch reclined in a bathtub, leisurely blowing bubbles.","Simultaneously, she began placing seals on her own body.","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was scheduled to assess Soft Feather's recent progress in her cultivation tomorrow. The additional seals were a precaution to prevent herself from unintentionally injuring Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly."]},{"number":2395,"title":"Chapter 2395 I’ll Become A Big Butterfly","paragraphs":["\"I wish to surprise Lord Spirit Butterfly tomorrow, but I can't really beat him up. I think the combat strength of a Sixth Stage should suffice,\" The Celestial Thearch muttered.","She was a person of her word. She had promised to live on the Spirit Butterfly Island for a week on Soft Feather's behalf, so she wouldn't give up halfway or make a low-level mistake.","Also... Other than waiting for the mysterious island to appear on the Spirit Butterfly Island, there was something else she wanted to know.","She wanted to take advantage of this week to get along with Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly and get more information about Soft Feather.","After fusing with Soft Feather's ghost spirit, she had developed some interest in Soft Feather as an individual. She wanted to know more about her and her life experiences since she was young, as well as... her birth.","\"Ah.\" Because she was slightly distracted, a small error occurred in the array on her arm.","The Celestial Thearch rubbed the formation diagram on her arm. \"Well, it's within acceptable margins. There won't be any problems.\"","With so many formations suppressing her, she would definitely be able to perform perfectly when she accepted the 'test' of Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly tomorrow.","..","..","On the other side, in a study room in the Spirit Butterfly Island, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly held the book in one hand and the teacup in the other while sipping the tea carefully.","Suddenly, a gust of cold wind blew through the window.","Sage Monarch?Spirit Butterfly shivered.","\"Hmm?\" Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly raised his head in confusion and looked out of the window. With his Eighth Stage Saint Monarch physique, he wasn't afraid of cold or heat. Why did he suddenly feel a little cold?","At that moment, a butterfly flew over from the window and placed a large package on Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly's table. \"Sage Monarch, the treasures for the transaction with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song are ready.\"","\"Thank you for your hard work,\" Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly said gently.","He reached out and opened the big package.","There was a batch of precious eighth-grade treasures and a precious Universe Bracelet inside.","Those Eighth Stage treasures were used to exchange for Song Shuhang's eye drops, and the Cosmos Bracelet was prepared for his daughter Soft Feather.","In the upcoming Su Clan's annual meeting, Song Shuhang was going to open the Wealth Throne. He wondered if this throne could be secretly manipulated.","If possible, he wanted to borrow Song Shuhang's hand and give this Universe Bracelet to Soft Feather so that she could have more fun at the Su Clan's annual party.","Thereupon, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly used his own account to send Song Shuhang a private message.","Speaking of which, Song Shuhang was also the only male cultivator in Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly's friend list who was of the same age as Soft Feather. This was a great honor!","*******","The night faded and dawn arrived.","At the Medicine Master's laboratory, after working overtime the entire night before, Xiaodian finally transported all the treasures that Song Shuhang had exchanged with the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. Having such a professional delivery elf was simply a blessing for all express delivery industries.","\"Oh right, Xiaodian, has Senior Spirit Butterfly's package arrived?\" Song Shuhang asked.","Last night, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly had contacted him in the middle of the night and asked him for a favor.","Here, Tyrannical Song.\" Xiaodian handed Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly's package to Song Shuhang.","\"Thank you for your hard work.\" Song Shuhang opened the bag and took out a spatial bracelet. This bracelet didn't only represent a spatial magical treasure, but also the wishes of a father.","In order to make Soft Feather even happier at the Su Clan's annual banquet, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly had done everything he could.","Song Shuhang hoped that in the future, he could become an outstanding father like Senior Spirit Butterfly. Therefore, he hoped that he could give birth to a cute and beautiful fairy in the future.","However, because he wasn't very confident in his own genes, the beauty of the little fairy would depend on the mother's genes.","\"Black-skinned Soft Feather, isn't Soft Feather here yet?\" Song Shuhang asked again.","Last night, they said that they would be arriving soon. Now that the sky was bright, why hadn't Soft Feather come yet?","Could she have gotten lost?","He still remembered that Soft Feather had a slight tendency to get lost. Back then, in order to prevent her daughter from getting lost, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly had specially made a magical treasure for her called 'To be able to see a thousand miles, to be able to reach a higher level'.","But logically speaking, Soft Feather was already at the Fifth Stage Realm. Even if she took the wrong path, she should be able to find her destination by flying around on her flying sword, right?","\"She should be here by now,\" said the black-skinned Soft Feather with a frown.","\"Did something happen?\" Lady Onion asked.","\"I don't think so. The connection between me and my main body is still there. If something really happened to her, I would definitely sense it. So, she might have encountered something fun on the way and was delayed,\" replied the black-skinned Soft Feather.","\"Then let's tidy up first and wait for her to come over.\" Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and put all the treasures into the Wealth Throne.","Of course, he would not distribute all these treasures. He would keep a portion of the treasures that were useful to himself, his disciples, and his family. The rest would be used to distribute wealth.","After all, as his disciples' cultivation increased, the time would come to forge a life-bound magical treasure for them. As their master, he naturally had to prepare the materials for them.","This was Song Shuhang's first time being a master, so he had no experience. Therefore, he could only do whatever he wanted to his disciples. He didn't force their hand and just let fate take its course.","The interaction between master and disciple was also different from that between official master and disciple in the cultivation world.","******","At this moment, in the depths of the vast sea, Soft Feather had indeed encountered an 'accident'.","However, this incident was not the 'interesting incident' that she liked.","At that moment, Soft Feather had transformed into a small fish and was carefully hiding under the coral rock. The Almighty Merchant had wrapped a blanket around her body and turned it into fish scales to protect her.","In the sky above the sea where she was, two massive leviathans were engaged in an intense battle.","When these two beings fought, the space around them collapsed. The aftershock of the battle kept rippling and shattered everything in the void.","Both of them were experts at the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm or above...Moreover, they had already unleashed their true strength. They were not afraid of being detected and attacked with their full strength.","One had to know that the collapse of the Heavenly Dao was imminent, and Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals were hiding from the world. They didn't dare to show their faces at all, afraid that they would be dragged into the great tribulation of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao and die.","\"This is bad. There's no chance to escape at all.\" Soft Feather, who had transformed into a fish, had tears streaming down her face.","She felt that she might very well become a pile of fish today.","Yesterday, the butterfly that she had transformed into had happily left Spirit Butterfly Island. When she was flying towards the Jiangnan area, these two leviathans suddenly tore through the air and started fighting.","They had been fighting all night, and it was not over yet.","What made Soft Feather even more uncomfortable was that these two leviathans seemed to have fallen in love with this sea area. They stayed in this sea area for the entire night and didn't move away.","\"Father, I shouldn't have escaped from the Spirit Butterfly Island yesterday.\" The small fish that Soft Feather had transformed into opened its mouth and spat out a string of bubbles."]},{"number":2396,"title":"Chapter 2396 Song, You Are A Dead Man!","paragraphs":["Soft Feather felt that before setting out yesterday, she should have consulted a divination. This way, she could have delayed her departure based on the divination results, ideally until this morning when she could safely leave Spirit Butterfly Island. This would allow her to skillfully avoid the ongoing battle between these two formidable individuals.","\"If I manage to escape this time without being turned into a pile of fish meat, I must remember to consult divination before any future outings,\" Soft Feather resolved inwardly.","One of her strengths was her ability to learn from her mistakes and improve her skills each time she identified an error.","While Soft Feather was silently updating her life's guidelines, the two celestial powerhouses in the sky took a brief break after an intense exchange of blows.","Both of them appeared somewhat fatigued, which was unusual given their extraordinary power. Normally, they could engage in battles lasting for decades or even centuries without issue.","But how long had they been at it this time? Earth, their current battleground, was evidently not their first choice. It was possible that they had fought for years before arriving on Earth.","Nevertheless, this was an opportune moment!","Soft Feather felt elated and began to survey her surroundings while searching for an opportunity to discreetly exit the vicinity of the ongoing battle between the two powerhouses.","At that moment, the large figure in the sky on the left side spoke in a deep voice, \"Immortal Fairy White Bones, our continued pursuit is futile. Regardless of where you seek refuge, you cannot elude my grasp. Return the White Emperor Sutra to me. With the imminent transformation of the world, I cannot afford to waste time on you.\"","The towering, grape-colored individual held a peculiar ruler-like magical treasure emitting a pitch-black fog of a world-destroying virus. His voice thundered like a storm and possessed an uncanny penetrative force, even reaching Soft Feather underwater.","He was speaking in an ancient language, which carried inherent power. Soft Feather, submerged beneath the water, could understand some of it, thanks to the occasional transmission of knowledge by her ghost spirit, which had been forcefully taken over by the Celestial Thearch. Among these transmissions was knowledge of ancient languages.","Soft Feather could comprehend most of the content in the ancient language, but she couldn't pronounce it.","\"This purple powerhouse is engaged in battle with someone named Immortal Fairy White Bones? It sounds like Immortal Fairy White Bones may have taken something valuable from him,\" Soft Feather speculated, vaguely recalling the name Immortal Fairy White Bones from somewhere.","\"You shameless wretch! Since when did the White Emperor Sutra become your treasure? And do you really think you can control me?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones retorted while sending out a flying sword as she spoke. She then conjured a pair of enormous hammers from nowhere and smashed them together. Gritting her teeth, she continued, \"King Kun, do you really believe my strongest skill is swordsmanship? Allow me to enlighten you: my true strength lies in the Way of the Hammer. When I employ the Hammer Dao, my power is ten times that of the Sword Dao! Back in the day, when I delivered a divine speech in front of others, it was about the Hammer Dao. If it weren't for the fact that using a hammer would damage my image, I would have hammered you to death long ago!\"","The grape-colored King Kun furrowed his brow. In his distant memories, Immortal Fairy White Bones had indeed given a divine speech about the Way of the Hammer.","However...","\"Ten times?\" He sneered and tightly gripped the virus-infused ruler. \"Then let me experience the tenfold power of Immortal Fairy White Bones' Hammer Dao!\"","The White Emperor Sutra held immense significance for him. With the world's transformation imminent, securing the White Emperor Sutra, which pointed directly to the origin of the Heavenly Dao, was crucial for his advancement and aspiration to become the supreme entity in the myriad worlds.","\"Very well! Since you insist on pushing your luck, I'll turn you into a pancake today with my hammer,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones declared as she adopted a hammer stance and her aura intensified. Her aura enveloped the surrounding space and expanded the battlefield's scope once again.","Soft Feather, concealed beneath the water, felt her heart race.","Finding an opportunity to escape seemed impossible now. The battle between Immortal Fairy White Bones and King Kun had grown even more challenging for her to evade.","What should she do?","Could she seek help from the Heavenly Emperor?","She hesitated, fearing it might bruise her ego.","However, she recalled Senior Song's advice: \"What's the worth of your dignity? When necessary, toss it away, and then pick it back up. It's better to lose your dignity than to lose life.\"","With Senior Song's wisdom guiding her, Soft Feather activated the cultivation chat feature and prepared to send a distress signal to The Celestial Thearch.","Senior Song's cultivation chat function was truly remarkable.","Just as Soft Feather opened the cultivation chat function, a message arrived.","Coincidentally, it was from Song Shuhang. \"Soft Feather, where are you having fun? Don't get too carried away. I've already prepared the treasures and am ready to set off for the Su Clan's Spirit River. Where are you? I'll come pick you up!\"","Song Shuhang had meticulously organized the Wealth Throne and programmed the water clone puppets to engage their roommates in chat groups. If everything went as planned, perhaps his roommates would awaken to 'cultivation' in three to four months.","Since he had nothing else to attend to, Song Shuhang gathered all the pendants and decided to contact Soft Feather for a pick-up.","\"Senior Song, I might be in trouble today. There's a chance I might end up as sashimi,\" Soft Feather hastily replied.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Judging by the distance, Soft Feather should have already reached the vicinity of Jiangnan, right?","Could someone be targeting her in the Jiangnan region?","This would be a direct affront to Tyrannical Song! After all, the cultivation world tacitly recognized that the Jiangnan region was under the protection of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","While Song Shuhang had a thick skin, it didn't mean he enjoyed being slapped in the face.","\"Soft Feather, where exactly are you in the Jiangnan region now?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Senior Song... I haven't arrived in the Jiangnan region yet. I'm currently hiding in a sea area. I've been here for a night, and it's a bit chilly. I don't have my exact coordinates, but I believe it's the sea area between Spirit Butterfly Island and the Jiangnan region,\" Soft Feather responded.","\"I can lock onto your approximate position. Senior Song, can you give me your phone?\" Black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhang's shadow and requested.","Song Shuhang handed over his phone and simultaneously sent a message. \"I'll have Black-skinned Soft Feather lock onto your location and pick you up immediately. Who is the other party?\"","\"I've locked onto the location. It's right here,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather pointed to a coordinate on the map displayed on her phone.","Pavilion Master Chu, who had been eavesdropping on the conversation, suggested, \"Since the distance isn't too far, I can teleport a Branded Wooden Saber to you first. Then, you can use your Inner World to perform a spatial jump. This way, the disturbance will be minimized.\"","\"Agreed!\" Song Shuhang nodded.","Pavilion Master Chu elegantly flicked her hair and teleported a branded wooden saber near Soft Feather.","Song Shuhang activated his Inner World, created an exit at the coordinates of the wooden saber, and activated the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure defense before stepping inside.","\"Immortal Fairy White Bones...\" Song Shuhang began to speak, but was interrupted by a delicate voice that emanated from the void.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","It seemed that a black pot with the Song family's name on it had arrived, and it was quite a sizable and dark one."]},{"number":2397,"title":"Chapter 2397 The Lesson from Pavilion Master Chu, Etched in Memory!","paragraphs":["Once again, the sky revealed a majestic figure, a King Kun with a deep purple-grape hue, perfectly matching the massive black pot below.","In this day and age, it seemed that wherever there was a Kun, there was usually a pot not far behind.","\"Don't mind her; let's first find Soft Feather and get her out of here,\" reminded Pavilion Master Chu, who perched atop Song Shuhang's head.","Whether it was King Kun or Immortal Fairy White Bones, both possessed combat prowess akin to that of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders or even Immortals. There was no need to engage in a perilous showdown over a black pot.","At that moment, the most rational course of action was to rescue Soft Feather and make a swift exit.","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement, and his divine sense swept through the sea area in search for Soft Feather's presence. However, at this moment, Soft Feather was concealed beneath the 'Almighty Merchant's Blanket,' transformed into a small fish. Despite the protagonist's divine sense scanning the surroundings, he couldn't pinpoint her location.","\"Soft Feather, where are you hiding? I should be close to you.\" Song Shuhang quickly activated the 'cultivation chat' function and sent a message to Soft Feather.","Upon receiving the message, Soft Feather, in the form of a small fish, peeked out from behind a coral reef. She spotted Song Shuhang in the distance.","\"It's Senior Song!\" she exclaimed.","She had been saved.","In this moment, Song Shuhang's stature in Soft Feather's eyes grew, and he became as towering as Venerable Spirit Butterfly's Abba.","\"Senior Song, I see you.\" The small fish that Soft Feather had transformed into swiftly swam over and nestled into his arms.","Song Shuhang carefully cradled this beautiful little fish and asked through telepathy, \"Is it you, Soft Feather?\"","\"Yes, it's me.\" Soft Feather joyfully wagged her tail.","At that moment, her body, which had been tense throughout the night, finally relaxed. Even the cold seawater seemed to have turned warm.","Although Song Shuhang was only a Seventh Stage Venerable, he was the one in the Nine Provinces Number One Group who had clashed with major players the most, and he was still alive and kicking. Hence, when facing formidable opponents, he was considered a safe and reliable choice.","Furthermore, after the recent crisis, Soft Feather experienced a surge of new emotions—exhilaration!","She had teetered on the brink of life and death for a while, which had left her both nervous and excited.","Indeed, venturing out from Spirit Butterfly Island to find Senior Song had been the right decision!","They had only reached halfway, and they had already encountered such an exhilarating experience.","If the appetizer was this captivating, there was undoubtedly more excitement awaiting her after she officially reunited with Senior Song.","Her whole being was on the verge of igniting.","...","...","After confirming that the little fish in his hand was indeed Soft Feather, Song Shuhang breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Let's go!\" he held the small fish, which was Soft Feather in disguise, and turned to return to his Inner World.","This time, his Inner World opened with no trouble. In the sky, neither King Kun nor Immortal Fairy White Bones had set up any 'spatial lockdown' techniques.","\"Hurry up,\" Pavilion Master Chu urged from above.","Song Shuhang didn't waste any time and stepped into his Inner World.","Just as half of his body entered the Inner World, a formidable will descended from the sky and swept across his location. It was the purple-grape King Kun. Upon hearing Immortal Fairy White Bones' alluring shout, it grew wary and immediately sent a strand of divine sense to scan the area.","For King Kun, it didn't matter if the aura that suddenly appeared below was the one surnamed Song that Immortal Fairy White Bones had mentioned. It wouldn't hurt to keep a vigilant eye on it.","\"Eh?\" With half of his body already inside the Inner World, Song Shuhang softly exclaimed. He had sensed King Kun's divine sense scanning him.","And then...","As he made his escape, he sent out a Golden Core QR code to meet the divine sense of the magnificent Grape King Kun!","Song SHuhang cherished the teachings of his seniors. Pavilion Master Chu had previously advised him not to monopolize all the opportunities.","He found his advice sensible, so he contemplated adding a few more major players to his blacklist. In the future, when the need arose to exploit opportunities, he could occasionally switch to another one. He didn't want to stubbornly latch onto the Demon Emperor for his own gain.","Now, this King Kun was a perfect candidate.","At the very least, he was an Immortal big shot, and he had crossed paths with Immortal Fairy White Bones, who was connected to Slow-Witted Song. Moreover, King Kun had proactively scanned his divine sense.","Why reject a friend who had come knocking on his door?","\"Let's be friends, King Kun,\" Song Shuhang said.","He was well-versed in this sort of thing.","After capturing the Golden Core QR code, he brought Soft Feather with him and entered his Inner World.","His life-saving trump card, the Inner World, had finally come into play today. It had truly saved his life.","This was a heartwarming moment.","...","...","On the other side, King Kun's divine sense had just swept over the Golden Core QR code.","Then, an unexpected prompt appeared in his mind.","\"Congratulations, you've already added 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song' as a friend. From now on, there will be no distance between you. No matter how far apart you are, your two hearts will always be able to communicate without any distance.\"","This notification had come without warning.","\"A mental attack?\" King Kun, who was engaged in a battle with Immortal Fairy White Bones, was momentarily stunned.","What was this? It could actually directly affect his mind?","In battles between experts, a moment of distraction was a fatal flaw.","Naturally, Immortal Fairy White Bones wouldn't miss such an excellent opportunity.","\"Eat this!\" she exclaimed while calling out all sorts of martial moves.","Behind her, an energy-based skeleton giant materialized and attached itself to her body.","Simultaneously, the pair of hammers in Immortal Fairy White Bones' hands vanished into thin air and reappeared in the hands of the white bone giant. It transformed into a pair of giant hammers. Evidently, these hammers were exclusive magical tools for the white bone giant.","Once the skeletal giant appeared, it swung its twin hammers and brought them down heavily on King Kun's head.","Furthermore, the twin hammers were enveloped in laws. The left hammer represented withering, and the right hammer represented decay. They looked like the epitome of villainy.","The pair of hammers struck King Kun's body, penetrating through his layers of defense. King Kun's once-proud protective abilities had completely withered and decayed under the influence of the twin hammers' law of decay.","Then, the left hammer, imbued with the Withering Death Law, struck King Kun's body from a peculiar angle.","Under the hammer's impact, King Kun's plump body shriveled up. His skin dried up, and the purple luster faded.","The intense pain contorted King Kun's face.","All of this was caused by that accursed 'prompt' in his mind.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song? There was no distance between their hearts?","Darn it!","One day, I'll ensure that the ruler in my hand is no longer distant from your heart—I'll use it to stab a hole in your chest!","Just as King Kun was losing his mind, another notification sounded in his mind.","\"Ding ~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has already moved you into 'Blacklist 2'. Do you want to move him into the 'Blacklist' as well?\"","King Kun was speechless.","After living for so many years, King Kun suddenly felt like cursing again.","First, he added himself as a friend, and then he moved himself to the blacklist. What kind of foolish operation was this?","...","...","In the Inner World, Song Shuhang looked at the solitary King Kun, lying quietly in 'Blacklist 2,' and smiled."]},{"number":2398,"title":"Chapter 2398 Song Gradually Becoming a Qualified Master","paragraphs":["Just a moment ago, Song Shuhang attempted to create a 'Blacklist 2,' and to his surprise, he succeeded.","As his strength and realm continued to improve, his authority to perform various operations in the game also increased.","So, with a smile on his face, he added King Kun to the 'Blacklist 2.' After all, the original 'blacklist' was in name only; in reality, it was more like a super VIP list. The individuals on it were all high-ranking players with significant authority, and normally, it would be unwise to provoke them.","That's why Song Shuhang came up with the idea of creating a 'blacklist' in the truest sense, where he could list the big shots who could genuinely be useful for him to exploit.","\"Even though you're the only member on Blacklist 2 right now, don't worry. In the future, the number of members on this list will gradually increase.\" Song Shuhang silently promised himself.","Next, he attempted to give King Kun a title and nickname, and once again, he succeeded.","[Change King Kun's title and nickname to 'Purple Grape'? [Confirm/No?]","With a knowing smile, Song Shuhang confirmed the change.","This nickname was a perfect fit for Senior King Kun.","...","...","On the other side, King Kun, who had endured several strikes from Immortal Fairy White Bones, was dehydrated and aging. He had finally managed to interrupt Immortal Fairy White Bones's continuous attacks and create some distance between them to give himself a moment to catch his breath.","At that moment, another notification sounded in his mind: [Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has used his authority to change your title and nickname to 'Purple Grape.' We hope you like it.]","King Kun was left speechless.","Really, what's going on here?","It was getting a bit too much.","'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, don't let me find an opportunity. Otherwise, I'll make you, the 'first Sage in a thousand years,' the fastest Profound Sage to meet his end in a thousand years!' King Kun swore to himself.","\"Ha, why are you running away? Weren't you trying to snatch the White Emperor Sutra from me? You think you can steal from me with that cowardly appearance of yours?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones taunted King Kun. \"Why do you look so fierce on the surface? If you're not convinced, come at me!\"","\"Hehe.\" King Kun raised his head and looked at Immortal Fairy White Bones. Instead of getting angry, he laughed. \"Even though your White Bone Giant mode is powerful, how long can you keep it up?\"","The laws of Withering Death and Decay were top-tier among the laws of Death. Sustaining attacks using both of these law attributes consumed a tremendous amount of energy. Moreover, King Kun and Immortal Fairy White Bones had been engaged in a prolonged chase and battle even before they arrived in the main world, Earth. Both sides were already fatigued.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was left speechless.","The skin of a Kun divine beast was incredibly tough, and despite her critical attacks earlier, she hadn't managed to harm its core. In terms of defense, she was at a disadvantage.","Furthermore, Immortal Fairy White Bones was feeling a bit resentful.","\"Song, remember this!\" She gritted her teeth.","She had sensed a familiar aura earlier and was certain that the guy named Song had sneaked nearby.","She had thought that this guy had come secretly to help her, so she had been delighted.","But in the end... That guy had only shown his face and then quietly disappeared.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was furious.","She intended to keep this in her little black book.","Once she found a way to shake off King Kun, she would also find a way to track down Song and let him taste what it felt like to be flattened into a pancake by the Death Twin Hammers.","**********","In the Inner World, Song Shuhang had left a small eyeball-sized hole at the exit of the Inner World. He had created it to observe the battle between Immortal Fairy White Bones and King Kun.","\"Can you see the details of the battle?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked curiously. Immortal Fairy White Bones was one of the two parties in the battle, so she was interested in knowing the outcome.","\"I can't see anything at all. The hole is too small, and there's a powerful energy field surrounding King Kun and Immortal Fairy White Bones that's obstructing my vision,\" Song Shuhang regretfully replied.","\"Alright then, you guys move to my main body's location... I'll go out and take a look,\" Pavilion Master Chu said casually.","With that, her fluffy tuft of hair jumped down from Song Shuhang's head and exited the Inner World with a whoosh.","Pavilion Master Chu wasn't familiar with Immortal Fairy White Bones, so she had no intention of helping her deal with King Kun.","She simply wanted to stay behind and watch how things unfolded while enjoying the show. At the same time, she wanted to broadcast the battle between King Kun and Immortal Fairy White Bones to Song Shuhang and the others.","After all, duels among immortals were extremely rare, and most ordinary cultivators would never have the opportunity to witness such high-level battles.","Even if some lucky cultivators did manage to witness the battle of immortals safely, it was very likely that they would fall into a coma due to their inadequate cultivation level. When immortals fought, every move they made was accompanied by their own 'Dao.' Those who were not strong enough would not be able to withstand the explosive information contained within these 'Dao,' leading to paralysis.","Of course, Pavilion Master Chu would filter and block some of the information during the battle to prevent it from affecting Lady Onion and the hamster.","...","...","In the void, Immortal Fairy White Bones gritted her teeth. After assessing her current condition, she controlled the White Bone Giant to launch an attack on King Kun.","At such a moment, she couldn't afford to show weakness.","Currently, she and King Kun were in a situation of 'either you die or I die.'","Either she hammered King Kun into submission... or she would be killed by King Kun.","She had no intention of dying before she had the chance to flatten Slow-Witted Song into a pancake. Therefore, her only option was to turn King Kun into a pancake first.","Additionally, there was a divine sword lurking in the void like a viper while waiting for the right moment to strike. It was the divine sword that Immortal Fairy White Bones had thrown out when she took out her hammer.","This was her backup plan and a means of preserving her life.","If she were truly killed by King Kun, the 'white bone' hidden within this divine sword would allow her to rise again.","\"Hehehe, how long can you hold on, Immortal Fairy White Bones?\" At that moment, King Kun was becoming even more composed.","He no longer attempted to directly confront Immortal Fairy White Bones's attacks but instead focused on evasion. He was determined to drag the battle out until Immortal Fairy White Bones exhausted herself.","Right now, Immortal Fairy White Bones was merely enduring and launching relentless attacks. Once this round of attacks ended, she would inevitably reveal an opening, and that's when King Kun would seize the opportunity to take her down in one decisive blow.","...","...","Below, in the Inner World.","Pavilion Master Chu's tuft of hair floated leisurely on the surface of the sea as she observed the battle in the sky.","At the same time, she recorded the battle scene in the sky and transmitted it to Song Shuhang and the others through her connection with her main body.","During the broadcast, her main body also provided live commentary for Song Shuhang and the others. It allowed them to gain insights from the battle.","Enjoying the spectacle and providing educational commentary, Pavilion Master Chu was multitasking.","Song Shuhang silently took notes while recording the entire battle scene. This was like a teaching manual for him. In the future, he could use it as a reference to teach his own disciples about 'immortal battles.'","Song Shuhang was gradually becoming a qualified master.","\"Senior Chu, judging from the current situation, it doesn't look good for Immortal Fairy White Bones, does it?\" Soft Feather spoke up.","Pavilion Master Chu's main body, still floating on the sea's surface, yawned lazily. \"Unless there's a sudden turn of events, this battle will likely end poorly for Immortal Fairy White Bones. It's a pity; I was planning to teach you all more about immortal battles.\"","\"So, can we somehow prolong the battle?\" Song Shuhang asked.","Curious, Lady Onion asked, \"How can we extend it?\"","Lady Onion felt a certain fondness for Immortal Fairy White Bones because she sensed the aura of camaraderie from the novel \"All the Monsters in the World Unite as a Family\" in her.","\"Let me make it clear first—I won't interfere,\" Pavilion Master Chu said with a yawn."]},{"number":2399,"title":"Chapter 2399 A Heavily Armed Skeleton!","paragraphs":["\"Unfortunately, I tricked the Molt Ball into sealing and transporting it to Senior White Two's laboratory. Otherwise, the Molt Ball would lock onto my position every now and then and launch a mental corruption attack on me...I can then transfer the mental attack to Senior King Kun through a private chat.\" Song Shuhang said regretfully.","Pavilion Master Chu was left speechless.","\"It's clearly the Molt Ball that countered your attack,\" Sword couldn't help but say. \"Why does it sound like it's your skill?\"","\"This is called sleight of hand,\" Song Shuhang replied while rubbing his chin as he stared at the broadcast screen, lost in thought.","At that moment, Black-Skinned Soft Feather appeared and said, \"Senior Song, if we want to prolong this battle, there are only two options: strengthen Immortal Fairy White Bones or weaken King Kun.\"","\"Yeah, I think so too.\" Song Shuhang nodded and continued, \"I have a few plans in mind. Firstly, I can use the cultivation chat function and my divine third eye to inject a large amount of irrelevant information into King Kun to disrupt his mental state.\"","However, he cautioned that this plan had a low success rate and could lead to a backlash if not executed properly. Moreover, the divine third eye might not be effective against an Immortal-level opponent like King Kun.","Pavilion Master Chu chimed in. \"The method of forcibly injecting information through the cultivation chat channel should be reserved for crucial moments. King Kun will likely be prepared if we use it too soon.\"","\"Fellow Daoist Chu is right.\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet agreed. Song Shuhang also nodded in agreement. The method of forcefully feeding data was very convenient to use, and it was more suitable to be used in the future.","\"What about the other plans?\" the hamster asked while stroking its whiskers.","\"The second plan is to have Immortal Fairy White Bones add me as a friend. Then, I can find a way to remotely transmit energy to her to bolster her condition. However, she hasn't scanned the QR code with her divine sense yet, so I'll need to get it close to her and remind her to add me as a friend.\"","But Soft Feather pointed out the practical challenges of this plan, as it required Immortal Fairy White Bones to pause during a battle that could cost her life.","Song Shuhang then suggested a third plan, \"If we can't strengthen her energy-wise, we can enhance her equipment. I have the eye drops, but they might not be of much use to her since she already has a life-bound magical treasure with a weapon spirit.\"","Soft Feather's eyes lit up. \"That thing is very valuable. I won't give it away casually. Moreover, Immortal Fairy White Bones is already an Immortal, so her life-bound magical treasure must already have a weapon spirit. The eye drops won't be of much use to her,\" Song Shuhang said.","After saying this much, he took out a portion of the eye drops that he had prepared beforehand and handed it to Soft Feather.\" Here, Soft Feather. This is for you.\"","\"Eh? For me? Aren't you going to trade?\" Soft Feather's small hand reached out from the blanket and took the eye drops.","\"I'm giving it to you,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile. This was his way of thanking Soft Feather for taking care of him ever since he started cultivating.","\"Thank you, Senior Song.\" Soft Feather giggled.","Song Shuhang said,\" I don't have anything else to give you. This is the only thing I can give you. It's fine as long as you don't mind giving me a shabby gift.\"","Song Shuhang proposed a fourth plan, \"The fourth plan is to strengthen my 'Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure' and have it tested in a real battle, specifically against King Kun and Immortal Fairy White Bones.\"","\"No, the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts 'Combined Magical Treasure is your life-bound magical treasure. It's too dangerous.\" Pavilion Master Chu frowned. A life-bound magical treasure was different from other magical treasures. It grew together with its master...He was very close to his master. Other magic tools were external objects to cultivators. Even if they were damaged, it would not affect the main body. However, the life-bound magical treasure was different. If it was damaged, it would directly reflect on the cultivator's body.","Therefore, many cultivators' life-bound magical treasures were not used for battle, but to assist in cultivation. They used their life-bound magical treasures to improve the quality of their patterns and strengthen the potential of their Golden Core and Nascent Soul. Usually, they would stay in their life-bound spiritual lake for nourishment.","\"Pavilion Master Chu, you don't have to worry. After my Combined Magical Treasure was strengthened by the fusion of Unknown White 1- 33, it no longer fears being damaged and has a powerful self-recovery ability,\" Song Shuhang said. When he was in the man-made small world, every 'Unknown White' he met corresponded to a spirit beast in the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts 'Technique. After receiving the inheritance of 'Unknown White', not only did Song Shuhang's cultivation technique change, but his two sets of combined magical treasures had also been strengthened.","Now, even if the Combined Magical Treasure was shattered, Song Shuhang's main body would at most suffer a certain amount of pain. As for pain, it was just a trial for Song Shuhang. One day, he would taste all kinds of pain in the world, and then challenge the greatest pain in the universe and completely conquer it. In addition, even if it was shattered...","As long as the fragment was brought back to Song Shuhang's 'intrinsic spiritual lake', the Combined Magical Treasure would be able to come out alive and kicking after a while. This was also the reason why Song Shuhang dared to put the Combined Magical Treasure into the battlefield of Immortals to test it. Moreover, taking ten thousand steps back... Even if something happened, he could still look for Senior White Two. One of the two sets of combined magical treasures belonged to Senior White Two. After Song Shuhang finished explaining, he looked at Immortal Fairy White Bones' white skeleton giant on the screen while deep in thought.","In the battlefield, Immortal Fairy White Bones' offensive began to wane, and King Kun remained composed, waiting for the right moment to strike.","\"The more it nears the end, the calmer one must be,\" King Kun thought to himself.","Immortal Fairy White Bones, feeling the pressure, knew she couldn't hold on much longer.","But she had a last-ditch plan. With determination, she unleashed a final strike, and her hidden divine sword in the void began to move.","King Kun wore a confident smile. He believed victory was imminent.","Just then, a beam of light emerged from the sea below and struck Immortal Fairy White Bones. Sixty-six uniquely shaped magical tools equipped themselves onto the skeleton giant behind her."]},{"number":2400,"title":"Chapter 2400 Well, What a Coincidence!","paragraphs":["It wasn't the 'Steel Lion' mode, nor the 'Impregnable Holy City' or 'Destruction Giant' mode.","When the two sets of Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasures came into contact with the giant skeleton, they automatically assembled into a complete set of armor, each piece fitting onto the giant's body one piece at a time. Finally, a beast god mask, formed from the fusion of 33 types of spirit beasts, covered the giant's face, fully arming it!","A red light emanated from the eyes of the skeleton giant. This fierce red glow was just like Song Shuhang's Destruction Giant.","With 66 magical treasures at its disposal, the initially skeletal giant transformed into a steel Gundam. It shifted instantly from a terrifying supernatural entity to a sci-fi mecha battle style. It's worth noting that, unlike Song Shuhang's treatment, Immortal Fairy White Bones' delicate form was safeguarded by both the skeletal giant and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure. She was nestled within the steel giant. It ensured her utmost safety.","The Beast God White Bone Giant was fully armed!","Thunder rumbled, and lightning streaked across the sky.","The sea churned with turbulence.","The sky and the sea played a serene, nature-inspired background music, as if they were celebrating the arrival of the Beast God Skeleton.","This sudden transformation left King Kun bewildered.","In fact, Immortal Fairy White Bones, encased within the steel armor, was also puzzled. However, she quickly grasped the situation.","A sly smile graced the fairy's lips.","She knew that only the Slow-Witted Song would pull off such a stunt.","Moreover, this was the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure from the Divine Beast Department, and Slow-Witted Song was the one who had refined it. Back when she had whimsically created 'All the Monsters of the World Should Unite and Become a Family', Slow-Witted Song had asked her to conceal the secret inheritance of the Beast God within the Alliance's Canon.","\"At least you've got a few tricks up your sleeve,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones whispered.","As the two sets of Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasures equipped themselves upon the white bone giant, a surge of power flowed from the armor.","Immortal Fairy White Bones felt her fatigue dissipating. Of course, this was merely a sensation. In reality, she was still in a weakened state. It was just that her mood had suddenly brightened. It gave her the illusion of relaxation.","The two warhammers held by the Beast God skeleton resonated with the Combined Magical Treasures. They vibrated violently and expanded in size to three times their original dimensions.","Fully armed, the Beast God White Bone Giant raised its hand and brandished the colossal hammer.","Boom!","The deafening clash drowned out even the thunder in the sky.","The distinctive laughter of Immortal Fairy White Bones echoed from the Beast God White Bone Giant.","Then, the Beast God White Bone Giant raised the hammer in its right hand and pointed it at King Kun. \"Are you prepared to tremble, King Kun?\"","King Kun was at a loss for words.","This woman had resorted to trickery before her demise.","But regardless, King Kun couldn't afford to show weakness in the face of Immortal Fairy White Bone's provocation.","\"Don't think that you'll stay safe for long. I can sense that you're still in a weakened state,\" King Kun analyzed her calmly.","Immortal Fairy White Bones' aura had dropped to its weakest level since the battle began.","The additional armor on her body hadn't bolstered her strength.","More importantly, this set of armor, although it looked impressive, was essentially an Eighth Stage Profound Sage magical treasure upon closer inspection. Even when combined, it could barely reach the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm.","The appearance had startled King Kun, but upon closer scrutiny, it proved to be more of a fa?ade.","\"Do you still consider me weak?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones asked slowly.","As she spoke, the Beast God White Bone Giant moved once more.","It reached towards its left eye socket and made a peculiar gesture.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was taken aback.","This wasn't her doing!","The Beast God White Bone Giant was moving.","\"As expected, Immortal Fairy White Bones' skeletal giant and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure are a perfect match... It seems that the skeletal giant's secret technique was specially designed to complement the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure,\" Song Shuhang mused.","When he had seen the white bone giant conjured by Immortal Fairy White Bones in the broadcast earlier, he had a vague sense that this skeletal giant was highly compatible with the 'Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure.' This was one of the reasons why Song Shuhang had decided to test the strength of the Combined Magical Treasure.","Now, his suspicion had been confirmed!","At that moment, Song Shuhang had the ability to control the two sets of Combined Magical Treasures and allowed him to command the combined skeleton.","Just like now, he had transferred a small eyeball to the eye socket of the Beast God White Bone Giant through his Inner World!","Song Shuhang had left the Sage Seal and the imprint of the Magical Weapon Mirror on each of the Combined Magical Treasures. Each Combined Magical Treasure served as his spatial coordinate!","Although the eyeball was much smaller than the Beast God White Bone Giant, it exuded an intimidation that was no less formidable than the entire skeleton.","Guided by Song Shuhang, the Beast God White Bone Giant raised its head and fixed its gaze on King Kun.","\"Prove to me whether you are a peerless expert!\" A majestic voice resonated from the Beast God White Bone Giant.","Subsequently, a cold gleam materialized and struck King Kun's body.","It was the Scholarly Sage's expert appraisal technique!","In the past, due to Song Shuhang's limited realm, the effectiveness of the Sage's eye was greatly diminished. It could only affect cultivators below the Ninth Stage and a small number of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders.","Peak Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals were completely immune to the effects of the expert appraisal technique.","Now that the Scholarly Sage's eye had been placed into the eye of the 'Immortal' level Beast God White Bone Giant, would the efficacy of the expert appraisal technique improve?","Song Shuhang intended to use this opportunity to experiment!","If this experiment succeeded, he would have a plethora of tricks at his disposal in the future. For instance, he could employ Pavilion Master Chu's beautiful visage to unleash the light of the expert appraisal technique.","\"Scholarly Sage!\" In that moment, King Kun, who had been struck by the cold light, let out a horrified cry. His body leaped in a grand arc and formed a perfect circle.","The reaction seemed all too familiar.","Fate had a funny way of working.","It appeared that King Kun had once challenged the Scholarly Sage!"]}]);
